window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2501,"title":"Chapter 2501: At This Time, We Need to Use the Process of Elimination","paragraphs":["Chapter 2501: At This Time, We Need to Use the Process of Elimination","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang possessed a remarkable ability to adapt.","Since that day, June 4th of the previous year, when his worldview, built over eighteen years, had suddenly shattered, he had risen, Phoenix-like, from the ashes. Now, he was like a blank canvas continually embracing new experiences and revising his understanding of the world and his values.","On the night of January 2nd, current year, he was utterly panicked about the possibility of being pregnant and felt his brain shake with trepidation.","But when the sun rose on January 3rd, Song Shuhang serenely accepted this preposterous reality.","In the modern world, at the White Cloud Academy of the scholarly faction, on the Star Observation Platform...","Song Shuhang, fully rejuvenated in spirit and condition, sat cross-legged on the platform. He pushed his mask up to his forehead and quietly enjoyed the sunrise.","In contrast, a group of senior masters and goddesses behind him looked on with concern.","Soft Feather’s primary form whispered, “Is Senior Song really okay? I’ve heard that some people become reserved and taciturn after extreme events. The quieter Senior Song is, the closer he might be to breaking down. It’s very dangerous! ”","Soft Feather, Su Clan’s Sixteen, and Lady Onion had all withstood the Tyrannical Annihilation Speech.","The Tyrant’s Death Time, terrifying for cultivators across the universe, had barely affected Soft Feather. The repeated deaths in Tyrannical Time were merely a fun experience for her.","Su Clan’s Sixteen, too, had survived the Tyrannical Annihilation Speech. The trial she endured in secret was no less challenging than Tyrannical Time. With some adjustments and the aid of the living spring, she would soon overcome Song Shuhangs speech.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, apart from Yellow Mountain, only Senior Northern River seemed relatively normal.","Lady Onion, having gone through the experience once, was more accustomed.","After the second viewing of the speech, she awoke lively and energetic as ever.","After emerging from the Inner World, they learned of Song Shuhangs pregnancy.","Their reactions varied.","Upon hearing the news, Lady Onion first reacted with shock, then a series of theories about the Cycle of Karma flooded her thoughts. Eventually, she succumbed to an inexplicable fear... one could only wonder what scenario she had concocted in her mind.","Soft Feather initially expressed surprise, followed by curiosity. She pondered how Senior Song became pregnant, the underlying principles, whether it was a boy or a girl, and whether it could be born. Her mind buzzed with a myriad of questions. After her intense curiosity subsided, she began to worry about Pregnant Husband Senior Songs state.","As for Su Clan’s Sixteen, she was still reeling from the shocking news.","The White Dragon’s small claws fluttered before her eyes, but Sixteen showed no reaction.","“This shutdown is even longer than when Shuhang used the Karma Saber Technique.” The White Dragon inwardly noted—Sixteen’s ability to accept new things was worse than anticipated.","“Don’t worry, Soft Feather, I’m fine,” Song Shuhang turned and offered her a reassuring smile.","Soft Feather nodded in response to Song Shuhang.","As Song Shuhang turned back to continue watching the sunrise, Soft Feather murmured, “Seniors, do you think Senior Songs smile was genuine?”","“From the outside,” the White Dragon replied, “I’d give that smile eight points. ”","“Don’t worry too much, everyone. Look, Tyrannical Song is currently binge-eating and drinking. He’s using food to temper his emotions. If he goes overboard, he might just recover,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet analyzed calmly. “So, why don’t we think about how to handle the child inside Tyrannical Song?”","Lately, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had been the voice of reason, always steering off-topic discussions back on track.","“Child...” Su Clan’s Sixteen murmured behind them.","“Sixteen, have you finally rebooted?” the White Dragon asked with a smile.","However, turning to look, she found Su Clan’s Sixteen still in a state of shutdown—the mention of ‘child! by Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had simply triggered a single phrase.","“This girl is beyond help,” the sword declared.","The White Dragon fell silent.","“Speaking of a solution, I actually came up with a feasible one last night,” Pavilion Master Chu spoke up. She had temporarily positioned herself atop Soft Feather’s head to speak to everyone.","“What’s the plan?” Senior Turtle asked, intrigued.","“Actually, Shuhangs issue is quite simple to resolve. If you think about it, Shuhang’s ‘pregnancy isn’t literal. The embryonic lifeform is just in his ‘core reactor.’ So... if we temporarily remove the core reactor, wouldn’t that solve","Soft Feather shook her head, feeling a strange sensation as Pavilion Master Chu spoke atop her head.","“What happens after it’s taken out?” the White Dragon inquired.","“How do we take it out?” asked the black-skinned Soft Feather.","“Could Fairy @#%x manage the extraction process?” Pavilion Master Chu turned to the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous lamia interlocked her fingers and placed them beneath her chin. She nodded gently. As the embodiment of Song Shuhangs light of virtue, she was intrinsically connected to him. She could enter his Dantian and remove the core reactor.","This, however, would require Song Shuhangs consent.","“As for what comes after... perhaps we could consider surrogacy?” Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","The embryo in the core reactor was already a new life that needed to grow and required a mother for nourishment. “Who will it be?” Senior Turtle inquired.","Silence enveloped the group.","“This is where we must employ the process of elimination,” the White Dragon said with a calm smile, “First, exclude me, Fairy @#%x, and Fairy Creation.","We are all in a ‘state of virtue’ and lack physical bodies, so we’re out of the equation.”","“Fellow Daoist White Dragon makes a valid point,” the stone tablet concurred.","“So, I think Fairy Chu is quite suitable,” the White Dragon proposed. “We can’t leave such matters to the younger generation. As seniors, it’s our responsibility to step up at such times!”","“Regrettably, Scarf Fairy, I haven’t yet grown to waist-level and lack that functionality,” Pavilion Master Chu responded calmly.","“Seniors, how about letting me try?” Soft Feather’s original form suddenly volunteered. “It sounds like fun, I...","Before she could finish, the black-skinned Soft Feather lunged at her and covered her mouth. “Original body, this matter really isn’t feasible.”","Father will die!"]},{"number":2502,"title":"Chapter 2502: Living This Life To The Fullest","paragraphs":["Chapter 2502: Living This Life To The Fullest","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“This situation would definitely be too much for Father’s weak nerves...” Black- skinned Soft Feather covered her main body’s mouth in an attempt to dissuade her.","After a thoughtful moment, Soft Feather’s main body nodded in agreement.","Black- skinned Soft Feather finally heaved a sigh of relief and released her hand from her main body’s mouth.","“Alright, then let Father be the surrogate,” Soft Feather’s main body suggested.","Black- skinned Soft Feather was startled.","What’s with that absurd suggestion, main body?","Up ahead, Song Shuhang was pretending to admire the sunrise. He couldn’t help but feel his heart tremble. What kind of devilish suggestion was Soft Feather making?!","This conversation mustn’t reach Senior Spirit Butterflys ears.","“So, as expected... Senior Spirit Butterfly is a fairy, right?” Lady Onion suddenly said. Otherwise, why would Soft Feather come up with such a ridiculous suggestion?","Black- skinned Soft Feather was confused.","Song Shuhang shook his head frantically.","Lady Onion remained in her green onion form as she sat on Fairy Creation’s lap while shaking her little feet. “l remember seeing Senior Thrice Reckless mention something in the Nine Provinces Number One Group chat group. It was said that there was a rumor on Spirit Butterfly Island... According to the legends, Senior Spirit Butterfly was actually a fairy! Moreover, this is based on evidence. If everyone thinks about it carefully, we can find a lot of clues.” “For example?” Senior Turtle’s gossipy heart surged as he asked.","“Like Senior Spirit Butterfly’s Daoist name being very feminine? And how sometimes Senior Spirit Butterfly would throw a tantrum and act like a little woman who would ‘nitpick’ others! Moreover, it was said that Senior Spirit Butterfly had never brought his ‘wife’ back to Spirit Butterfly Island. He had always left the Spirit Butterfly Island to go on dates with his wife. Even after Soft Feather was born, Senior Spirit Butterfly brought her back to Spirit Butterfly Island alone.” Lady Onion raised her five fingers and counted them one by one. “So, if Senior Spirit Butterfly is really a woman, then everything can be explained!”","Black- skinned Soft Feather was dumbfounded.","Song Shuhang, who was pretending to enjoy the sunrise, suddenly found the sun glaring and almost blinding his right eye.","Soft Feather’s main body blinked. She felt that she was almost convinced by Lady Onion! If it wasn’t for her special constitution from staying in her mother’s body for a long time and sensing the outside world through her father’s spell, she really would have believed it!","“Did Senior Thrice Reckless spread the news?” Black- skinned Soft Feather asked after thinking calmly.","In front of them, Song Shuhang, who was staring at the rising sun, couldn’t help but shed a line of sad tears for Senior Brother Liu Jianyi and Senior Thrice Reckless. The sunlight was too dazzling, and tears couldn’t help but flow out.","However... The fact that Senior Spirit Butterfly might be a fairy was firmly imprinted in his mind.","Although he felt that the possibility of this was not high, his brain instinctively remembered this information because it was very fun.","“Don’t change the topic. Even if Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly is really a fairy, she’s not suitable to become the mother. Let’s continue discussing.” At that moment, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet once again turned the tide and brought the topic back.","At this time, Song Shuhang took off his mask, turned around, and said seriously, “Seniors, you really don’t have to worry about me. After I woke up this morning, I accepted the fact that I was pregnant. My mind is fine, my mentality is not broken, and my brain is very rational. The path of cultivation was filled with trials. As long as you treat this as a part of the trial, it’s not a big deal.”","“Shuhang, you’re so calm and rational. I’m actually starting to get a little worried,” the sword said after a slight pause.","“In short, seniors, there’s no need to worry about this problem anymore. There would always be a solution to this problem. If it really doesn’t work, we can contact Senior Almighty Merchant. As long as you have enough spirit stones, the Almighty Merchant can sell anything.” Song Shuhang added. As long as he had spirit stones, Senior Almighty Merchant was almost omnipotent.","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, a vivid image immediately appeared in the minds of the pendant big shots and fairy seniors behind him.","On a bright and sunny morning, in a pavilion with long and thin ivy vines, the Almighty Merchant was draped in a thin sheet. He caressed his round belly while revealing a motherly smile.","The possibility of this scene appearing was very high! Just as Song Shuhang said, as long as he had enough spirit stones, Senior Almighty Merchant would sell anything. If he doesn’t want to sell it, it must be because you didn’t give him enough spirit stones!","Everyone knew that Song Shuhang’s words didn’t mean that. What Shuhang wanted to say was that the Almighty Merchant should have a treasure that could solve the problem.","However, the image that appeared in his mind was automatically created by his brain and went completely out of his control.","In the end, the White Dragon coughed lightly and concluded, “Shuhangs plan is feasible. If we don’t have a more suitable solution in a short period of time, we’ll contact fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant... Shuhang still has a batch of spirit stones with him.”","“Yes, while there are spirit stones.” Song Shuhang stood up and sighed.","He had a lot of things he needed to do before he used up all his spirit stones. He needed to repair the Sacred Shadow Land, pay off his debts, and contact the Almighty Merchant to buy treasures.","Next, he would bid farewell to Senior Eternal Fire and the others.","It was time to leave the scholarly faction, a place that had caused him to panic. If he continued to stay in the scholarly faction, who knew what would happen? He and the scholarly faction were truly not fated.","“Senior Song, where should we go after leaving the scholarly faction?” Soft Feather asked.","“l have to go home first. Now that the Heavenly Dao had collapsed, the world had changed, and the main world had also undergone great changes. I’m going to make arrangements for my family first to resolve my worries. Moreover... It’s time to be honest with them,” Song Shuhang said.","His family had the protection of the scholarly disciples, so their safety was not a problem.","After the collapse of the Heavenly Axiom, Mars, the Moon, and the underwater world all underwent tremendous changes. Something similar must have happened on Earth.","Now was the best opportunity to describe the world of cultivators to his family.","It was also the most worry-free to explain at this time.","After all, the world had already become like this. What else could they not believe?","At that time, he would be able to connect his family to the Inner World... No, it would be best to ask Senior Eternal Fire for a favor and arrange for his family to move to the safer world of the golden lotus. Although the Inner World was safe, his master’s current situation was not very reliable. Therefore, the world of the golden lotus was more appropriate.","After settling his family, he would be able to walk his own path without any worries before the new Wielder of the Will appeared.","In this way, in this era where the Heavenly Dao collapsed, he would not have lived in vain!","Soft Feather thought for a moment and said, “Then I’ll go back with Senior Song.” She looked at the schedule. “If there’s enough time, I’ll play for two more days before returning to the Spirit Butterfly Island.”","She had an agreement with the Celestial Thearch to return home in time.","“Alright, then let’s go all the way.” Song Shuhang stood up and said to Su","Clan’s Sixteen in a soft voice, “Let’s go, Sixteen..”"]},{"number":2503,"title":"Chapter 2503: Returning Home","paragraphs":["Chapter 2503: Returning Home","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The White Dragon waved her little claws and replied on behalf of Su Clan’s","Sixteen, “She’s still rebooting.”","“I’m awake,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied.","At a crucial moment, she finally returned to her senses and responded in time.","“Kid...” Su Clan’s Sixteen looked up at Song Shuhang.","“Don’t worry, I’ve already accepted it.” Song Shuhang smiled and comforted her. “The worst-case scenario is that I’ll have to give birth to her myself. It’s not a big deal. My ability to accept new things is especially strong now. Don’t worry.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen gently nodded. No one knew what she was thinking at that moment.","“Shuhangs condition is indeed not good... After accepting the absurd fact of being pregnant, he subconsciously thought that others could accept this kind of thing as calmly as he did. Although his mentality didn’t collapse, he still felt that something was wrong.” The Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword secretly sent a group voice transmission from behind.","Pavilion Master Chu replied with a voice transmission, “I’m looking forward to seeing if he’ll honestly tell his family about his ‘pregnancy’ after he gets home.’","After pondering for a moment, the black-skinned Soft Feather said, “That shouldn’t be possible. It’s not like Senior Song has lost his mind.”","Just as they were talking, Song Shuhang called out to them from the front.","He stretched out his hand and took out the Myriad World Piercing Shuttle that Senior White Two had given him. Senior White had asked the hamster to give it to him to escape, and he hadn’t returned it to Senior White Two yet.","This time, he could use it to go home and make noodles!","8:03 AM.","After bidding farewell to Senior Eternal Fire and the Four Tribulation","Transcenders of the scholarly faction, Song Shuhang returned to Wenzhou City with a box of shiny spirit stones, which was a local specialty of the scholarly faction, thanks to Senior Eternal Fire’s kind hospitality.","In truth, spirit stones weren’t a local specialty of the scholarly faction.","However, everyone in the scholarly faction knew that Song Shuhang lacked money. Therefore, all the local specialties were converted into spirit stones","and given to Tyrannical Song. Song Shuhang was so moved that tears","streamed down his face.","Before leaving the scholarly faction, Song Shuhang had also applied to Senior Eternal Fire for the right to reside in the Confucian Golden Lotus World and prepare to use it to settle his family.","Senior Eternal Fire nodded and agreed to Song Shuhangs request. Since the entire scholarly faction believed that Song Shuhang was the reincarnation of a Sage, they all wished that Song Shuhang could move his entire family and stay there forever.","Song Shuhang applying for the right of residence in the world of the golden lotus for his family was exactly what the members of the scholarly faction wanted.","At this time, the scholarly faction wished that they could send someone to directly move Song Shuhangs family to the world.","Song Shuhang spent a lot of effort declining the enthusiastic help of the scholarly faction.","8:10 AM.","Blue sky, white clouds.","Above the sea of clouds, the Myriad World Piercing Shuttle turned into a beam of light and flashed across the clouds, cutting the thick clouds in half.","Soft Feather’s joyful laughter came from the immortal boat. The one driving the fastest immortal shuttle in the universe at its top speed was none other than her.","“Senior Song, this immortal shuttle is ridiculous!” Soft Feather cheered.","Only by piloting this immortal shuttle could one experience its extreme beauty. After driving it once, be it a fairy, a Taoist priest, or a master, they would fall in love with this kind of rapid happiness.","“After all, this is the speed of the number one physics expert in the universe.” Song Shuhangs legs were in a horse stance. He stood firmly in the cabin of the immortal shuttle.","Although there were seats in the immortal shuttle, Song Shuhang didn’t dare to sit down...","Black-skinned Soft Feather tightly gripped the armrest, and her small black face turned pale. She was trying her best to persuade Soft Feather. “Main body, slow down. It is better to wait for a minute than to fight for a second. There are thousands of roads, but safety was the most important. If this thing turns over, the Shuhangs baby will cry.”","The words of the black-skinned Soft Feather echoed Song Shuhangs thoughts.","“Okay, then let’s slow down!” In front of him, Soft Feather actually replied in a considerate manner.","Song Shuhang looked at Soft Feather in surprise.","“Although 1 still want to continue playing for a while, if I go any faster, I might not be able to control myself. My realm is still too low,” Soft Feather said regretfully. “My reaction speed isn’t good enough. Senior Song, if there’s a chance to level up quickly next time, please bring me along.”","“Don’t mess around. Leveling up is not child’s play.” Pavilion Master Chu, who was sitting on top of Soft Feather’s head, lightly patted her head. “Don’t learn from Song Shuhang. He hasn’t even mastered Five-Blow-Thunderstruck yet.","Moreover, the price of his method of leveling up is too high.”","In the universe, how many people could be like Song Shuhang. He relied on death after death to break through to the next realm!","Song Shuhang was speechless.","With the speed of the Myriad World Piercing Shuttle, Song Shuhang soon saw his familiar hometown.","Soft Feather had already begun to slowly reduce the speed of the shuttle and entered the parking phase.","Su Clan’s Sixteen leaned against the window of the immortal shuttle and looked down.","Below, Wenzhou City did not seem to have changed.","Song Shuhang moved behind Su Clan’s Sixteen and also looked down.","“On the surface, Wenzhou City hasn’t expanded,” Song Shuhang said in a soft voice. He still remembered that the change on Mars was a change in the principle of the Universe Magical Treasure in space, and its area had expanded by dozens of times.","Such changes would not be a problem on Mars. However, if it appeared on Earth, it would cause a lot of trouble... If the space inside the Earth expanded like the space of the Universe Magical Treasure, the increase in area would cause all roads, roads, gas, water, and electricity pipes to collapse.","Without water and electricity, modern humans would collapse.","“There’s a huge change in the spiritual energy,” the White Dragon said. “The dense spiritual energy is filling every corner. Even in the bustling city center, the density of spiritual energy is comparable to the encampment of a small sect in the past.”","Pavilion Master Chu was stunned. “There’s a tremor in space. I’m afraid that many small spatial cracks have appeared in the center of the city. A large amount of spiritual energy gushed out from these spatial cracks. These spatial rifts appeared randomly all over the city...","“Ordinary people couldn’t touch them. However, if some humans with special physiques come into contact with these spatial rifts, they might be sucked in.”","“Senior Song, I’m going to start descending,” Soft Feather said.","She could already see Song Shuhangs old house on Baijing Street.","“Deal! Be careful. When we land in the air, we’ll get out of the immortal shuttle and go down quietly,” Song Shuhang replied.","After the immortal shuttle landed, Song Shuhang found that there were very few people on the streets of the city.","The people from every household shut their doors and did not leave.","“There’s an evil aura,” said the black-skinned Soft Feather.","After the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, evil appeared everywhere.","Now that the spiritual energy between heaven and earth had become denser, if no one stopped the evil spirits, they would also become stronger because of the spiritual energy.."]},{"number":2504,"title":"Chapter 2504: This Scenery","paragraphs":["Chapter 2504: This Scenery","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The picturesque scene unfolded as Song Shuhangs divine sense swept the area below. He nodded in agreement. “Indeed, there are quite a few malevolent entities lurking in the shadows of the city... Seriously, it’s already 2020, and they’re still playing the end-of-the-world game, even though 2012 is long gone.","“Senior Song, should we go down and deal with these spirits?” Soft Feather asked with anticipation.","She had only learned about Xie Wang in theory. Now, for the first time, she was encountering numerous ones in the city below, and she found it quite intriguing.","Soft Feather had a penchant for exploring and understanding anything new, unfamiliar, and interesting. Curiosity was one of the driving forces of human progress.","“No rush. We’re likely going to stay in Wenzhou City for a few days... When the time comes, I’ll take you all to deal with these creatures. It’ll be a good way to spice up our daily activities,” Song Shuhang replied.","The knowledge and methods he had about handling Xie Wang could finally come in handy. This was a rare opportunity for him to play the role of a ‘senior’!","Furthermore, he had a feeling that Xie Wang were similar to inner demons. If he studied them carefully, he might be able to create a set of cooking techniques for a Malevolent Feast based on the cooking methods of the Inner Demon Tribulation Suit. This way, he could enhance his ability to pay off his debts.","Soft Feather nodded and said, “Alright, I’ll follow your lead.”","Following Senior Song seemed to be the right choice. If there were various Xie Wang to deal with, the next few days in Wenzhou City were bound to be far from boring.","“We’ve arrived. What’s our plan for descending?” Lady Onion also spotted the location of Song Shuhangs hometown and asked.","“Of course, we’re heading straight down,” Soft Feather replied as she gently pressed a button on the Myriad Worlds Piercing Immortal Shuttle. The shuttle hovered steadily in the air.","Subsequently, the shuttle’s door opened.","Soft Feather left the control panel and held the small hand of her inner demon. Then, she said to Song Shuhang, “Senior Song, we’ll go down first.” Black- skinned Soft Feather blinked in confusion.","Before Black- skinned Soft Feather could react, Soft Feather had already taken her hand and leaped out of the shuttle’s door.","“Wait, wait a minute... I’m not ready yet,” Black- skinned Soft Feather nervously exclaimed. She was dressed differently from her main body and wore a ladylike attire.","“Don’t worry. I’ve got you,” Soft Feather reassured her. Soft Feather’s right hand firmly held the left hand of her inner demon. The two Soft Feathers interlocked their fingers, and one pale and one dark figure descended from the sky simultaneously.","Soft Feather’s long black hair fluttered in the wind as her cheerful laughter filled the air.","A moment later, a group of colorful butterflies appeared beside the two Soft","Feathers to carry them and set them down gracefully in a captivating dance. The escape technique from Spirit Butterfly Island was more suitable for elegant fairies!","Lady Onion looked at Soft Feather with envy.","“As long as you practice diligently, 1 can teach you the Heavenly Peng Flight Technique once you reach the Fifth Stage Realm,” Song Shuhang said while gently flicking Lady Onion’s green onion shoot.","“Use less force. Don’t send my head flying again,” Lady Onion said, somewhat discontented. “However, my progress is nowhere near as fast as yours.”","“Yes, I haven’t been supervising you enough lately. I’ll reflect on that,” Song Shuhang said seriously. Lady Onion was someone that Senior Scarlet Heaven and Senior Three-Eyed had both confirmed as possessing the Will of the Wielder of Heaven.","In other words, this year’s Lady Onion might not have a chance, but the next one would definitely be a strong competitor!","Even if the Heavenly Dao had a master, Lady Onion might become an existence like the Scholarly Sage. She could be one capable of dominating an entire world with a single green onion.","“Lady Onion, as a green onion with the appearance of the Heavenly Dao, you’ll ascend to the throne and become an entity capable of crushing myriad worlds one day. So, aim higher,” Song Shuhang said earnestly.","Lady Onion pondered for a moment and then asked, “Can I hang you up and beat you?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Believe in yourself. There must be hope in life. Hope is a good thing,” Song Shuhang said solemnly to Lady Onion.","Then, he grabbed Su Clan’s Sixteen’s small hand, put away the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation, put Scarlet Heaven Sword and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet back in place, and inserted Pavilion Master Chu’s hair back into his head.","Finally... before Lady Onion could react, he jumped out of the shuttle with Su Clan’s Sixteen.","He used the Heavenly Peng Escape Technique, and a pair of dazzling VIP wings extended from Song Shuhangs sides, carrying him and Su Clan’s Sixteen as they descended.","“Wait, what about me? What should I do?” Lady Onion finally realized. Song Shuhang was being too stingy. He had only asked if she could beat him, and now he had left her all alone in the shuttle?","Lady Onion was lying on the shuttle’s door. She shouted at Song Shuhang,","“People with the surname Song are all scumbags!’","Below, Song Shuhang suddenly rotated his head 180 degrees and chuckled at Lady Onion.","It turned out that humans and owls were different.","An owl’s head was cute when it turned around, but a human’s head was eerie when it did the same.","Lady Onion was startled by this sight.","Song Shuhang chuckled and snapped his fingers.","With a bang, the Myriad Worlds Piercing Immortal Shuttle disappeared and was taken away by Song Shuhang.","After losing the shuttle as a foothold, Lady Onion’s body fell freely through the air.","“Aaah Lady Onion let out a series of screams in the air.","Her current realm hadn’t reached the level of Sword Flight yet, so she couldn’t","fly.","Just as she panicked, Song Shuhangs head suddenly separated from his body.","His hair transformed into a braided hand and gently grabbed Lady Onion.","“How was it? Exciting, isn’t it?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Ahhhhh!” Lady Onion’s eyes rolled back, and her body went limp.","A part of her was startled by the free fall, while the other half was frightened by Song Shuhangs head-flying technique. She had been watching many horror movies recently, and she was allergic to such terrifying scenes.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Lady Onion’s psychological fortitude was sometimes very contradictory. She could face death experiences without fear, but she was afraid of ghosts, even though she wasn’t afraid of death.","Song Shuhang grabbed Lady Onion’s head and returned to his body.","“There are too many accessories.” The White Dragon thought to herself. In normal circumstances, having more accessories is a good thing. With so many accessories, Song Shuhang had the ability to fight back no matter what kind of enemy he faced.","However, having too many accessories could be inconvenient.","For example, right now, descending from the sky with Su Clan’s Sixteen was a very romantic gesture. But because of the multitude of accessories watching, if he forced the romance, the scene would instantly turn into a public execution.","“We’re landing, Sixteen,” Song Shuhang said softly at this time.","With these words, he suddenly gently threw Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body upward and used his palm to support her feet.","At the same time, a black lotus floated under Song Shuhangs feet and supported him.","The White Dragon had underestimated Song Shuhang. He was the man who had created the Nine Forms of Awkward Flirtation. For him, forcefully romantic gestures and public executions were no problem.","Wenzhou City, Baijing Street, the backyard of Song Shuhang’s hometown.","The few scholarly disciples who were guarding the place in secret sensed something and looked up.","Then, they saw two beautiful twin fairies, one pale and one dark, descending from the sky with their fingers interlocked.","And behind the twin fairies, the reincarnation of the Sage, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, stepped on a lotus flower while gently holding a petite and delicate fairy in his palm as he slowly descended.","The scene was like a painting.."]},{"number":2505,"title":"Chapter 2505: Did You Commit Murder?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2505: Did You Commit Murder?","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Reincarnation of a Sage, Supreme Sage Tyrannical Song!","Excited disciples of the Confucian faction, lurking in the shadows, gazed in awe as Supreme Sage Tyrannical Song descended like an immortal.","Subsequently, they discreetly withdrew from the vicinity of the Tyrannical Song family and retreated even further away to quietly guard this sacred place.","The reincarnation of a Sage would inevitably return to the Confucian faction, so there was no rush to make contact with Supreme Sage Tyrannical Song at this moment. Until Supreme Sage Tyrannical Song officially rejoined the Confucian faction, their duty was to silently protect his ‘home’ in this lifetime and ensure he had no reason to worry.","As Song Shuhang touched down, he also noticed the Confucian disciples nearby, who were covertly watching over the area. He made a mental note of their appearance and planned to offer them some rewards when the opportunity arose.","Although he lacked spirit stones, his Inner World still held treasures that he could offer. For instance, the spring water from the upper reaches of the Living Spring, known to be frequented by immortals, would make an excellent gift. Additionally, he possessed some local Inner World products that could enhance one’s spiritual power and divine sense upon consumption. If all else failed, he could prepare a lavish Heavenly Tribulation Feast to entertain these disciples.","In essence, he would ensure that his fellow Daoists did not face any hardships.","Two Soft Feathers touched down first, followed by Song Shuhang, Su Clan’s Sixteen, and Lady Onion.","After landing, the two Soft Feathers extended their hands and elegantly traced a line in the air. They used a minor magical technique to tidy up their appearances and that of Lady Onion.","“The concentration of spiritual energy here is remarkable, and spell consumption has been significantly reduced,” both Soft Feathers remarked softly.","Song Shuhang surveyed his surroundings.","The plants within the courtyard exhibited rapid growth due to the increased spiritual energy, and some even bore fruit out of season.","Beyond that, the area surrounding his abode remained unaffected. This was likely because the Confucian disciples were discreetly caring for it.","Furthermore, Song Shuhang noticed the presence of low-level Soul Tranquil Talismans and Heart Calming Talismans discreetly inscribed on the street pillars outside his house. These runes were scattered throughout the city and helped individuals maintain a calm and composed state of mind to the greatest extent possible, even in the face of the world’s transformations.","It appeared that cultivators had taken measures to stabilize the situation.","“Across the world, cultivators from various schools have made similar arrangements”, noted the White Dragon. She had also sensed similar methods being implemented in nearby cities.","“This is most favorable,” Song Shuhang gently placed Su Clan’s Sixteen on the ground. “Let’s proceed. My parents are at home, which spares me the need to repeat the explanation.”","“Senior Song, I will return first. My presence may affect your parents’ well-being,” both Soft Feathers expressed politely.","Being an inner demon, her existence could influence the emotions of those around her and amplify negative sentiments within human hearts. Song Shuhang’s parents, being ordinary mortals, would not be immune to her influence.","“Indeed, you’re right. In that case, come into my shadow first. I have the protection of the virtuous lamia, which can mitigate your impact on ordinary people to the greatest extent,” Song Shuhang affirmed.","The Soft Feathers nodded slightly. Their form melded into Song Shuhangs shadow and vanished from sight.","“Let’s proceed,” Song Shuhang also removed the basic illusion from himself and Su Clan’s Sixteen while taking out his keys to unlock the door.","At that moment, Mama Song and Papa Song sat affectionately on the couch while watching live news on the television.","In the past two days, various changes had swept across the world.","Plants seemed to grow vigorously, as if they had ingested growth hormones, while an indescribable energy permeated the atmosphere, substantially enhancing the physical resilience of humans and all living creatures. Unusual occurrences took place within the city from time to time.","Overall, people sensed as if the key to human evolution had been unlocked once more, heralding the onset of a new phase of development.","This peculiar sensation inexplicably gripped many individuals and refused to let go.","In this new cycle of evolution, it wasn’t just humans but also various creatures and plants that found themselves on the path of transformation.","Failure to seize this opportunity for evolution left them pondering the future of humanity with trepidation.","Fortunately, the Huaxia region remained relatively stable. The government appeared well-prepared for the unfolding changes in the world. As these developments emerged, they promptly intervened to maintain order and seal off perilous zones.","The news now covered the purification and elimination of threats in previously labeled ‘dangerous areas.’","Furthermore, they introduced a series of well-organized countermeasures.","In general, the government projected an aura of composure and assurance. This remarkable sense of tranquility helped ease the initial panic among the populace.","In addition, the news reported the government’s intention to conduct a health examination for expectant mothers. They sought to compile information about pregnancies within the upcoming year. Children born during this period were anticipated to possess unique qualities.","“Did you call Shuhang yesterday to verify?” Mama Song inquired at that moment.","Papa Song nodded. “He’s fine. He and his roommates are safe. He told us not to worry.”","Just as Papa Song finished speaking, the living room door swung open.","Subsequently, Song Shuhang and two strikingly different young ladies entered together.","“Dad, Mom, I’m back,” Song Shuhang greeted them with a radiant smile.","Papa Song found himself momentarily stupefied at the sudden return of Song Shuhang.","“Why are you back?” Papa Song inquired. “l called you last night. Weren’t you still in school with your roommates?” Why had he returned home so early?","“Eh?” Song Shuhang was puzzled.","But he soon understood it had to be Tree Monster Qing Wu.","Was she still impersonating him at school? He had explicitly told her that he wished to conclude his student status.","“Eh? Miss Soft Feather, and who is this?” Mama Song differed from Papa","Song. She noticed the two attractive young women accompanying Song Shuhang.","She had seen Soft Feather before, the young lady who had been delivered to her through an express service. Her strikingly long legs left a lasting impression.","The girl on the right, with a distinct style, also seemed vaguely familiar.","“Hello, Auntie. Hello, Uncle,” Soft Feather waved her hand while displaying the characteristic smile of a Spirit Butterfly Island lady.","“You’re already acquainted with Soft Feather. This is Su Clan’s Sixteen,” Song Shuhang introduced Su Clan’s Sixteen while holding her hand.","“Hello, Auntie. Hello, Uncle,” Su Clan’s Sixteen greeted them with a hint of shyness.","Though her name sounded peculiar, it mattered little as long as she was good-looking. Mama Song cast a glance at Song Shuhang, then at Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather.","Suddenly, her eyes lit up.","In that moment, Mama Song had already constructed an entire romantic drama plot in her mind.","Her son had been at school just yesterday, but today he returned home with two girls. Something must have happened!","Mama Song recalled what she had seen in the news—the government was planning to conduct health assessments for recently pregnant ‘mothers’ and compile data about children expected to be born in the coming year.","Mama Song believed she had uncovered the truth.","But she remained uncertain—was it the girl with the long legs? Or perhaps this petite girl?","Mama Song warmly welcomed Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen to take their seats. She then discreetly gestured to Song Shuhang and whispered, “Come here, Shuhang. Come here.”","Song Shuhang approached Mama Song, bewildered.","“Tell me the truth, did you recently commit a murder?” Mama Song asked in a hushed tone.."]},{"number":2506,"title":"Chapter 2506: So, You Finally Admit It?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2506: So, You Finally Admit It?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but feel stunned.","He was overcome by a textbook case of guilty conscience. After all, he had just ingested a life into his body, and Mama Song had suddenly broached the topic without any prior warning.","Out of sheer reflex, Song Shuhang found himself momentarily taken aback.","If he hadn’t been aware of how peculiar the concept of ‘self-pregnancy’ was and if he hadn’t known that his mother’s imagination couldn’t possibly stretch to such levels—he would have thought that there was some kind of telepathic connection between him and his mother!","“It’s nothing, Mom, you’re overthinking it,” Song Shuhang replied in a hushed tone after regaining his composure.","Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen were both seated in the living room. Being cultivators, their hearing was exceptional. Mama Song had pulled her son aside and whispered to him, but Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather in the living room had caught every word.","Mama Song sighed and regarded her son with a complex expression... How could he have been so visibly guilty if he hadn’t done something wrong?","Song Shuhangs astonishment had been too evident, so even without the ability to read faces, Mama Song could sense that something was amiss.","“Tell me, don’t keep it hidden. Was it that long-legged Soft Feather? Or is it Su Clan’s Sixteen, the girl you brought back this time?” Mama Song inquired in a hushed tone once more.","She and Papa Song held more conservative views on such matters. They didn’t object to their children being in a relationship, but they hoped that their children wouldn’t engage in certain acts of bedroom violence before marriage. They wished for their children to follow their example. They fell in love and then got married and stayed committed to each other for life.","However, if an accident had indeed occurred, Mama Song hoped to find a solution that satisfied both parties and their parents. She didn’t want to evade responsibility. When the girl’s parents inevitably expressed their anger, she hoped to do her best to mollify them with sincerity.","What concerned her was whether Song Shuhang was afraid of taking responsibility. The more he tried to conceal it, the worse the situation would become.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“If you can’t tell me, I’ll speak to those two girls myself,” Mama Song said with a sigh when she noticed her son’s reticence. “After all, you brought them here, so you should have mentally prepared yourself, right?”","Song Shuhang was still speechless.","Niom, would you believe me if I told you it was all a coincidence?","Pavilion Master Chu, his fellow daoist stone tablet, the virtuous lamia, Fairy","Creation, and the Scarlet Heaven Sword within him, along with the invisible White Dragon on Sixteen’s neck in the distance, all seemed to be sipping tea and watching the spectacle.","Pavilion Master Chu sighed with a hint of amusement and employed the group voice transmission magical technique to convey her sentiments. “Even though Shuhang isn’t foolish enough to confess to his parents that he’s pregnant, the plot has reached this stage. Fate is truly wondrous. I can’t help but marvel at the twists and turns of destiny.”","“Now, how will he respond to his mother? Let’s wait and see!” Daoist Stone Tablet, acting responsibly as a magic tool, prepared to record this scene and send a copy to his master, Senior White of the main world.","In the shadows, the eyes of the black- skinned Soft Feather suddenly lit up. She sent a voice transmission to offer a suggestion, “Senior Song, shouldn’t you seize this opportunity to reveal the truth about ‘cultivation’ to your parents?” She felt it was an ideal moment. “Why don’t you use the topic of","‘pregnancy’ as an entry point to confess about ‘cultivation’ to your parents?” “Have you considered it?” Mama Song asked while gazing at her watch.","In the living room, Papa Song and his wife, who were connected telepathically, began to warmly entertain Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen. They even prepared the tea leaves Song Shuhang had left for them. Meanwhile, Papa Song discreetly observed the expressions of the two young ladies.","Soft Feather held the teacup and took a delicate sip.","“Yes, that’s the name of this tea,” Papa Song smiled.","Soft Feather nodded proudly and said, “Yes... I’m the one who stir-fried these tea leaves.’","She had once stir-fried a batch of Spirit Green Tea leaves and secretly sent a portion to Senior Song. The tea leaves bore the flavors of Spirit Butterfly Island’s soil and water, as she had stir-fried them herself.","The spiritual energy imbued within the Spirit Green Tea would naturally differ depending on the planting location.","“l didn’t expect my tea-frying skills to be this good,” Soft Feather praised herself after taking another sip of the spirit tea. She believed her tea-frying skills had reached the same level as her father’s!","Papa Songs interest was piqued upon hearing this. These tea leaves were stir-fried by this Miss Soft Feather?","Su Clan’s Sixteen blinked her eyes.","She had once given Song Shuhang a large bottle of fasting pills, but she hadn’t considered bringing spiritual items that ordinary people could use. She made a mental note of this.","The spiritual energy imbued within the Spirit Green Tea would naturally differ house for her everyday life.","She quietly turned her head to look at Song Shuhang.","It wasn’t just the pendants on Song Shuhangs body. Sixteen was also very curious about how Song Shuhang would respond.","In the kitchen, Song Shuhang contemplated for a moment and reached a decision.","He thought that the suggestion from black- skinned Soft Feather was excellent. Since he intended to reveal the truth about ‘cultivation’ to his parents, he should use this opportunity to confess everything.","Of course, he couldn’t use the concept of ‘pregnancy’ as a starting point. It was too sensational, even for cultivators.","Therefore, he would first tell his parents about ‘cultivation’ and then gradually steer the conversation to his accidental ‘pregnancy’ and take control of the topic.","“Very well, it’s settled!” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Seeing that her son had finally made up his mind, Mama Song pulled him into the kitchen.","“You’re here early. Have you had breakfast?” Mama Song inquired.","“I’ve already eaten at the Confucian faction,” Song Shuhang replied with a nod. “Ru Family Hotel? Did you stay together last night?” Mama Song asked softly.","“No, it wasn’t a hotel,” Song Shuhang shook his head. “Let me explain everything from the beginning.”","“Alright... I’ll prepare some snacks. Tell me while I work,” Mama Song said.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and said, “Mom, I’m sure you’ve noticed the changes in the world outside, right?”","“What does that have to do with your ‘pregnancy?” Mama Song asked.","Song Shuhang nodded.","The changes in the outside world were a result of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, and the reason for his ‘pregnancy’ was also linked to the Heavenly Dao. It was due to the lingering influence of a Dao Artifact left behind by the Heavenly Dao.","“So, are you finally admitting to being ‘pregnant?” Mama Song asked.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","It was indeed a trap.","“Tell me, which young lady is responsible for this?” Mama Song wiped her hands and asked.","The conversation had circled back to its initial point.."]},{"number":2507,"title":"Chapter 2507: Senior Song, Begin Your Performance","paragraphs":["Chapter 2507: Senior Song, Begin Your Performance","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the living room, Soft Feather, who was sipping tea, struggled to stifle her laughter. Su Clan’s Sixteen also raised her teacup, lowered her head, and perked up her ears to eavesdrop on the conversation between Song Shuhang and his mother in the kitchen.","“Although I’m pregnant, it’s not the way you’re imagining it, Mom. Let me explain it step by step,” Song Shuhang said with a sigh from the kitchen.","Mama Song responded dismissively, “Don’t be so tedious. Just tell me who it is. I’ve been feeling quite youthful lately, so you don’t need to worry about me not being able to handle it. Don’t beat around the bush. Even if you describe a lengthy process, I have no interest in hearing it.”","Regardless of which mother it was, from Mama Songs current perspective, none of them would be interested in listening to their son’s nonsense. Discussing his love life could be postponed; right now, she only wanted to know the answer.","“I’m afraid that if I explain the process directly, you won’t be able to accept it,” Song Shuhang retrieved some ingredients from the fridge and handed them to his mother.","Mama Song frowned.","Her son was being evasive and refusing to disclose which girl had caused all this. Moreover, he had been repeatedly cautioning her, as if he believed she","couldn’t handle the truth.","From a rational standpoint, the answer seemed clear.","That’s right; if one were to think like a normal person, the answer was evident.","“Shuhang, bigamy is against the law in our country,” Mom Song frowned. To be honest, she had trouble accepting this possibility.","Song Shuhang was taken aback. “What?”","Mama Song discreetly glanced at the two girls in the living room.","Based on her son’s hints, the answer was... both of them.","She hadn’t expected her son to change so much in college. Not only had his appearance undergone a significant transformation, but his personality had changed as well.","Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help but chuckle via the voice transmission function.","“Wait, Mom, can you not be so imaginative?” Song Shuhang hastily waved his hand.","Mama Song was momentarily stunned before letting out a sigh of relief.","If the two girls in the living room were pregnant, she truly didn’t know how to handle the situation. In such a case, she and Shuhangs father couldn’t express their sincerity to the parents of the two girls.","“Of course not. Neither Soft Feather nor Sixteen are pregnant,” Song Shuhang clarified.","“None? Then who is pregnant?” Mama Song rubbed her temples.","“It’s me.” Song Shuhang gazed at the sky in despair.","God only knew how the conversation had led to this point.","Originally, he had planned to steer the conversation toward the topic of ‘cultivation,’ take the initiative, and then elucidate various ‘because’ arguments. Finally, after giving his mother a psychological shock, he would admit that he was pregnant.","But the conversation had spiraled out of control and had progressed in leaps and bounds.","All the plans he had formulated were rendered useless.","“In the end, it all comes down to this.” The White Dragon’s body began to twitch.","“Wouldn’t it have been better to be honest from the start?” the sword remarked.","The kitchen fell silent.","Mama Song was at a loss for words.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","After a while, Mama Song rubbed her ears. “Who p s pregnant?”","“It’s me. You didn’t hear incorrectly. It’s me, myself,” Song Shuhang calmly stated.","“l don’t remember giving birth to a daughter.” Mama Song looked at her son.","“That’s why you definitely won’t be able to accept it. Now, do you want to hear me explain the process from the beginning to the end?” Song Shuhang calmly offered.","“Did you change your gender?” Mama Song inquired while trying to make sense of her son’s response based on her existing knowledge.","“l believe you’ve noticed the changes in the outside world,” Song Shuhang redirected the conversation, this time resisting his mother’s narrative rhythm. He shifted the topic to his own pace.","Mama Song nodded. “What does the outside world’s changes have to do with you?”","“Yes, about half of those changes are because of me,” Song Shuhang affirmed. When the Heavenly Dao collapsed, it was his fifth speech. Before that, the Heavenly Dao Ball had devoured his lower body, and then it collapsed.","Mama Song was rendered speechless.","How could she describe this feeling? Mama Song felt incapable of continuing the conversation with her son.","“Mom, you should’ve considered the changes in the outside world. There are ‘mysteries’ in this world, right?” Song Shuhang began to speak at his own pace and transitioned from the superficial to the profound.","“As for me, this year... To be precise, it was last year when I encountered these ‘mysteries’ related to cultivation.” After revealing this much, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but recall his first interaction with the Nine Provinces Number One Group and his initial excitement.","“In fact, the Spirit Green Tea I left at home, the unique ‘spring water,’ and the special rice stored at home are all extraordinary. You and Dad should be able to feel the changes in your bodies. It’s just that all this time, you haven’t considered it from that perspective,” Song Shuhang continued.","The living spring could extend one’s lifespan, and the spiritual rice and green vegetables could enhance one’s physical condition to a certain extent. This effect had already manifested in Papa Song and Mama Song.","Mama Song was speechless.","There was so much information that she didn’t know what to say.","However, upon careful consideration, she began to accept it to some extent, as she had indeed become much younger.","Previously, Song Shuhang had wisely used spiritual rice, spiritual tea, and the living spring as a foundation. It had been a very wise decision. With these elements acting as a buffer, Mama Song found it much easier to accept. But even so, she still found it surreal. It was as though she were in a dream.","“Well, there’s no evidence. I’m going to show you some evidence. Senior Chu, can you help me set up a barrier in my house?” Song Shuhang requested. Pavilion Master Chu was taken aback.","Niama Song glanced at her son’s hair in surprise. After pondering for a moment, she asked, “Are Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen not ordinary people either?”","In the past, she hadn’t given it much thought, but now, if she thought about it more deeply... the names of these two girls were different from those of ordinary people.","Song Shuhangs big heart had most likely been inherited from his mother.","Mama Song still felt like she was in a dream, but her mind had already started to calmly analyze some information. At the very least, it wasn’t crashing.","“Yes. Come to the living room,” Song Shuhang said. “I’ll show you and Dad something.”","“Wait. You’re not planning to use the City-level Lightning Palm, are you? If you’re going to use it in the house, I will need to add a ‘space’ type spell for defense.’","Song Shuhangs City-level Lightning Palm was enormous. If he used it in his room, Pavilion Master Chu would have to incorporate a spatial spell.","“Of course not,” Song Shuhang replied.","Afterward, in the living room, Mama Song and Papa Song sat side by side.","Song Shuhang stood in front of the television.","“Senior Song, start your performance,” Soft Feather rested her chin on her hands and chuckled.."]},{"number":2508,"title":"Chapter 2508: No Comparison, No Harm","paragraphs":["Chapter 2508: No Comparison, No Harm","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Soft Feather’s face was filled with excitement.","Su Clan’s Sixteen crossed her fingers and placed them on her thighs while looking a bit nervous.","Meanwhile, at this moment, Mama Song was still preoccupied with the inescapable topic of ‘pregnancy.’ As a mother, she was naturally more concerned about that matter.","On the other side, Papa Song had a puzzled expression beside his wife. He hadn’t heard the previous conversation between his wife and son, so he was unaware of what had transpired. But when he saw Song Shuhang standing in front of the TV with a serious expression, he guessed that his son intended to put on a show.","For some inexplicable reason, Papa Song suddenly had a premonition that his liver was aching.","It was even more painful than the time his son had driven home on a hand-guided tractor.","Papa Dad discreetly touched his chest and contemplated whether he should take some preemptive pills to address the ailment.","“So, what should we perform first?” Song Shuhang asked.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet responded, “Just do something. Honestly, there isn’t much for you to showcase at the moment. You only possess the knowledge of a few spells.”","Papa Dad couldn’t help but glance at the small stone tablet hanging from his son’s waist. Was this some cutting-edge smart voice device? Was the Al really that advanced?","Pavilion Master Chu was left bewildered. “Regarding thunder techniques, aside from the Lightning Palm, you also have some knowledge of the Five-Blow-Thunderstruck, though you haven’t fully mastered it.","Five-Blow-Thunderstruck isn’t suitable for a home performance.”","“l also have a charging spell,” Song Shuhang added.","Pavilion Master Chu responded disdainfully, “Don’t embarrass yourself! Do you intend to use that insignificant spell to charge your parents’ phones?” Papa Song once again scrutinized his son’s hair.","If the small stone tablet pendant could indeed be a high-intelligence Al device, then what purpose did his hair serve? Was it an antenna?","Papa Song unease continued to mount. He turned to his wife.","His wife extended her hand and grasped his large hand, intertwining their fingers. “The outside world is evolving, so let’s embrace a more open-minded perspective.”","Papa Song held his wife’s hand tightly, and even the pain in his liver seemed to subside.","Song Shuhang reflected for a moment and then remarked, “In that case... Should I quickly demonstrate some of the minor spells I’m acquainted with?”","Having said that, he exhaled gently and activated the Lotus Blossoming Tongue, a skill he had mastered.","Beautiful white lotuses materialized out of thin air and floated in the void to emit a peculiar fragrance that triggered salivation.","Song Shuhang employed his mental prowess and extended his hand to gracefully present the white lotuses to his parents, Su Clan’s Sixteen, the White Dragon, and Soft Feather.","“Clap, clap, clap!” Soft Feather applauded lightly.","Papa Song caught the descending white lotus with a bewildered expression.","“It’s edible,” Su Clan’s Sixteen reminded him from the side.","“What?”","“These white lotuses are edible.” Su Clan’s Sixteen treated the white lotus as though it were a lollipop and gently licked it.","Papa Song took hold of the white lotus and then looked up at his son.","“What bizarre turn of events is this? Magic tricks? Wait a moment... Earlier, my wife mentioned that the outside world is changing. Has Shuhangs body also undergone a mutation?”","Papa Dad had viewed science fiction and fantasy movies depicting a changing world, genetic mutations leading to superhumans, and the emergence of superpowers.","“Next up is this,” Song Shuhang said while taking a step in midair.","Subsequently, a crystalline black lotus manifested beneath his feet. Lotus Step was undeniably an impressive ability! Even if it scored only 5 points for aesthetics, it would easily garner a rating of around 7 points with Lotus Step.","“Senior Songs ‘Lotus Step’ remains as splendid as ever,” Soft Feather commented enviously. She had long envied Song Shuhangs talents.","Regrettably, such mystical techniques weren’t attainable through mere desire.","Papa Song ruminated momentarily, then gestured at Song Shuhangs black lotus and asked in a subdued voice, “Can this be consumed?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen blinked and responded, “l don’t think that’s possible, right?” After all, this lotus was the very one Song Shuhang had trodden upon...","Papa Song took a bite of the white lotus in his hand and silently nodded. “l see.","I’m starting to get it.”","“What do you understand?” Su Clan’s Sixteen inquired, puzzled.","“Shuhang, are you a lotus-based esper?” Papa Song ventured a guess, even though he found it ludicrous. People with superpowers typically appeared in movies.","However, the issue lay in the fact that his son had just exhibited two lotus-related abilities before their eyes.","“Perhaps I’m still in a dream? Perhaps it’s still the end of 2019, and I’m having an amusing dream on New Years Eve? Thus, in 2020, the outside world is changing, and my son has become a practitioner of some kind.”","The White Dragon chortled, “Hahahaha, a lotus-based esper. Shuhang, I’ve made up my mind. The next time you reveal your divine powers, I’ll dub you ‘Tyrannical Lotus!","Song Shuhang, hovering on the black lotus in midair, was rendered speechless.","He couldn’t help but reminisce about the day when he was introduced to the ‘cultivation world’ thanks to Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen and shattered his worldview.","“Not an esper,” Mama Song corrected, her heart resolute.","Papa Song queried, “Not an esper? Then what is it?”","“Yes, it’s cultivation.” Song Shuhang affirmed earnestly. Regardless of whether his parents could accept it or not, he was determined to demonstrate the abilities of a cultivator!","Acting assertive in front of his parents without needing to flee afterward was quite exhilarating.","Having relayed this much, Song Shuhang extended his hand and pointed. A pair of sharp treasured sabers emerged from his Dantian and hovered beside him while executing graceful rotations. “This is a saber control technique used for riding a flying saber.”","“It’s not a sword control technique?” Mama Song suddenly inquired. “Mom, that hurts. Am I really your biological son?” Song Shuhangs mental state teetered.","“Auntie, Senior Song isn’t skilled in sword control techniques. However, he does excel in saber techniques,” Soft Feather explained.","Following this statement, Yu Rouzi opened her mouth and expelled a sword light.","The sword light transformed into a beautiful longsword adorned with butterfly patterns. When the longsword soared, it emitted the dazzling radiance of Spirit Butterfly Island’s spells, complete with fluttering butterfly wings. The overall presentation was both beautiful and stylish.","“Clap, clap, clap!” both Papa Song and Mama Song applauded enthusiastically.","Their minds hadn’t fully comprehended the situation. They might still possess subconscious resistance to the concept of ‘cultivation.’ Nevertheless, they were already captivated by Soft Feather’s and Sixteen’s sword and saber techniques.","Su Clan’s Sixteen gently gripped Mama Song’s small hand.","“I specialize in the way of the blade,” Su Clan’s Sixteen responded. She reached out while conjuring an old-fashioned oil-paper umbrella.","Subsequently, Sixteen grasped the umbrella’s handle and gently extracted it. A straight blade gleaming with a cold, sharp light emerged from within the umbrella.","Her life-bound magical treasure, the short knife, had undergone evolution thanks to Song Shuhangs Eye Drops. It had successfully merged with her painting path and resulted in the creation of the current umbrella knife. Following this, Sixteen released her grip on the weapon and allowed it to float in the air with the blade pointing downwards. An expansive landscape painting unfurled around the blade and enveloped the entire living room.","“Clap, clap, clap!” both Papa Song and Mama Song applauded heartily.","While Papa Songs mind had yet to fully grasp the situation, he might still possess subconscious resistance to the notion of ‘cultivation.’ Nevertheless, Papa Song and Mama Song were already captivated by Soft Feather and Sixteen’s sword and saber techniques.."]},{"number":2509,"title":"Chapter 2509: Mama Song’s Happy Dilemma","paragraphs":["Chapter 2509: Mama Song’s Happy Dilemma","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","By this time, Mama Song had started to come to terms with what her son referred to as ‘cultivation.’ Of course, this acceptance didn’t happen all at once; it required some adjustment time. It was like installing a program that transitioned from one percent to one hundred.","—Her big heart that she had passed down to Song Shuhang played a crucial role in this.","Compared to Mama Song, Papa Songs ability to accept this was somewhat lacking.","However, with his wife appearing so composed and accepting the concept of their son’s involvement in ‘cultivation,’ he couldn’t afford to show disbelief or panic. It would be rather embarrassing, after all.","So, holding Mama Songs hand firmly, Papa Song decided to embrace the concept with his body first, regardless of his brain’s acceptance. He would later feed this concept back to his brain and carefully ponder whether this was reality or a dream.","With this in mind, Papa Song also began to remain composed when faced with Feather’s swordplay and Su Clan’s Sixteen’s saber techniques.","In fact, even if he wasn’t actively thinking, he could turn around and look at his son. “Shuhang, do you have any other techniques besides saber wielding?” Song Shuhang was left momentarily speechless.","“In reality, Shuhang has a remarkable talent for saber techniques. However, his style isn’t suited for performances; every swing of his blade could bring about world- shattering destruction, even at home,” Su Clan’s Sixteen began explaining after returning her saber to its umbrella, as she attempted to accumulate points on Song Shuhangs behalf.","“World- shattering destruction?” Mama Song gazed at the pair of blades twirling around her son and tried her best to imagine. To be honest, not that she wasn’t a loving mother, but she truly couldn’t fathom how her son could cause ‘world- shattering destruction.’","It was a test of her imagination.","There was no way around it. At the beginning of last year, her son was just an ordinary college student. This year, she was told her goofy son could bring about ‘world-shattering destruction.’ Even a mother would find such a notion difficult to accept.","However, Mama Song narrowed her eyes as she observed Su Clan’s Sixteen.","This young lady might have a chance.","As someone who had been through it, she could naturally see that this young lady was doing everything in her power to protect her goofy son.","However... Although Feather appeared to be in a cheerful state, she seemed to have helped her son out of predicaments before.","Both of these girls were incredibly outstanding, each with their unique beauty. Mama Song couldn’t help but feel a mix of happiness and worry.","“Mom, your disbelief is written all over your face. I must have inherited that","‘passive face-reading from you,” Song Shuhang sighed and said. “Actually, I’m somewhat famous in the world of cultivation now. In the myriad realms, if you mention my name, Tyrannical Song, it can even intimidate some of the lowlifes.’","“What in the world is ‘Tyrannical Song?” Papa Song couldn’t help but feel a pang of embarrassment upon hearing that title.","“It’s a Sage Name. It’s the title obtained by an Eighth Stage Profound Sage after displaying their divinity. It’s also a symbol of the cultivation realm,” Su Clan’s Sixteen explained.","Mama Song nodded and asked, “So, Soft Feather and Sixteen, what level are you at?”","She and Papa Song had gained more insight into this ‘cultivation’ from their conversation with Sixteen.","“Soft Feather and I are currently at the Fifth Stage Realm,” Su Clan’s Sixteen explained.","Papa Song nodded. “l see. No wonder Shuhangs saber technique is a bit lacking. It turns out there’s a three-level difference between him and you guys.”","In the hearts of most people, the higher the number, the lower the grade. After all, in ancient times, there were ninth-grade Sesame Officials and first- grade Great Prime Ministers.","Song Shuhang was at the Eighth Stage, while Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather were at the Fifth Stage. In that case, Sixteen and Soft Feather should be more powerful.","Soft Feather chuckled and said, “Uncle, you’re mistaken. Cultivators’ levels aren’t calculated that way. The levels of cultivators range from the First Stage Foundation Establishment Cultivators to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders. Senior Songs Eighth Stage Profound Sage realm is only inferior to that of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.”","In fact, initially, the world of cultivators didn’t have the concept of ranks.","Instead, it was divided into stages based on Foundation Establishment, Houtian, Xiantian, Jindan, Yuanying, and so on. The concept of grades likely became popular during ancient times.","Papa Song was left speechless.","He glanced at his son once more while wearing an expression of disbelief. “It seems that if I don’t show off my skills, you all might underestimate me,” Song Shuhang jumped down from the black lotus confidently and got into a stance, ready to use the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique.","As he started to demonstrate his power, a radiant aura of virtue appeared behind him.","The virtuous lamia extended her hands and assumed the stance of a white crane spreading its wings. The tip of her tail was forked, and her body leaned to the left, mimicking the posture of a golden rooster standing alone. “It’s time to show my true skills!” declared Song Shuhang as one.","Fairy Creation, standing in the middle, also adopted the classic white crane spreading its wings and golden rooster standing alone posture. She said, “Let me say a line occasionally!” This was Song Shuhang as two.","Finally, the black- skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhangs shadow and struck the same pose as the two seniors, leaning to the right. Under the influence of the virtuous lamia’s aura of virtue, if she didn’t appear for too long, it wouldn’t affect the emotions of ordinary people.","She didn’t have any suitable lines, but fortunately, Fairy Creation had sent her a prerecorded ‘voice’ at the last minute. With a light tap, she played the voice.","“l think, maybe... Maybe... Maybe... 1 need a pregnancy test kit?” Song Shuhangs voice resounded once more.","Papa Song was left speechless.","Mama Song was left speechless.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","This was how a family should be organized.","After a while, Papa Song asked, “Are these three girls under the effect of a spell?”","“No, they’re pendants,” The White Dragon on Su Clan’s Sixteen’s neck explained, though she didn’t reveal her physical form.","“The girl in black on the right looks like Soft Feather?” Mama Song had sharp eyes.","“Yeah,” Soft Feather proudly confirmed. “That’s my inner demon.”","‘Even her inner demon has a connection with Shuhang? Could it be that Soft Feather is the one with a chance?’ Mama Song couldn’t help but glance at Soft Feather.","Papa Song rubbed his chin and said, “So, does Sixteen have an inner demon on Shuhangs body?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen shook her head slightly, feeling a bit disappointed.","At this point, Song Shuhang chuckled and said, “Sixteen’s inner demon isn’t on me. However, I actually have something related to her... It’s just that his personality is a little bad.”","Mama Song was confused.","Song Shuhang snapped his fingers.","Hua","A ball of flame appeared beside him.","Within the flames, a grown version of ‘Sixteen’ appeared.","After Sixteen appeared, she first looked around and saw Song Shuhangs parents, Soft Feather, and... Su Clan’s Sixteen.","When she saw Sixteen, her eyes lit up.","But before she could do anything, Song Shuhang snapped his fingers again, and ‘Sixteen’ disappeared unwillingly.","Mama Song couldn’t help but glance at Su Clan’s Sixteen again. She nodded her head in agreement with her appearance.","“Alright, after seeing this, your father and I should be able to accept some settings of this ‘cultivation’.” Mama Song nodded.","“Wait, Mom. I haven’t really shown my skills yet,” Song Shuhang hurriedly said.","Papa Song waved his hand. “No need. We already know what to do. In addition, let’s first digest what Sixteen and Soft Feather just told us. You don’t have to show off anymore. Anyway, you’ve already achieved your goal.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","It’s so uncomfortable. Let me show you my skills.. Let me really show you my skills!"]},{"number":2510,"title":"Chapter 2510: Clearly Arranging Family Matters","paragraphs":["Chapter 2510: Clearly Arranging Family Matters","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Papa Songs words made a lot of sense. The main reason why Song Shuhang wanted to ‘show off’ in front of his family was to make them believe in the existence of ‘cultivation’.","Now, both Papa Song and Mama Song were in the process of believing. Their bodies had faithfully relayed the information that ‘cultivation is real’ to their brains, and their brains were slowly processing and confirming this information.","In this situation, there was no need for Song Shuhang to ‘show off’ again.","In fact, if Song Shuhang forcefully continued to ‘show off,’ it would only add","to the burden on the minds of Papa Song and Mama Song. At this point, what they needed was not more evidence, but some time to digest the information and think calmly.","Pavilion Master Chu agreed. “You can’t convince them all at once. Shuhang, since your parents have already started to accept it, you should give them some time to process it. Just stay quietly by their side, and when they have doubts, you can help clarify things.”","Song Shuhang had no choice but to temporarily suppress his desire to perform.","A while later, Papa Song and Mama Song sat side by side on the sofa.","Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen sat beside Mama Song.","Song Shuhang squeezed in next to Papa Song.","The virtuous lamia’s tail was coiled up and ‘sitting on the opposite side of the coffee table while she gazed at the ‘white lotus’ on the table.","Fairy Creation was pacing back and forth behind the sofa, and no one knew what she was doing.","Black-skinned Soft Feather was worried about affecting Song Shuhangs parents, so she quietly returned to the shadow of Song Shuhang.","“It suddenly feels a lot livelier,” Mama Song said... Besides, she finally noticed something. Her son had conjured girls like magic. Even the hair on his head emitted pleasant female voices.","This didn’t seem to be a bad thing, but it wasn’t necessarily a good thing either. Mama Song secretly glanced at Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather.","Papa Song rubbed his eyes and looked at the tail of the virtuous lamia.","“Dad, don’t resist reality,” Song Shuhang consoled him. Today, his parents’ worldview would collapse along with his.","It’s better to face it alone than together.","He had wanted to do this for a long time. Now that he finally had the chance to do it, he was super excited.","“Sixteen and Soft Feather, did you start practicing cultivation when you were young?” Mama Song pondered for a moment before asking.","“Yes, I’m a member of the Spirit River Su Clan,” Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded.","“I’m a member of Spirit Butterfly Island. Our Spirit Butterfly Island is an overseas immortal island with a good environment. Actually, I was planning to invite Senior Song to come with me to Spirit Butterfly Island to practice cultivation,” Soft Feather said with a smile.","“Invite Senior Song to Spirit Butterfly Island to practice cultivation?” Mama Song felt that there was a story behind this.","When Su Clan’s Sixteen heard this, her small face turned red. She had also invited Shuhang to join the Spirit River Su Clan before. However, the Spirit River Su Clan normally didn’t accept outsiders, so the method she used to invite him was quite unique. At that moment, she was too embarrassed to tell Mama Song about this invitation method.","“Did Sixteen also invite Shuhang?” Mama Song saw Sixteen’s face suddenly turn red. Her heart skipped a beat. She felt that there was hope here.","“Haha, haha,” Song Shuhang, who was standing at the side, suddenly laughed heartily.","His hearty laughter couldn’t hide his guilty conscience.","“Why are you smiling so strangely?” Mama Song stretched out her hand and patted Papa Songs thigh. At the same time, she understood that Su Clan’s Sixteen had indeed invited her son, and the story behind it might be even more profound.","Dong","When Mama Song slapped Song Shuhangs thigh, the sound of a large metal bell being slapped rang out. The sound was long and melodious.","Mama Song frowned.","“You have an iron plate in your leg?” Her hands hurt from the slap.","“No, Mom, don’t misunderstand,” Song Shuhang hurriedly waved his hand and said, “This is my protective divine art. I have practiced the Mutated Steel Hands Technique, the Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, the Holy","Ape Dragon Power Technique, and the newly added Liquid Golden Body Technique. Therefore, my body is actually much harder than an iron plate now.”","Not only was it much harder than an iron plate, but the hardness of an iron plate wasn’t even worthy of comparison to Song Shuhang’s body! Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help but say, “You’re really tough.”","“Is your whole body like this?” Mama Song asked.","Song Shuhang nodded. “Yes, they all have this level of defense. Some a_reas are even tougher.”","Niama Song didn’t believe it and stretched out her hand to twist Song","Shuhangs arm.","When she stretched out her hand to pinch Song Shuhangs arm, it felt as if she was pinching an iron arm.","“Do you believe me now?” Song Shuhang said.","“How will you get an injection when you’re sick?” Mama Song asked worriedly.","Was there a needle in this world that could penetrate Song Shuhangs body? What if he needed surgery? How would they cut open this iron body? A saw? Soft Feather comforted her. “Auntie, you don’t have to worry. When a cultivator is sick, they naturally have their own methods of treatment.”","“That’s right. I haven’t fully adapted to it yet.” Mama Song rubbed her eyebrows.","If her son had turned his entire body into a lump of iron for no reason, what would happen to their intimacy in the future?","Mama Song looked at Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather, who were beside her. The two young ladies had delicate skin and tender flesh... She had a headache.","Why would her son turn his body into a lump of iron for no apparent reason?","After thinking up to this point, Mama Song fiercely slapped Song Shuhangs arm.","The most annoying thing was that it was her hand that hurt.","Papa Song quickly rubbed his wife’s hand and suggested, “Don’t use your hands. Later, use a ruler. It won’t hurt your hands.”","“Dad, are you for real?” Song Shuhang didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","“Let’s get down to business... Shuhang, since you’ve confessed to us about ‘cultivation,’ do you have any plans for the next step?” Papa Song asked.","His worldview had nearly collapsed, and he was starting to rebuild it.","“Yes, 1 wanted to take advantage of the global changes to confess to you about ‘cultivation,’ so that it would be easier for you to accept. After that, I want to transfer all of you to the world of the golden lotus in the scholarly faction. In the coming period, the myriad worlds will probably be in turmoil. I’ll feel more at ease after I transfer you to the world of the golden lotus,” Song Shuhang nodded.","“So, you mean we’re moving?” Mama Song tried to calm herself and asked.","“At least for eight to ten years, and possibly even a hundred years or a thousand years,” Song Shuhang said.","“A hundred years?” Papa Song raised his eyebrow. “A thousand years?”","“Yes, even though I can’t solve your ‘cultivation’ problem at the moment, with my current methods, extending your lifespan by a thousand years is not a problem,” Song Shuhang said confidently.","Papa Song was speechless.","That’s right, since ‘cultivation’ was involved, extending one’s lifespan was a given.","“When are we moving?” Mama Song asked.","“I’ve requested a batch of spots from the scholarly faction... So, if you feel it’s necessary, we can bring some of our family members to the scholarly faction in the next few days,” Song Shuhang replied.","This was also the reason why he had told Soft Feather that he might stay in Wenzhou City for a few days.."]},{"number":2511,"title":"Chapter 2511: The Resounding Name Of Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2511: The Resounding Name Of Tyrannical Song!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“How are we going to explain this to our relatives and friends?” Papa Song furrowed his brow.","To be honest, when it came to the concept of ‘cultivation,’ he wouldn’t have believed it at all if his wife weren’t there to witness it with him. It had been quite a challenge for both of them to grasp, let alone their relatives and friends.","And there was another matter... it was their hard-earned house, finally free from the burden of the loan!","Song Shuhang flashed a smile. “That should be relatively easy. We just need to come up with a reason that aligns with the unusual changes happening in the outside world.’","Soft Feather chimed in, “For instance, if there are significant upheavals in the outside world, it could pose great dangers. But lucky for us, we have a national-level sanctuary at our disposal, a safe haven to seek refuge.” Mama Song furrowed her brow and inquired, “How many people are allowed","“Is it genuinely perilous outside?” Papa Song asked simultaneously.","Song Shuhang reassured them, “The exact quota isn’t determined yet, but it’s certainly limited. Let’s try to keep it as compact as possible... After all, the Golden Lotus World belongs to the Confucian faction. But don’t fret, I’ll arrange for the first group to enter this Confucian Golden Lotus World. As for the second group, I’ll find a way to make arrangements. We’ll prioritize the first group based on their closeness to us. Later on, we’ll come out and organize the second batch.”","Every individual had their own circle of relatives and friends, and those relatives and friends had their own networks as well. This made it quite challenging to orchestrate such a plan flawlessly. Song Shuhang couldn’t possibly usher in a massive crowd of people into the Golden Lotus World. Hence, he could only start with a select group of close friends and relatives.","Once that was settled, he would need to wait for his Inner World to synchronize with the ‘Nian-Made Small World.’","Should his realm advance one more step and complete the development of the Man-Made Small World, he would be able to arrange for all his friends and family, regardless of the number.","Once his parents were settled, he would adjust his condition and progress further!","Only by elevating his realm and strengthening himself could he truly integrate with the Man-Made Small World.","Only when his fists were powerful enough would he be qualified to pursue his own ambitions and follow his chosen path.","This lifetime would not have been in vain!","“In addition, I can’t say for certain whether there will be danger in the outside world. However, one thing is clear: regardless of Earth’s fate, if you both continue to stay in Wenzhou City, you will undoubtedly be in harm’s way,” Song Shuhang stated earnestly.","“Why?” Papa Song looked bewildered.","“Because of me, of course,” Song Shuhang pointed at himself. “As I mentioned,","I’ve gained some recognition in the world of cultivators. In the near future, numerous big shots will come to challenge me. During this period, there’s a high chance you’ll get caught up in it.”","Mama Song was rendered speechless.","Papa Song nodded. “l understand what you mean. I’ll select the first group of relatives and friends and discuss it with them. I’ll try to come up with a reason that they’ll find acceptable.”","Soft Feather’s ‘refuge reason’ would likely incite panic among her friends and family, so it wasn’t suitable. Papa Song would have to think of a milder explanation, one that wouldn’t cause anxiety among his friends and relatives, while still bringing a group of his closest friends and relatives into the Confucian faction.","“For those relatives and friends who are relatively distant, we can offer door m to-door service,” Song Shuhang added.","“Alright, I’ll talk it over with your mother,” Papa Song said. He took out his phone and began swiping through it.","This decision wasn’t an easy one.","Mama Song furrowed her brow and contemplated while searching for suitable candidates.","While Papa Song and Mama Song were deep in thought, Song Shuhang took the opportunity to cast a spell and create numerous white lotus flowers while distributing them to Sixteen, Soft Feather, the virtuous lamia, and Fairy Creation.","“How many days are we staying here?” Pavilion Master Chu asked while appearing somewhat dazed.","Song Shuhang stood up and walked to the window. He gazed at the outside world and replied, “Three to four days should suffice.”","“Senior Song, should we go and deal with Evil Wang now?” Soft Feather held a white lotus in each hand, raised her head, and inquired. “What’s Evil Wang?” Mama Song asked with a sharp tone.","The name sounded dangerous.","“Hmm, a small menace? Or perhaps an ingredient?” Song Shuhang responded.","Mama Song was confused.","Su Clan’s Sixteen elucidated with a smile, “Evil and delusional entities are malevolent beings that can harm ordinary people. It’s easier to deal with them while they’re still weak.”","“Could it be dangerous?” Mama Song expressed some concern.","Song Shuhang patted his chest. “Mom, don’t worry. Compared to them, your son is in even greater danger.”","Mama Song was left speechless.","As they conversed, a phone began to ring.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw Papa Songs phone.","“Is Dad already contacting people?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“No, it’s an unknown number. Could it be someone still trying to sell their products at this hour? They’re certainly dedicated,” Papa Song remarked with a smile as he answered the call.","“Hello, is this Mr. Song?” A gentle female voice emanated from the phone. The voice sounded practiced, designed to create a positive impression.","“And who might you be?” Papa Song asked.","“We are responsible for conducting tests on expectant mothers who are pregnant this year. Is your wife at home today? If it’s convenient, we can send a professional over to check on your wife and register the child’s information,” the gentle woman replied.","Ah, that’s what it was. The morning news on television had mentioned this.","“I’m at home. You can come over anytime,” Papa Song said. Then, he suddenly looked at Song Shuhang and asked, “Shuhang, do you want to get tested as well?”","“No, my situation is a bit special. Actually, I’m not pregnant. I can’t explain it clearly at the moment. Once you and Mom calm down, I’ll explain the cause and effect to you in detail.” Song Shuhang waved his hand.","He wasn’t actually pregnant; it was just an exaggeration.","“Alright, then our professionals will be at your house soon. Please be prepared,” the gentle woman said.","Song Shuhang looked out the window and scanned the area with his divine sense.","Sure enough, about a kilometer away, a medical vehicle started to move and","headed toward Song Shuhang’s house.","The reason Song Shuhang was so sure about this car was that two out of the three professionals in the vehicle possessed ‘spiritual energy’ and were low-level cultivators.","As expected, China had already made arrangements for the world’s metamorphosis.","After a moment of contemplation, Song Shuhang faintly smiled, took out Sixteen’s mask, and put it on.","“What are you doing?” Papa Song asked.","“This mask...” Song Shuhang said with a smile. “To avoid startling the youngsters in the cultivation world, I think it’s best if I wear a mask.” “You’re just fooling around. You’re even scarier when you wear a mask, you know?” Papa Song didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","At this moment, Papa Song and Mama Song had no inkling of how terrifying their son, Tyrannical Song, was in the world of cultivation.."]},{"number":2512,"title":"Chapter 2512: Song Shuhang in the Corner","paragraphs":["Chapter 2512: Song Shuhang in the Corner","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang quietly withdrew his divine sense. With his current level of cultivation and mastery over his mental energy, the two young cultivators in the ambulance remained completely unaware of Song Shuhangs mental energy sweeping over them.","The difference in cultivation levels was immense.","The two young cultivators in the ambulance had no idea that they were on their way to the home of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. Their mission: to perform a fetus test for his biological mother and record the birth of his soon-to-arrive sibling.","If they knew the truth, not even a million spirit stones would have convinced them to come.","Their profession involved assisting others with baby testing, not undergoing tests themselves.","Sometimes, ignorance was a form of bliss. At least, before they laid eyes on Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the three ambulance staff members were chatting happily and expectantly.","“The next stop is Mr. Songs residence. His wife is expecting their second child. She became pregnant just two months ago and is due this year. According to the information, their eldest son is already quite mature, likely in university,” remarked the scholar-like cultivator on the left, known as Vast Sea Scholar. He hailed from the Overseas Immortal Islands and had affiliations with the scholarly faction, assisting officials as part of his ‘worldly entry’ duties.","“In other words, the age gap between the two children is more than 18 years? That’s unusual among regular folks,” noted the young Daoist nun named ‘Miaoqing,’ who stood beside him.","“It couldn’t be helped. After all, the two-child policy has only recently been implemented. A few years ago, having a second child was illegal,” added the lady who was driving and had previously spoken to Papa Song. Her voice was gentle and amiable, but she was not a cultivator; she was just an ordinary person.","“In other words, Mr. Songs wife shouldn’t be young... Let’s hope everything goes well with the fetus, given her age and condition,” Eon Sea Scholar softly expressed his concerns. As a newcomer to the mortal realm, he felt compassion for the worldly joys and sorrows.","Miao Qing, seated beside him, perused the information about Papa Song and suddenly whispered, “Surname Song.”","The name ‘Song had become quite prominent in the cultivation world lately, all thanks to ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,’ who kept changing his status every month.","Eon Sea Scholar couldn’t help but inhale sharply.","The lady driver noticed the sudden change in the expressions of the two ‘experts’ in her rearview mirror and felt a faint sense of curiosity. Nevertheless, she refrained from asking further questions, not wanting to inadvertently reopen old wounds.","Miao Qing gently closed the dossier containing information about Papa Song and Mama Song. She couldn’t tell if it was a psychological illusion, but when she connected the ‘Song’ surname to the enigmatic figure who went by","‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,’ she couldn’t shake the feeling that this ‘Mister Song was somehow familiar.","The ambulance soon arrived at Baijing Street, right below Song Shuhangs house.","The lady driver, accompanied by Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing, exited the vehicle.","Both the scholar and the Daoist nun lightly touched their ‘Daoist robes,’ and their attire seamlessly transformed into that of medical personnel.","“The spiritual energy here is abundant. By past standards, it could qualify as a spiritual site,” Eon Sea Scholar remarked as he assessed the surroundings ot Song Shuhangs residence.","Since the world’s transformation had begun, spiritual energy had erupted worldwide, resembling a volcanic surge. Many ordinary residential areas now met the criteria for being considered spiritual sites.","“The greater the spiritual energy, the higher the likelihood of fetal anomalies. Let’s hope the mother and child remain safe,” Miao Qing whispered.","“That’s why we’re here for the test, to ensure a smooth process,” Eon Sea Scholar said with a smile. “This upcoming generation of children about to be born will be a valuable asset to the entire cultivation world. Let’s proceed.”","The lady with the pleasant voice nodded and approached Song Shuhangs house, pressing the doorbell.","“I’m here. Please wait a moment,” replied Papa Song.","Then, he turned to his son and instructed, “Shuhang, the person checking on your mother’s fetus has arrived. Go downstairs and let them in.”","When Papa Song turned, he caught sight of Song Shuhang once again wearing his peculiar mask while standing motionless by the window.","Not only that, but Song Shuhang had also gathered Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather by his side. The three of them stood in a row, seemingly absorbed in the view outside.","Papa Song was bewildered.","“Ahem, are you sure you want me to open the door?” Song Shuhang chuckled dryly.","Papa Songs mouth twitched.","After Papa Song descended the stairs to greet the medical team, Song Shuhang, Su Clan’s Sixteen, and Soft Feather huddled even closer together. At the same time, Song Shuhang recalled Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia.","Lady Onion remained tucked in Song Shuhangs pocket.","Mama Song exited her room and saw her son clustered by the window. She inquired curiously, “What are you all up to?”","“It’s nothing, Mom. I’m doing my best to keep a low profile. You don’t need to worry about me,” Song Shuhang reassured her.","Mama Song was at a loss for words.","In the past, she would have undoubtedly investigated what her son was up to.","However, now, after seeing Su Clan’s Sixteen, Soft Feather, and Song Shuhang huddled together, Mama Song secretly dismissed the idea.","It was good that the two young girls were having fun.","Downstairs, Papa song led the three medical personnel up to the house.","“Do I need to prepare anything? Like boiling some water or anything else?” Papa Song inquired as they walked.","“No need, no need. Our testing method this time is different from the past,” Eon Sea Scholar replied with a smile.","Mr. Song appeared remarkably youthful, even younger than his information indicated.","It seemed highly likely that he had benefited from the ongoing changes in the world.","Papa Song nodded. “By the way, can you determine if it’s a girl or a boy?”","“Mr. Song, it makes no difference whether it’s a boy or a girl. Girls are just as precious as boys,” Eon Sea Scholar stated earnestly. In this day and age, favoring one gender over the other seemed outdated.","“Yes, that’s true,” Papa Song agreed. “It would be wonderful if it’s a girl. We already have a son at home, and having another one would be a bit monotonous.”","Daoist Nun Miao Qing was left speechless.","Upon entering the house, Mama Song approached them.","“Is this Madam?” Eon Sea Scholar looked at Mama Song with surprise once again. She appeared incredibly young.","This couple seemed exceptionally fortunate to have been beneficiaries of this world’s spiritual power transformation.","“Do we need to come inside for testing?” Mama Song asked.","“No need, no need. We can conduct the test right here,” Eon Sea Scholar assured her with a smile.","Speaking of which... ever since he had entered the room, he couldn’t shake the feeling that something was amiss with his entire being.","Eon Sea Scholar’s gaze started to roam around the room.","However, after scanning the surroundings, he found nothing out of the ordinary.","“Peculiar,” Eon Sea Scholar mused.."]},{"number":2513,"title":"Chapter 2513: The Premature Arrival of a Chilly Night","paragraphs":["Chapter 2513: The Premature Arrival of a Chilly Night","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Beside him, Daoist Nun Miao Qing pretended to retrieve what appeared to be a highly intricate set of instruments from her luggage.","However, in reality, this set of instruments was merely for show, a mere facade.","The genuine ‘detection device’ was still in the midst of accelerated development. The sudden upheaval of the world had left many things unprepared. True time waits for no one.","As a result, until the practical ‘detection equipment’ was ready, the task of detection had to be performed manually.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing had brought out this complex set of instruments to enhance credibility... When the family members of the pregnant women undergoing testing saw these intricate instruments, they inexplicably felt a sense of reassurance. This would make the subsequent fetal testing process proceed more smoothly.","Once the high-end instrument was set up in the living room, Daoist Nun Miao Qing gestured for Mama Song to take a seat in front of the instrument and place her hand into a device resembling a blood pressure cuff.","Seizing this moment, Daoist Nun Miao Qing discreetly checked Mama Songs pulse while casting a spell in secret while enveloping Mama Songs body with her mental power. Alongside a specialized spell designed to assess the fetus’s condition, she scrutinized the physical state of both the pregnant woman and the fetus.","Standing by the side, the Vast Sea Scholar discreetly performed hand seals to assist Daoist Nun Miao Qing during the examination.","Papa Song appeared somewhat anxious.","A series of incomprehensible data appeared on the device’s screen.","Eon Sea Scholar pretended to examine the data and then addressed Papa Song and Mama Song with a serious tone, “The pregnant woman is in excellent health, with no issues whatsoever. The fetus is developing well. Mr. Song, as long as you and your wife continue to maintain good health, there should be no problems with the fetus’s well-being.”","Papa Song nodded slightly, then kept glancing at the Eon Sea Scholar. Was it a male or female?","“Mr. Song, please don’t worry. Our responsibility is solely to assess the child’s health and various conditions. We are not tasked with determining the child’s gender,” Eon Sea Scholar reassured him with a smile.","Papa Song was rendered speechless.","After Eon Sea Scholar finished speaking, he continued to focus on the instrument’s screen. In secret, he initiated a telepathic conversation with Daoist Nun Miao Qing, asking, “How is the fetus’s data? Has it been influenced by external spiritual energy?”","A child conceived during the world’s transformation was likely to be affected by spiritual energy. However, this effect was not entirely positive. Most babies couldn’t withstand the interference of spiritual energy and might experience unfavorable mutations.","Eon Sea Scholar and the others were on a mission to determine whether the fetus had been affected by the world’s transformation. If it had, they needed to determine whether the change was beneficial or malignant.","If it was a positive transformation, this child would possess great potential. They would be responsible for documenting the child’s information, and a series of support systems would be put in place upon the child’s birth.","If it was a malignant mutation, the Vast Sea Scholar would step in to mitigate the malignant symptoms as much as possible. If the mutation was too severe for him to handle, they would need to report it.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing frowned and replied, “l am certain that this fetus has been influenced by the world’s transformation. However, its data differs slightly from all the other tested babies. It deviates significantly from the standard data. Let me examine it more closely.”","Eon Sea Scholar was puzzled by this deviation and inquired, “Significant deviation? How is it different?”","Daoist Nun Miao Qing pondered for a moment and then explained, “If the data from previously tested affected fetuses could be likened to a smooth arc, the data from Mrs. Songs fetus resembles a fluctuating, intense, and wavy line.","The degree of fluctuation is akin to Dharma King Creation’s singing.”","Eon Sea Scholar was taken aback. Senior Dharma King Creation’s singing? Was it that pronounced?","“So, is this type of change a benign evolution or a malignant mutation?” Eon Sea Scholar inquired with some apprehension.","“l cannot say for certain yet... Wait, something is amiss. The data appears to have changed once again. The intense fluctuation we observed earlier did not capture the fetus’s information. The real fetal data is concealed beneath it,” Miao Qing exclaimed, surprised.","The recent data change seemed to stem from another ‘source’ connected to the pregnant woman’s bloodline. The genuine data had been obscured by data that resembled the ‘fluctuations of Dharma King Creation’s singing voice.’","“Could it be twins? No, that’s unlikely. This situation appears to be influenced by an external force,” Miao Qing mused.","She began to probe further.","After careful observation and contemplation, she sensed that the exaggerated fluctuation data likely represented a form of ‘merit’ silently protecting the fetus.","The genuine fetal data concealed beneath the fluctuating data displayed a gentle upwara curve.","“It’s a favorable response. After being influenced by the power of heaven and earth during the world’s transformation, the fetus exhibited a positive change. The curve is smooth and well-defined and indicates exceptional progress. As for the previous fluctuations, they were likely the result of this couple or one of their family members accumulating significant merits through good deeds. This merit not only shields them but also blesses their family,” Miao Qing surmised.","“The power of great virtue? How significant is this merit?” Eon Sea Scholar asked, puzzled. Could there be cultivators in Mr. Songs family?","“In short, the fetus is in excellent condition, displaying a remarkable positive evolution. Document it for now,” Miao Qing responded.","Her level of insight was limited, so she could only make educated guesses.","Such outstanding test results might attract the attention of elders from major sects. If they were fortunate, the child in Madam Songs womb might have a bright future.","Eon Sea Scholar nodded and said, “Very well, I will handle the documentation. Gradually withdraw your spell, ensuring not to rush. We must avoid any disruption to the pregnant woman or the fetus.”","Miao Qing nodded and exhaled softly. With a deliberate thought, she began to conclude her spell.","Her spiritual energy receded from the fetus, then from the layer of protection with intense fluctuations, and finally, slowly withdrew from Mama Songs body.","Everything proceeded smoothly.","However, just as Daoist Nun Miao Qing’s mental energy completely retreated from Mama Songs body, an unexpected occurrence took place. Her spiritual energy was triggered.","Under the influence of this sudden sensation, she involuntarily turned her head to gaze at a corner of the window.","After performing the spell, her spiritual energy might have carried a trace of the ‘violent fluctuation’ aura. Guided by this karmic connection, her eyes widened.","Suddenly, she spotted three figures huddled together by the window, concealed beneath a thin sheet.","The central figure wore a familiar mask and, despite being curled up, exuded a terrifying aura that left one breathless.","Though it was still early outside, Daoist Nun Miao Qing felt a shiver coursing through her entire body, as if the chill of night had descended upon her.."]},{"number":2514,"title":"Chapter 2514: Dad, Do You See How Awesome I Am?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2514: Dad, Do You See How Awesome I Am?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Standing beside the masked figure was a petite fairy and a fairy with long, eye-catching legs. The three of them were wrapped in a blanket, huddled together, which should have been quite a comical sight. However, Daoist Nun Miao Qing couldn’t find it amusing at all.","This group, these three members...","“Ancient Sage Ling Die Zi!”","“Profound Sage Su Shan!”","And the terrifying figure whose name alone could make people uneasy.","“Ba... Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!” Miao Qing involuntarily exclaimed.","Her sudden exclamation startled Eon Sea Scholar, Papa Song, and Mama Song.","“What?” Eon Sea Scholar’s body stiffened upon hearing the name. “What?”","Why did Fellow Daoist Miao Qing suddenly utter this indescribable name?","“Ba... Tyrannical Song...” Miao Qing pointed at a corner of the window, her tongue tied, and her speech stuttering. Papa Song could even discern the sobbing in her voice.","Mama Song turned her head and looked at the culprit hiding in the corner of the window – Song Shuhang.","‘Tyrannical Song seemed to be his son’s Daoist name. Song Shuhang had mentioned this matter during their earlier conversation.","Was my son truly that intimidating?","“T-T-Senior Song!” Eon Sea Scholar finally saw this legendary presence under the guidance of Daoist Nun Miao Qing.","The next moment, Eon Sea Scholar’s mind went blank.","Why would Senior Tyrannical Song appear here? Didn’t this formidable senior just complete his fifth divinity show? He should be very occupied at the moment, shouldn’t he?","Was it an illusion?","No, it wasn’t an illusion! He was indeed the genuine Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, and he was standing a mere five meters away. Now, they were all breathing the same air!","In an instant, a myriad of thoughts surged through his mind.","But why was Senior Tyrannical Song here? Why were they the focus of Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs attention?","There was no apparent reason.","They were just ordinary cultivators; there was no justification for attracting Senior Tyrannical Songs attention.","Eon Sea Scholar couldn’t fathom it.","He instinctively reached out to press his abdomen.","Instinctively, he sought to avoid the gaze of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, but his feet wouldn’t obey his commands, so he didn’t dare to move.","Papa Song observed the two trembling staff members, then shifted his gaze to his son.","Was his son some sort of demon?","Why were these two staff members, whom he had never seen before, so terrified?","The scene remained silent.","The lady who had led the way with a pleasant voice also noted the strange situation and refrained from speaking hastily.","After a brief pause...","“Shuhang?” Papa Song called out.","What had his son done to incur the wrath of the heavens and the fear of these people? How could he instill such terror in others?","“Sigh.” Song Shuhang pushed up his mask and stretched out his hand to remove the sheets.","Some individuals were akin to the sun in the sky – regardless of how they concealed themselves, they would inevitably be discovered.","“l knew we couldn’t keep it hidden,” Soft Feather giggled.","Su Clan’s Sixteen extended her hand and accepted the ‘sheet’ from Song Shuhangs hand, her face blushing.","“Cough, what did you say again?” Song Shuhang waved his hand and remarked, “Don’t be frightened. I won’t devour you. Please, calm down and don’t alarm my family.”","Years of experience had endowed Song Shuhang with the demeanor of a great senior.’","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing took a deep breath and attempted to regain their composure.","Moreover, what had Profound Sage Tyrannical Song just said?","His family?","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing couldn’t help but glance at the seemingly youthful Song couple,","Could it be that this Song couple were descendants of Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs bloodline?","So that was the explanation. This clarified why Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had appeared here! For a great senior like Senior Tyrannical Song, he could enter seclusion for a thousand years or even longer.","It wasn’t uncommon for him to seek out his own descendants after emerging from seclusion.","“No wonder I sensed a resemblance between Mr. Song and Senior Tyrannical","Song when 1 read his information. It turns out he’s a descendant of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. [If that’s the case, the child in Mrs. Larsson’s womb is truly extraordinary!” Miao Qing pondered to herself.","With an ancestor like Senior Tyrannical Song overseeing the situation, coupled with the exceptional potential of Madam Songs unborn child, once this child was born, it would undoubtedly become the most prominent figure of its era. Such fortune was enviable.","Having confirmed the reason for Senior Tyrannical Songs presence, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing felt considerably more at ease.","“Eon Sea Scholar, a disciple of Book Sword Pavilion of the Overseas Immortal Islands, extends greetings to Senior Tyrannical Song, Ancient Sage Spirit Butterfly, and Sage Monarch Su Shan.” Eon Sea Scholar respectfully bowed to Song Shuhang, Soft Feather, and Su Clan’s Sixteen.","“X-xiu disciple Miao Qing extends greetings to Ba... Senior Tyrannical Song,","Senior Spirit Butterfly, and Senior Su Shan.” Miao Qing was still tongue-tied. “There’s no need for such formality,” Song Shuhang pushed his mask upwards, revealing the lower half of his face.","After saying all this, Song Shuhangs consciousness began to search through his ‘bracelet space’ and ‘Inner World,’ hoping to find something suitable to give to the juniors.","However, after a lengthy search, he failed to locate any suitable treasures. King Kun’s treasures were too high-level; it wouldn’t be appropriate to reward the younger generation with them.","He had already depleted all the low-level treasures and spoils of war he had acquired in the past, leaving only a few small storage bottles of the immortals.","Was he supposed to resort to giving them bottles again?","Awkward.","After considering his options, he decided to bestow a wooden saber as a token of appreciation. The wooden saber harbored his saber intent, and the saber intent armor on it could shield low-level cultivators from a fatal blow.","“It’s our first encounter, and I don’t possess anything exceptional to offer you both,” Song Shuhang said with a smile while reaching out his hand to retrieve the wooden saber.","However, he was oblivious to the fact that the moment he made this statement, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing were on the verge of tears due to fear.","Could they accept this gift?","Everyone in the cultivation world knew that Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs most formidable ability was to give birth with his gaze.","Were they going to get pregnant?","“No need, Senior Tyrannical Song; there’s genuinely no need. It’s our responsibility, and we would never dare accept your rewards,” Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing hastily declined while waving their hands.","Observing the terrified expressions of the two Daoists, Song Shuhangs hand holding the wooden saber froze for a moment.","How could they communicate like this?","The atmosphere grew awkward once more.","Forget it, let’s set aside the gift for now.","“Ahem,” Song Shuhang cleared his throat and turned to Papa Song while remarking, “So, Dad, did you witness that? Actually, I’m quite renowned in the cultivation world.’","“You’re not merely a little famous. If you were just a little famous, then there wouldn’t be any famous individuals in the myriad worlds.” Scholar and Daoist Nun thought to themselves.","However, a moment later, their minds were suddenly jolted.","Wait, what did Profound Sage Tyrannical Song just call Mr. Song?","Dad?","Could they have misheard? Dad?","This Mr.. Song wasn’t a descendant of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song; he was his father?"]},{"number":2515,"title":"Chapter 2515: The Real Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 2515: The Real Deal","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Alternatively, could it be that this Mr. Songs Daoist name was shortened to something like ‘Dad’ in pronunciation, so Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was calling him by his Daoist name?","“How is that possible? Who would simply pronounce someone else’s Daoist name as ‘Dad’!”","If there really was such a Daoist name that took advantage of others, he would have been beaten to death long ago.","So, could this Mr. Song really be the father of Tyrannical Song?","But no matter how you looked at him, this Mr. Song appeared to be an ordinary person who had never cultivated... He was not a high-level expert who had experienced the trials of the cultivation world.","How could he possibly be the father of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song? After all, with Senior Tyrannical Songs strength and realm, he was undoubtedly an ancient giant who had cultivated for thousands of years.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing looked at Mr. Song in confusion.","Even if they racked their brains, they couldn’t figure out how this Mr. Song could become Tyrannical Songs father.","Song Shuhang noticed the confusion on the faces of the two young cultivators. He smiled and said, “Let me introduce you two to each other. This is my dad, my biological dad. The one next to him is my mom, also my biological mom.","You don’t have to doubt that.”","“It’s actually true, biological?” Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing looked at Nir. and Mrs. Song in shock. The disbelief was written all over their faces.","His parents were speechless.","Why did it seem so shocking to outsiders that their son was their biological child?","The husband and wife exchanged glances. It seemed that Song Shuhang was truly powerful in the cultivation world.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing were stunned for a moment, but they quickly regained their composure.","After all, they were already qualified to “leave the mountain.” Although they were still puzzled and shocked, they managed to calm themselves down.","“Greetings!” Eon Sea Scholar turned to Mr. Song and Mrs. Song and bowed.","“I’m Eon Sea Scholar, a disciple of the Book Sword Pavilion from the Overseas Immortal Islands. Greetings...” Wait a minute.","What should they call them?","What should Tyrannical Songs dad be called?","What should Tyrannical Songs mom be called?","Tyrannical Songs father? Daddy Tyrannical Song? Dad?","Tyrannical Songs mother? Tyrannical Songs mother? Mom?","It felt wrong no matter how they called them.","Eon Sea Scholar’s brain was working overtime. He needed to choose the most suitable form of address in the shortest time possible to address Senior Tyrannical Songs father and mother.","“Song Clan Patriarch!” Finally, an idea flashed in Eon Sea Scholar’s mind, and he found a suitable name. Then, he turned slightly to Mrs. Song and said, “Greetings, Patriarch Fairy Zhao!”","Song Family Patriarch Mr. Song: ” ! ! ! ”","Patriarch Fairy Zhao Mrs. Song:","Mr. Song was only forty-five years old this year, and yet he was given the title of patriarch... Nirs. Song was one year younger than him.","Normally, those with the title of patriarch should have their names engraved on the memorial tablet and be buried in the grave.","The couple glared at their son who was smiling foolishly on the side. It seemed that their son’s status in the cultivation world was definitely not as simple as just being a little famous.","On the side, Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen secretly chuckled.","With Eon Sea Scholar leading the way, Daoist Nun Miao Qing quickly followed.","“I’m Daoist Nun Miao Qing, a disciple of Xiuyou Sect. Greetings, Song Clan Patriarch. Greetings, Patriarch Fairy Zhao.”","“No need to be so formal,” Mr. Song didn’t know how to face these two workers.","After the formalities, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing secretly sighed in relief. At least they had passed the hurdle of addressing them. Then, the two young cultivators secretly glanced at Mr. Song and Mrs. Song.","Their minds continued to speculate about all sorts of possibilities.","“Could Senior Tyrannical Song possess a secret reincarnation technique? Did he use Mr. Song and his wife’s bodies for reincarnation in this life?”","“Or perhaps, Mr. Song and his wife are ancient beings who were sealed by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in ice, and they were only recently unsealed?","To find a way out for their biological parents in this Great Era?”","Strange thoughts filled the minds of the scholar and Daoist nun.","The most powerful ability of humans was their imagination... Faced with something that was unreasonable but true, the human brain would automatically fill in the gaps and try to make it as logical as possible.","“Please, have a seat and rest. Explaining about my parents is a bit complicated, and you won’t believe it right away. But I can assure you that I am indeed their biological son.” Song Shuhang invited the two young cultivators and the lady with the pleasant voice to sit and rest.","The Daoist nun, scholar, and lady squeezed onto a two-seater sofa, trembling with trepidation.","Mr. Song and Mrs. Song sat down nearby.","“Don’t be worried. My parents haven’t started cultivating formally yet, so if you’re too nervous, they’ll hold back. Come, let me give you a welcome gift.” After saying this, Song Shuhang reached out and pointed.","A layer of spatial ripples appeared behind him to reveal the exit to the Inner World.","Then, three saber lights flashed from the Inner World and landed in the hands of the Daoist nun, scholar, and lady.","It was Song Shuhangs ‘Coordinates Wooden Saber.’ The blade was made from the branches of the headless wooden body, and it bore a protective saber intent from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, as well as the spatial imprint of the Magical Weapon Mirror.","Not to mention anything else, just the blade itself was a precious raw material for wood-type magic tools. Even if these sprouts were produced through spiritual power, their strength was still at the Fifth Stage.","For ordinary cultivators, the wooden saber itself was a precious treasure.","“This wooden saber was something I casually carved when I had nothing to do. It has a protective saber intent attached to it. It can protect you once in danger.” Song Shuhang introduced it.","At this moment, he unintentionally emitted the aura of a true senior. The more big shots he talked to, the more he became a big shot. It was like the logic of a good doctor.","“Thank you, Senior Tyrannical Song.” Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing quickly and carefully put away the wooden blade.","As expected of a great senior. Anything that flowed out from between his fingers was a treasure to small cultivators like them.","Also... The two of them had just noticed that the moment the spatial ripple behind Profound Sage Tyrannical Song opened, several terrifying auras surged out. Even if that aura only flashed for a moment, it made their bodies stiffen and they couldn’t help but tremble.","Thank you, Senior Tyrannical Song.” The lady with the pleasant voice also bowed. Although she was an ordinary person, she knew how precious this treasure was.","“How’s the condition of the fetus in my mother’s womb?” Song Shuhang casually asked.","“Senior Tyrannical Songs younger sister is in an excellent state. Under the influence of the great change in the world, she is in a positive state of evolution. With Senior Tyrannical Songs virtue and blessings protecting her, her birth will be safe and smooth.” Daoist Nun Xuan Qing hurriedly said.","“It’s a younger sister.” Song Shuhang pinched his chin.","“It’s a daughter.” Papa Song pinched his chin.","The father and son nodded in tacit agreement, their faces filled with satisfaction.."]},{"number":2516,"title":"Chapter 2516: Bestowing Fortune Upon The Unborn Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 2516: Bestowing Fortune Upon The Unborn Girl","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“It’s also a disease to favor women over men. It has to be treated. Men and women are equal. We can’t favor this over that. We can’t favor that and despise this.” thought Eon Sea Scholar to himself.","However, he only dared to think about it in his heart and did not dare to openly advocate for it.","Although he was inwardly upright and kind, when faced with a figure of authority like Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, he could only strategically yield.","Song Shuhang conversed with the Daoist nun, the scholar, and the lady for a while.","He aimed to comprehend the measures that China had taken in response to the world’s metamorphosis, how to stabilize the situation during this chaotic period, and if there was any way he could offer assistance.","Eon Sea Scholar answered Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs questions one by one.","“At present, the most pressing issue we’re dealing with is the appearance of Wang in various places. The nature of evil is highly changeable, and each type of evil requires a different approach for resolution. Fortunately, some sects in different parts of China have emerged from seclusion and taken the initiative to clear the malevolent spirits around their sects, sharing the burden.","According to my teacher, the problem of malevolence and fantasy is a headache for all worlds,” Eon Sea Scholar replied.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing added regretfully, “It’s a pity that Senior Tyrannical Songs last speech has already concluded... Actually, many of us juniors were eagerly anticipating Senior Tyrannical Songs monthly speeches to learn how to deal with Evil.’","It must be said that Senior Tyrannical Songs speeches inspired both fear and admiration. The greater the fear, the deeper the admiration.","Every time Senior Tyrannical Song began a speech, everyone would tremble with apprehension. Yet, 99-9% of fellow cultivators chose to grit their teeth and listen to Senior Tyrannical Songs speeches.","How delightful!","As soon as Daoist Nun Miao Qing finished speaking, Song Shuhangs eyes suddenly brightened! A powerful spiritual force surged, manifesting as a faint gleam in his eyes.","Fortunately, his eyes were concealed by a mask—he now wore it halfway and reveal the lower half of his face. The two openings on the mask didn’t align with his eyes, so the person opposite him couldn’t see his eyes.","Otherwise, if his eyes lit up, Daoist Nun Miao Qing and Eon Sea Scholar would cry out and call him “Mister Shiny Eyes.”","“Marvelous, marvelous!” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","The new approach to his speeches was a success!","Cultivators across the universe believed that he had delivered his final speech —even he himself believed it was his last.","But in reality, he still had a chance to deliver the ultimate speech.","The highest level of deception was deceiving oneself.","“After 1 bring my parents to the Golden Lotus World, I’ll begin preparations to break through to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm. Then, I’ll publicly reveal my divinity and commence the final round of my speeches.”","The content of the lecture was already in place—he would discuss “365 Ways to Confront Evil and Extravagance in Times of Great Change in Heaven and Earth”!","Additionally, in the coming days, if he, Soft Feather, and Su Clan’s Sixteen discovered a way to deal with Evil Wang, he could add a short chapter at the end of the lecture titled “How to Fry Evil Wang Until It Turns Golden, Making the Senior Next Door in Seclusion Envious.’","In China, no matter what kind of monster it was, as long as it had value as food or medicine, it wouldn’t have room to grow unchecked. At that time, Evil Wang would have to undergo artificial breeding.","Song Shuhang rubbed his chin and silently nodded.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing were puzzled.","Sixteen, Soft Feather, let’s go try to eliminate some Evil Wang in a little while,” Song Shuhang couldn’t contain his excitement any longer, and numerous plans began to form in his mind.","Soft Feather beamed with joy. “Senior Song, you’ve said so much today, but this sentence is my favorite!”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded and then said to Eon Sea Scholar, “Do you have information about the distribution of malevolent forces in Wenzhou City? Among them, mark the ones that are stronger and more challenging to deal with. While we’re still in Wenzhou, we’ll do our best to assist in eliminating the more troublesome ones.’","“Senior Tyrannical Song, Senior Su Shan, Senior Spirit Butterfly, are you all going to collaborate?” the scholar and Daoist nun across from them asked with excitement.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Since I have some free time, I’ll help exterminate a batch of Evil Wang for fun. Additionally, I need to conduct some experiments that require the use of Evil.”","“No problem,” Eon Sea Scholar said enthusiastically. “Senior Tyrannical Song, please wait a moment. I’ll immediately contact the elders and transmit the required information.”","The Evil Wang in Wenzhou City was fated to meet a tragic end. It was growing up in Senior Tyrannical Songs hometown—a sure path to its demise!","Having said that, Eon Sea Scholar took out his phone and made a call to contact the elders.","On the other side, Daoist Nun Miao Qing contemplated for a moment and then asked with anticipation, “Senior Tyrannical Song, would you allow the two of us to observe from the sidelines while you deal with Evil Wang?”","Senior Tyrannical Song personally taking action was a tremendous opportunity!","Although they might not understand the principles behind Senior Tyrannical Songs battles, they could at least learn from watching him fight.","If they were fortunate enough to comprehend even a single move, it could benefit them for a lifetime!","Such an opportunity was not to be missed.","“Of course. With you two leading the way, it will be easier to locate these Wang,” Song Shuhang donned his mask and chuckled like a seasoned expert.","“Thank you, Senior Tyrannical Song!” Miao Qing expressed her gratitude.","Being in the presence of Senior Tyrannical Song in person seemed more intimate than when he was delivering speeches. Additionally, she could also sense that even being within five meters of Senior Tyrannical Song made her mind exceptionally clear, and her spirit became more sensitive.","From time to time, insights related to cultivation flashed through her mind.","This was the joy of being a newbie alongside a big shot. Big shots had their own laws, and their existence was a complex combination of information laws. As long as a newbie stayed by the side of a big shot, they would reap endless benefits.","“l really wish I could hang around Senior Tyrannical Song.” Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing shared the same thought.","Just as they were lost in thought, Eon Sea Scholar’s phone rang.","“It’s here,” Eon Sea Scholar answered the call with a smile.","The phone number was an internal one, indicating that it should be a senior.","“Hello, Senior,” Eon Sea Scholar greeted.","“Hahaha, you must be Eon Sea from the Book Sword Pavilion. I’m Master Ming Heng of the Longevity Sword Sect. I was very pleased when I saw that you uploaded information about a girl with excellent aptitude named Song. By the way, are you still at the Song family’s house? Wait for me for a moment; I’ll immediately fly over on my sword and bestow good fortune upon this unborn little girl.” A jovial voice sounded on the phone.","The Southern Longevity Sword Sect was the sect of the Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da, the Head of the Dog Head Building. It was a renowned sect in the cultivation world.."]},{"number":2517,"title":"Chapter 2517: Papa Song, Grandpa?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2517: Papa Song, Grandpa?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Eon Sea Scholar felt a sense of confusion.","Senior Niing Hengzi of the Longevity Sword Sect hadn’t come to share information about the distribution of evil forces in Wenzhou City. Instead, he had traveled a great distance to meet Tyrannical Songs yet-to-be-born sister.","“Wait, Senior Ming Hengzi, please hold on for a moment. You see, this unborn little girl, a member of the Song family, already possesses great fortune,” Eon Sea Scholar hastily interjected.","She was none other than the younger sister of the renowned Tyrannical Song, connected by blood. While most children were born with silver spoons in their mouths, she had been born with the potential of an immortal. The moment Tyrannical Songs biological sister came into the world, over 90% of cultivators across the universe would have to show her respect. With the influential backing of Big Boss Tyrannical Song and her exceptional aptitude, her future as a renowned figure in the universe was all but assured.","Previously, Daoist Nun Miao Qing had been tasked with investigating information about Big Boss Tyrannical Songs younger sister. Eon Sea Scholar’s responsibility had been to relay the information about this unborn sibling. When they had transmitted the details, they had not been aware of the girl’s true identity which led to an omission in the information.","“Great fortune? Someone else has already laid claim to it?” Senior Ming Hengzi of the Longevity Sword Sect was taken aback.","He had contacted the scholar immediately upon learning this information. Little did he expect that someone else had acted faster than him.","Senior Ming Hengzi was reluctant to accept this turn of events. “Who was so swift as to preempt me? Eon Sea Scholar, reveal their identity, and I will confront them.”","If such a gifted girl could be recruited into the Eternal Sword Sect, she might well become the sect’s future cornerstone. To lose such a treasure to someone else was a missed opportunity worth a hundred million regrets.","Eon Sea Scholar was at a loss for words.","Quietly, he cast a glance at Senior Tyrannical Song, who happened to be within earshot. Old man Tyrannical song?","Though the voice on the phone was not particularly loud, Senior Tyrannical Song stood no more than five meters away, likely having heard Senior Ming Hengzi’s words.","Fortunately, Senior Tyrannical Song appeared unperturbed, even offering a sincere smile. “It’s impressive that you recognize my sister’s exceptional talent, Senior Ming Hengzi.”","Relieved, the Eon Sea Scholar replied, “Senior Ming Hengzi, it’s not a matter of someone beating you to it. It’s just that this young lady from the Song family possesses a highly unique background.”","“What kind of background?” Ming Hengzi inquired, perplexed. “She’s Tyrannical Song’s sister,” Eon Sea Scholar disclosed.","“What?” Ming Hengzi was dumbstruck.","After a moment, he stammered, “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song? The","Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Demon, Tyrannical Dragon, and Tyrannical Annihilation?”","“That’s correct,” Eon Sea Scholar affirmed.","“Biological?”","“Indeed, biological,” Eon Sea Scholar confirmed. “Whether sister or parent, they’re all biologically related. Moreover, Senior Tyrannical Song is right here with me.’","Ming Hengzi found himself speechless.","Could it be that the parents of Senior Tyrannical Song, who was an incomparable powerhouse in the universe and a prominent contender for immortality, had managed to conceive a child despite their age? To do so, they would need to have achieved at least the Ninth Stage of Tribulation Transcendence, right?","Two Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcendents had somehow managed to bear a child? Wasn’t it widely accepted that cultivators would be sterilized upon reaching the Eighth Stage?","This defied all established rules!","Or could it be... that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had already resolved the issue of ‘Eighth Stage Profound Sage sterilization,’ and his parents were the first to benefit from it?","Ming Hengzi’s imagination ran wild, and his perception of Tyrannical Song grew even more enigmatic.","After a brief pause, he blurted out, “l apologize for the intrusion,” before hastily adding, “Farewell, and no need to see me off.”","With that, he promptly ended the call in fear that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song might seize the opportunity if he hesitated.","Simultaneously, he blocked the phone numbers of the Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing to prevent any further calls.","During this period, keeping a low profile was paramount. He planned to remain holed up in his cave abode at the base and avoid any inadvertent encounters with Tyrannical Song.","Little did he expect that, just over ten minutes later, Daoist Priest Ming Hengzi of the Longevity Sword Sect would appear at his doorstep of his own volition.","He had personally brought the information regarding the distribution of Evil Wangs forces in Wenzhou City to Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs family.","In theory, such information could have been transmitted through phone calls or the internet.","However, it was Eon Sea Scholar who had reported to Senior Tyrannical Song that the latter was currently on Baijing Street in Wenzhou, and that his biological sister had become an embryo and was gradually developing.","In deference to Senior Tyrannical Song, Ming Hengzi had no choice but to swallow his pride and deliver the information in person.","During his journey, he had also prepared a small gift on behalf of everyone, which he presented to Tyrannical Songs parents to congratulate them on the birth of their daughter.","Daoist Priest Ming Hengzi sighed as he looked up at the sky in resignation.","Nonetheless, despite his trepidation, he had to maintain a sincere smile on his face.","After their meeting, Daoist Master Ming Hengzi first presented the small gift. Although it was modest, it was a gift from the entire group, and the quantity was rather generous.","He also included a list of the contributors’ names, subtly revealing his daoist name to Tyrannical Song.","Subsequently, Daoist Priest Ming Hengzi handed over printed information on the distribution of Evil Wangs forces in Wenzhou City to Senior Tyrannical Song. This report emphasized the strength and challenges posed by these evil forces.","Song Shuhang smiled and commented, “You’ve gone to great lengths to make this journey, Fellow Daoist. Actually, this information could have been conveyed through the internet and save you the trouble.”","As for the earlier incident in which Ming Hengzi had referred to him as an old man on the phone, Song Shuhang paid it no mind. After all, the reference was made in praise of his unborn sister, and he felt genuinely pleased about it.","“No trouble at all, Senior Tyrannical Song. It’s an honor to have the chance to meet you,” Daoist Priest Ming Hengzi replied sincerely.","Papa Song and Mama Song found the situation somewhat odd as they observed this elderly daoist addressing their son as ‘senior.’","Song Shuhang then flipped through the information in his hand and casually inquired,","“Are there any cultivators in Wenzhou City specializing in dealing with evil illusions?”","“Yes, surprisingly, the Limitless Demon Sect has dispatched numerous elite disciples to eliminate Evil Wang. The actions of the Demon Sect are enigmatic,” Ming Hengzi revealed.","“Limitless Demon Sect? That name brings back memories,” Song Shuhang mused softly. He subtly reached out and held Sixteen’s small hand, gently wrapping his fingers around hers.","There was still unresolved animosity between Sixteen and the Limitless Demon Sect.","Daoist Priest Ming Heng did not linger in Song Shuhangs residence for long. After delivering the information and answering Song Shuhangs inquiries, he promptly took his leave.","After all, he was plagued by guilt and did not dare to overstay his welcome.","As for the Daoist nun, the scholar, and the lady, they had no intention of departing. They would soon follow Senior Tyrannical Song, Senior Su Shan, and Senior Spirit Butterfly to confront Evil Wang and witness Senior Tyrannical Songs invincible prowess.","Once the guests had left, Song Shuhang suddenly beckoned to his family with a mysterious smile.","“What’s the matter?” Papa Song inquired.","“Hehe, Dad, Mom, I have a surprise for you,” Song Shuhang announced, his smile widening.","“A surprise?” Mama Song asked, her curiosity piqued.","“Observe closely,” Song Shuhang urged while rolling up his sleeves and extending his hand.","Spatial ripples materialized in the air once more.","The Inner World had been activated!","Even Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather watched in anticipation and wondered what surprise Song Shuhang had in store.","At that moment, a small, silver figure emerged from the Inner World and landed in Song Shuhangs arms.","Papa Song and Mama Song gazed at their son in anticipation.","Before them stood an exquisite little girl who appeared to be around two years old, if not younger. Her long, silver hair cascaded behind her, and her long eyelashes fluttered as if she had just awakened, creating a subtle aura of innocence.","She was an endearing sight that instantly won the affection of Papa Song and Mama Song.","Moreover, upon closer inspection, it became evident that this little girl bore a striking resemblance to Song Shuhang.","Or, to be more precise, Song Shuhangs current appearance had taken on a semblance to this young girl. Over the course of his cultivation journey, Song Shuhangs appearance had naturally evolved.","Various factors, such as his cultivation state, techniques practiced, exposure to ghost spirits, consumption of heavenly materials and earthly treasures, accumulation of virtue, state of mind, resurrection methods employed, and more, had subtly influenced his appearance as a cultivator.","“Ah Song,” the silver-haired girl chirped joyfully as she nestled against Song Shuhang’s chest.","Song Shuhang affectionately patted her head and spoke gently, “Yinzhu, go ahead and call Grandpa and Grandma.”","Li Yinzhu turned to face Papa Song and Mama Song, her eyes filled with","innocence, and uttered in a melodious voice, “Grandpa, Grandma.”","Papa Song was left speechless.","Mama Song was equally taken aback.","The term of endearment this little girl used melted their hearts and left their minds in turmoil.","Papa Song carefully and gently accepted his granddaughter when Song Shuhang offered her.","Today had been an exceptional day in terms of mental gymnastics. His son was a cultivator, his wife was pregnant with a daughter, and now, he had just been called ‘grandpa’ in front of everyone.","Life, he realized, was full of surprises and excitement.","After Papa Song held Little Yinzhu for a moment, he passed her to Mama Song.","Mama Song, now holding her granddaughter, glanced at Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather.","These two young girls did not have silver hair.","“Not us,” Soft Feather waved her hand dismissively. “l haven’t given birth to a baby yet. Although I’d love to have one for playtime, it’s not the right time.”","And what about Sixteen?","Mama Songs gaze shifted to Sixteen.."]},{"number":2518,"title":"Chapter 2518: Family Bonds","paragraphs":["Chapter 2518: Family Bonds","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Mama Songs gaze weighed heavily on her. Su Clan’s Sixteen instinctively averted her eyes, feeling guilty under her scrutiny.","As she looked away, a whole series of campus romance scenarios immediately played out in Mama Song’s mind.","Observing this, Soft Feather explained, “It’s not Sixteen. Sixteen is just like me. We both met Senior Song last year.”","“You both only met him last year?” Mama Song was taken aback. She lowered her head to gaze at Yinzhu in her arms.","Little Yinzhu appeared to be around two years old. If you added the usual ten months of pregnancy, she couldn’t possibly be the child of Soft Feather and Sixteen.","If Mama Song calculated based on Little Yinzhu’s age... Could it be that her son secretly had a child with a mysterious woman during high school?","At the thought of this possibility, Mama Song regarded her son with a suspicious look, as if he were a scoundrel.","“Hehe, Mom, are you speculating that Little Yinzhu might be the child 1 fathered in high school?” Song Shuhang said with a faint smile while knowing he had led his mother’s thoughts in this direction intentionally.","Because this was the result of his deliberate guidance in the shadows!","He had brought the miniaturized Li Yinzhu out of his Inner World and laid the groundwork for this situation for a long time. He refrained from directly introducing her background to let his parents jump to the wrong conclusions!","Was he quite amused by this?","Of course, the joy of being mischievous surpassed their imaginations!","Mama Song was left speechless.","“So, the relationship between Little Yinzhu and me isn’t what you think. The relationships between cultivators can be quite complex. Mom, you can’t apply ordinary worldly connections to define my relationship with Little Yinzhu,” Song Shuhang explained in a serious tone.","Mama Song remained silent.","For some reason, she suddenly had the urge to metaphorically beat Song Shuhang with a big stick—figuratively speaking, since her hands were currently occupied holding Little Yinzhu, or she might have done it for real.","If only she wasn’t holding Little Yinzhu, she might have taken a swing at him.","Li Yinzhu giggled and nuzzled her head against Niama Songs shoulder, silently displaying her affection, which quickly melted away the anger in Mama Songs heart.","“So, what’s really going on between you and Little Yinzhu?” Mama Song gently patted Little Yinzhu and inquired.","“If you really want to know, you could consider her an adopted daughter, but our relationship is closer than that. Moreover, Mom, you’ve actually met Little Yinzhu before,” Song Shuhang responded. “In essence, I’ve inherited the karma of Little Yinzhu’s father. From that perspective, she can be considered my biological daughter.”","After Daoist Priest Li Tiansu’s body had been sent flying thousands of miles away and his shattered soul had affected Song Shuhangs spirit, a transformation occurred.","Under the influence of Daoist Priest Li Tiansu, Song Shuhangs spiritual ghost had become a gateway. It enabled Song Shuhang to enter the dream of Daoist Priest Li Tiansu and experience his life. Through these dreams, he had even met the oast Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven and received the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique from him.","The karmic bond between him and Li Yinzhu was unbreakable.","“So, her father is...” Mama Song suddenly grasped something.","She stopped herself from pursuing the topic further, gently patted Little Yinzhu, and said earnestly to her son, “While I may not fully understand the intricacies of karma and other aspects of cultivation relationships, if you’ve decided to adopt Little Yinzhu, you should treat her as your own and raise her well. If... and I mean if, you find it challenging to raise Little Yinzhu, you can entrust her to us.’","The first part of her sentence was directed at Song Shuhang, but the latter part, using the term ‘you,’ was intentional on Mama Songs part.","Firstly, she had some concerns that Soft Feather or Sixteen might struggle to accept the fact that Song Shuhang already had a ‘daughter.’ Regardless of who might become her daughter-in-law in the future, they needed to take this step first.","Secondly, she hoped to gauge if she could use this opportunity to uncover something substantial.","Soft Feather blinked her eyes in surprise.","Su Clan’s Sixteen pondered for a moment and then nodded, speaking earnestly, “Though she isn’t my biological daughter... I can treat her as my own.”","Mama Songs eyes lit up.","She hit the mark.","“That’s good,” Mama Song, feeling happy inside, tried her best to maintain her composure and nodded with a smile.","After hearing Su Clan’s Sixteen’s sincere response, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but feel pleased.","What did Su Clan’s Sixteen’s response mean? It was something anyone could understand if they weren’t foolish.","He turned to Su Clan’s Sixteen. Perhaps it was time to employ the Nine Forms of Awkward Flirting?","No, no, this wasn’t the right moment for an awkward approach.","It needed to be warmer.","“Ah, Song.” At that moment, Li Yinzhu slipped out of Mama Songs arms. She lightly jumped into Song Shuhangs embrace and affectionately rubbed against him. “So, from now on, are we officially family?”","“Always,” Song Shuhang replied gently.","Li Yinzhu smiled sweetly. As a celebration of their newfound family, she wanted to be playful.","After spending so much time by Song Shuhang’s side, Li Yinzhu, whose mind","was still childlike, had inevitably been influenced by his personality and","picked up certain traits.","“Ah, Song, I’ll gradually get used to it, and then I’ll change how I address you,” she said with courage. “Dad?”","“No need, no need. Just call me Song,” Song Shuhang smiled and patted Li Yinzhu.","If she really called him ‘father,’ he would feel extremely uncomfortable.","“Okay,” Li Yinzhu blinked and then happily moved from Song Shuhangs lap to Su Clan’s Sixteen’s.","Her silver eyes met Su Clan’s Sixteen’s, and her sparkling gaze was filled with anticipation.","Su Clan’s Sixteen reached out and gently hugged her.","“Now that Ah Song is officially part of the family, I think we should change everyone’s titles,” Li Yinzhu said sweetly, addressing Su Clan’s Sixteen. “Sister","Sixteen! ”","“Pfffm ” Song Shuhang, who had been drinking tea, sprayed it all out.","“I’m super happy to be mischievous this time,” Li Yinzhu sat on Sixteen’s lap and gave Song Shuhang a thumbs-up.","After saying this much, she leaned against Su Clan’s Sixteen’s chest and gently rubbed against her.","She was expressing her love for Sixteen.","Although she was being playful, she truly cherished Su Clan’s Sixteen.","After rubbing against her, Li Yinzhu found a comfortable position in Sixteen’s arms and curled up, not moving at all.","A moment later, her long eyelashes closed, and she fell asleep within seconds.","The sound of her rhythmic breathing filled the room, accompanied by a cold aura emanating from her.","As the cold air spread, her body underwent a transformation.","Under the astonished gazes of Papa Song and Mama Song, Li Yinzhu’s body rapidly grew to the age of five or six.","“Huh?” Papa Song was stunned.","Finally, he recognized the appearance of the five or six-year-old Li Yinzhu.."]},{"number":2519,"title":"Chapter 2519: Dealing with the Unexpected","paragraphs":["Chapter 2519: Dealing with the Unexpected","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Little Yinzhu’s condition is a result of thermal expansion and contraction,” Song Shuhang explained in a serious manner. “Due to a cold-related illness, her body undergoes changes in various age stages. When the cold air inside her surges, her body shrinks. Conversely, when the cold air is expelled, her body temperature rises, causing her to grow slightly. It’s a scientifically proven phenomenon.”","The last time he brought Li Yinzhu and Cherry back home, Li Yinzhu had maintained the appearance of a five or six-year-old. Her current appearance after expanding due to warmth must have triggered memories in Papa Songs mind.","However, their relationship during the previous visit home was different from the present, as they hadn’t yet confirmed their familial connection.","Papa Song was left speechless.","“Are you calling this thermal expansion and contraction?” Mama Song asked, somewhat surprised, as she reached out to touch Little Yinzhu, who was now in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s arms.","Such a remarkable phenomenon occurred right before their eyes—far more reliable than Song Shuhangs flying saber technique.","“Yes, I brought her and Cherry back home last time,” Song Shuhang added. “Moreover, due to suffering from a cold-related illness since childhood, Little Yinzhu has spent most of her life in slumber. As her condition worsened later on... the cold air would directly freeze her. So, in terms of personality, she’s almost indistinguishable from a child. In fact, she’s even more childlike than ordinary children.”","As Song Shuhang introduced the situation, he instinctively adopted the role of her late father, Daoist Priest Li Tiansu, his face radiating paternal love. “Wait a moment, could Cherry also be your son?” Mama Song suddenly raised her head and inquired.","Song Shuhang was bewildered.","“Mom, what are you thinking? Cherry’s family is still alive and well, and I don’t have the habit of adopting sons and daughters on the spot.” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but laugh at his mother’s imaginative ideas.","“What a pity,” Mama Song expressed her regret. “That little guy is quite cute.”","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","Mom, if you knew that he would secretly leave home and sell himself to human traffickers just to get rid of hemorrhoids, you probably wouldn’t find him cute anymore. That mischievous brat was exceptionally cunning. Not only did he run away from home, but he also brought two little girls with him.","Papa Song went to the room and fetched a blanket to hand it to Song Shuhang.","In some aspects, Papa Song was even more attentive than Mama Song.","Song Shuhang turned around and gently covered Little Yinzhu and Su Clan’s Sixteen with the blanket.","“How old is Little Yinzhu exactly?” Su Clan’s Sixteen lowered her head and looked at Li Yinzhu, who was in her arms, and secretly transmitted her voice to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang patted Su Clan’s Sixteen’s small hand with a smile and replied via voice transmission, “I don’t know her exact age, but when Little Yinzhu first met me, she was already at the Fourth Stage Realm and could control sword orbs.”","Little Yinzhu snuggled in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s arms and slightly furrowed her brow. In her deep sleep, she turned over again. The cold air surrounding her body was restrained, and her body rapidly shrank back to the size of a one-year-old.","At this moment, her tightly knit brow finally relaxed in satisfaction, and she contentedly nestled in Sixteen’s arms. She gazed longingly at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhangs time was running out.","No one could guarantee that Song Shuhang wouldn’t immediately advance to the Eighth Stage Realm and display his divinity in front of others, and then become completely sterile after a round of preaching.","Downstairs, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing returned after bidding farewell to Master Ming Heng of the Longevity Sword Sect.","As soon as they entered the room, they saw Profound Sage Su Shan holding another Eighth Stage expert in his arms—Ancient Sage Yinzhu!","Even though Ancient Sage Yinzhu had shrunk to the size of a baby, the effect of the Sage Seal was still evident.","Today, Senior Tyrannical Songs house could be described as a gathering of big shots.","But when did Ancient Sage Yinzhu arrive?","The appearance of another big shot made Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing feel somewhat uneasy.","“Other than Yinzhu being your daughter, do you have any other surprises to share with us? Just spill it all at once,” Mama Song suggested.","“I no longer have a daughter, but... I have also taken in a few disciples,” Song Shuhang replied. “My second disciple, Chu Chu, is currently in the midst of her studies. She specializes in both sword techniques and Immortal Chefs. She is currently learning the Immortal Chef Secret Technique from a top-notch","Master Immortal Chef in the cultivation world. Once she completes her apprenticeship, I’ll bring her to meet you, and you can taste her cooking.”","“Chu Chu? I heard that not long ago, a fairy named Chu Chu came to Immortal Fairy Bie Xue to learn culinary arts. This person is actually Senior Tyrannical Songs disciple?” Eon Sea Scholar immediately noted this down.","Fairy Chu Chu would undoubtedly play a significant role in the future, and he must not offend her. Of course, this information had to remain confidential and not be easily leaked.","Song Shuhang continued, “Additionally, my third disciple had a mishap while transcending the tribulation and is currently undergoing regrowth.” “What about your eldest disciple?” Papa Song inquired.","Starting with the second and third disciples first left him feeling quite uncomfortable.","“My eldest disciple is far away but right here before us,” Song Shuhang laughed and waved his hand.","A cute little sparrow flew over and landed in his palm.","Papa Song: “???”","Mama Song: “???”","First disciple? Little Que ‘er?","“Little Cai greets the two Grandmasters,” the bird monster Little Cai flapped her wings and said handsomely.","This crisp and pleasant voice...","“Is Little Cai a girl?” Mama Song asked.","It seemed like Chu Chu, and now this Little Cai, both had names that sounded like girls’ names.","As a mother, her perspective was indeed quite intricate.."]},{"number":2520,"title":"Chapter 2520: It Turns Out This Was All Senior Tyrannical Song’s Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2520: It Turns Out This Was All Senior Tyrannical Song’s Plan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Master, Little Cai is indeed a girl,” Little Cai replied, not fully grasping the meaning behind Mama Songs words. She elegantly retracted her wings and beat them gracefully in her master’s palm.","At this point, Little Cai had already consumed the Transformation Stone Milk that Song Shuhang had brought back from the Black Dragon World. She could now assume a human form, but she had a preference for her sparrow mode. With her combination of Steel Hands, Saber Technique, and Saber Intent Condensing Lotus Seed, she was Cai Que, and she was ready to master the Dual Saber Style.","Mama Song raised the corner of her mouth and glanced at her son. From the moment Song Shuhang had entered the house until now, she had realized that all the individuals he had introduced to them were females. Whether it was his girlfriend, pendants, child, or disciple, they were all girls.","“When did my silly son become so popular?” Mama Song wondered aloud.","“Mom, actually, I still have two backup disciples,” Song Shuhang quickly added. No one understood their son better than their mother. Furthermore, Song Shuhang was well aware of Mama Songs way of thinking, which had been passed down through generations.","“Master has backup disciples?” Little Cai looked at her master in confusion. She had been unaware of this.","Song Shuhang coughed lightly and explained, “One of those disciples is named Joseph, and he’s a foreigner. Due to certain coincidences, he can now be considered an in-name disciple. Also... I have a disciple with great potential in another world. I’m waiting for him to grow up and pass my trial before officially accepting him as my disciple. He’s a perfect fit for me,”","The youth from the Black Dragon World, Chi Tong, possessed the ability to resurrect himself and had once decisively deleted his account for retraining. He had made an agreement with Song Shuhang. All that was left was for him to grow and become Song Shuhangs disciple.","“Are all the backup disciples male?” Mama Song inquired.","Song Shuhang nodded in confirmation.","Mama Song and Papa Song exchanged baffled glances.","At noon, Mama Song prepared a sumptuous meal.","Song Shuhang and the others had already reached the point where eating had become optional due to their advanced cultivation levels. However, Mama Song and Papa Song were still regular people.","“Are you guys planning to do that this afternoon?” Mama Song asked.","Song Shuhang nodded. “Since I don’t have anything better to do while I’m still in Wenzhou City, I might as well help out with some local issues.”","“You’re right. This is your hometown, where you were born and raised,” Papa Song agreed. “Even if we have to leave for a while, we shouldn’t forget our roots. ”","Chinese people had a deep-rooted concept of returning to their origins. Unless there were extraordinary circumstances, their hometown and roots remained constant throughout their lives.","On the side, Daoist Nun Miao Qing and Eon Sea Scholar were thrilled to be part of Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs family dinner.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, may I take a photo?” Miao Qing asked hesitantly.","“It’s up to you,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","He was no longer concerned about keeping his parents’ identities a secret, as he would soon be taking them to the world of the golden lotus to settle down. Moreover, things had changed, and he was no longer worried about his family being targeted by miscreants.","The idea of taking photos reminded him of Fairy Lychee from the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","After receiving Senior Tyrannical Songs approval, Daoist Nun Miao Qings face lit up with joy.","She took out her selfie stick and raised her phone high, although she didn’t have the same level of control as the seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","In order to take selfies, Fairy Lychee had even developed a special technique for taking pictures, which could put the camera or phone in unmanned shooting mode. Miao Qing couldn’t do that.","“Senior, may I post this on my WeChat Moments?” Miao Qing asked after taking the photo. She already had a title in mind: “Today, I had the privilege of dining with Senior Tyrannical Song. PS: The entire meal was personally prepared by Senior Tyrannical Songs mother!”","“As you wish,” Song Shuhang replied happily.","“Thank you, Senior,” Miao Qing said with gratitude as she immediately started working on her phone.","Mama Song was at a loss for words. She still hadn’t fully adjusted to the idea of her son suddenly becoming so renowned.","Who knew what her son had experienced in the past year?","“Speaking of which, Shuhang,” Papa Song suddenly remembered something.","Song Shuhang looked at his father and waited for him to continue.","“Do your mother and I still have the opportunity to cultivate?” Papa Song asked seriously. He wanted to continue loving Mama Song for another ten thousand years and to love their yet unborn daughter for another ten thousand years.","Song Shuhang replied, “In theory... It might be a bit late. Once you’re past eight years old, it becomes challenging.”","“When you were eight years old, you were still with us,” Papa Song interjected, abruptly cutting off his own words. He didn’t want to embarrass his son in front of the two girls. Additionally, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miaoqing were present, so he felt compelled to maintain his son’s image.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing quickly lowered their heads and refrained from saying anything that might reveal Senior Tyrannical Songs past.","“That’s why I said ‘in theory,’” Song Shuhang replied with a smile. “Give me some time, and I’ll figure something out in the future. Have faith in your son’s methods.’","Guiding his parents to cultivate at this point would be fruitless.","Once he arrived in the world of the scholarly faction, he would ask the scholarly faction to provide his parents with theoretical knowledge of cultivation. After all, the scholarly faction excelled in teaching.","And then... they could discuss it further in the future!","“Senior Tyrannical Song, do you truly intend to compete for the Heavenly Dao?” Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing silently wondered to themselves.","Although they didn’t understand why Senior Tyrannical Songs parents hadn’t cultivated and were still regular people, Senior Tyrannical Song had unsealed them in this era for a reason. Perhaps he had plans for their future!","When ordinary individuals reached the age of Senior Tyrannical Songs parents, it was nearly impossible for them to cultivate. Regardless of the cultivation system, once a certain age was reached, unless there was a miraculous encounter, the path of cultivation became increasingly challenging.","However, if Senior Tyrannical Song succeeded in achieving immortality by contending for the Heavenly Dao, he could easily change the fate of his parents.","It seemed that many mysteries could be explained in this way!","Senior Tyrannical Song was striving to rectify the Dao in this era, and everything appeared to be part of his grand plan!","No wonder Senior Tyrannical Song had such an impact on the era.","As they pondered, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qings perception of Senior Tyrannical Song reached new heights.","“Let’s take a short break, and we’ll set off later,” Song Shuhang announced as he stood up.","“Senior Song, Senior White mentioned you in the group chat,” Soft Feather suddenly informed him.","“Senior White is online?” Song Shuhang was surprised.","Wasn’t Senior White planning to ascend to godhood? Why was he online today?","Song Shuhang retrieved his phone and opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group. He saw a message from Senior White: “@Tyrannical Annihilation, Shuhang, are you online?”","“Senior White is looking for me?” Song Shuhang replied.","“I’m Meteor Sword. Master is still occupied,” came the response from Senior White’s account.."]},{"number":2521,"title":"Chapter 2521: Get As Many Xie Wang As You Can!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2521: Get As Many Xie Wang As You Can!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No wonder Senior White hadn’t directly contacted Song Shuhang through the cultivation chat function. It turned out that his life-bound flying sword,","Meteor Sword, was controlling his account.","Wait!","Meteor Sword had gained consciousness?","“Impressive, Senior White,” Song Shuhang said. “Meteor Sword has awoken to a complete weapon spirit.”","Unlike his Defiant Whale Tool Spirit Fairy, Senior White’s Meteor Sword Tool Spirit had a very high degree of completion. After condensing, it was already able to replace its master and chat online. This was an artifact spirit that had reached the level of Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword!","Su Clan’s Sixteen said, “Senior White’s Meteor Sword already had a weak consciousness from the very beginning. With the eye drops you gave him last time, it wasn’t strange for Meteor Sword to rise to a tool spirit. However, it can already go online and chat for Senior White. This is the most amazing part. As expected of Senior White.”","“We also have eye drops, so we can’t be weaker than Senior White. We have to try our best to nurture a tool spirit that belongs to us as soon as possible.” Soft Feather clenched her fists and encouraged everyone.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing and the Vast Sea Scholar were dumbfounded. What did the birth of a weapon spirit have to do with eye drops? This was a completely different topic, right?","Also... The ‘Senior White’ Senior Tyrannical Song was referring to should be Sage White?","Sage White was indeed extraordinary. Even Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had to call him ‘senior’. Moreover, a magical treasure with a treasure spirit was very rare. Every magic tool that gave birth to a weapon spirit was enough to be recorded in the history of the cultivation world.","After all, most of the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender magical treasures didn’t have a weapon spirit. Basically, all the magical treasures that were known to have a weapon spirit were Immortal divine weapons!","Basically, the rarity of weapon spirits and divine weapons was directly proportional to the rarity of Immortals!","Sage White’s divine weapon had already condensed a complete weapon spirit, and he even knew how to chat online. As expected of the dream lover of everyone in the cultivation world, Sage White.","“Sage Monarch White’s Meteor Sword actually came online to chat? Shuhang, lend me your account in a while. I have time to chat with Meteor Sword.” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet at Song Shuhangs waist said happily.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt that he and Meteor Sword definitely shared a common language.","“Heh, you’re just a stone tablet. What common topics can you have with fellow Daoist Meteor Sword? Shuhang, give me your account number. As a divine sword that also possesses an artifact spirit, I feel that Fellow Daoist Meteor Sword and I have a good chat.” Scarlet Heaven Sword didn’t want to be outdone and replied in a pleasant voice.","It was said that there would be some resemblance between the artifact spirit and the owner. Since Meteor Sword was Sage White’s artifact spirit, he would definitely be as handsome as Sage White, and would be able to topple a country. He would definitely be a good match.","“Yiyiyi A little sister’s spirit appeared on Song Shuhangs gloves. The Defiant Whale’s spirit was kneeling on the gloves while stretching her small hand forward and letting out a passionate cry.","Three Artifact Spirits?","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing swallowed their saliva-Senior Tyrannical Song lived up to his reputation.","He was wearing the Three Artifact Spirit Deity Equipment, and he couldn’t afford to offend him.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, after learning that Senior White’s account was actually Meteor Sword, the seniors in the group were all shocked.","Medicine Master: Meteor Sword, what input method are you using?","He was shocked, alright? Even Meteor Sword, which had just condensed its weapon spirit, was typing faster than him!","“I’m the same as Master. Whether it’s the Pinyin input method, Wubi, or even handwriting, 1 can do it,” Meteor Sword replied honestly.","“What about Meteor Sword?” Cave Lord Snow Wolf asked curiously. “Do you use the tip of the sword to write?”","“I’m an Artifact Spirit. 1 can condense the shape of an Artifact Spirit and type with my hands.” Meteor Sword replied.","“Meteor Sword,” Fairy Lychee said curiously, “quickly take a selfie and let us see what you look like.”","“My appearance hasn’t been completely confirmed yet. I’m still in the process of sculpting my face. Fairy Lychee, I’ll take a selfie after I’m done sculpting my appearance.” Meteor Sword replied.","This little fellow was very honest.","No matter what the seniors in the group asked, it would answer honestly. Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, “What do you identify as? A fairy or a non-fairy?”","[System Message Notification: User Thrice Reckless Mad Saber has been muted by the administrator for 1 day.]","Thrice Reckless looked at himself, who had been muted, with a dumbfounded expression.","Could it be that Senior Yellow Mountain had secretly peeked at him and muted him?","“Did Senior Yellow Mountain make a move?” , Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked.","“No, I didn’t make a move. Meteor Sword was the one who silenced Thrice Reckless... Senior White’s account is the administrator’s account.” Senior Yellow Mountain replied.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was speechless.","Thrice Reckless didn’t die in vain.","“Everyone, stop fooling around. If you have any questions to ask Meteor Sword, you can ask them later. Did Senior White have something to discuss with little friend Song Shuhang? Don’t delay Senior White’s business.”","Song Shuhang smiled and typed in the group with his fingers. “Senior White, is there something you need me for?”","“How is Fellow Daoist Shuhangs condition in the main world recently?” Meteor Sword asked.","“After the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, the myriad worlds are now in chaos. The remains of the Heavenly Dao have appeared, and Xie Wang has also appeared in various places. Recently, I’ve been planning to farm these Xie Wang and study their effects.” Song Shuhang replied.","“Fellow Daoist Shuhang,” Meteor Sword said,” if you are planning to deal with","Xie Wang, please help Master collect a batch of Xie Wangs cores. Any Xie Wang whose threat was greater than that of the Fifth Stage Realm should have a core inside his body. There are many types of cores. Some are bead-shaped, some are crystal-shaped, and some are even skeletal or fleshy.","In any case, as long as it was the core of Xie Wang, it was fine. Master’s experiment requires a large number of cores.","“Master said that he can buy it at a high price. He will give you a tempting price. ”","“l still owe Senior White a huge debt that I can’t repay. When I go to farm Evil Fantasy later, I’ll pay attention to collecting cores.” Song Shuhang replied. When the time came, he would at least pay for a portion of Senior White’s loan... The interest!","Meteor Sword said, “The same goes for the fellow daoists in the group. If you’re interested, you can go and get a batch of Xie Wang. Master will take as many as there are, and...lt was not limited to the purchase of spirit stones. When the time comes, we can trade.’ “Senior White is the best.’","1 will always love Senior White.”","“The event for this year’s New Year has been decided. It’s to farm Xie Wang cores. ”","“In addition, if possible, Master hopes that Fellow Daoist Shuhang can help him purchase the core of Xie Wang.” Meteor Sword said.","“No problem, leave it to me. The next time I give a speech, I’ll use the method to deal with Xie Wang as a script. After the speech, I’ll attach an advertisement for the cores. Alright Song Shuhang laughed.","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were speechless.","Didn’t you say that the last time was the last time?"]},{"number":2522,"title":"Chapter 2522: You Know What I Mean","paragraphs":["Chapter 2522: You Know What I Mean","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","From a literal perspective, ‘Tyrannical Songs monthly speech program’ hadn’t concluded yet.","“Wait a moment, Shuhang. Did you just mention ‘next speech’? Didn’t you already finish your last speech?” Daoist Bright Moon asked in haste.","“Displaying divinity before others and promoting the Profound Sage Speech... Shuhang, you truly are a genius,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator remarked with a mix of amusement and bewilderment.","No other cultivator would dare attempt such antics during a sacred speech.","Eternity served as a cautionary tale. He bravely confessed during the Profound sage speecn segment, only to be ensnared In an Inner demon tribulation and reaped dire consequences.","However, Song Shuhang could play this game as he pleased. Setting aside the fact that this was his ‘final warning,’ his abundant virtuous power rendered him immune to a mere inner demon tribulation.","He might even be looking forward to the inner demon tribulation’s arrival.","Song Shuhang smiled faintly and replied, “After all, this is my genuine final speech. I made an error in my previous speech, but I won’t slip up this time. This last speech must be utilized wisely.”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer retorted, “I’d rather believe that a dog can change and eat sh*t!”","Doudou chimed in, puzzled. “??? Phoenix Slayer, what do you mean by this?”","At this point, Fairy Dongfang Six declared, “l believe in Fellow Daoist","Tyrannical Song, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Scholar, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical","Demon, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Dragon, and Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Extinguisher. The next speech will undoubtedly be your last! Every time you conclude a speech, I am unwavering in my belief. This trust has remained unshaken. Therefore, given my unwavering trust in you, Shuhang, could you send me a private message before your next speech so that I can prepare mentally?”","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“Don’t worry, Shuhang,” Dharma King Creation chimed in. “Even if the entire Nine Provinces Number One Group doubts you, I still have absolute faith in you. After all, you’re my fan! As a singer, you have unwavering confidence in your fans.”","“Don’t fret, Shuhang. Just go for it.” Senior Medicine Master reassured him, “I’ve already released the Tyrannical Song Contraceptives that 1 specially developed. As long as you boldly deliver your speech, I can offer you 20% of the profits from this pill.”","Song Shuhang was left without words.","They couldn’t continue chatting for the remainder of the day.","Farewell, farewell!","Yellow Mountain: “Shuhang, after the advertisement, where are you planning to collect the cores? There must be a collection point, right?”","“Meteor Sword, does Senior White have any plans?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“Master is currently very busy... That’s why I thought of asking Fellow Daoist Shuhang for assistance in collecting a batch of Xie Wang cores,” Meteor Sword replied.","Song Shuhang was once again without words.","Senior Yellow Mountain rubbed his forehead and said, “Forget it. I happen to have some free time. I’ll establish a collection point on the moon. When the time comes, we can obtain as many as possible. Shuhang, when your next speech is about to begin, send me a signal, and I’ll provide you with the coordinates.’","Song Shuhang swiftly replied, “Thank you, Senior Yellow Mountain!”","Within the Nine Provinces Number One Group, Senior Yellow Mountain was akin to a comforting blanket. In this age of emotional distance, Senior Yellow Mountain always managed to impart warmth to the group members.","“Seniors, this afternoon, I plan to lead a group to harvest a batch of Evil Wang and conduct simultaneous research on it. When the time comes, if my research yields any results, I’ll come online to share my findings with everyone.” Song Shuhang sent a [waving goodbye] emoji and temporarily logged off.","After Song Shuhang logged off, all the online members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group began privately messaging Senior Yellow Mountain.","Using the Xie Wang acquisition point as a pretext, Senior Yellow Mountain successfully determined the precise time of Song Shuhangs upcoming speech. Once Song Shuhang messaged Senior Yellow Mountain, the latter would promptly notify everyone in the group.","Senior Yellow Mountain put away his phone.","“Let’s go,” Song Shuhang said. “Where is the highest-threat level Xie Wang closest to us located?”","“In the Red Horse Town area near Baijing Street, there’s an abandoned old campus area originally slated for demolition. After the world underwent drastic changes, evil forces descended upon that area and made it their nest. We don’t know their origins. We tried various methods, but couldn’t disperse them. We could only barely contain them within the old campus area and study their attributes,” Eon Sea Scholar explained.","Xie Wang were enigmatic and ever-evolving entities. Different types of Xie Wang required distinct methods for dealing with them. Furthermore, many Xie Wang would merge and evolve into new species.","Therefore, confronting Xie Wang either required overwhelming power to exterminate them outright or a comprehensive study of their attributes and structure to find a way to vanquish them.","This was the frustrating aspect of dealing with Xie Wang.","“Red Horse ???? I recall it’s quite nearby, correct?” Song Shuhangs divine sense swept over the area, and he nodded. “Very well. The threat level should be above Fifth Stage. It’s worth investigating.”","“Are we departing now?” Su Clan’s Sixteen handed over Li Yinzhu to Song","Shuhang.","However, as Song Shuhang was about to receive Li Yinzhu, the little girl furrowed her brows and clutched Su Clan’s Sixteen’s clothes tightly, refusing to let go.","Song Shuhang was perplexed.","“Let me try!” Soft Feather curiously reached out and hugged Li Yinzhu.","Li Yinzhu resisted momentarily but eventually let go and entered Soft Feather’s embrace.","At the same time, her tightly knitted brows relaxed in her deep sleep, and her face expressed satisfaction.","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","Am 1 being rejected?","“Perhaps this child subconsciously yearns for a motherly embrace?” Pavilion","Master Chu speculated.","“Sixteen, you still need further growth,” White Dragon sighed.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was confused.","Red Horse Town, Old Campus Area.","The area near the nest of Xie Wang had been covered with barbed wire to prevent people who did not know the truth from entering this place by mistake.","At the same time, there were guards at the entrance to guard it.","These guards were all strong-willed members who had undergone a period of intensive training. Every member was wearing some old-fashioned robes inside their equipment.","The world was changing too quickly, and there were many things that couldn’t be made in time. They could only use the robes of the retired disciples of large sects to cope with it.","Due to the special circumstances, no one was so particular about it.","A black hand-guided tractor suddenly appeared at the entrance of the old school district.","Previously, this hand-guided tractor had been invisible.","The guards were already used to this.","At some point, hand-guided tractors seemed to have become popular in the cultivation world. This year, many big shots were equipped with such a vehicle.."]},{"number":2523,"title":"Chapter 2523: What Merit and Ability Does My Clueless Disciple Have?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2523: What Merit and Ability Does My Clueless Disciple Have?!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After the hand-guided tractor came to a halt, a tall Western monk and a sage-like Taoist priest stepped out of the car.","“Is this the place? I can already sense a wicked aura coming from it,” the Western monk remarked in thickly accented Mandarin.","“Yeah, this is it... According to our research, the malevolent spirits here might be suppressed by the light of virtue,” the sage-like Taoist priest said with a","tone of concern.","“So, this is where I come in, Master!” the Western monk exclaimed while patting his chest and laughing heartily.","The Taoist priest touched his chest at the thought of his disciple finally being of use, though not without a sense of melancholy.","“Alright, I’m going in, Master!” the Western monk donned an emerald- green kasaya and, with a swift motion, produced a large Vajra Demon Subduing Pestle in his hand.","The Taoist priest’s face turned purple.","Eventually, he let out a sigh and signaled to the guards.","The guards extended their arms, opening the entrance gate and watching as the monk and his entourage entered the old campus.","At that moment, the old campus area was shrouded in a thick white fog, creating an eerie atmosphere.","Once the monk and his group had entered, the guards carefully closed the gate.","“By the way, did the master just refer to that Taoist priest as ‘Master?” asked a square-faced man on the left, disbelief in his voice.","He wondered if there was something wrong with his hearing.","“No, you heard correctly. We all heard it clearly. The master addressed him as ‘Master’ several times,” replied the long-faced man on the right.","“Master of what? Buddhism?” nodded the square-faced man, still perplexed.","The long-faced man simply shook his head in disbelief.","“By the way, do any of you know how to operate a hand-guided tractor? Can someone at least move this hand-guided tractor to the side?” another guard inquired.","“Don’t, don’t touch it. These hand-guided tractors are cursed. Avoid touching","them at all costs,” the long-faced man warned, his voice filled with more dread than when discussing Xie Wang.","Evidently, contact with an expert had left a lasting impact on this individual.","“So, let’s leave this hand-guided tractor here,” he advised.","A few minutes later, a series of explosions echoed through the old campus, accompanied by the sounds of buildings collapsing.","“It seems that the Taoist priest, the master, and Xie Wang have crossed paths,” the square-faced man said with a deep voice.","He pondered whether the Taoist priest’s disciple, brought here by the master, could address the malevolent presence in this place.","If they failed to find a solution, Xie Wang within the old campus might break free from the suppression defense circle.","Their responsibility was to guard this place, and they could feel the mounting pressure within the old campus.","Strange sounds filled their ears daily, increasing in frequency from once a day to more than ten times a day.","Without their specialized training, they would have been overwhelmed long ago.","A chorus of roars echoed throughout the campus.","These were the cries of Xie Wang, not just one voice but dozens or even hundreds joining in unison.","The Xie Wang here represented the fusion and evolution of numerous malevolent entities which made it the most formidable challenge for cultivators.","“If I don’t go to hell, who will?” the master’s voice rang out suddenly.","Simultaneously, a brilliant light erupted from the old campus and cast a warm glow that seemed like applause from the entire world.","The evil roars instantly diminished in intensity.","“It’s effective. Keep it up!” the Taoist priest urged calmly.","“Come on, come and face me!” the grandmaster continued, beginning to recite a rapid stream of scriptures in the rhythm of a temple master’s chant. The words were in English, but delivered at such speed that they were incomprehensible to ordinary ears.","It was clear that these were not traditional Buddhist scriptures.","The Taoist priest was growing weary.","“Damn it!” the Western monk yelled while tossing his Buddha beads into the air. Each bead emitted a radiant Buddhist light.","“Master, I can’t hold on any longer!” the Western monk shouted to the Taoist priest after releasing the beads.","The Taoist priest was at a loss for words.","“While the power of virtue can suppress these malevolent spirits, my own virtue is still insufficient. Let’s retreat for now and gather fellow cultivators with strong virtue to form a formation. Together, we can eradicate the malevolence in this place!” the grandmaster proclaimed.","“Let’s go!” the Taoist priest raised the Western monk’s kasaya and dragged him away.","Originally, their purpose had been to test whether the power of virtue could control the malevolent spirits here. They had never anticipated that the Western monk would be able to handle the local malevolent entities.","As long as they could confirm that virtue had an effect on the malevolence in this place, they could formulate a plan to completely eliminate it.","“Not good, Master. Xie Wang are pursuing us!” the Western monk exclaimed.","Xie Wang, suppressed by the sealing spell, was now forcefully attempting to break free, latching onto the Western monk and refusing to let go,","While the power of virtue could suppress the local malevolence, it could also provoke it.","“Everyone, retreat!” the Taoist priest commanded in a solemn tone.","He pushed the Western monk out of the old campus and activated the second layer of defensive seals on the ground.","To prevent Xie Wang from escaping the old campus, multiple layers of defense had been established.","After all the guards and the Western monk had retreated, the Taoist priest swiftly activated layer after layer of defensive seals to contain Xie Wang.","“Contact my senior brother and inform him that Xie Wang is causing trouble. Send reinforcements to suppress Xie Wang immediately. Furthermore, while virtue can subdue Xie Wang, it can also incite him. In our next operation, we must eliminate Xie Wang decisively, or the consequences will be dire,” the Taoist priest instructed the Western monk.","“Understood, Master!” The Western monk retrieved his phone but, instead of dialing a number, he gazed up at the sky absentmindedly.","“What are you waiting for?” the Taoist priest, still focused on the defensive seals, snapped at his seemingly dazed disciple.","“Hello, Senior Song!” the Western monk suddenly raised his hand and waved at the sky.","The Taoist priest furrowed his brow, looking up at the sky as well.","From above, several figures descended on swords, sabers, and lotuses.","Although the leader wore a mask, his attire, the distinctive black lotus, and the stone tablet magic tool hanging from his waist revealed his identity.","“Oh, it’s you. Master, it’s been a while,” Song Shuhang greeted the Western","monk with a laugh.","The Taoist priest was left speechless.","How could his seemingly foolish disciple be addressed as ‘Master’ by Senior Tyrannical Song?"]},{"number":2524,"title":"Chapter 2524: This Is Awkward","paragraphs":["Chapter 2524: This Is Awkward","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","More importantly, his disciple seemed to be very familiar with Senior Tyrannical Song? Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi had a dumbfounded look on his face—when did this silly disciple of his get to know Senior Tyrannical Song?","Just as Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi was deep in thought, Senior Tyrannical Song, Profound Sage Su Shan, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, and the two young fellow cultivators slowly descended from the sky. In Ancient Sage Ling Diezi’s arms was a little girl. Ancient Sage Yinzhu?","Song Shuhang smiled and shook hands with the western monk. “We haven’t seen each other for quite some time since we performed Apocalypse War with Great Master. I didn’t expect to meet you here. As expected, I’m fated to meet you.”","“l didn’t expect to meet Senior Song here either,” the western monk replied in familiar Chinese.","Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi, who was still activating the sealing array formation behind him, was stunned when he heard this. His disciple had actually acted in Apocalypse War? Why didn’t he have any impression of it?","“Unfortunately, after the movie Apocalypse War came out, 1 only had a fleeting shot, and it was in the crowd, showing my side profile. However... The director is a master of art in my heart,” the western monk replied with a silly smile.","“Then next time, if we have a movie to film in the group, we will definitely give Master a positive role.” As Song Shuhang spoke, his gaze fell on the western monk’s kasaya.","Wasn’t this kasaya the emerald- green kasaya he had exchanged with the western monk?","“Master, are you satisfied with this emerald-green kasaya?” Song Shuhang said happily.","The western monk gave him a thumbs up. “Senior Song, this kasava vou gave me is awesome! I’m so satisfied with it. I relied on it to protect me several times when I was rescuing evil spirits. It saved my life.”","Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi was confused.","Puff...","This emerald- green kasaya was actually exchanged by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and his disciple?","Back then, when he found out that the Daoist robe he had given to his disciple had been exchanged for a kasaya, he had been furious.","After giving his disciple a good beating, Wu Yinzi made up his mind that if he ever met a fellow cultivator who exchanged a kasaya for a Daoist robe with his disciple, he would...","I dare not decide, dare not decide, dare not decide!","“Right, Grandmaster. Did you get past your master?” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","He remembered that there was once when the western monk came to him and asked him to temporarily change his emerald- green kasaya back into a Daoist robe so that he could return to the sect to participate in a grand ceremony. Unfortunately, the Daoist robe in Song Shuhangs hand was damaged, and he couldn’t help.","“Of course I passed. Although I was beaten by Master, I still passed successfully in the end.” The western monk laughed. He stretched out his hand to undo the emerald- green kasaya on his body and flipped it over.","Inside the emerald-green kasaya, there was a layer of Daoist robe skin.","The western monk wore the kasaya inside out, buttoned it with a few hidden buttons, and tied it around his waist. In the blink of an eye, the kasaya turned into a Daoist robe.","“Master, you are truly a genius.” Song Shuhang praised.","Soft Feather also nodded. “Great Master, your brain is very unique. As expected of the man Senior Song has taken a fancy to.”","Even Su Clan’s Sixteen couldn’t help but take a second look at this Western monk who had a strange brain.","The western monk rubbed his head and smiled shyly.","Song Shuhang used his divine sense to scan the situation of the Great Master and praised, “It’s been a while since I last saw him, but his power of virtue has increased by a large margin. Congratulations.”","Unlike him, who used cheats to gather the power of virtue through speech, the western monk used the method of ferrying souls and burying evil ghosts to accumulate merit. Every bit of merit on his body was solid.","In this aspect, he was completely worthy of the title of ‘Master.’","“Senior Song, your power of virtue has increased even more,” the western monk replied.","Song Shuhang faintly smiled, and replied, “In this aspect, it’s all thanks to the Ksitigarbha’s Soul Ferrying Scripture and the Diary of the Ascetic Senior Monk that you taught me. If it weren’t for the soul ferrying technique that you taught me, I wouldn’t have had the chance to condense this light of virtue.” If he didn’t have the Ksitigarbha’s Soul Ferrying Scripture and the transcending method that the western monk had taught him, he wouldn’t have had the chance to condense the virtuous lamia. His first group tribulation would have ended in failure, and he might have died in the first Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation.","Behind him, the Eon and Daoist Nun Miao Qing were stunned.","They looked at this Western monk in shock. Senior Tyrannical Songs method of ferrying virtue was actually taught by this Western monk?","Behind him, Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi also had a look of disbelief on his face. He didn’t hear wrongly. Was it his foreign disciple who taught Profound Sage","Tyrannical Song the transcending method of the Ksitigarbha’s Soul Ferrying","Scripture instead of the other way around?","“Senior Song, this is all your own merit. I only played a small role as a catalyst,” the western monk replied humbly.","“By the way, Master, are you also here to deal with Xie Wang?” The western monk suddenly remembered something important and asked.","Song Shuhang nodded. “It just so happens that I want to use Xie Wang to do some experiments and help a senior collect some materials at the same time. Therefore, I need to farm some Xie Wang to store them.”","“That’s great. Master, we don’t need to call for reinforcements!” The western monk happily turned to Wu Yinzi.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He looked at the Taoist priest who was struggling to hold on to the barrier seal with a tired expression.","Was this the western monk’s master?","This was awkward.."]},{"number":2525,"title":"Chapter 2525: A Solemn Scene","paragraphs":["Chapter 2525: A Solemn Scene","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The situation felt a bit awkward.","It was like secretly planning some mischief with a friend against their dad, only to suddenly turn around and realize that the friend’s dad was standing right behind them.","“Ahem,” Song Shuhang cleared his throat and said, “Fellow Daoist, you’ve done well. Now, I’ll take care of the malevolence in this place! Please step back and release the sealing barrier.”","Wu Yinzi let out a sigh of relief. He stood up and gave a nod to Song Shuhang. “On behalf of the local residents, I want to express our gratitude to you, Senior Tyrannical Song for helping us.”","Regardless of why Senior Tyrannical Song had come out to deal with this ‘malevolence,’ it was a great stroke of luck for the creatures living here.","“No need to thank me. In fact, I’m just doing my best to keep my hometown safe,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Wu Yinzi took a few steps back and stopped maintaining the barrier.","The Xie Wang finally broke through the layers of seals and brought with them a thick white fog that surged out like a huge wave. The white fog rose like a wave about to crash upon everyone.","Song Shuhang raised his head and gave the white fog a casual glance.","The radiant light of virtue on his body soared!","The formidable light of virtue transformed into a small sun, dazzling to the point of being blinding.","In the next moment, the arrogant white mist wave seemed to back down.","The huge wave shrank back.","After confirming with their eyes that they had provoked someone they couldn’t handle, the malevolent white fog started retreating at a visible speed.","“You want to leave? Take this!” At this moment, Pavilion Master Chu, who was perched atop Song Shuhangs head, called out.","Rumbl&","In the air, a massive wave of water vapor materialized out of thin air and transformed into over 80 water columns that pressed down.","The 80 water pillars formed an incredibly powerful sealing barrier, pinning the malevolent fog to the ground, making it difficult for them to move!","“Senior Tyrannical Songs power is truly terrifying!” Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi exclaimed in shock.","This water pillar sealing technique was incredibly potent. To be honest, using such a technique against the Xie Wang in the old campus seemed like a waste!","Eon Sea Scholar and the others shared the same sentiment.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had taken action... It was akin to using a nuclear bomb to eradicate a mosquito!","“However, perhaps for Senior Tyrannical Song, this level of sealing is already the least powerful method?” At the same time, this thought crossed everyone’s minds.","After all, he was a cultivator who had delivered five consecutive Profound Sage-level Speeches and was regarded as one of the most promising candidates for the position of Heavenly Dao and attaining immortality.","In fact, it wasn’t just Eon Sea Scholar and the others who were astonished. Even Song Shuhang was taken aback by Pavilion Master Chu’s display of power.","“Senior Chu, they are just Rank-5 or 6. Do we really need such an elaborate show of force?” Song Shuhang telepathically inquired.","“I’m already doing my best to control the power of my attacks,” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair swayed slightly. Recently, she had entered the stage of regrowing her ‘small waist,’ and this part of her body was also connected to a cultivator’s ‘core.’ Although the energy of a Ninth Stage Tribulation","Transcender was no longer confined to the sea of qi and dantian, Pavilion Master Chu’s power had dramatically increased after she had almost fully recovered in this part of her body.","“Let’s don’t waste any more time. Let’s go in and deal with these Xie Wang first. I’m not particularly fond of them. It feels like they’re too noisy,” Pavilion Master Chu remarked absentmindedly.","White Dragon’s eyes lit up, and she asked, “Did these Xie Wangs trigger some unpleasant memories for the lovely fairy?”","“Fellow Daoist Scarf, you’re overthinking it,” Pavilion Master Chu responded decisively.","“Ahem,” Song Shuhang coughed to interrupt the two fairies.","The next moment, he stood up and walked into the old campus where Xie Wang was.","In his mind, knowledge about Xie Wang quickly surfaced, and he began to compare it with the Xie Wang before him.","“Senior Song, this Xie Wang is a rare fusion-type malevolent entity, and it can be restrained by the power of virtue,” the western monk followed behind him and reminded him.","“Fusion-type? 1 see,” Song Shuhang nodded.","The virtuous lamia appeared behind him.","She transformed into her virtuous form and stood over ten meters tall.","Then, she puffed up her cheeks and blew gently into her eyes.","After she exhaled, the white fog that had enveloped the entire old campus area dissipated completely.","The true form of Xie Wang appeared before Song Shuhang and the others.","It was a group of pitch-black humanoids.","They were about two meters tall, with some being overweight and others slender. Some of them were suppressed by Pavilion Master Chu’s water pillars, and it was unknown whether they were still alive or not.","Without the white fog, these humanoid beings seemed somewhat frightened.","Some of them attempted to burrow into the ground, but they had no escape from Pavilion Master Chu’s seal.","“If they were in human form, it wouldn’t be easy to devour them,” Song Shuhang said with regret.","The western monk, Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi, Eon Sea Scholar, and Daoist Nun Miao Qing were all left speechless.","What did he mean by “it wouldn’t be easy to devour them’!?","Did Senior Tyrannical Song intend to consume these malevolent entities?","“Xie Wang doesn’t have a fixed form, especially the fusion-type malevolent entities. Perhaps they can transform into other forms,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet reminded.","“Hoo, hoo!” At this moment, the humanoids on the other side began to move.","They started to gather.","They even had facial features on their heads.","“Hoo, hoo!” One particularly robust Xie Wang began to shout.","Its expression was fierce, with wide-open eyes and a protruding tongue which made for a menacing gesture.","“Hoo, hoo, hoo, hoo!” Behind it, all the Xie Wang began to shout in unison while singing some syllables.","At the same time, they stomped their feet vigorously and waved their arms in an imposing manner.","While singing, they began to stomp their feet and slowly advanced towards Song Shuhang and the others!","Closer and closer!","“Hoo-la-la, hoo-la-la!” The Xie Wangs shouted loudly in unison.","Song Shuhang could even hear a few of them. Their voices cracked because they were shouting so loudly.","“What are they doing?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","“Perhaps... Are they trying to scare us away?” Soft Feather guessed.","Su Clan’s Sixteen commented, “It’s quite imposing. This kind of roaring voice has the taste of a battle song. In addition to their orderly movements, it looks like some kind of haka?”","Song Shuhang nodded silently and memorized this scene.","Perhaps it would come in handy in the future.","After recording everything, Song Shuhang lightly snapped his fingers.","The virtuous lamia pointed her finger at Xie Wang and repeatedly pointed.","Tut-tut-tut-tut","In an instant, countless rays of light exploded.","The dancing and singing Xie Wang fell like wheat.","The scene was extremely tragic.."]},{"number":2526,"title":"Chapter 2526: My Name is Song Shuhang, and I Love Discounts!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2526: My Name is Song Shuhang, and I Love Discounts!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The degree of its tragedy was enough to make a tough guy shed tears!","In just a moment, the group of Xie Wangs that had been angrily dancing and sticking their tongues out in front of Song Shuhang and the others were all captured in one fell swoop.","“Good thing they don’t look cute,” Soft Feather said, “otherwise it would be seen as torturing small animals by dealing with them in such large numbers.”","Eon Sea Scholar asked, “Is it over?”","They had imagined various methods Tyrannical Song would use to deal with these mischievous beings, but they didn’t expect that he wouldn’t even have to lift a finger. Just the combination of some of his pendants could wipe out this batch of fused Xie Wangs.","Truly, Senior Tyrannical Song!","A mere nuisance of this level wasn’t worth his personal intervention!","Senior Tyrannical Song was invincible!","In the eyes of Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miaoqing, the image of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song soared once again.","After sweeping away the mischievous beings, Virtuous Lamia playfully formed her index finger and thumb into the shape of a pistol, held it to her mouth, and blew gently.","“Well done,” Song Shuhang praised her.","As he spoke, he felt strands of virtue gathering on his body from all directions.","There was also a small portion of virtue that fused into the body of the western monk behind him.","“Huh? Master, are you gaining more merit points?” Little Cai asked in surprise.","Having learned the Ksitigarbha’s Soul Ferrying Scripture and the Diary of the Ascetic Senior Monk from Song Shuhang, she was very sensitive to the power of virtue.","“It did increase a bit. Strange... I didn’t gain any merit points the last time I crushed Xie Wang,” Song Shuhang looked at the virtuous lamia in confusion. The virtuous lamia returned to her normal size and sang, “Prices are rising, prices are rising, I don’t even have enough money to spend. Prices are high, prices are rising, and wages can’t keep up with the prices!”","Fairy Creation pursed her lips. Singing used to be her specialty, but the virtuous lamia had a strong learning ability and had taken that specialty away from her.","Song Shuhang was confused.","After a moment of pondering, Soft Feather said, “Fairy, what you are really saying is that it also increased last time, but the increase was like a salary increase, so small that Senior Song, you couldn’t sense it.”","“After all, the Xie Wang you crushed last time were very weak,” Pavilion Master Chu added.","“Interesting. I’ll beat the next wave of Xie Wang to the brink of death. Then, Little Cai, you can go up and try to strengthen your power of virtue,” Song Shuhang said to his eldest disciple on his shoulder.","Song Shuhang understood the power of virtue better than most people in the cultivation world. This thing was a versatile discount card! With strong virtue, you could reduce the power of curses, evil spirits, and even heavenly tribulations.","Therefore, he hoped that his disciples could be like him and be covered in a dense light of virtue.","“Alright, Master. No problem, Master,” Little Cai said while flapping her wings. She had been cultivating for a long time, and it was time to spread her wings.","“Sixteen, Soft Feather, you guys can try it out later. Let’s make the most of our time and deal with a few more batches of Xie Wang,” Song Shuhang turned his head and said.","He turned his head and found that Soft Feather had gone to the Xie Wang, who had been struck down by the light of virtue. She held Li Yinzhu in one hand, squatted down, and began to cut the Xie Wangs’ bodies with her immortal sword.","Su Clan’s Sixteen smiled as she followed along with Soft Feather. Some time passed.","“Senior Song, where is the core of this batch?” Soft Feather called out. “I’ve been searching for a while, but I couldn’t find their cores.”","“Although this batch of Xie Wangs appears to be a group of different individuals, in fact, they are still ‘one’ Xie Wang. Look for the Xie Wang that led the singing at the beginning. That should be the real source,” Song Shuhang replied.","Soft Feather’s eyes lit up.","“Are we going to collect these Xie Wangs?’! Su Clan’s Sixteen asked.","“Of course, these Xie Wangs can be collected and used for research. Although they are humanoid and not easy to eat, we will definitely consume them in our experiments on the Evil Phantasm. They can be used as consumables,” Song","Shuhang nodded.","He had to extract the value from every Xie Wang.","Song Shuhang controlled his telekinesis, stretched out his hand, and gathered the bodies of Xie Wang that had been struck down to send them into his Inner World.","There, the core assistant had specially cleared a space in the fragment of the Heavenly City and set up a sealing barrier to store Xie Wang.","“I found it, Senior Song,” Soft Feather said.","She opened her right hand, and there were three black cores on it.","One looked like a peach pit, dry and withered.","One looked like a meatball on a cat’s paq.,r that was soft and squishy.","The last one looked like an irregular piece of metal.","“Why are there three cores?” Daoist Nun Miaoqing asked in confusion.","The western monk joined his palms together and said, “Female benefactor, this Xie Wang is a fusion type. It evolved from the fusion of several different Xie Wangs. That’s why it’s so difficult to deal with.”","“Digging out the core of an Xie Wang feels like opening a treasure chest. 1 wonder what kind of core will come out,” Soft Feather giggled.","She liked the feeling of opening treasure chests.","“Leave the task of digging out the cores to me next time,” Soft Feather said. She extended her hand and tossed the three cores to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang reached out and caught them.","“Wuvvuwu Q’ The Defiant Whale treasure spirit, let out a series of cries.","At the same time, her fingers poked the core of the meatball.","As she gently poked it, a message suddenly flashed in Song Shuhangs mind.","“Fusion-type Xie Wang Core. Possesses powerful fusion and invasiveness.”","“Is this an appraisal technique?”","Moreover, he didn’t have to pay any price to activate the secret appraisal technique that Defiant Whale Fairy had used.","“Could it be that Little Fairy Artifact Spirit also has a discount attribute? By using her secret appraisal technique, the cost of appraisal can be forcibly discounted?” Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat. “Little Fairy Defiant Whale, poke the other two cores!”","If his guess was correct, he had really hit the jackpot.","Although Song Shuhang had a high pain tolerance and could adapt to it well, he wasn’t a masochist. It was good that the pain of each appraisal could be reduced, even if a little,","“Eh?” The Defiant Whale treasure spirit, Little Fairy, knelt on Song Shuhangs finger and swayed gently.","Then, she leaned forward and poked the other two cores with her little hands.","Walnut Core: “Doppelganger Xie Wang. Can split into countless subsidiary bodies using the core as the seed.”","Strange Evil Core: “This Evil Core has signs of artificial cultivation and modification. It is not a naturally occurring evil.”","“Huh?” Song Shuhangs eyes lit up. He had discovered something intriguing.","Artificial cultivation?","Someone had actually developed this technology?"]},{"number":2527,"title":"Chapter 2527: Not Here, Beat It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2527: Not Here, Beat It!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Interesting.” thought Song Shuhang to himself. “If someone has really figured out how to nurture an Xie Wang, it might come in handy in the future.’","However, whether this technique of nurturing Xie Wangs could be useful would depend on when they figured out how to ‘cook Xie Wangs. If his experiment succeeded, the method of nurturing Xie Wangs could be combined to benefit the myriad worlds!","Obtaining the raw materials for braising heavenly tribulations wasn’t something everyone could do, but Xie Wangs were now scattered throughout the myriad worlds which made it convenient to obtain materials. In the future, they might even be artificially raised.","If the experiment succeeded, it would undoubtedly be a significant achievement.","With these thoughts in mind, Song Shuhang silently moved the odd core to the side and stored it separately.","Although the secret appraisal technique didn’t provide any further hints, Song Shuhang had some theories about the origin of this ‘artificially nurtured Xie Wang Core.’","If his suspicions were correct, then this method of nurturing Xie Wang might be connected to his destiny.","“Is there something off about that core?” Pavilion Master Chu inquired when she saw Song Shuhang separate the core.","“Yes, this core seems a bit different,” Song Shuhang replied with a faint smile. He then transmitted information about the core to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group in the cultivation chat.","As soon as he uploaded information about the Xie Wang, senior members lurking in the group began to emerge one after another.","Pavilion Master Chu asked in puzzlement, “Artificial nurturing?”","Dragon God of the Beast Cultivation World, also known as Dragon Ball, exclaimed, “Holy crap, who’s got nothing better to do than artificially nurture Xie Wangs?”","The beast cultivation world was rife with malevolence, and the lingering effects of the fallen divine weapon of the Netherworld still haunted it. The big shots in the beast cultivation world were currently facing a headache.","Even Senior Divine Dragon, who was undergoing the Holy Mountain trial, was aware of the chaotic situation in the beast cultivation world.","Seeing that someone was actually nurturing Xie Wang, it couldn’t contain its astonishment.","This was madness!","Venerable Yellow Mountain inquired, “Shuhang, do you know who’s behind this?”","Song Shuhang responded, “Yes, I have some suspicions, but I lack concrete evidence.’","Soft Feather added, “Could it be... Is it the Limitless Demon Sect we discussed during lunch?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen chimed in. “Limitless Demon Sect?”","“It’s just a conjecture. There’s no evidence to confirm it, and 1 can’t be certain.","However, didn’t the Limitless Demon Sect recently make significant moves? Moreover, they appear to be harboring a crucial internal plan. Additionally, during lunch, I overheard someone mentioning that the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect are subduing Xie Wangs everywhere. It struck me as somewhat peculiar,” Song Shuhang explained.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was cautious. “Sixth Son, Fairy Dongfang Six, do either of you have any information?”","Fairy Dongfang Six, also known as the God of Racing, responded, “I’ll investigate it, but I won’t get your hopes up. Although we both belong to demonic sects, we don’t see eye to eye with the Limitless Demon Sect. We placed spies in the Limitless Demon Sect a long time ago. I wonder if we can still make contact with them now.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain reminded him, “Do your best, but exercise caution when probing. Don’t get entangled in this matter.”","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, also known as Tycoon Jie, interjected,","“Strange, am I dreaming? Soft Feather, did I just wake up recently?”","In the real world, Soft Feather looked at Song Shuhang quizzically while raising an eyebrow.","“Don’t look at me; I don’t have a clue,” Song Shuhang waved his hand.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, also known as Envious Senior Style, queried, “Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly, what have you been up to these past few days? We’ve been waiting for you to join us for some experiments. Why haven’t you come over yet? We’re now forced to split everything in half to use it.”","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was left speechless.","The sage contemplated deeply.","In his memory, the last recollection was of a sudden urge to test his daughter’s cultivation progress.","Then...his memories became somewhat hazy.","There appeared to be a massive explosion?","Terrifying destruction?","An overwhelming power that could induce despair?","After that, he seemed to have lost consciousness.","Well, did his daughter knock him out a few days ago?","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly began to question the course of his life.","He swiftly sent a message to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, “Soft Feather, what is my current condition?”","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s words contained a wealth of information.","Upon learning that the Celestial Thearch had replaced Soft Feather and was temporarily staying on Spirit Butterfly Island, Song Shuhang and Soft Feather had numerous thoughts running through their minds.","In the real world, Soft Feather once again glanced at Song Shuhang while contemplating how to respond to her father.","“Perhaps ask the Celestial Thearch?” Song Shuhang suggested.","The Celestial Thearch had blocked him, and he hadn’t been able to contact her for the past few days. Furthermore, the Celestial Thearch hadn’t transferred any energy during this time.","“Soft Feather?” Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly called out once more.","Soft Feather pretended to be unconscious.","Simultaneously, she discreetly reached out to the Celestial Thearch, “What’s happening to my father?”","“Your father is in excellent condition. He i s still in seclusion. Over the past few days, his cultivation has advanced by leaps and bounds under the influence of my various precious elixirs. When he emerges from seclusion, his cultivation will undoubtedly skyrocket.” the Celestial Thearch swiftly responded.","Soft Feather was left speechless.","“If you don’t believe me, would you like me to send you a photo?” the Celestial Thearch added.","It didn’t sound like she was joking.","After contemplating for a while, Soft Feather went online and replied, “Father, have you forgotten? You’re currently in seclusion. Your strength has made tremendous progress during this period of closed-door cultivation. Right now, your cultivation is advancing by leaps and bounds!”","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was baffled.","“Huh, although it appears as though I’ve been in a deep slumber, my strength has genuinely increased significantly. As for the results of my hundred years of arduous cultivation...” Lord Spirit Butterfly began.","“Congratulations, Senior Spirit Butterfly!” Song Shuhang quickly chimed in.","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly acknowledged him. “@ Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Fellow Daoist Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, I might have to wait until the end of my seclusion before coming over to assist.”","“If you’re in seclusion, there’s nothing you can do. Congratulations, Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly!” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue replied with a smile.","Soft Feather and Song Shuhang breathed a collective sigh of relief.","Fortunately, Senior Spirit Butterfly loved his daughter dearly, so he wouldn’t delve too deeply into this matter.","“Very delicious,” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue commented, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, do you still have the raw materials for the heavenly tribulation? The materials you provided last time have been depleted.”","“Immortal Fairy, have you mastered the method of creating the heavenly tribulation set meal?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue replied, “I’ve grasped a portion of it, but I still require additional materials to experiment with more heavenly tribulation recipes. Do you have enough materials for the Inner Demon Tribulation?”","“Immortal Fairy, please wait a moment. Also... I have a new project here. Would you be interested in participating, Immortal Fairy?” Song Shuhang proposed.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue: “?”","“Regarding the cooking method of Xie Wang, see if there’s a way to arrange Xle Wang on the dining table like the inner demon, Song Shuhang replied.","At the same time, he thought for a moment and opened the VIP group. He opened the profile picture of More than Senior.","“Senior, are you there?” Song Shuhang sent a message.","Not Only Demon Emperor: “Not here, scram!”"]},{"number":2528,"title":"Chapter 2528: Human Customer Service 001, Madam Long Luo, At Your Service","paragraphs":["Chapter 2528: Human Customer Service 001, Madam Long Luo, At Your Service","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior, don’t worry, I’m not planning to deceive you this time,” Song","Shuhang responded cheerfully while paying little attention to Senior More","Than’s tone. Lately, no influential figure had remotely divined him, and he","had just obliterated the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, so he had no immediate concerns.","The Demon Emperor remained silent.","“I, the great Demon Emperor of an era, once ruled over the land. Wherever the Demon God Pillars landed, it became my Demon Country. Why should I fear you just because you claim not to deceive me? Do you think I’ll believe you?” He grew increasingly uneasy as he spoke.","The Demon Emperor extended his divine sense across the planet where he was temporarily residing. At this moment, the Demon Emperor had relocated to a plane even he was unfamiliar with. He had established a temporary cave dwelling and set up various intricate arrays.","“I couldn’t find any trace of Tyrannical Song, and there are no signs of an outsider’s intrusion,” the Demon Emperor’s avatar reported with a deep voice.","The frowning wasn’t limited to the Demon Emperor alone.","“Perhaps he was just bored and wanted to chat with you?” one of the Demon Emperor’s clones speculated.","“If I hadn’t been ambushed by him in the Black Dragon World and betrayed, I would have already crushed him to death,” the Demon Emperor coldly remarked.","“He’s a troublesome mammal,” the clone reminded. “You even admitted that last time.’","As they conversed, Song Shuhang sent another private message: “Senior, do you have knowledge of the concept of evil?”","The Demon Emperor was once again left speechless.","“Nonsense. I attained Dao immortality during the immemorial era, and I’ve encountered many manifestations of evil,” he replied.","At one point, he had deeply studied Xie Wang while attempting to subdue and absorb them in order to transform them into some kind of demon god pillar.","“I believe you are familiar with Xie Wang. Have you ever delved into the art of cultivating Xie Wang?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Even if he didn’t respond to his question, Shuhang was content to continue asking.","The Demon Emperor remained speechless.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song seemed intent on deceiving him while secretly studying him.","“I suspect you’ve explored this aspect and conducted experiments,” Song Shuhang continued.","“What is he up to?” the Demon Emperor muttered while tapping his chair’s armrest.","At the same time, he attempted to manipulate Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs cultivation chat friend function to block him. Ideally, he wished he could simply delete Tyrannical Song.","“So, Senior, how feasible do you think it is to turn ‘Xie Wang into an ingredient on the dining table?” Song Shuhang suddenly posed another question. “Your Heavenly Tribulation Feast menu can even transform heavenly tribulations and Heart-Linking Demons into ingredients. Wouldn’t it be easier for Xie Wang, who possess a physical body, to become an ingredient?”","Song Shuhangs questions concealed his true intentions—to confirm some of his suspicions about the Demon Emperor. Additionally, if Senior was willing to answer directly, it would be a valuable gain.","In any case, asking the questions didn’t cost him anything, and it might lead to useful information.","Once again, the Demon Emperor was left speechless.","Had Tyrannical Song fully mastered his Heavenly Tribulation Feast?","Just as the Demon Emperor’s emotions fluctuated, a notification sounded in his mind.","[Ding! Detected user [Blacklist.Falling into a Box] attempting to infiltrate the Cultivation Chat system as the Demon Emperor. Switching artificial intelligence mode to human customer service mode. Hello, customer service [Long Luo’s Will, Lady Fat Ball] is at your service.]","The Demon Emperor was puzzled.","[Hello, customer service number 001, Ms. Fat Ball, at your service. I’ve already been waiting for you for a long time.] The emotionless voice of Madam Long Luo resonated in the Demon Emperor’s mind.","The Demon Emperor remained silent.","The recent upgrade of Song Shuhang’s cultivation chat was supported by the will of Long Luo, known as Lady Kunna. She had made every effort to assist the evolution of Song Shuhangs cultivation chat function.","To ensure the continued operation of Song Shuhangs cultivation chat on a daily basis, Lady Kunna had established two layers of safeguards.","The first layer involved transforming Song Shuhangs will into an artificial intelligence known as ‘Squirrel,’ responsible for maintaining the system’s normal operation.","When a problem exceeded the squirrel’s capabilities, it would be forwarded to the human customer service lady. At present, Long Luo’s will personally handled the role of customer service lady.","Lady Long Luo had been silently working as a human customer service lady without receiving any salary, all in preparation for this day.","The Demon Emperor was in Song Shuhang’s cultivation chat friend list. Given the Demon Emperor’s character, it was certain that he would cause trouble one day.","As soon as he regained a bit of his strength, he would inevitably attempt to infiltrate the cultivation chat system!","Madam Long Luo had always believed in this possibility.","When the Demon Emperor attempted to infiltrate cultivation chat, the squirrel would transfer the issue to the human customer service lady. When enemies met, their eyes turned red!","At that time, if Song Shuhang hadn’t come to the Black Dragon World by chance, the Black Dragon World might have already changed its name to the More Than Demon’s World.","Madam Long Luo held a grudge.jpg","“Black Dragon World, Dragon Channel’s Will?” the Demon Emperor was stunned.","Why was the will of the Dragon Channel appearing in Tyrannical Songs ‘cultivation chat’ when the Black Dragon World was separated from the main world, making infiltration difficult?","The human service lady, Ms. Long Luo, spoke with her cold and emotionless voice: “Dear user [Blacklist, Falling into a Box], due to your attempt to invade and infiltrate the cultivation chat, we will impose the appropriate penalties.”","“Hehe, come at me if you have the guts.” The corners of the Demon Emperor’s mouth curled up as he said, “In this world, no one knows you better than I do, Long Luo of the Black Dragon World... I know you better than you know yourself. I know every single structure of your dragon network, every single node, and every single storage location of your spells.”","He was intimately familiar with Long Luffs methods.","If she truly dared to cross the boundary and target him, not only would the Demon Emperor have no qualms about severing the hand that crossed the boundary, but he would also turn it into his own nourishment to recover from his injuries.","“You’re scary,” Lady Long Luo replied, “but we are living beings, not lifeless creatures. Living beings continue to learn. You may know everything about my past, but you can’t possibly know everything about me now! My name is Lady","Fat Ball.’","This name held profound meaning.","She had obtained certain information from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. The information belonged to the Fat Ball.","It was the result of the Impregnating Gaze that Song Shuhang had brought from the main world to the Black Dragon World.","Combining some of the information from the Fat Ball, Lady Long Luo had created new spells.","“Level 10 Blessing Spell: You Are a Good Person..”"]},{"number":2529,"title":"Chapter 2529: This Round Goes to You","paragraphs":["Chapter 2529: This Round Goes to You","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Lady Long Luo had a knack for naming spells with simplicity and clarity that cut straight to the point without any hidden meanings.","A Level 10 spell signified that it surpassed the power of a Ninth Stage","Tribulation Transcender and was backed by the combined might of the entire","Black Dragon World’s dragon channel. It embodied the will of the Black Dragon World and represented the ultimate in magical prowess!","Moreover, this spell was not of the offensive variety; it was, in fact, a blessing spell. However, one should not underestimate the potential harm that blessing spells could inflict on certain special groups. Blessing spells, despite their benign effects, proved poisonous to some. Resisting blessing spells was even more troublesome than countering offensive ones.","The name of the final spell, ‘You’re a Good Person,” directly mirrored its effect.","Under the influence of this potent blessing magic, even the most wicked wrongdoers would find their inner kindness stirred and lead them to perform acts of benevolence that could move one to tears.","The severely wounded and weakened Demon Emperor fell victim to it in an instant.","Just moments ago, he had been mentally simulating Lady Long Luffs remote attack against him while pondering how to intercept her assault and absorb her power to rejuvenate himself and reduce his vulnerability.","But he had never anticipated that Lady Long Luo’s long-range attack would turn out to be a Blessing Spell.","Blessing her enemies and pummeling her teammates?","All the defensive measures he had hastily set up proved futile. The only defense that held was his mental fortitude. Nevertheless, these defenses proved entirely inadequate against Lady Long Luo’s ‘Blessing.’","In the next moment, the Level-10 spell, ‘You’re a Good Man,’ was triggered!","Even with the Demon Emperor’s high-level cultivation, he would remain under the spell’s sway for approximately ten seconds.","Ten seconds. It was neither excessively long nor overly brief.","After falling victim to it, the Demon Emperor’s eyes welled up with tears as his irises turned crimson. He suddenly comprehended the extent of his wickedness and callousness in his past actions. He felt utterly unworthy of being called a human.","Then, he recalled the final private message exchange between himself and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had inquired about the Xie Wang while pondering if it could be transformed into an ingredient and featured on the dining table.","“Each of us bears a responsibility to vanquish Xie Wang. It is our obligation to convert evil into good. Tyrannical Song, I wholeheartedly support your idea.”","The Demon Emperor not only swiftly responded to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song but also added several thumbs-up emojis.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Heavens above, has he suddenly gone mad?","While Song Shuhang was puzzling over this, he was inundated with a torrent of messages.","With the noble ideal of ‘concern for the nation and its people, prioritizing the world, and worrying about myriad realms,’ the Demon Emperor promptly shared his research findings on Xie Wang with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","The Demon Emperor had indeed conducted experiments on breeding, but he had only scratched the surface, merely touching upon the topic before setting aside this aspect of his research.","These experimental records were all included in the legacy he left behind on the surface. By now, they should have been scattered among various demonic sects. Perhaps one of these sects had completed his research and perfected the experiment.","In addition to this, the Demon Emperor had also undertaken some preliminary investigations on the possibility of converting Xie Wang into a culinary ingredient... However, midway through his research, he changed direction and began a new experiment: transforming heavenly tribulation into a meal.","To be precise, he found the inspiration for creating the Feast of Heavenly Tribulation.","Hence, if he desired to explore the concept of transforming evil ingredients, he could reverse-engineer the feast menu to gain insights.","Ultimately, the Demon Emperor’s dossier encompassed dozens of plans for capturing living Xie Wang of various attributes, securely packaging them, and transporting them to the laboratory for containment.","This approach guaranteed the freshness of the experimental subjects.","Song Shuhang, who was currently in Wenzhou City, found himself dumbfounded after receiving this massive influx of information.","Had Song Shuhangs repeated attempts to exploit this demon finally backfired?","“Thank you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. Work diligently for the happiness of all worlds’ inhabitants and strive for the ascension of countless beings!’ Senior Niore than One appended.","For a moment, Senior More than One’s image in Song Shuhangs mind radiated brilliance.","After some contemplation, Song Shuhang commenced an examination of the information. He encountered some sections too profound for his understanding, but the fundamental information appeared theoretically viable.","Subsequently, he shared the information separately with Pavilion Master Chu, the White Dragon, and Senior White Two... Since Senior White’s main body was currently engrossed in experiments, Song Shuhang chose not to disturb him at this time.","He then conveyed the information to Su Clan’s Sixteen, Soft Feather, Senior Stone Tablet, and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Moments later, Pavilion Master Chu replied while somewhat befuddled, “Though I can’t confirm its veracity, this information does seem theoretically sound.’","“Likewise,” the White Dragon concurred, “l sense no issues with the information. If you remain skeptical, we can conduct experiments to validate it. ”","Senior White Two remained unresponsive for the time being.","“With this information at hand, I can collaborate with Immortal Fairy Bie Xue... We should be able to develop ‘Evil Cuisine’ soon,” Song Shuhang mused, stroking his chin. “So, should I express gratitude to Senior More than One?” While he couldn’t fathom what had prompted Senior More than One’s generosity, the wealth of research materials and information was undeniable.","“Thank you,” Soft Feather chimed in. “It should be quite interesting.”","“That’s true,” Song Shuhang concurred.","Indeed, it was quite fascinating.","Hence, Song Shuhang brought up the list containing Senior More than One’s name: “Thank you for the information provided by Senior More than One. If my research proves successful in the future, I will express my gratitude in front of the myriad worlds during my next speech!”","On the other side...","The magical effects that had enveloped the Demon Emperor had dissipated long ago.","He stared impassively at Tyrannical Songs message.","“Was all of this part of your scheme?” the Demon Emperor intoned with a deep voice, referring to his encounter with Lady Long Luo.","“Is there anything else I can assist you with, Mr. Box? If not, please take a moment to rate my service,” The artificial customer service attendant, Miss Long Luo, continued in her emotionless tone.","“I admit I underestimated you, but next time, your little tricks won’t succeed with me,” the Demon Emperor responded calmly.","Even in the face of his defeat at Lady Long Luffs hands, he remained unruffled.","“Then, let’s wait and see,” Madam Long Luo responded sweetly. “As I’ve mentioned before, I am a living being, not an inanimate object.”","“Humph,” the Demon Emperor snorted, crushing the armrest as he terminated the call with Madam Long Luo.","Subsequently, he opened Song Shuhangs message: “Tyrannical Song, you’ve won this round.’","Song Shuhang was baffled.."]},{"number":2530,"title":"Chapter 2530: Look Back Or I’ll Smoke You","paragraphs":["Chapter 2530: Look Back Or I’ll Smoke You","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","What’s going on? Why did I win more than just one round against the Demon Emperor?","Could it be that the ‘timeline’ jumped without my knowledge?","Song Shuhang was utterly perplexed.","“Ding ding” At that moment, Pavilion Master Chu lightly tapped Song Shuhangs iron-like skull and asked, “What are you doing? Suddenly spacing out?”","“It seems like I unwittingly fleeced more than just the Demon Emperor’s wool again,” Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","“I feel like Senior’s condition today is off, and his personality is capricious... It seems like I can’t fleece his wool anymore,” Song Shuhang sighed and added, “Unfortunately, King Kun got beaten into an egg by me and handed over to Senior White Two. It was not easy to add another piece to the Wool-Fleecing No. 2 collection.’","He didn’t know when he’d have the chance to add a standard big shot like Senior King Kun to the Blacklist No. 2.","The White Dragon, upon hearing this, suggested, “Actually, Shuhang, you can send your QR code to the Ball Shuhang clone on Mars. If he encounters a suitable opponent on Mars, you can ask the clone to reveal the QR code.”","“... Are you trying to say, Scarf Fairy, that you’re a sneaky dragon?” Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help but quip.","“Great idea!” Song Shuhangs eyes lit up. “I’ll have to figure out a way to send the QR code.”","Those who dared to challenge the fat ball’s clone on Mars were at least at the Immortal level.","If some big shots there met the criteria, they could be added to Blacklist 2 and make the currently quiet Blacklist 2 more lively.","“Regarding the research material that Senior More Than sent over earlier, we can put it to good use,” Song Shuhang suggested.","“The experimental materials 1 just obtained could come in handy,” Stone","Tablet Fellow Daoist chimed in. “Open up an experimental area for me in your small world, and I’ll verify this part of the data.”","If the experiment succeeded, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song might really be able to create the Evil Feast. Presumably, whether it was the ruler of the","Netherworld, White Two, or the main world’s Sage White, they would all like it very much. Therefore, as its master’s most loyal magical treasure, it had the obligation to help Song Shuhang complete the experiment of the Evil Feast.","Black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhangs shadow and said,","“I’ll go in and help Senior Stone Tablet.”","Regardless, her main body was by Senior Songs side. If she stayed here, her ‘experiences’ would only overlap with her main body’s. It was better for her to do something she wanted to do.","For example, she could quietly study and happily carry out some challenging experiments to verify and practice her theoretical knowledge.","“Go ahead. Then, I’ll see if I can trick Immortal Fairy Bie Xue into coming over to help us complete the experiment,” Song Shuhang laughed.","Behind him, when Wu Yinzi, Eon Sea Scholar, and Daoist Nun Miaoqing heard Profound Sage Tyrannical Song mention the words ‘Immortal Fairy Bie Xue,’ their mouths began to water.","Although Immortal Fairy Bie Xue wasn’t the most beautiful fairy in the cultivation world, she was definitely the most drool-worthy fairy.","On the other side, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue furrowed her brow as she contemplated Tyrannical Songs suggestion.","“Bringing Evil Fantasy to the dining table just like inner demons?” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue rubbed her forehead.","If someone had told her a few months ago that they wanted to eat Xie Wangs, she would have slapped them. Could something like Xie Wangs be eaten?","But now, even the mighty heavenly tribulation had become an ingredient... It seemed more feasible to bring Xie Wangs, who had a physical form, to the dining table.","After pondering for a long time, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue replied, “Are you confident in turning Xie Wangs into an ingredient?”","“I’ve just received a detailed research report from an ancient big shot.","According to the ancient big shot, his inspiration for studying the Heavenly Tribulation Set Meal came from his research on Xie Wangs. Therefore, if you wish to deepen your understanding of the Heavenly Tribulation Set, you can join our Xie Wang Research Project,” Song Shuhang replied.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue instantly agreed. “Deal!”","The research materials of the ancient big shot who created the Heavenly Tribulation Set were too enticing for her.","She really couldn’t resist such a massive temptation.","For her, this kind of research information on ingredients was comparable to the allure of Tribulation Transcender-level cultivation techniques for ordinary itinerant cultivators.","Moreover, that ancient big shot hadn’t completed the transformation of the evil ingredient. If she took over, it would be a challenge for her.","A challenge on the path of Immortal Chefs!","“Where are you now? I’ll come find you,” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue eagerly inquired.","Song Shuhang chuckled.","“You used the ‘More Than Demon Emperor Xie Wangs Research Material’ enticement attack on Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue received 10,000 points of damage.","“You have successfully lured Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.”","Song Shuhang said, “Immortal Fairy, go find Chu Chu. After that, I’ll use the power of space to bring you here. In addition, you might need immortal kitchen utensils during the experiment, Immortal Fairy, remember to bring them along.”","Chu Chu had the coordinates of the wooden saber imprinted on her.","This way, he could directly bring Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu into his Inner World.","If he was lucky, he might be able to taste Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s cooking tonight.","“Then, let’s move on to the next evil place.” Song Shuhang turned around and said to the Eon Sea Scholar.","Eon Sea Scholar nodded and said, “The strongest Xie Wang closest to us is Hu","Ao, a mountain village two towns away. There is a Level 5 Xie Wang in a forest there. Its exact strength is unknown.”","“Let’s go. When the time comes, I’ll beat Xie Wang half to death first. Then,","Sixteen, Soft Feather, and Little Cai will take turns killing a few Xie Wangs.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and summoned the Divine Lobster’s Chariot.","Before leaving, he glanced at the western monk and Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi.","After pondering for a moment, he took out a box and threw it to the western monk.","“Senior Song, what is this?” The western monk took the small box in confusion.","“This is a special product of my small world. If it is nurtured by a precious","Immortal in a spring, it can extend one’s lifespan by another 20 years.” Song","Shuhang said via secret sound transmission, “l think you might need it.”","The western monk was stunned for a moment, and then he clasped his hands together in front of Song Shuhang.","His master, Daoist Priest Wu Yinzi, had been severely injured when he was young, and he didn’t have long to live.","Previously, his master had already consumed the living spring water. The present that Senior Song gave him would allow his master to enjoy another twenty years of life.","He really couldn’t refuse this gift.","Even if his master slapped him every day, he still loved his master very much.","Unfortunately, it would be even better if his master was a monk. The western monk looked at Wu Yinzi with a complicated gaze.","“What?” Wu Yinzi said warily.","“Actually, Master, your hairstyle is really suitable for a bald head.” The western monk gave him a thumbs up and grinned.","Wu Yinzi was speechless.","I’ll beat you to death later!"]},{"number":2531,"title":"Chapter 2531: Aren ‘t You Afraid of Shortening His Lifespan?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2531: Aren ‘t You Afraid of Shortening His Lifespan?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Divine Lobster’s Chariot lived up to its reputation with its impressive speed.","This flying magical treasure was Song Shuhang’s absolute favorite and even featured its own guardrails that provided a sense of security during flights.","Once aboard the Divine Lobster’s Chariot, Eon Sea Scholar nervously reached out and gently touched the chariot’s guardrail. “Senior Tyrannical Song, is this one of your life-bound magical treasures?”","“That’s correct,” Song Shuhang replied.","Eon Sea Scholar couldn’t contain his excitement. “Just as I suspected, this is an Immortal’s divine weapon!’","Deep within the Divine Lobster’s Chariot, there seemed to reside an immensely powerful heart core and continuously supplied boundless energy to the chariot.","Given Eon Sea Scholar’s abilities, he couldn’t determine the core’s exact level, but considering Senior Tyrannical Songs status, this chariot %vvas very likely the legendary ‘Immortal divine weapon’!","To have the chance to sit on an Immortal’s divine weapon in his lifetime was more than worth it.","A low hum emanated from the Divine Lobster Chariot as it seemed to respond slightly to Eon Sea Scholar’s touch.","“An artifact spirit?” Daoist Nun Miao Qing couldn’t help but blurt out. “Senior Tyrannical Song, does this chariot possess another weapon spirit?”","Soft Feather blinked and explained, “Not quite. This is merely a weak divine weapon consciousness. It will take some time before it can fully condense into a weapon spirit. Most of Senior Songs life-bound magical treasures are still at this stage.”","“l recall hearing that Senior Tyrannical Songs life-bound magical treasure is a combination of 33 divine weapons, correct?” Eon Sea Scholar quickly inquired.","“One set indeed consists of thirty-three pieces,” Song Shuhang confirmed with a smile.","But now, he possessed two complete sets. After Senior White Two generously lent him a set, he hadn’t taken it back.","This second set technically belonged to Senior White Two, but in reality, Song","Shuhang had been using it as his own.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing and Eon Sea Scholar were astounded.","In their minds, Senior Tyrannical Song’s stature had once again soared. In the future, they would have plenty to boast about when conversing with their fellow Daoists.","Miao Qing couldn’t resist taking out her phone and snapping a selfie with Eon Sea Scholar.","“Currently, we’re riding on Senior Tyrannical Songs Immortal divine weapon, the Divine Lobster Chariot, and having a blast!”","Deep within the mountain village, the Xie Wang Cave was also guarded by professionally trained sentinels to prevent unsuspecting villagers or travelers from stumbling into this perilous place.","Song Shuhang’s Divine Lobster’s Chariot landed quietly more than 200 meters away from Xie Wangs cave. They chose to disembark and approach on foot, leaving the chariot behind.","Inside the Divine Lobster’s Chariot lay the heart of a fake big-eyed planet boss. If it were to land directly in front of ordinary people, the pressure it exuded would be quite substantial.","“Senior Song, once we enter Xie Wang’s cave, can we handle the Xie Wang ourselves initially? If things get too tough, then, Senior Song, you can step in?” Soft Feather extended her hand and handed over Li Yinzhu to Song Shuhang.","After all, the enjoyment of facing Xie Wang lay in experiencing the process.","Song Shuhang smiled and agreed, “Certainly. When we enter the nest, I’ll first brief you on the Xie Wangs characteristics. You all can engage them initially, and I’ll be there to support from the rear.”","He picked up the slumbering Li Yinzhu and secured her on his back. Simultaneously, his flowing hair transformed into a braid that cradled Li","Yinzhu.","Pavilion Master Chu was left momentarily stunned.","The Nine Slashes of Braid Saber, which she had imparted to Song Shuhang, was now being showcased with various intricate maneuvers.","Upon reflection, it became clear that regardless of the magical technique, it took on a peculiar twist in Song Shuhangs hands.","“Senior Chu, you’re too kind,” Song Shuhang replied modestly.","As they conversed, the group arrived at the location of Xie Wangs lair.","The guards in charge spotted Song Shuhang’s group approaching from a distance. Two of them hastened forward to welcome them.","“Hold it right there. This is a dangerous area. Please refrain from getting any closer,” one of the guards gestured to Song Shuhang and his companions.","Song Shuhang turned to Eon Sea Scholar for guidance.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, due to our hasty arrival, 1 haven’t had a chance to inform the guards responsible for this area,” Eon Sea Scholar explained.","Senior Tyrannical Song’s decision to confront Xie Wang was a spur-of-the-moment one.","Eon Sea Scholar had only managed to report that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song intended to deal with Xie Wang, but he hadn’t specified which Xie Wang he wanted to confront.","“But that’s not an issue. We can simply reveal our identities to them,” Daoist Nun Miao Qing added.","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement.","At that moment, one of the two guards who had approached, a bespectacled man, suddenly exclaimed, “Song Shuhang?”","Song Shuhang raised an eyebrow, puzzled by the unexpected recognition.","The bespectacled man appeared to be in his forties.","To address him by name, he must have been someone who knew him.","However, Song Shuhang couldn’t recall ever meeting this uncle-like figure.","“You must be Shuhang, Mr. Songs child, right? I’m a friend of your father’s... Ever since your role in the movie Apocalypse War, Mr. Song has been singing your praises to us nonstop. We’ve practically grown calluses on our ears from listening to him,” the bespectacled man said with a chuckle. He might not have recognized Song Shuhang without that reference.","A friend of Papa Song?","“Hello, Uncle,” Song Shuhang greeted with a warm and friendly smile.","Eon Sea Scholar behind him was astounded.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing exclaimed, “Oh my!’","Senior Tyrannical Song, what happened to your dignity?","Aren’t you concerned that addressing him as ‘uncle’ might shorten his lifespan?","In the eyes of Daoist Nun Miao Qing and Eon Sea Scholar, Senior Tyrannical Song was an ancient giant who had lived for thousands of years. It seemed a waste of his immortal lifespan to call a forty-something man ‘uncle.’","“By the way, your house is indeed nearby on Baijing Street. It’s a shame I can’t leave right now, or I’d love to meet Mr. Song and have a drink,” the bespectacled uncle chuckled.","After a hearty laugh, he turned serious and cautioned Song Shuhang, “Shuhang, this place is quite dangerous now. If you’re here for leisure, it’s best to find another location.’","He surveyed Song Shuhangs group and noticed both men and women among them. They seemed like they were heading into the mountains for an excursion.","“Don’t worry, Uncle. We’re here to take care of the evil inside this nest,” Song Shuhang reassured with a smile.","The bespectacled uncle was left baffled.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing stepped forward to introduce themselves to the bespectacled man.","Su Clan’s Sixteen smiled at Uncle Glasses, extended her hand, and drew her umbrella blade, following closely behind Song Shuhang.."]},{"number":2532,"title":"Chapter 2532: Version Update – Introducing Recharge Feature!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2532: Version Update – Introducing Recharge Feature!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The bespectacled gentleman observed a sudden glimmer in the hands of Su Clan’s Sixteen, and a beautiful umbrella materialized. Could it be that the child from the Song family and this young lady were both the legendary practitioners?","“Goodbye-,” Soft Feather giggled and waved her hand. Her long, slender legs gracefully took a step, and she teleported behind Song Shuhang.","This young lady was undoubtedly extraordinary!","Meanwhile, the bespectacled gentleman finally took notice of a silver-haired young girl hanging behind Song Shuhang.","At the back of Song Shuhangs head, a few strands of exceptionally long hair tied the silver-haired girl behind him.","Vaguely, he seemed to see two very beautiful... heads? Two beautiful heads sporting different styles sprouted from Song Shuhangs neck, smiling at him.","Had the bespectacled gentleman not possessed a strong mentality and undergone professional training before the world underwent changes, he might have screamed in fear.","“Which cultivation system does the child from the Song family belong to?” The bespectacled gentleman silently touched the phone in his pocket... At this moment, he truly wished to call Mr. Song to calm his nerves.","“Senior Song, please wait for us.” After Eon Sea Scholar introduced his identity, he politely waved at ‘Uncle Tyrannical Song and hurriedly followed Song Shuhang with Daoist Nun Miao Qing.","The bespectacled man remained rooted to the spot. After a while, he turned to his companion.","“Shuzhong, do you know Senior Song?” The captain of the guard team, responsible for handing over Miao Qing to the Daoist Nun, asked the bespectacled man.","“Senior Song? Song Shuhang?” The bespectacled gentleman nodded.","“Shuzhong, your opportunity might be coming.” The captain suggested. “The child from your old friend’s family is not an ordinary person,” he said. “Senior Song holds a very high seniority in the world of cultivation. He doesn’t look as young as he appears; he might have lived for hundreds of years or even longer. Although the Daoist nun didn’t reveal much, 1 can sense a lot from her expression. ”","The bespectacled gentleman was speechless.","The child from the Song family was Senior Song as referred to by others, and he hadn’t quite gotten used to it.","“Even a child is so powerful and respected. In other words, your old friend is very likely to be a reclusive expert. He’s definitely stronger than Senior Song. After this mission, there might be some downtime. You can consider meeting your old friend,” the captain suggested.","In this unpredictable era, it was crucial to connect with a hidden expert. Perhaps, in a crisis, they could save your life.","As for Senior Songs father, the hidden expert, since he was willing to become friends with Shuzhong... He must have admired something about him.","This was an opportunity!","“Mr. Song, is he a reclusive expert?” Shuzhong pushed his glasses up as he recalled Papa Songs experience after they met.","In his memories, no matter how he looked at it, Mr. Song had never revealed his powers.","He had completely integrated into the lives of ordinary people. Mr. Song was indeed amazing!","The bespectacled gentleman sighed.","At this moment, Papa Song, who was far away on Baijing Street, suddenly looked up at the sky in bafflement.","“What are you doing?” Mama Song asked.","Papa Song lowered his head and continued washing the dishes. “My brain is still slowly receiving feedback from my body,” he replied.","His body had accepted the huge amount of information that his son had spoken and was now slowly feeding it back to his brain for digestion.","In Xie Wangs nest, the virtuous lamia puffed up her cheeks and blew hard, dispersing all the evil energy that enveloped the nest, revealing the Xie Wangs body that was hiding here.","A five-meter-tall beast appeared in front of everyone.","This was another kind of Xie Wang that had a physical body!","It looked like a canine, but its forelimbs were short and stubby, while its hind limbs were strong and muscular. It looked quite appetizing.","At this time, the five-meter-tall Xie Wang retreated timidly while looking at Song Shuhang and the others vigilantly while constantly baring its teeth.","“l bet it will be even more delicious than the previous batch of Xie Wang,” Soft Feather said.","“l think so too,” Song Shuhang agreed.","At the same time, he glanced at this dog-shaped Xie Wang, and the information about Xie Wang in his mind quickly entered and compared with the Xie Wang in front of him.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miaoqing were confused.","This time, they didn’t hear wrong... Senior Tyrannical Song and the others wanted to eat the Xie Wang!","Su Clan’s Sixteen spun the umbrella in her hand and asked, “Shuhang, do you have any information about this Xie Wang?”","“Yes, this is a beast-shaped resentment Xie Wang. It’s formed when the resentment of living beings and the power of disaster Xie Wang merge, creating this beast-shaped Xie Wang. Its specialty is its potentially powerful illusion techniques. Virtue power will have a deterrent effect on it, and attacks using ‘willpower’ will be particularly effective. Saber intent, sword intent, fist intent, and even Chef’s Heart techniques all have a good impact,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Then let me handle this one,” Su Clan’s Sixteen pulled out the straight-edged saber from the umbrella, and a dominating saber intent condensed on the edge of her blade.","The White Dragon lazily turned around, and a pure white power of virtue covered Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body.","“The scarf around Profound Sage Sixteen’s neck is actually formed by the power of virtue?” Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing discovered another intriguing detail.","Furthermore, Profound Sage Sixteen’s power of virtue was beyond imagination. Even the slightest aura that leaked out made their legs go weak.","“Pay attention to its illusion techniques. Don’t be fooled by its appearance,” Song Shuhang reminded.","“Got it,” Su Clan’s Sixteen gently swung the straight blade in her hand.","The other ‘willpower’ hidden within the overpowering saber intent quietly dispersed. That power transformed into paper within Xie Wangs nest, secretly sketching a scroll.","The dog-shaped Xie Wang glanced at Song Shuhang and the others behind him, and then at Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was approaching closer and closer. It let out a low growl and charged towards Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Sixteen didn’t back down. Her petite body burst out with the aura of a giant dragon as she confronted Xie Wang head-on. Against this kind of evil, she chose to confront it directly.","A powerful dragon’s presence enveloped the entire nest.","Soft Feather took out her phone, aimed the camera at Su Clan’s Sixteen, and started recording.","However, due to the influence of the evil aura, coupled with Sixteen’s extremely fast movements, the phone’s camera couldn’t keep up with the scene.","Soft Feather put away her cell phone in disappointment. “What a pity. I originally wanted to record this scene and send it to the Nine Provinces Number One Group. Looks like I’ll have to ask Father to upgrade my phone again. ”","At this moment.","[Ding The little squirrel that hurts my hand: The minor update of the Cultivation Chat’ version has been completed. The new version will provide top-up functions, group live-streaming functions, and donation functions. Fellow Daoists, you are welcome to experience the new version.]","Little Squirrel: “@[Purple Grape] King Kun, thank you for your feedback on the ‘top-up function! suggestion. You will receive a 12% discount for the first purchase.”","King Kun Egg was speechless.","The thread of King Kun’s consciousness in Yuanzi’s subconscious was speechless.."]},{"number":2533,"title":"Chapter 2533: A Real Illusion?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2533: A Real Illusion?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Hey? It’s like making a wish, and it comes true!” Soft Feather exclaimed cheerfully.","She needed a ‘live stream’ feature, and Senior Songs cultivation chat had just been upgraded with this new functionality.","Soft Feather gave Song Shuhang a cute thumbs-up. “Senior Song, you’re the best! ”","Song Shuhang was baffled.","In the next moment, in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group:","System Notification: “[Reliable Junior, White Skin] Spirit Butterfly Island’s Soft Feather has activated the group live stream feature. Would you like to watch?”","Always-online Saint Seiya Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “New feature?”","Mother Yellow Mountain,Group Owner Venerable Yellow Mountain chimed in, “Who proposed this top-up function? Shuhang, are you going to turn this innate ability into a mess?”","Soon, the seniors of the Nine Provinces Student Group joined Soft Feather’s live broadcast one after another to experience the effects of the new version and its new features.","Song Shuhang was left baffled.","Su Clan’s Big Horse Monkey Su Clan’s Seven asked, “Is Soft Feather livestreaming the battle between Sixteen and Xie Wang?”","“l thought Shuhang was asking for trouble as soon as I saw everyone’s nicknames and titles,” Cave Lord Snow Wolf remarked.","Future Successor of the Motherland Lady Onion chimed in, “I’m already used to it. My heart is calm, so naturally, it’s cold. Seniors, you should also get used to it as soon as possible.”","After all, Song Shuhang was her boss, and she couldn’t let him be beaten to death by the seniors in the group. Therefore, Lady Onion carefully spoke up for Song Shuhang and comforted the seniors.","Tycoon Jie Saint Monarch Spirit Butterfly was confused.","“Soft Feather, where are you? You’re not on Spirit Butterfly Island?” he inquired.","At this moment, the effects of the medicine had worn off a little. Besides being able to chat in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, his consciousness had also partially returned to reality.","The wisp of consciousness he sent out happened to see his daughter Soft Feather lighting incense beside him while he was in seclusion.","In other words, his daughter was clearly beside him. Then who was the one currently livestreaming in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group?","“Father, I’m Fair-skinned Soft Feather. Divination Litchi Six Bean Phoenix,” Soft Feather quickly replied as her voice trembled.","In reality, Soft Feather was already filled with guilt after lying to her father.","“l see,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator said, bewildered.","His consciousness fell on Soft Feather’s nickname, Reliable-looking Junior, White-skinned, and he was certain it was the fair-skinned one, not black skin.","“Soft Feather, don’t cause trouble for Sixteen while you’re farming Evil. Return home early when you’re done playing,” Lord Spirit Butterfly added.","After saying that, his consciousness began to fade again as he gradually lost consciousness. The Celestial Thearch lit the agarwood beside him, and the effect was activated.","After Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly went offline, Soft Feather let out a sigh of relief.","She turned her attention back to filming the battle between Sixteen and Xie Wang.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator remarked, “Sixteen’s fighting style... has it changed?”","In the past, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s fighting style had been greatly influenced by Su Clan’s Seven, and her saber techniques had a heroic aura.","But now, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s saber technique seemed to have reached a higher level, and the boldness in her saber technique had transformed into dominance. Her petite body was like a giant dragon, exuding a sense of oppression.","Every slash was accompanied by a dragon’s roar.","Su Clan’s Seven sighed happily. “Sixteen’s saber technique has fused with her own style, and she has completely transformed herself. Her saber technique has merged with her True Dragon Constitution and the Dao of Painting. It’s completely different from my saber technique now. Thrice Reckless Mad","Saber, if you don’t work hard, even Sixteen will surpass you in the Dao of the Sword.’","Zhiyin.Pathogen Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was left speechless.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s saber technique was second only to Su Clan’s Seven’s. His seventy-two swift saber moves were so fast and ruthless that even he was afraid of them.","But now, Sixteen was almost catching up to him in terms of saber dao.","“Work hard and cultivate. Senior Skylark also has a unique understanding of saber techniques. She can also give you some pointers in this area,” Su Clan’s Seven suggested.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber finally made a decision.","“What have you decided?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked.","“I’ve decided to stop practicing the saber!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber chuckled. “Hello, everyone, please call me Thrice Reckless Mad Sword from now on.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain was left speechless.","Meanwhile, Fairy Lychee offered a warning, “Soft Feather, remind Sixteen to be cautious. Xie Wang might use a magic technique to suppress her.”","Fairy Lychee had faced many enemies similar to Xie ???? in her adventures across various planes, so she had valuable experience in this area.","On the screen, Soft Feather sent a voice transmission to warn Sixteen, “Be careful, Sixteen. Xie Wang is about to use his big move.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded slightly.","On the other side, Xie Wang, battered and covered in injuries, raised his head and let out a wolf howl.","Numerous ‘eye’ runes suddenly appeared on his body, opening one by one.","In the next moment, a complex illusion enveloped the entire lair.","“Eh? Senior Three-Eyed might really appreciate this Xie Wang,” Song Shuhang mused aloud.","An entity covered in eyes all over its body would likely align with Senior Three-Eyed’s aesthetics.","Should he capture Xie Wang alive and show it to San Qian? Perhaps he could use it to obtain some treasures from Senior?","Of course, before presenting it to Senior Three-Eyed, he had to sever its hind","Just as Song Shuhang contemplated this, the illusion unleashed by Xie Wang was activated.","The once shadowy lair transformed into a swamp and emitted a foul stench.","“Eh?” Pavilion Master Chu murmured.","“Senior, what’s wrong?” Song Shuhang asked. “Is there an issue with this illusion?”","“An illusion of reality?” Pavilion Master Chu muttered, puzzled.","The potent illusion emanating from Xie Wang felt like a simulation of reality.","However, the threat level of this Evil Wang was only at level five, close to level six. Given its strength, it should not have been able to create such a lifelike illusion.","In the midst of the swamp, the wounded Evil Tyrant Dragon Hound howled again.","Mud surged from the swamp and covered its body.","Its injuries began to visibly heal at an astonishing rate.","At the same time, small dog- shaped Xie Wangs emerged from the swamp. In the blink of an eye, they gathered into a formidable army of hounds.","“It’s indeed an illusion,” Song Shuhang confirmed.","This illusion of reality was something he needed to study further.."]},{"number":2534,"title":"Chapter 2534: Your Heartbeat","paragraphs":["Chapter 2534: Your Heartbeat","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the world of cultivation, once a practitioner reached the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, they could harness their life experiences to transform their existence into a ‘true illusion.’ This was a highly advanced illusion technique, and according to the wisdom of Senior Three-Eyed, mastering such an ability should be beyond the reach of a Seventh Stage Venerable.","However, reality often defied logic, and even the most absurd phenomena could manifest in the physical world.","And now, before our eyes, this previously Fifth Stage Xie Wang, after a transformation, had somehow activated the ‘true illusion.’ This was intriguing.","Back when Song Shuhang was still at the Sixth Stage Realm, he had managed to create a ‘true illusion’ by mimicking Senior White’s desert world. However, his illusion was but a replica. He had constructed it by emulating the supreme technique of the Demon Emperor, the Demon God Pillar, and sacrificing 99 miniature versions of himself, all ablaze and suspended from the pillar.","On the other hand, the true illusion cast by the Overlord Hound Xie Wang was no imitation.","At this moment, the fully healed true form of the Overlord Hound let out a long howl and commanded a full-scale assault.","In the next instant, within the true illusion, the previously diminutive pack of fierce dogs sprang into action. They coalesced into a formidable army and charged relentlessly towards Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Even in their shrunken phantom forms, these hounds were each at least three meters in size. As the entire canine army surged forward, the swamp trembled as if a thousand troops were thundering into battle.","Behind Song Shuhang, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing could feel their hearts being tugged by an unseen force. Each step of the canine army’s advance felt like a weight upon their chests that caused their vital energy to roll.","They silently activated their mental cultivation techniques to suppress the surging blood within their bodies.","Such was the influence of the true illusion—it could impose a stifling effect on practitioners of insufficient strength.","In Soft Feather’s livestreaming room, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator expressed concern. “Can Sixteen handle this?”","“Don’t worry, Shuhang is still nearby,” Doudou reassured.","“Sixteen is about to make her move!” Fairy Lychee exclaimed.","“Wind, clouds, rain, thunder!” Su Clan’s Sixteen called out with undeniable authority.","Her body was lifted by the power of the storm, hovering in mid-air.","In the sky, dark clouds blanketed the heavens, a fierce wind raged, and a deluge of rain poured down. Thunder rumbled and crackling lightning arcs filled the clouds.","Su Clan’s Sixteen raised her straight-edged saber high. Guided by her true dragon bloodline, she controlled the storm and lightning energies in the atmosphere.","Ten thousand thunderbolts roared!","All the power of lightning converged onto her blade.","Beside her, the Sage Seal of Profound Sage Su Shan materialized, and a potent dragon’s aura surged from Su Clan’s Sixteen that pressed down with tremendous force. Under the weight of the Sage Seal and Dragon’s Might, the ferocious canine army, which had been charging, suddenly halted in its tracks.","In that very instant, Su Clan’s Sixteen swung her saber downward.","In the next moment, Soft Feather’s live stream was shrouded in lightning and the radiance of her blade.","Simultaneously, a soft voice emanated from the live stream.","“My eyes, my eyes!” Lady Onion, perched on Song Shuhangs shoulder, cried out desperately.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator remarked, “The power of this attack... Isn’t it a bit excessive?”","Judging from the visuals, the force behind this attack almost rivaled his own full-powered strike, and currently, Su Clan’s Sixteen was one realm below him!","Su Clan’s Seven explained, “Sixteen has been diligently cultivating recently, and she’s currently undergoing a special trial within the Su Clan. Each successful step in her trial significantly boosts her strength. At her current level, if she were to engage in a direct confrontation, her power should be roughly equivalent to 2.5 times Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was aghast.","“However, this should be considered a short-term burst of combat capability for Sixteen. Sustaining such explosive strength continuously would be quite challenging. So, overall, Sixteen’s current strength is approximately equivalent to 1.5 times Thrice Reckless.” Su Clan’s Seven elaborated.","“Seven, did I do something to upset you today?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked cautiously. Why did it feel like Seven was targeting him in their conversation today?","Soft Feather cheerfully chimed in, “Senior Thrice Reckless, I understand this!","It must be because of Senior Seven’s nickname.’","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was rendered speechless.","The ‘Su Clan’s Big Horse Monkey’ nickname?","But didn’t Song Shuhang come up with that title? Why was he being teased about it?","Whether he was Thrice Reckless Mad Saber or Thrice Reckless Mad Sword, he was not Song Shuhang.","As the conversation continued, the lightning on the live stream dissipated.","On the screen, Su Clan’s Sixteen, suspended in the storm, gazed down from above.","Electric arcs flickered amidst her hair and emphasized her delicate face.","Below, the fierce canine army had been utterly obliterated by a single swing of her saber, leaving nothing behind. Even the swamp conjured by the true illusion had been reduced to scorched earth.","The Overlord Hound Xie Wang raised its head, its howls of despair echoing.","At this moment, Song Shuhang spoke up. “Sixteen, no issues with energy consumption, right?”","“Mm-hm Su Clan’s Sixteen replied. She tugged on the White Dragon and used her sister’s body to cover half of her face.","Simultaneously, the White Dragon’s tail hung down over her left breast, concealing the powerful heartbeat within.","This pulsating heart served as a wellspring of energy that continuously supplyied Su Clan’s Sixteen with incredible power.","This was Song Shuhangs heart.","During Su Clan’s Sixteen’s transcension and manifestation of her divinity, her chest had been pierced, and she had lost her heart. Fortunately, Song Shuhang possessed a treasure that had helped her survive that ordeal.","After the tribulation...just to be safe, Song Shuhang had extracted a crystal","heart and entrusted it to Su Clan’s Sixteen.","She hadn’t informed anyone of this.","Now, whenever she thought about Song Shuhangs heart beating within her chest, she couldn’t help but feel bashful. She could only use the White","Dragon’s body to shield her face and conceal her reddened cheeks from prying eyes.","Supported by this crystal heart, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s endurance in battle far exceeded Su Clan’s Seven’s expectations. The explosive state just now had been effortlessly achieved, with no pressure at all.","“Get used to it.” The White Dragon sighed, disappointed that Su Clan’s Sixteen was still struggling with this. “It’s just Song Shuhang’s heart beating inside your body. If you can’t even get used to this, what are you going to do in the future?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen vigorously turned the White Dragon around and covered her nose as she only revealed her eyes. “Shuhang, switch hands!”","“Aren’t you going to continue? Only the true form of the Overlord Hound remains,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “Big Sister White Dragon said you wanted to study the true illusion, so I’ll leave it to you.”","The White Dragon was confused.","‘When did I say that?’"]},{"number":2535,"title":"Chapter 2535: A World of Shared Techniques","paragraphs":["Chapter 2535: A World of Shared Techniques","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Alright, since Sister White Dragon said so, then leave the rest to me,” Song Shuhang smiled and went up to greet her. He extended his large palm toward Su Clan’s Sixteen. “Let’s switch.’","“Sure,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied while grabbing White Dragon’s body with one hand to cover half of her small face. Then, she extended her other hand and gently patted Song Shuhangs hand.","Slap!","The exchange of contestants took place as their hands met and separated.","Contestant Su Clan’s Sixteen exited the stage, and contestant Song Shuhang entered!","With a soft touch of their hands, Song Shuhang suddenly felt his heart rate increase inexplicably.","The warmth from Su Clan’s Sixteen’s hand still lingered between his fingers.","Their hearts seemed to resonate.","“Could I become pregnant?” Song Shuhangs peculiar mind suddenly conjured up this absurd thought. “Wait, I’m already pregnant.”","“No... What am I thinking!?”","Song Shuhang vigorously shook his head and regained his composure. He strode towards the Overlord Hound Evil Wang.","Behind him, Su Clan’s Sixteen, who had brushed past him, held White Dragon with both hands, as if she wished she could also cover her eyes.","White Dragon was speechless.","Enough!","My body isn’t a real scarf. If you pull me down, I’ll resist!","“Sixteen, are you feeling shy?” Right at that moment, Soft Feather’s voice suddenly sounded in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s ears.","Su Clan’s Sixteen gave Soft Feather a brief glance. She had already covered her face so securely, so how could Soft Feather still detect it?","“You are indeed feeling shy. Your reaction is too obvious,” Soft Feather said seriously. “Is it because of Senior Song?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen was speechless.","“l didn’t feel it before, but during the battle, I smelled Senior Songs scent on","you.” Soft Feather stared at Su Clan’s Sixteen and gently sniffed. “Is it because of Senior Song?”","“It’s just your imagination,” Su Clan’s Sixteen tried to keep her voice calm. “Let’s see how Shuhang deals with the Xie Wang first, and then it’ll be your turn to attack the next Xie Wang.”","To divert Soft Feather’s curiosity... As long as she changed the topic to something that interested her.","“Oh, right, it’s my turn to attack the next Xie Wang,” Soft Feather said happily.","Su Clan’s Sixteen quietly heaved a sigh of relief.","Soft Feather rested her chin on her hands and shifted her gaze to Song Shuhang, who stood in the center, continuing to broadcast seriously.","In the midst of battle, Song Shuhang rolled up his sleeves to reveal his pair of iron fists. The Mutated Steel Hands activated and turned his fists into formidable steel weapons.","“Come here!” Song Shuhang beckoned to the Overlord Hound Xie Wang.","On the opposite side, the Overlord Hound Xie Wang began to tremble. Its five-meter-tall body quivered at a visible frequency.","Unbeknownst to them, Song Shuhang had already become a man feared even by monsters.","The Overlord Hound felt the pressure on its body increasing.","Ultimately... the overwhelming fear caused it to collapse.","“Roar Q’ The Overlord Hound roared again, and illusory evil dogs emerged one after another from the charred swamp toward Song Shuhang.","Behind them, the scholar and Daoist nun grew excited.","Here it comes, Senior Tyrannical Song is about to make a move!","They were about to witness Senior Tyrannical Song in action—a privilege reserved for experts above the Tribulation Transcender realm. What technique would Senior Tyrannical Song employ next?","They had to remember it well for later analysis.","In the next moment, under the anticipatory gazes of Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing, Senior Tyrannical Song gently raised his right hand.","Crackle, crackle, the sound of intense electric arcs filled Senior Tyrannical Songs palm.","“Is it a thunder technique?” the Daoist nun and scholar wondered, uncertain about what kind of thunder technique Senior Tyrannical Song was preparing.","The ability of Profound Sage Su Shan to command wind, rain, thunder, and lightning had left them trembling. How shocking would Senior Tyrannical Songs thunder technique be?","Amid their anticipation... a ball of lightning condensed in Senior Tyrannical Song’s palm.","“Lightning Palm?” Eon Sea Scholar was puzzled.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing quickly dismissed that notion. “It can’t be just the Lightning Palm. With Senior Tyrannical Songs strength, this must be an unfathomable lightning technique. It just looks somewhat similar to the Lightning Palm.”","White Dragon was speechless.","“Ha!” At that moment, Song Shuhang shouted, and the volume of the Lightning Palm in his hand expanded.","In the blink of an eye, it transformed into a colossal bolt of lightning that enveloped the entire illusory reality.","The swampy space created by the Overlord Hound Xie Wang was about the size of two ordinary villages.","The Lightning Palm in Song Shuhangs hand filled the entire space.","A massive ball of lightning floated above everyone’s heads, pressing down.","Before the Lightning Palm could be unleashed, the charging army of Xie Hounds was shattered into pieces by the electric current emanating from the Lightning Palm.","Ka, ka, in the next moment, the entire illusory reality space became unstable.","It was as if it would shatter at any moment.","“Shuhang, tone it down. If the ‘illusory reality’ were to dissipate after your Lightning Palm... Then your Lightning Palm will explode in the real world,” Pavilion Master Chu calmly advised.","Song Shuhang chuckled dryly and extended his hand.","Boom!","The Lightning Palm, which was on the verge of shattering the entire illusory reality, vanished just like that.","On the opposite side, the Overlord Hound Xie Wang was charred black. The black mud in the illusory swamp surged and covered its body to heal its injuries.","“Compared to the ‘illusory reality’ created by ordinary cultivators, the ‘illusory reality cast by Xie Wang is much smaller. Furthermore, it’s not strong enough. With just a bit of force, it will shatter,” Song Shuhang remarked.","He then strode toward the Overlord Hound Xie Wang.","The Overlord Hound Xle Wang let out a frantic howl, and the black mud in the illusory swamp surged towards Song Shuhang like a massive wave.","However, before the black mud could reach Song Shuhangs body, it was dispersed by the light of virtue and vanished without a trace.","Song Shuhang approached the Xie Wang unflinchingly and pressed his hand directly on its body.","He intended to use the secret appraisal technique to determine what method this Evil Wang had employed to cast the illusory reality.","However, when Song Shuhangs palm made contact with the Xie Wangs body, he suddenly had a thought.","An intuitive feeling surged within him.","“Real Illusory Reality,” Song Shuhang murmured and summoned his own illusory reality from the Xie Wangs illusory reality space.","He possessed several different illusory reality spaces.","Seven of them originated from the small golden cores in his dantian, each representing the composition of a different golden core. The eighth one was the illusion of Senior White’s desert, created by the power of the demon god pillar.","Additionally, there was the chaotic space that belonged to him.","A chaotic world composed of countless os and IS.","This chaotic world covered the body of the Overlord Hound Xie Wang.","The body of the Overlord Hound Xie Wang seemed to have been torn apart and turned into a large amount of data that was being forcibly analyzed.","“Shared Real Illusory Reality,” Song Shuhang said softly as he delved into the mysterious illusions before him.."]},{"number":2536,"title":"Chapter 2536: More Than Just the Disdain of the Demon Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2536: More Than Just the Disdain of the Demon Emperor","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Song Shuhang delved into the concept of “shared reality illusion,” his mind easily embraced the idea.","“Isn’t it essentially sharing a genuine illusion?” In this era, regardless of the reliability of anything, the prevailing trend was to explore the concept of “sharing.” It wasn’t that big a deal.","In today’s world, whether it was a house, a car, a bicycle, a computer, or a smartphone, nothing was exempt from sharing. Even relationships between boyfriends and girlfriends were venturing into sharing services. Whether it was reliable or not, giving sharing a try seemed like the right way to go.","The small illusory reality that the Overlord Hound Xie Wang had conjured was shared from a more formidable Xie Wang.","As for the even mightier Xie Wangs true form, it wasn’t even within the confines of Earth’s space. How he managed to “share” his genuine illusion remained a mystery.","“Can this ‘shared genuine illusion’ technology be extracted?” Song Shuhang attempted to command his chaotic space.","In the next moment, the chaotic space composed of os and IS devoured the Overlord Hound Xie Wangs illusionary realm in one swift motion.","The Overlord Hound Xie Wang, ensnared within the chaotic space, let out a series of agonizing screams.","One by one, the ‘eye runes’ on its body were peeled away. In the blink of an eye, it resembled a plucked chicken, entirely stripped of its illusions.","Subsequently, Song Shuhangs chaotic space autonomously contracted and began executing his directives. It diligently analyzed the method of the ‘shared genuine illusion.’","If Song Shuhang could dissect and develop this “sharing technique,” he could integrate it into the cultivation chat feature.","This way, members of the cultivation chat group could partake in the experience of sharing genuine illusions. Once the technology matured, senior members who possessed their own genuine illusions could even share them and lease them out for a fee.","This function, coupled with live-streaming and top-up options, was a match made in heaven!","“Wonderful, absolutely wonderful,” Song Shuhang mused as his excitement grew.","He was an individual with seven genuine illusions of small golden cores and a faux Senior White’s desert illusion. If he were to lease out all his genuine illusions, making a fortune every day wouldn’t be far-fetched.","With this opportunity, he could eventually pay off his debts!","With these thoughts in mind, Song Shuhang privately messaged Lady Long Luo from the Black Dragon World.","“I’m busy. Please call me Lady Fat Ball,” replied Madam Long Luo.","“Then, would you mind being a bit busier?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“l do,” Madam Long Luo responded candidly. Madam Long Luo, resembling an artificial intelligence, didn’t possess the finesse to navigate certain questions with ambiguity or polite refusals.","“So, what should I do to make you not mind being busier?” Song Shuhang had communicated with Lady Long Luo before and understood the key to engaging with her. There was no need to beat around the bush.","“I’m sorry,” Long Luo contemplated for a moment before replying, “l request","to adjust the charging ratio for the cultivation chat to 10 First Stage spirit stones: 1 coin.”","“Is that all?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","“That’s it,” Madam Long Luo confirmed.","Madam Long Luffs request was modest to the point of being heart-rending.","“No problem, I agree to your request. I’ll adjust the charging ratio for the Demon Emperor to 10:1,” Song Shuhang nodded, readily accepting the proposal.","Madam Long Luo proceeded with the operation, her delight evident.","Moments later, a small system announcement appeared in the Cultivation Chat feature: [Recharge function fully activated: Fellow Daoists who recharge for the first time can enjoy a 5% discount. [Purple Grape] King Kun has an exclusive 12% discount. [Not only does the Demon Emperor enjoy a 10 First Stage spirit stones rate, but the exchange rate is also 1 coin.]","King Kun was left speechless.","Why was he being repeatedly reminded about the 12% discount? He only had one egg left. How could he recharge? The Demon Emperor was equally bemused.","Is he targeting me?","“But is there any point in targeting them? Childish,” the Demon Emperor coldly chuckled.","He was much more than that. As a Demon Emperor of his generation, he had forcefully forged his own path with the talent of eight dragon patterns, attaining immortality. This “cultivation chat” function held no meaning for him.","Given its meaninglessness, there was no necessity for him to recharge.","Thus, not only a 10:1 exchange rate but even a 100:1 or ?????????? wouldn’t impact him in the slightest.","Go ahead, Madam Long Luo. Have fun doing as you please.","The Demon Emperor held an air of disdain in his heart.","On the other side, after issuing the announcement, Madam Long Luo promptly provided Song Shuhang with a plan to enhance the cultivation chat feature.","Lady Long Luo assisted Song Shuhang in upgrading and refining the “cultivation chat” feature.","Since her authority was granted by Song Shuhang, whenever an upgrade was required, she had to present the “upgrade plan” to Song Shuhang. Once Song Shuhang approved it, she could connect the upgrade function to the cultivation chat feature for implementation.","Song Shuhang was the true core of the cultivation chat.","The upgrade plan she submitted this time included the VIP function that King Kun had previously proposed.","This encompassed the “friend block” function that both King Kun and the Demon Emperor desired. Additionally, it featured some exclusive minor functions such as dazzling, multicolored usernames...","“Miss Long Luo, you’ve developed so many new functions?” Song Shuhang expressed his surprise.","Miss Long Luo replied, ‘As long as there’s a framework and ideas, perfecting new functions isn’t difficult.’","Originally, in Lady Long Luffs plan, the “top-up function” for the cultivation chat could only be implemented after Song Shuhang had advanced to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm and acquired spatial talent. However, with the continuous evolution of Song Shuhangs Inner World, along with the “space authority” talent he had acquired from the fat ball’s clone, and the spatial coordinates of the Divine Weapon Mystic Mirror, the simple spirit stone charging function could be smoothly developed.","As long as Song Shuhangs Inner World didn’t falter, the upgraded cultivation chat function would allow him to use the QR code to confirm friends’ coordinates and perform remote spirit stone recharging.","Once the top-up function was complete, various new functions centered around top-up capabilities could be launched.","With money on hand, one could access a multitude of services!","Madam Long Luo believed that once the “VIP user” function was introduced, not only would the Demon Emperor become the most loyal customer of the “VIP function” before he cracked the cultivation chat.","“Alright, let’s connect the VIP function and proceed with the upgrade,” Song Shuhang confirmed.","Moments later, an announcement appeared: “The VIP customer function will be launched after this update. The monthly VIP function will include the ability to ‘block designated friends for 7 days’ each month, a cool Rainbow Gem member name function, and top advertisement placement in the live broadcast room... For more details, please see the upgraded VIP user privilege","The Demon Emperor was speechless.","Tyrannical Song, you rascal!"]},{"number":2537,"title":"Chapter 2537: A Master Produces Outstanding Disciples","paragraphs":["Chapter 2537: A Master Produces Outstanding Disciples","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Before cracking the cultivation chat function, blocking Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was of utmost importance to Demon Emperor.","If he didn’t block Tyrannical Song, who knew when that guy would suddenly send him a private message and then lead disaster his way?","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was essentially a mobile disaster.","Especially now, as he competed for immortality and challenged the realms of the universe, Tyrannical Song had become the source of countless calamities. Countless beings in the universe were eager to secretly deal with Tyrannical Song.","If he didn’t block Tyrannical Song, perhaps the guy would send him a private message every few days, transferring a wave of disasters his direction?","so...","“Do I have to top up for a VIP card?” Demon Emperor felt aggrieved.","He didn’t want to top up, and he didn’t want to be wronged.","But to block Tyrannical Song, he had no choice but to top up.","Meeting Tyrannical Song was one of the biggest regrets of his life.","“One day, I’ll crack the cultivation chat function. When that day comes, I’ll repay this karma to you twicefold,” Demon Emperor gritted his teeth while gazing at the exclusive 10:1 recharge rate he enjoyed, determined to make it happen.","Then, he accessed the newly added recharge function of the cultivation chat and reluctantly prepared to recharge some spirit stones.","But... just as Demon Emperor was about to attempt recharging, a thought struck him.","“Wait a minute, what methods do I have to go through for recharging? How does Tyrannical Song accept my spirit stones? Does he need to transfer the spirit stones to a fixed location? Or can Tyrannical Song directly use his spatial ability to receive the spirit stones from me?”","“If it’s the latter... doesn’t that mean Tyrannical Song has my coordinates at all times?”","Demon Emperor furrowed his brows while realizing that something was amiss.","After all, he didn’t even know his exact coordinates, so how could Tyrannical Song know his location?","“l see now. So you’re trying to tempt me to recharge through this method and allow you to grasp my true coordinates,” Demon Emperor smirked.","Tyrannical Song was too naive.","Even if I am endlessly ‘harassed’ by you, I won’t be topping up my VIP account.","Being pestered by others was just a waste of energy.","But if Tyrannical Song gained access to my coordinates, that would be even more troublesome.","Given the choice between dealing with a big troublemaker and a small troublemaker, it wasn’t just Demon Emperor who chose the latter.","Demon Emperor smiled inwardly and silently closed the cultivation chat interface. This useless feature held no attraction for him at all!","In the Black Dragon World, Lady Long Luo enjoyed her wine with a contented smile. Her ebony skin had taken on a rosy hue.","With no external threats in the Black Dragon World, her greatest pleasure now was targeting none other than Demon Emperor.","“In that case, Miss Long Luo, please work a bit harder from now on, researching one more project amidst your busy schedule,” Song Shuhang sent a message.","Miss Long Luo replied with a smile, “Certainly, Tyrannical Song. Please briefly describe the project I need to research.”","“I’ve already extracted the information and data on the ‘illusory reality sharing method. I need professionals to analyze and study it, modifying it into a spell suitable for me, Then, integrate this function into the cultivation chat feature,” Song Shuhang swiftly replied.","“Even though I’m quite occupied currently, since I’ve agreed, 1 won’t outwardly mind it, though inwardly, I’ll still feel rather put out,” Lady Long","Luo replied earnestly. “Please send me the data on the shared reality illusion. I’ll study this function at the earliest convenience and incorporate it into the next upgrade of the cultivation chat.”","“Thank you, Miss Long Luo,” Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude with a smile while sending all the information he had extracted from the illusory world to her.","Meeting Lady Long Luo in the Black Dragon World had proven to be a wise decision. Without the expertise and unpaid assistance of Lady Long Luo in this area, who knew when his cultivation chat function would be perfected and upgraded.","“I’m busy. Goodbye.” After receiving the message, Lady Long Luo returned to her busy work.","Song Shuhang concluded the private chat session with satisfaction.","His pair of pitch-black iron fists firmly held the Overlord Hound Xie Wang, preventing it from escaping.","At this point the Overlord Hound had no strength left to break free. Its body had shrunk by a size, and it was powerless to struggle in Song Shuhangs grasp.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and knocked it out with a couple of punches to its head.","“Senior Chu, is there a way to seal it?” he inquired. “If we intend to deal with it later, it might be better to capture it alive.”","Pavilion Master Chu responded disdainfully, “This type of Xie Wang is only at the Fifth Stage Realm. Sealing it up would be a waste of time. You might as well eliminate it and see if you can gain some merit.” “In my opinion, it’s only worthwhile to seal them when encountering a Rank-7 or higher Xie Wang.” “That makes sense.” Song Shuhang nodded.","Subsequently, he pressed the Xie Wang to the ground and struck its head several times.","Xie Wang’s body twitched a few times before it ceased to move.","Seeing that the Xie Wang was on the brink of death, Song Shuhang nodded with satisfaction and called out to his eldest disciple, “Little Cai, come over and try to finish it off.”","“On my way, Master!” the monster bird Little Cai responded while flapping her wings as she flew over.","Halfway there, she revealed her full demon form, transforming into a massive bird.","With the activation of the Mutated Steel Hands, her wings took on a pitch-black and steel-colored appearance that radiated a fervent and unwavering blade intent.","Her blade intent resonated with her current disposition—her unwavering commitment to cultivation brought her joy.","This unwavering determination had transformed into a fanatical blade intent. As she wielded it, the temperature in the surroundings seemed to intensify.","“Gale Blade!” Little Cai exclaimed.","Her wings slashed at the Xie Wang.","Each slash was swifter than the last, with the force of each strike compounding.","After ten strikes... Xie Wang, already weakened, was cleaved in half. It was a complete elimination.","This method of cutting allowed for the preservation of Xie Wangs Overlord’s hind legs.","Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","At the same time, a virtue light began to accumulate around Little Cai’s form.","Eliminating the Xie Wang was akin to aiding vengeful souls, both of which were significant merits recognized by the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","Little Cai exhibited remarkable talent in both the art of the blade, body-refining techniques, and the way of virtue. Early on, Song Shuhang had noticed her similarity to him. She was essentially a miniature version of himself.","Furthermore, in terms of cultivation, Little Cai’s determination was unparalleled.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded. “l have a feeling that someday, Little","Cai will become the second Song Shuhang.”","In the future, this seemingly foolish bird monster might end up like Song Shuhang, not well-versed in magical techniques and relying solely on body tempering techniques, saber techniques, and the power of virtue to protect herself.","“A great teacher produces an outstanding disciple.” Behind him, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing flattered him.","This flattery made Song Shuhang blush.","“Master, here’s the core,” simultaneously, Little Cai shrank down and offered the core to Song Shuhang with her wings.."]},{"number":2538,"title":"Chapter 2538: How About I Give You My Pancreas Next Time?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2538: How About I Give You My Pancreas Next Time?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Nice job,” remarked Song Shuhang as he accepted the core from Little Cai’s hand. It was about the size of a marshmallow and had an appearance that seemed deceptively sweet.","Each Xie Wangs core had its ovvn unique characteristics, and even cores from the same Xie Wang exhibited significant differences in form. Matters like Evil and Extravagance allowed for a great deal of flexibility.","This time, there was no need for Song Shuhang to provide a reminder. The fairy within the Defiant Whale Warrior Glove extended its hand and prodded the marshmallow-like core.","Within moments, Song Shuhang received information in his mind. Thanks to the assistance of the artifact spirit Little Fairy, the cost of appraising the Xie Wang Core had been reduced, and he didn’t feel any discomfort.","Interesting. 1 enjoy 10110wnng clues to uncover mystenes tne most,” song Shuhang chuckled as he stored the marshmallow-like evil nucleus along with the irregular metal core, which had hints of being artificially cultivated from their previous encounter. These were all special cores that might prove useful in the future,","On the side, Soft Feather giggled as she concluded her first live broadcast. Then, she typed in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, “The live broadcast has ended. It’s my turn to face Xie Wang next. When the time comes, I’ll show the seniors how to tackle Xie Wang. The seniors in the group will surely be interested in my approach.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator smiled faintly and replied, “In that case, I’ll look into the top-up feature. When you’re dealing with Xie Wang, I’ll provide you with some tips.”","Steel Friend Doudou chimed in, “Let me summarize Soft Feather’s live broadcast: The Spirit River Su Clan has found a successor, and Shuhang has found one too.’","“This little monster bird is quite talented, especially in saber arts,” Su Clan’s Seven remarked.","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman added, “If only this little monster bird were my disciple... I still have a mission to teach a formidable sword cultivator that I haven’t completed.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain was left speechless.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, no one knew Copper Trigram’s gender, and similarly, no one knew how many unfulfilled vows Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman had in his wishing book.","On the other side, after defeating the Xie Wang, Song Shuhang and the group proceeded to the next one.","As usual, Pavilion Master Chu set up a barrier to seal the entire lair before they entered.","Soft Feather, armed with her sharp sword and live streaming, cheerfully approached the fog snake-like Xie Wang in the nest.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing stood by to observe the battle between Ancient Sage Ling Die Zi and Xie Wang.","Soft Feather’s graceful sword techniques and the dreamy magical techniques of Spirit Butterfly Island greatly impressed Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing.","Spirit Butterfly Island’s techniques were both elegant and deadly, perfectly suited for fairy-like combat.","Some of these techniques were custom-made by Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly for his daughter. When Soft Feather employed these special moves, her charm peaked and even captivated Daoist Nun Miao Qing.","“Is Senior Spirit Butterfly actually a fairy?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber couldn’t help but ask in his livestream. “How could a man develop such exquisite spells and beautiful sword techniques?”","“Don’t forget, Thrice Reckless, Senior Spirit Butterfly might be watching this online,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator reminded him. “Even if he’s in closed-door cultivation and can’t watch the live broadcast immediately, he can always catch up later. But when he does, he’ll definitely watch Soft Feather’s live stream.’","“Don’t worry about me, Northern River,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied smugly. “l haven’t been in the main world recently, so Senior Spirit Butterfly won’t be able to find me for a while.’","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator had no response to that.","Fairy Lychee suddenly asked, “By the way, where’s Shuhang?”","While Soft Feather was busy with her Xie Wang farming, Song Shuhang seemed to have disappeared.","Cave Lord Snow Wolf suggested, “Soft Feather is using her first-person view for the livestream. Perhaps Shuhang is not in her field of vision.”","As they discussed it, Soft Feather’s livestream camera panned around and captured Song Shuhang sitting with Su Clan’s Sixteen in a corner. They sat side by side, their expressions serious as they silently watched Soft Feather farm Xie Wang.","After the camera shifted away, Song Shuhang’s serious expression vanished.","When they sat together, they could feel each other’s heartbeats as long as their skin touched.","Two identical hearts beat in perfect synchrony.","Su Clan’s Sixteen, unable to contain herself, reached out and pulled the White Dragon toward her to cover her blushing cheeks.","The White Dragon was left speechless.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s heartbeat quickened audibly.","Simultaneously, Song Shuhangs heart rate increased and matched the rhythm.","“Is Sixteen feeling shy?” Song Shuhang deduced her emotional state.","Under the mysterious resonance of their two hearts, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s emotions were an open book to Song Shuhang.","Additionally, Song Shuhang had already figured out the condition of Sixteen’s body. It seemed that the heart he had given her was finally serving its purpose.","This sensation was strange and indescribable.","“Perhaps next time, I should give Sixteen more gifts? Since I’ve given her my heart, why not offer her my other organs? Liver, gallbladder, spleen, stomach, kidney... How about a complete set?” A bizarre thought crossed Song Shuhang’s mind.","“Wait, what am I even thinking?” He shook his head vigorously, dispelling the odd notion. Who would gift a fairy internal organs? Moreover, if he replaced all of Sixteen’s organs with his own, wouldn’t she become Song Sixteen? “Your thoughts are quite chaotic,” Pavilion Master Chu commented cryptically.","Rooted in Song Shuhang’s mind, she could sense the rising temperature in his thoughts even without using her mind-reading abilities.","“No, it’s just a weird idea that popped into my head,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Sixteen,” he reached out and took her hand. “Next time, I’ll give you my spleen. How does that sound?”","The White Dragon raised an eyebrow.","Pavilion Master Chu was left utterly baffled. “???”","Su Clan’s Sixteen whispered, ” Is this what they call love?”","The White Dragon cynically drawled, “It feels more like something from a horror movie.’","Song Shuhang chuckled.","Unnoticed by anyone, the ghost fairy spirit had quietly entered Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body through their connected hands and entered her heart. Ever since the ghost spirit fairy had cultivated with Scholar X.XX and achieved great success in her divine technique, not even the White Dragon would notice her unless she paid special attention.."]},{"number":2539,"title":"Chapter 2539: Heartbeat","paragraphs":["Chapter 2539: Heartbeat","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even Song Shuhang didn’t notice that the ghost fairy had silently slipped away from his body.","The Tyrant Yue faction was living on borrowed time.","In this vast multiverse, apart from unique beings like Senior White, few would pay any attention to the Tyrant Yue faction. Their persistence up to this point was indeed a miracle.","“Senior Song, I need backup!” suddenly exclaimed Soft Feather, who was in the midst of battle.","“Soft Feather, do you need fire support?” Song Shuhang inquired, raising his head.","“I need Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword,” Soft Feather replied loudly. “I’ve found it. The power of the inner demon should be able to counter this mist snake’s malevolence! ”","Song Shuhang nodded, and the virtuous lamia materialized behind him.","She opened her mouth, and a sword beam flew out, landing beside Soft Feather and taking on the appearance of the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, please lend me your power,” Soft Feather giggled and recited her heroic lines.","“No problem!” The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword agreed.","It always felt that it got along well with Soft Feather.","Soft Feather extended her hand and grasped Scarlet Heaven Sword, then gently twisted her wrist... This was the starting stance of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique!","“Eh?” The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was surprised.","Soft Feather had clearly used a sword, right? Why did she know how to use a saber technique?","Moreover, she had never learned the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique before, right?","The Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique was a Flaming Saber Technique that Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven had modified. It possessed the power to burn the sky and boil the sea.","At present, only Song Shuhang had obtained the cultivation method of this technique from Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven in his dream.","However. Song Shuhang hadn’t taught this technioue to Soft Feather.","“Could it be a stance?” The Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword speculated in its mind.","However, just as it was thinking about this, Soft Feather turned her wrist, and the power within the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword was drawn out. That was the power of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","Swoosh~","A saber flame that could burn the sky and boil the sea burst out from Soft Feather’s hand, slashing toward the Xie Wang Snake.","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was speechless.","It was undeniably the authentic Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique. It wouldn’t mistake this saber technique.","The body of the Xie Wang Snake was directly engulfed by the saber flames. The saber Qi concealed within the saber flames cut it into dozens of pieces, and the unquenchable saber flames turned its body into ashes.","“Not good, I overdid it with the fire,” Soft Feather exclaimed.","She had only intended to control the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique to cut the Xie Wang Snake in half. She didn’t expect the saber flame to be so dominant that it directly incinerated the Snake to ashes.","“I wonder if the core is still intact?”","Soft Feather dragged Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and approached the area around the mist snake’s remains. Then, she used Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword’s body to prod the burning undying flame.","“It’s gone. The core has also been burned away. My mistake!” Soft Feather’s small face wrinkled in disappointment.","Ding! The always-online Saint Seiya Northern River’s Loose Cultivator has rewarded Soft Feather with 100 spirit stones of the First Stage.","“Don’t be discouraged, Soft Feather,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator consoled. “There are plenty of malevolent creatures in this world. Let’s just go and face another one.’","Before Thrice Reckless Mad Saber met his end, he had to comfort Soft Feather and shift the topic, all while giving her a reward. This was to prevent Thrice Reckless from acting recklessly.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was deeply concerned about Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, who never seemed to learn his lesson.","Speaking of which, it was odd that they both enjoyed courting danger. Thrice","Reckless Mad Saber had always been secretly protected by Northern River’s Loose Cultivator, but as soon as Immortal Master Copper Trigram sought trouble, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator would berate him until he started questioning his life choices.","Reality had proven that people were biased.","“Thank you for your comforting words, Senior Northern River! You’re right; there are plenty of malevolent creatures out there. Let’s go and deal with the next one,” Soft Feather said, rallying herself.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, let’s continue to cooperate and eliminate all the malevolent monsters in Wenzhou City,” she said, gently waving the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Let’s set aside the matter of dealing with malevolence for now. I’m more interested in knowing why you know the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique,” the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword questioned.","“I’ve seen Senior Song use the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique many times, so I just tried to learn it once and learned it. It didn’t feel very difficult... Or do I seem to have learned this saber technique before?” Soft Feather tilted her head and replied.","“Could it be that you were like Shuhang, dreaming of Scarlet Heaven?” Red Heaven Sword asked.","Soft Feather shook her head. “Moreover, after thinking about it, I don’t seem to have any memories of learning the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber","Technique. ”","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was perplexed.","“Wait, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword. Could this Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique be Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s secret technique? Then wouldn’t I be stealing it?” Soft Feather suddenly remembered the rules of the cultivation world and hurriedly asked.","“Don’t worry, it’s not some closely guarded secret technique. Since you’ve learned it, I’ll grant you the right to learn this secret technique!” After some consideration, the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword confidently stated.","Although it wasn’t a closely guarded secret technique, the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique was Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s signature saber technique,","Besides, not pursuing Soft Feather for secretly learning the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique could be seen as harming Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s interests.","But it liked it!","After all, it was an inner demon. As an inner demon, it had to do something that matched its identity as an inner demon. For example, he would occasionally poke Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s weak spot in his heart.","Thinking of this, Scarlet Heaven Sword started to contact his main body and told him about Soft Feather learning the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique without a teacher. He also attached his decision.","However, Scarlet Heaven Sword didn’t receive a reply for a long time.","He had no idea what Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven was up to.","Since Soft Feather had accidentally burned the entire Mist Snake Evil, Song Shuhang and the others had no choice but to rush to the next nest of the malevolence and let Soft Feather handle another one.","As usual, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing were recording the battle between Soft Feather and the Xie Wang.","Song Shuhang and Su Clan’s Sixteen found a clean corner and sat down.","“I’m warning you. Don’t tease me anymore,” the White Dragon reminded Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang wasn’t talented enough in speaking sweet nothings.","Her awkward flirting skill was maxed out. She wrapped her arms around Sixteen’s neck, feeling so awkward that her entire body was aching.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Su Clan’s Sixteen buried her face into the White Dragon’s body, and her heart began to pound again.","In the opposite nest, Soft Feather and Xie Wang were engaged in an intense battle.","Sixteen felt that her heart was beating continuously, as if it was in sync with the rhythm of Soft Feather’s evil battle.","Her heart was beating like a drum as she played the background music.","A moment later, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s consciousness seemed to be brought into the rhythm of her heartbeat.","Vaguely, a blurry figure appeared in front of her.","It was a fairy maiden with a gentle and quiet aura. She held her chin with both hands and squatted in front of Sixteen with a smile.","The two fairies looked at each other.."]},{"number":2540,"title":"Chapter 2540: An Unexpected Revelation, Pavilion Master Chu!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2540: An Unexpected Revelation, Pavilion Master Chu!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A blurry figure suddenly materialized in front of him. If an ordinary person had encountered such a scene, they might have been startled.","However, for cultivators, such situations were not uncommon. Whether it involved entities like the soul, inner demons, or even illusions, they could all produce the same effect.","Su Clan’s Sixteen remained remarkably composed as she gazed at the serene and gentle fairy before her.","Once their eyes met, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s gaze shifted to the fairy’s chest...","First, she employed a process of elimination—this fairy was undoubtedly not her inner demon.","If she were her inner demon, the area she was currently examining should have been even more substantial... At the very least, it should have matched the standards of Fairy @#%x. It would exceed even the likes of Soft Feather. This was a psychological barrier. If there were an inner demon, it certainly wouldn’t ignore such an obvious psychological obstacle.","Next, she ruled out any illusionary effects. Ever since her True Dragon bloodline had awakened, and the consciousness of White Dragon had stirred within her, there were very few illusions in the world that could affect her without alerting the White Dragon. The White Dragon’s power was undeniable.","This time, as the serene fairy locked eyes with Su Clan’s Sixteen, the White Dragon within her did not appear to take notice.","The serene fairy followed Su Clan’s Sixteen’s gaze and stared at her chest with a puzzled expression.","She felt an unspoken sense of being outmatched.","After a moment, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s gaze reluctantly returned to the serene fairy’s face.","This visage invoked a sense of familiarity. She must have encountered her somewhere before, but the memory eluded her at the moment.","The fairy on the opposite side winked at Su Clan’s Sixteen as if she had recollected something. After a moment, she smiled gently at Su Clan’s Sixteen. This smile radiated warmth and goodwill, leaving people with a pleasant feeling.","“Shuhang!” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s heart stirred.","The fairy’s smile on the opposite side was identical to Song Shuhangs... To be precise, it was an exact match for Song Shuhang.","Upon closer examination, this fairy’s appearance bore some resemblance to Song Shuhangs.","Su Clan’s Sixteen immediately thought of the spirit of the Defiant Whale Glove residing on Song Shuhangs right fist and compared it to the serene fairy before her.","After a brief comparison, the artifact spirit fairy significantly differed from","the fairy in front of her.","The resemblance between this fairy and Song Shuhang primarily centered around her smile and temperament.","“Sister White Dragon.” Su Clan’s Sixteen communicated with the White","Dragon within her mind. “Can you perceive this fairy maiden in front of me?”","The White Dragon and Su Clan’s Sixteen shared a telepathic connection. When necessary, they could communicate with just a thought. “In front of you? A fairy?” The White Dragon was bewildered.","She saw nothing.","After contemplating for a moment, her dragon form circled around Su Clan’s Sixteen’s neck, and she delved deeper into a resonance with Sixteen’s spirit. Then, she intently peered ahead.","A moment later, the White Dragon’s eyes lit up, and she spotted the indistinct figure of a young girl before Su Clan’s Sixteen.","The serene fairy, Su Clan’s Sixteen, and the White Dragon silently locked gazes.","Their eyes connected.","Song Shuhang turned his head, puzzled, as he observed Sixteen. Her previously rapid heartbeat suddenly eased.","It felt as if her heart had been racing, and then she got sidetracked?","What had happened?","“Sister White Dragon, can you perceive this fairy?” Su Clan’s Sixteen inquired within her mind.","“Yes, I see her,” the White Dragon replied.","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded and remarked, “In that case, she isn’t my inner demon, nor is she an illusion. She is indeed real. Do you recall anything about her?”","“Wait a moment.” Subsequently, the White Dragon turned her head. “Pavilion Master Chu.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood on end in confusion as she asked, “What is it?”","“Come over here, you silly hair. Climb on top of my head.” the White Dragon instructed.","Pavilion Master Chu was flabbergasted.","“You’re here, no need for formalities.” the White Dragon stated.","Pavilion Master Chu was left speechless.","Which eye of yours saw me being formal?","“There’s something I need you to confirm. Come over quickly,” the White Dragon urged.","Pavilion Master Chu sighed. Unable to dissuade the White Dragon, she lightly leaped from Song Shuhangs head and landed on the White Dragon’s head.","The White Dragon remained in a daze. She circled around Sixteen’s neck once more and adjusted her angle. Then, she said to Pavilion Master Chu, “Pavilion Master Chu, harmonize your mental energy with my rhythm.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s fur quivered slightly as she cooperated with the White Dragon.","Guided by the White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu also beheld the figure of the girl with a gentle and serene demeanor standing before Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Consequently, the scene transitioned to Pavilion Master Chu, Sister White Dragon, and Su Clan’s Sixteen gazing at the tranquil girl across from them.","Nevertheless, their eyes remained locked.","Pavilion Master Chu lacked eyes.","“How is it? Did you see her?” the White Dragon inquired.","“Yes.” Pavilion Master Chu affirmed.","“Is she connected to Senior Chu?” Su Clan’s Sixteen queried.","“Don’t you sense that her temperament is somewhat reminiscent of Pavilion Master Chu’s?” the White Dragon inquired.","“So, Fellow Daoist Scarf, what are you suggesting?” Pavilion Master Chu regarded the girl with a gentle and serene demeanor and couldn’t help but soften her tone.","“Don’t you think she bears a resemblance to Slow-Witted Song? Don’t you feel that her temperament is somewhat akin to yours?” The White Dragon had uncovered the blind spot!","“Scarf, what are you implying?” Pavilion Master Chu asked.","“So... When did you and Slow-Witted Song have a child together?” the White Dragon remarked.","1 didn’t anticipate you giving birth behind my back!","Pavilion Master Chu was confused.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was flabbergasted.","“Do you believe I’m Shuhang, capable of getting pregnant at will? Do you wish to have offspring?” Pavilion Master Chu retorted.","Song Shuhang, who was lying in the cannon pit, still under machine gun fire, was rendered speechless.","I don’t possess this capability either!","And what are you all discussing? Why did you drag me out to be shot with machine guns?","“Is she genuinely not your daughter?” The White Dragon questioned.","“No, she’s my daughter!” Pavilion Master Chu declared.","Pavilion Master Chu’s response alleviated the White Dragon’s concerns.","Language communication was indeed remarkable.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair extended as she gently touched the tranquil young girl across from her.","The fairy opposite her reached out and gently stroked Pavilion Master Chu’s fuzzy fur, while appearing very affectionate.","“Fairy Sixteen.” the serene young girl finally spoke.","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded. “Do you have something to tell me?”","“Yes,” Song Shuhang replied, “but Sister White Dragon won’t let me flirt with her.’","“Don’t interrupt.” the White Dragon turned and scolded him.","Song Shuhang was bewildered.","Was it his imagination, or had the White Dragon been scolding him all day today?","“Hehe.” the fairy covered her mouth and chuckled. Then she said to Sixteen, “I’d like to spend some time with Fairy Sixteen. Is that acceptable?” “Live together?” the White Dragon looked at her in puzzlement.","Are you trying to move in with her?"]},{"number":2541,"title":"Chapter 2541: The Secret Conversation of Two Fairies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2541: The Secret Conversation of Two Fairies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“How can we coexist?” Su Clan’s Sixteen asked.","Surprisingly, she had no intention of rejecting the proposal from this mysterious fairy, and in her heart, she accepted it quite naturally—both in a physical and figurative sense.","Her heart didn’t resist this gentle and composed fairy. The steady heartbeat calmed Su Clan’s Sixteen’s state of mind.","“Coexisting in a physical sense,” the fairy with a gentle demeanor gently released Pavilion Master Chu’s hair and extended her hand towards Su Clan’s Sixteen. “Would you like to sign another temporary contract?”","After a brief moment of contemplation, Su Clan’s Sixteen replied, “Sure.”","She reached out her palm, and her fingers interlocked with the slender fingers of the gentle fairy.","In the next instant, a rune of the contract lit up between Su Clan’s Sixteen and the fairy’s palms.","Song Shuhang, standing nearby, was drawn to the contract runes. Having signed two ghost spirit contracts before, he immediately recognized the significance of this rune.","In other words, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s recent momentary distraction was due to her communication with the ghost spirit and the subsequent contract signing?","“It’s a temporary cooperation contract,” Su Clan’s Sixteen explained.","Song Shuhang raised an eyebrow, puzzled. “Temporary ghost spirit contracts? Even ghosts are freelancing now?”","The contract runes disappeared, solidifying the ghost spirit contract. Soon after, Su Clan’s Sixteen observed as the gentle and composed fairy melded into her like a liquid, eventually finding its place within her heart.","Once the ghost spirit entered, the total amount of spiritual energy in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body began to steadily increase. Following that, the various functions of the ghost spirit activated.","It assisted Su Clan’s Sixteen in circulating the spiritual energy within her body, engaged in automatic cultivation, and refined the purity of her spiritual energy, elevating its quality.","More importantly, Su Clan’s Sixteen was now connected to an even larger ‘energy source through this quiet ghost fairy spirit.","She turned to look at Song Shuhang, who stood beside her, and realized that he was the source of this energy.","Just as she had suspected, this ghost fairy was connected to Song Shuhang.","It was her intuition that led her to agree to sign the contract with the ghost fairy.","“I’m not too pleased with this arrangement,” the White Dragon grumbled. Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body had previously been solely occupied by her, but now, a ghost fairy spirit had been forcefully added to the mix. However, since it was a temporary contract, she had to tolerate it for the time being.","“Wait a moment,” Song Shuhang finally sensed something amiss.","He felt a void within his body.","“A ghost spirit?” After a while, Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded. He quickly assessed the state of his body, finding a broken ghost spirit contract imprint from his first-generation ghost spirit, followed by a complete ghost spirit contract from his second ghost spirit fairy.","But at that moment, a small mark appeared on the ghost spirit contract left behind by the second ghost spirit fairy.","The ghost fairy spirit within him had disappeared.","However, the various functions of the ghost spirit remained intact. Whether it was the automatic AFK Farming cultivation technique, the refinement and purification of spiritual qi, or the storage of spiritual qi, they all continued to operate.","Even though the ghost spirit was no longer present, it still used its remote function to assist Song Shuhang in his cultivation.","Furthermore, through the ghost spirit’s imprint, he discovered that he could now connect with another source of spiritual energy, which he soon realized belonged to Su Clan’s Sixteen.","“My ghost spirit signed a temporary contract with Su Clan’s Sixteen and entered her body?” Song Shuhang looked at Su Clan’s Sixteen.","With the ghost fairy spirit serving as an intermediary, Song Shuhangs spiritual energy and Su Clan’s Sixteen’s spiritual energy could freely exchange and bolster each other’s strength.","“Does the ghost fairy suddenly want to change homes?” Song Shuhang couldn’t decide whether to laugh or sigh. Moreover, he had never heard of a ghost spirit that could sign a temporary contract with another person after already having a contract in place.","“She probably wants to spend some time with me,” Su Clan’s Sixteen speculated while placing her hand gently on her chest.","Pavilion Master Chu chimed in, “Perhaps it’s a matter of the heart. Song","Shuhang, your ghost spirit can now reside within Sixteen’s body.”","“But why would she suddenly want to reside with Sixteen?” Song Shuhang asked, still perplexed.","“I’m not entirely sure,” Pavilion Master Chu said as she adjusted her hair, which had shifted due to the White Dragon’s movements. Song Shuhangs ghost fairy spirit posed numerous questions.","There was a gap in her memory—a blank region that was most likely related to Song Shuhangs ghost fairy spirit. This memory void was likely influenced by the Wielder’s small black room.","Pavilion Master Chu considered the possibility that Song Shuhangs ghost fairy spirit might be connected to her. She carefully recollected the circumstances of her first encounter with Song Shuhang and realized that the blank portion of her memory constituted a significant part of the encounter.","For a brief moment, Pavilion Master Chu wondered if she actually had a daughter.","“Don’t speculate any further. Just ask Sixteen about the ghost fairy,” the White Dragon suggested.","With the ghost fairy spirit still present within Sixteen’s body, there was no need to speculate. They could simply seek Sixteen’s perspective.","“I’ll attempt to communicate with her,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said in a subdued tone.","Her heart raced at the thought of the newfound connection between Song Shuhang’s and her spiritual energy, almost akin to dual cultivation.","After taking a deep breath and calming her emotions, Su Clan’s Sixteen initiated communication with the ghost fairy spirit.","“Can we converse, Ghost Fairy?” Sixteen inquired.","“Of course, anytime,” the ghost spirit fairy replied, her voice carrying a hint of sobbing.","“l suddenly thought of something and was quite moved. I couldn’t help but shed some tears,” the ghost spirit fairy admitted. “It’s been a while since I last cried. A little crying does wonders for a person’s mood.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen was rendered speechless.","Truly, Shuhangs ghost spirit was one of a kind.","While Shuhang endured and triumphed over pain, this ghost fairy was content with a good cry.","“Do you have any questions for me?” the ghost spirit fairy inquired. Su Clan’s Sixteen got straight to the point. “I have two experiments in mind.”","“The experiments involve our connection,” the ghost spirit fairy replied earnestly.","Su Clan’s Sixteen looked puzzled. “What do you mean?” “Firstly, do you like Shuhang?” the ghost spirit fairy queried.","“Yes,” Su Clan’s Sixteen affirmed.","“Then, do you like me?” the ghost spirit fairy continued.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was taken aback. “What?”","“You should know that I am Shuhangs ghost spirit. In a way, I am an extension of him. So, do you like me?” the ghost spirit fairy clarified with a chuckle.","Su Clan’s Sixteen found herself at a loss for words.."]},{"number":2542,"title":"Chapter 2542: The Most Rogue Dao","paragraphs":["Chapter 2542: The Most Rogue Dao","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The ghost spirit fairy was truly a master of logic and left Su Clan’s Sixteen baffled by her question.","The core of the matter was that what the ghost spirit fairy had said made perfect sense — the ghost spirit was the main body, and there was no distinction between the two.","However, in the entire cultivation world, were there any ghost spirits with an entirely independent personality like Song Shuhangs?","Typically, most ghost spirits, aside from being acknowledged as a cultivation shortcut, were essentially equivalent to clones in the cultivation world. They lacked an independent personality and existed in symbiosis with the main body.","In fact, as far as Su Clan’s Sixteen was aware, most ghost spirits were devoid of gender, with only a minority of them altering their personalities to align with their master’s form.","Seeing Su Clan’s Sixteen’s prolonged silence, the ghost spirit fairy smiled and remarked, “Indeed, we’ve just met. It would be quite audacious to discuss ‘love’ so soon.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen replied, “That’s not the only issue.”","“It’s precisely because we have a plethora of issues to address that I’ m here,” the ghost fairy stated. “We’ll be sharing our lives for a while. As for Shuhang, since he has the long-distance function, he can fend for himself temporarily.” Su Clan’s Sixteen was rendered speechless.","After concluding her conversation with the ghost fairy, Su Clan’s Sixteen opened her eyes.","“How did it go?” Song Shuhang inquired. “Did you manage to glean any information?”","“She simply mentioned that she wanted to live with me for a while and conduct an experiment,” Sixteen replied while shaking her head. The White Dragon asked, “What kind of experiment?”","“l don’t know. She didn’t specify,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied.","“Did you discuss anything else?” The White Dragon inquired again. Given the extended conversation, surely they touched on other topics.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s cheeks suddenly flushed. She used both hands to lift the White Dragon’s body and covered half of her face with all her might.","The White Dragon was at a loss. What was her lady doing now?","“Fellow Daoist Scarf, I suggest a spell for you — the Hair Growth Spell,” Pavilion Master Chu interiected. somewhat dazed.","“What?” The White Dragon was bewildered. “I’m not bald.”","“Because you need the Hair Growth Spell to lengthen your dragon mane and enhance the warmth provided by your scarf,” Pavilion Master Chu explained leisurely.","“My dragon mane isn’t hair! Your hair grows on your neck!” The White Dragon retorted.","Pavilion Master Chu adopted a quizzical expression. “Your comprehension of the ‘Hair Growth Technique’ realm is rather shallow. Shuhang has modified and reinforced the ‘Hair Growth Technique.’ It can now be applied not only to himself but also to his adversaries. When the Hair Growth Technique is employed, the subject’s entire body becomes covered in hair. With a single application of the Enhanced Hair Growth Technique, Fellow Daoist Wei can transform your White Dragon Scarf into a Furry Dragon Scarf.”","The White Dragon was left speechless.","“Can’t you possess a conventional magical technique for once?” She cast a disappointed gaze at Song Shuhang.","What sort of magical technique would remain unchanged in Song Shuhangs hands?","Even the Mutated Steel Hands were relatively normal.","Saber Intent Armor, Saber Nurturing Technique, Hair Growth Technique, City-level Lightning Palm... they were all strangely ruthless.","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted","As expected, the White Dragon was targeting him today and took every opportunity to jest at his expense!","“In actuality, I do possess some conventional spells,” Song Shuhang stated.","“For example, the Lightning Attracting Technique and the ‘Heavenly Roc Escape Technique’ that I’ve recently mastered. If I visit the Black Dragon world, I can utilize the power of the dragon channel to invoke the ‘Black","Dragon world’s ten fundamental spells.”‘","The White Dragon rolled her eyes. Her dragon body turned completely white.","“Three thunders?”","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","The White Dragon was giving him a hard time again!","Although I’m proficient with the Karma Blade, utilizing it comes at a steep cost. I have yet to repay the debt I incurred after employing the Karma Blade to eliminate Senior Kun King. My Karma Blade is incredibly potent, but 1 must bear a considerable burden. How does that make me a hooligan?","Meanwhile, in the Xie Wangs lair.","The battle between Soft Feather and the Xie Wang had reached its final stage.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, I’d like to try a sword technique. Can you assist me?” Soft Feather inquired cheerfully.","After enjoying herself to the fullest, she was now prepared to vanquish the evil before her.","“Is it a powerful move? Exercise caution and don’t obliterate the Xie Wang like last time. At present, we haven’t perfected the method of reviving them. If they perish, we’ll lose a valuable asset,” cautioned the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“This isn’t a direct sword technique, Senior, rest assured and cooperate with me,” Soft Feather assured.","“Very well, 1 shall cooperate to the best of my ability. After all, I am the Scarlet Heaven Sword,” the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword responded.","Soft Feather extended her hand, and the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword in her grasp produced two graceful sword flowers, driving the Xie Wang away.","Once they had created some distance, Soft Feather shifted to a two-handed grip on the sword. Peculiar energy fluctuations manifested around her.","“Is that time manipulation?” the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword wondered.","Since Soft Feather’s ghost spirit had been taken over by the Heavenly Emperor, her main body had continually received information, understanding, and power from the Heavenly Emperor.","“It’s a sword technique from the Celestial Thearch,” Song Shuhang muttered softly.","Ever since Soft Feather’s ghost spirit had been taken over by the Heavenly Emperor, Soft Feather’s main body had been continuously receiving information, comprehension, and power from the Heavenly Emperor.","“It’s the Celestial Thearch’s sword technique. The Dao of Time is one of the Great Dao that the myriad worlds cannot afford to offend. Just like the Great Dao of Karma, it’s completely unreasonable. If you offend someone who has mastered the Dao of Time and the Dao of Cause and Effect, you won’t even know how you died if you’re not careful. You’re an extreme hooligan,” the White Dragon quipped.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","The White Dragon was teasing him once more!","Soft Feather retracted her sword gradually.","However, the Xie Wang remained unscathed. It stood there in a daze, unmoving.","“It’s over!” Soft Feather declared confidently.","In the next moment, the Heart Demon Red Cloud Sword in her hand suddenly became limp, like a noodle.","Song Shuhang was puzzled. “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, what’s wrong?” “I’ve expended too much energy. I need to recuperate,” the Heart Demon Red Cloud Sword replied weakly.","Soft Feather’s earlier use of the ‘Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique!","and the Time Burial sword technique had drained the sword’s power significantly. Otherwise, Soft Feather’s own spiritual energy wouldn’t have sufficed to execute such potent techniques.","The Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword had depleted its stored energy and was temporarily incapable of exerting itself.","Boom!","Simultaneously, the Xie Wangs massive body slumped to the ground.","He had died due to ‘time depletion,’ his lifeforce severed, having met a natural demise.","“Impressive, Soft Feather,” Song Shuhang praised enviously.","“Ah, it was nothing,” Soft Feather replied with a giggle. She then waved at Song Shuhang. “Senior Song, come over here for a moment. This Xie Wang is quite peculiar..”"]},{"number":2543,"title":"Chapter 2543: The Cult of the Evil Pots","paragraphs":["Chapter 2543: The Cult of the Evil Pots","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Odd Xie Wang always intrigued Feather and made the grinding sessions all the more interesting.","But as they continued grinding, the Xie Wangs they encountered became increasingly peculiar, which raised some concerns.","Mutated Xie Wangs were not as common as cabbages, and they were only grinding a few malevolent beings within Wenzhou City. So why did they keep encountering mutated Xie Wangs repeatedly?","Senior White wasn’t accompanying them on this journey.","Therefore, Feather couldn’t shake the feeling that there was something hidden beneath the surface of this matter.","Things were getting more and more intriguing.","With a happy wave, Feather beckoned to Song Shuhang. The senior members in the group had spoken the truth—Senior Song possessed a unique constitution. If Su Clan’s Sixteen had a passive ‘kabedon’ constitution, then Senior Song undoubtedly had an active ‘absorb and withstand disasters’ constitution.","Song Shuhang: “Blessed Everyone, I’ll Fight If You’re in Trouble.”","It was precisely because of this unique constitution that when a disaster was about to strike, Senior Song would proactively bear the brunt of it due to the influence of his special constitution.","And when Senior Song faced disasters, he invariably stumbled upon many interesting occurrences.","This was a formula.","“That’s wonderful,” Feather said enviously. She also wished to possess Senior Songs physique. If she could be like Senior Song and have the ability to sense and absorb disasters, her life would undoubtedly be filled with excitement.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Why did he feel that Feather was regarding him with a peculiar gaze?","Lady Onion emerged from Song Shuhangs pocket and curiously inquired,","“What’s so special about this malevolent being?”","“When I used the ‘Time Burial’ sword technique against this malevolent being, I severed a total of nine strands of its ‘life.’ This is also why the energy expended by the ‘Time Burial’ sword technique exceeded the budget of Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword and me.” Feather shook the Heart Demon Scarlet","Heaven Sword in her hand, which was as pliable as noodles, and replied.","“Cut off nine strands of its life force? So, it revived eight times?” Song Shuhang asked.","This was astounding. It could instantly revive without worrying about the cost. Even Resurrection Coins couldn’t achieve this...","Unfortunately, the Xie Wang had encountered Feather’s unorthodox ‘Time Burial’ sword technique. It had been instantly revived eight times but perished in an instant nonetheless.","Reality proved that sometimes, quick resurrection was not a boon. The quicker they revived, the sooner they perished.","He needed to bear this in mind and take it as a lesson.","Feather shook her head and explained, “I don’t think it was revived eight times. It feels more like... it possessed nine distinct individual ‘life forces,’ all existing concurrently. That’s why I extinguished nine of its life forces in an instant.”","“Nine distinct life forces existing simultaneously, yet interconnected? A Nine-lives Demon Cat?” Song Shuhang suggested subconsciously.","Pavilion Master Chu tugged on Song Shuhangs hair and made a cross. “No, it’s more akin to a nine-headed snake. Each head possesses full life force. Regardless of which head is killed, the other eight heads remain brimming with vitality.”","The White Dragon added, “In other words, this Xie Wang here is essentially one of the nine life forces. The other eight life forces might be concealed elsewhere?”","“Yes, yes, that’s it,” Feather affirmed.","She followed the clues and employed Time Burial to eliminate this life force and the other eight life forces located in various areas.","“The Great Dao of Time should not be provoked, should not be provoked!” Song Shuhang reiterated.","He now understood what the White Dragon had meant.","In the future, he believed he should maintain a better attitude when facing the Celestial Thearch. He shouldn’t dismiss her terrifying side simply because she often acted cute.","If he angered the Celestial Thearch and she employed her true ‘path of time’ killer move against him, regardless of how many resurrection methods he possessed, he wouldn’t be able to counter it.","“Malevolent beings that are artificially nurtured and capable of fusion; Xie","Wangs with an organization capable of sharing ‘illusory reality’; and Xie Wangs with nine vitality heads scattered worldwide... since when did mutated Xie Wangs become so common?” The White Dragon pondered.","She had experienced the turbulent eras and evil times of the world.","In the past, while there were mutated Xie Wangs, their density was never this “So, I suspect someone is orchestrating this intentionally,” Feather raised her hand and expressed her theory. “Given the signs of Xie Wangs being artificially nurtured, could it be that someone has been intentionally collecting mutated Xie Wangs, secretly plotting to use them for a conspiracy?” “Feather, your thoughts align with mine,” Song Shuhang chuckled.","Su Clan’s Sixteen contemplated for a moment and suggested, “Then, let’s explore the nearby area and grind another batch of malevolent beings. We’ll check for mutated malevolent beings among them and mark their locations for analysis. With real data, we can determine if someone is covertly scheming.”","“First, let’s retrieve the Malevolent Core,” Song Shuhang agreed.","Simultaneously, he extended his right hand.","The Defiant Whale Glove opened at the fingertips.","“Wuvvuwu Q’ The artifact spirit, Little Fairy, knelt on the back of the fist and saluted.","Song Shuhang pressed his finger against the malevolent beings body.","He activated the secret appraisal technique.","“I need information about the origin of this malevolent being. Was it placed here by someone or did it occur naturally?” Song Shuhang mused.","As his proficiency in the Secret Appraisal Technique increased, Song Shuhangs mastery of the technique grew deeper. It was no longer as uncontrollable as before, allowing him to execute minor operations.","After paying the price for the appraisal, a deep cut appeared on Song Shuhangs fingertip, and a droplet of blood emerged.","However, before the droplet could descend, the artifact spirit fairy had already rolled to Song Shuhangs fingertip and bitten it. Her body hung from Song Shuhangs finger as she consumed the droplet of blood.","Self-sufficiency.","He couldn’t afford to waste a single drop of blood.","Concurrently, information about the secret appraisal technique materialized in Song Shuhangs mind.","[Unknown Mutated Xie Wang: A deformed Xie Wang with nine lives. Its remaining eight lives are dispersed throughout the world and have been extinguished. This ordinary Xie Wang underwent a natural mutation after accidentally devouring a disciple from the Demon Sect who came to exterminate it.]","“Eh?” It mutated after consuming a Demon Sect disciple sent to eliminate it?”","Based on the available information, it seemed like an accident.","Song Shuhang relayed this information to everyone.","Then, he turned to Eon Sea Scholar. “Prior to our discovery of Xie Wang here, were there any records of Devil Sect disciples coming to eradicate Xie Wang?”","“No,” Eon Sea Scholar shook his head. “Perhaps, the Devil’s Doctrine disciple had already perished before we discovered Xie Wang.”","Song Shuhang, do you suspect that the Devil’s Doctrine is behind this?” Su Clan’s Sixteen inquired.","“It’s just a tentative theory,” Song Shuhang responded.","He bore grudges against the Devil’s Doctrine, so it was only natural that he would cast suspicion in their direction, regardless of the situation.","Currently, they should proceed cautiously.."]},{"number":2544,"title":"Chapter 2544: Encrypted","paragraphs":["Chapter 2544: Encrypted","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Soft Feather contemplated, “If it’s really the Limitless Demon Sect causing trouble, what exactly are they up to? And why are they causing trouble specifically in Wenzhou City?”","Young Master Hai of the Limitless Demon Sect had interacted with Song Shuhang some time ago, so he was certainly aware of Song Shuhangs connection to ‘Wenzhou City.’","Under these circumstances, were they still choosing to stir trouble in Wenzhou City?","Were they that headstrong?","Or perhaps, were they causing trouble all over the country, hence not avoiding Wenzhou City?","Su Clan’s Sixteen replied, “The Limitless Demon Sect has a grand plan that they’ve prepared for a century, but we don’t know the specifics.”","“Fairy Six is already investigating this matter. I’ll ask her if she has any inside information.” Song Shuhang suddenly remembered something as he was speaking.","He reached into his pocket and retrieved a cell phone.","This was the phone of Demon Monarch Anzhi, one of the three pieces of","Young Master Hai r s set that he had acquired. Young Master Hai l s private number was stored in it.","“l wonder if Young Master Hai’s private number has changed?” he wondered.","The last time Song Shuhang had called using this phone, Young Master Hai had still been quite resolute. Even though he knew that Demon Monarch Anzhi had fallen into Song Shuhangs hands, and even his phone had ended up with Tyrannical Song, he hadn’t changed his phone.","While thinking, Song Shuhang retrieved Young Master Hai r s number and dialed it.","“Don’t disappoint me, Young Master Hai.”","Unfortunately... After all, there were very few individuals in the world as resolute as Song Shuhang.","Young Master Hai’s previous private number had been deactivated.","With Young Master Hai r s personality and intelligence, he had decisively abandoned his original number once he confirmed there was no chance to save Demon Monarch Anzhi. Keeping his private number was pointless and would only subject him to Tyrannical Songs repeated harassment.","“Young Master Hai r s audacity has waned,” Song Shuhang lamented. After saying this, he tossed the phone back into his pocket.","Back when Young Master Hai was only at the Fourth Stage Realm, he had dared to provoke the Spirit River Su Clan, a colossus, and directly provoked Su Clan’s Seven, who was the strongest at the Fifth Stage Realm. At that time, Young Master Hai r s aura had soared to the heavens, as if he wanted to trample the world underfoot. In his eyes, everything in the world was just a pawn. Now, he didn’t even dare to answer a phone call—his spirit had been broken!","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Don’t you know why Young Master Hai!s audacity has waned?","“Wait, I almost forgot.” When Song Shuhang tossed the phone back into his pocket, he suddenly had a thought.","Why did he need to call Young Master Hai?","Demon Monarch Anzhi, one of the three pieces, was still locked up in his Inner World!","Demon Monarch Anzhi might not know as much about the Limitless Demon Sect’s plans as Young Master Hai, but he definitely knew a lot of insider information.","More importantly, besides Demon Monarch Anzhi, Song Shuhang also had Young Master Hai r s incarnation with a heart demon!","It was the incarnation that Song Shuhang had forced out of his inner demon.","Last time, Song Shuhang had used the function of the fragment of the Heavenly City-Cave of the Inner Demon to extract more than half of the inner demon from this incarnation and turned it into ‘Inner Demon Sashimi.’ He had then exchanged it with Shadow Overlord for the magical treasure of the ‘Holy Land of Shadow.’","The inner demon within this incarnation had the potential to grow. It could mature like a leek after each harvest. Therefore, Song Shuhang hadn’t killed it but kept it and carefully nurtured it. He wanted to wait for the inner demon to grow stronger and harvest it again and again.","Now, Demon Monarch Anzhi and Young Master Hai’ s incarnations came in handy.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and opened his Inner World.","The core assistant thoughtfully packaged Young Master Hai r s incarnation and Demon Monarch Anzhi together.","Demon Monarch Anzhi’s body had become much leaner. After failing to transcend the tribulation, his injuries weren’t shallow. Additionally, the core assistant had been intentionally controlling his injuries to prevent him from having a chance to recover.","Therefore, how could he know that recently, Demon Monarch Anzhi had become thinner, which made people feel sorry for him?","Young Master Hai r s incarnation remained unconscious, and his mind was still in turmoil. After not seeing him for a while, the inner demons within this incarnation had partially recovered.","Young Master Hai had completely abandoned this clone and even used a secret technique to sever the connection.","Song Shuhang wondered if he could awaken it and extract some information from it.","The weakened Demon Monarch Anzhi opened his eyes and found that he had finally escaped the ‘Immortal Sealing Jail’ that had filled him with despair. The ‘Immortal Sealing Jail’ obtained from Zither Master Fengyi was meant to imprison Tribulation Transcenders and could even temporarily trap Immortals.","The Immortal Sealing Prison had thousands of methods of immobilization, including physical and mental suppression.","When Demon Monarch Anzhi was imprisoned within it, his body and mind were under tremendous pressure all day long, and he was on the verge of collapse.","“Are you awake?” At this moment, a familiar voice sounded in his ear.","Demon Monarch Anzhi turned his head and saw a terrifying figure standing with his back to him, hands behind his back.","“Tyrannical Song Senior...” Demon Monarch Anzhi’s heart trembled upon seeing Song Shuhang. Then, after a moment of thought, he straightforwardly said, “Senior, if you have any questions, just ask.”","As a disciple of the Demon Sect, he didn’t have high moral integrity.","He who understands the times is a wise man.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, please don’t imprison me in that terrifying prison...” Demon Monarch Anzhi weakly pleaded.","Song Shuhang wore a mask and turned around. “If I’m satisfied with your answer, I can transfer you to another location for imprisonment.”","“Senior Tyrannical Song, please ask me a question. As long as I know it, I’ll tell you everything I know.” Demon Monarch Anzhi sat up.","Song Shuhang nodded with satisfaction and asked, “What plans do you have in Wenzhou City? What’s the purpose of raising Xie Wang? Why is the Limitless Demon Sect recruiting so many rogue cultivators?”","Demon Monarch Anzhi’s weakened body trembled slightly. The world has changed this much?”","How could it change so fast? He had just transcended the Fifth Stage tribulation not long ago.","According to the internal calculations of the Limitless Demon Sect, the current Heavenly Axiom shouldn’t have collapsed so soon. It should have taken several decades or even a hundred years, right?","“The world has indeed changed, but it’s not because of me. I didn’t do anything,” Song Shuhang replied subconsciously, but he couldn’t hide the guilt in his tone.","Demon Monarch Anzhi was speechless.","Was the world’s metamorphosis brought forward was because of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","“It seems like you know quite a lot. Tell me everything you know.” Song Shuhang coughed lightly and stood with his hands behind his back to give Demon Monarch Anzhi a sense of oppression.","“l don’t know what special plans the Limitless Demon Sect has in Wenzhou City... This might have happened after I failed my tribulation. We’ve been conducting experiments on raising Xie Wang in secret. We’re waiting for the world to change so that we can grasp a large amount of Xie Wangs power as soon as possible. Recruiting itinerant cultivators is also a part of the experiment to raise Xie Wang.” Demon Monarch Anzhi replied.","His answer basically confirmed Song Shuhang and the others’ previous guesses.","Su Clan’s Sixteen spoke up. “What do you want to do after mastering this?”","“Use the power of Xie Wang to open the Demon Country. It would trigger the Tribulation Transcenders’ disaster and constructed the Demon Sect’s country... Ah...” Demon Monarch Anzhi hadn’t finished speaking when his entire head exploded.","This was a kind of imprisonment method hidden deep in Demon Monarch","Anzhi’s head. Once he revealed some secret, it would trigger this imprisonment method and trigger an explosion.","Demon Monarch Anzhi himself didn’t even know about this sealing technique in his body!"]},{"number":2545,"title":"Chapter 2545: “The Biography of Song Tiandao” Draft","paragraphs":["Chapter 2545: “The Biography of Song Tiandao” Draft","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Most of the disciples in the demonic sect were wise individuals who understood the current situation and knew when to yield. So, when certain disciples came into contact with the sect’s most significant secrets, it was standard procedure to implant some anti-theft techniques in the disciples’ minds.","This was precisely why when Demon Monarch Anzhi mentioned the","‘challenges faced by the transcendent immortals’ and the plan to ‘establish a demonic sect nation,’ things took a turn for the worse.","Blood and brain matter exploded to create a gruesome scene that wasn’t suitable for children and needed to be censored.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and, with invisible telekinesis, controlled the blood and plasma of Demon Monarch Anzhi, suspended it in the air, forcing them back into Demon Monarch Anzhi’s head, restoring them to their original position.","This telekinetic feat was quite impressive.","Invisible telekinesis was indeed ideal for cultivators like Song Shuhang, who didn’t have the time to master complex magical techniques.","However, as impressive as his actions were, they couldn’t prevent Demon Monarch Anzhi’s demise.","Not every cultivator had the luxury of having multiple resurrection formations like Song Shuhang. Even with a resurrection array and a magical weapon, there was still a chance of failure. Resurrection wasn’t a guaranteed success.","Demon Monarch Anzhi’s lifeless body fell to the ground.","Song Shuhang sighed.","[Three-piece grand gift set-I]","This was the gift he had prepared for Su Clan’s Sixteen during the New Year.","Now that Demon Monarch Anzhi was gone, the three-piece gift set was","incomplete.","This debt would have to be settled with the Limitless Demon Sect.","“It’s a shame that Senior White’s ‘divine lamp’ can only hold one lamp spirit. Otherwise, we might have been able to trap Demon Monarch Anzhi’s soul in the lamp and transform it into a lamp spirit,” Song Shuhang lamented.","Demon Monarch Anzhi, Zheng Neng, and Young Master Hai. If he could imprison all three of them in a divine lamp and turn them into lamp spirits for Su Clan’s Sixteen to utilize, it would be a decent idea.","“Do you want to imprison this guy’s soul?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired.","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, do you have a method?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Absolutely. My primary function is to restrain sealed objects. As long as you can provide sufficient spiritual energy, I can even suppress Immortals’ souls! A mere demonic sect disciple’s soul near Rank-5 strength is child’s play for me,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet boasted.","“As expected of my tombstone. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, your abilities are extraordinary!” Song Shuhang exclaimed and summoned the stone tablet.","Whoosh! Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s form expanded.","The inscription ‘Song Shuhangs tomb’ on it started to radiate light.","“Tomorrow, I’ll ask my master Bai Youyou to change ‘Song Shuhangs name to ‘Tyrannical Song.’ Tyrannical Song is quite renowned.” As the stone tablet spoke, it pressed down on Demon Monarch Anzhi’s lifeless body.","Demon Monarch Anzhi’s head had been obliterated. Even his soul had been damaged by this deadly spell.","Given the Devil’s Doctrine’s secretive nature, they were thorough in their actions. Not only did they dispose of his body, but they also targeted his soul. The cultivation world had various methods for interrogating souls!","Demon Monarch Anzhi’s soul was fragmented and rapidly dissipating. Under these conditions, even a Profound Sage-level expert would struggle to protect his soul.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, however, was an exception. Despite being at the Ninth Stage Realm, it was a unique magical treasure that was closest to a Dao weapon. It had been created before Heavenly Dao had taken shape.","After pressing down, Demon Monarch Anzhi’s fragmented soul was contained and sealed within the pattern at the base of the stone tablet.","In the future, when Song Shuhang obtained a magical treasure akin to the Ten Thousand Demons Banner or the Ten Thousand Ghost Banner, he could consider transferring Demon Monarch Anzhi’s soul.","The rapid sequence of events left Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing astounded.","In particular, the stone tablet magical treasure turned out to be the tombstone Senior Tyrannical Song had prepared for himself?","“I didn’t anticipate that someone as formidable as Senior Tyrannical Song, who had resolved to contend with the Heavenly Dao and verify the path to immortality, would be prepared to die!”","“In the pursuit of the path to immortality, one must confront a formidable adversary at each step! Each step might lead to death, so Senior Tyrannical Song prepared his tombstone! ”","“Yet, even in the face of the possibility of death, Senior Tyrannical Song refused to surrender. That’s Senior Tyrannical Song!’","Numerous thoughts raced through Eon Sea Scholar’s mind.","He discreetly recorded these thoughts and decided that he would later publicize the touching tale of Senior Tyrannical Song preparing his tombstone before challenging the Heavenly Dao.","If, in the future, Senior Tyrannical Song truly achieved immortality, this story could be incorporated into Song Tiandao!s biography.","Hmm, he might contemplate drafting a preliminary version of Song Tiandao’s Biography.","“Well done, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet!” Song Shuhang praised and took the stone tablet. Subsequently, he discreetly performed the Saber Nurturing Technique twelve times.","After all, the Saber Nurturing Technique was easily misconstrued as an evil technique. Therefore, Song Shuhang had to secretly practice it to avoid any misunderstandings in front of Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing.","Next, Song Shuhang extended his hand and touched the pattern on the stone tablet.","Demon Monarch Anzhi’s soul was released.","However, Demon Monarch Anzhi’s soul appeared bewildered, and his gaze was vacant.","Song Shuhang tried to inquire, “What does the Tribulation Transcender’s","Tribulation signify? Also, what was the extent of the country that the","Limitless Demon Sect intended to establish, and in what form?”","“The world has undergone immense changes, and malevolence has sprouted... Gong... The Sea, the Devil Nation, the Tribulation Transcenders must endure myriad tribulations,” Demon Monarch Anzhi robotically responded with fragmented words.","Regarding the Devil’s Doctrine’s nation, his soul had ceased to function long ago and rendered him mute.","Pavilion Master Chu suggested, “This guy’s soul is significantly damaged. Shuhang, if you have time, try feeding him some spring water from the living","spring. It might help restore his soul.”","“It would be a shame to waste the living spring upstream on him. I’ll obtain some living spring water downstream for him to try later,” Song Shuhang agreed.","“Isn’t the downstream the bathwater from Pavilion Master Chu’s main body?” The White Dragon chuckled and quipped, “Shuhang, the living spring water downstream will likely be even more precious. You should think it over. After all, Chu her original body isn’t just a head anymore. It’s about to grow to her waist.”","Pavilion Master Chu was left flabbergasted.","“Unbeknownst to us, Senior Chu has transformed into more than just a beauty.” Song Shuhang scratched his head and commented.","“Pa Pavilion Master Chu slapped Song Shuhangs hand. “Don’t touch me.”","Then, Pavilion Master Chu pondered, “According to this little guy from the demonic sect’s response, it seems that the Tribulation Transcenders are destined to face numerous tribulations. Could it be that the Limitless Demon Sect plans to take on a Tribulation Transcender?”","“Perhaps they have even grander ambitions? If they aim to establish a Devil’s Doctrine nation, one Tribulation Transcender might not suffice. Is it possible that the Limitless Demon Sect has its sights set on a multitude of Tribulation Transcenders?” Song Shuhang followed Pavilion Master Chu’s line of thought and speculated.","The Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword swayed in Soft Feather’s hand. “There’s another possibility. They might want to exploit the world’s immense changes to trigger some sort of world law. Then, through this law and the world’s transformations, they intend to incite a calamity at the level of a","Tribulation Transcender.’","“Right, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword. Just now, someone contacted me from afar and advised me to avoid using the term ‘world’s immense changes.’ Instead, they suggested using ‘civilization.”‘ Soft Feather shared this information.","The sword was confused.."]},{"number":2546,"title":"Chapter 2546: What’s Going on in This World?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2546: What’s Going on in This World?!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What does this have to do with being civilized? Besides, I’m a mighty Mental Demon. What civilization do I have to talk about?” The sword protested.","“Isn’t it funny that you’re talking about civilization with a demon?” Soft","Feather giggled. “I’m only responsible for passing on the message. Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, it’s up to you whether you want to talk about civilization or not. It has nothing to do with me.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet thought for a moment and then reminded, “Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, you should ask Soft Feather who sent you the long-distance message.”","Ever since Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had agreed to Song Shuhangs request, he was still regretting it. Therefore, now, it would repeatedly think about what it was doing and what it was saying. As a result, it became the most rational one among Song Shuhangs pendants. Recently, he had been shouldering the responsibility of reminding everyone not to make mistakes.","“It must be the Celestial Thearch,” Song Shuhang suddenly said. “The last time I mentioned this word to her, she suddenly got angry and blocked me. A woman’s heart is like a needle at the bottom of the sea.’","Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was speechless.","“So it’s your fault!”","As he spoke, Song Shuhang logged into the cultivation chat function and sent the information he had just received from Demon Monarch Anzhi regarding the Limitless Demon Sect’s plan to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group for the seniors to refer to.","In the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","Mother Yellow MountainGroup Owner: “Shuhang, where did you get this information?”","ServerGroup Owner: “Senior Yellow Mountain, this information was obtained from Demon Monarch Anzhi, a disciple of the Limitless Demon Sect whom I captured earlier. The price was quite high. Demon Monarch Anzhi, whom I was going to give as a gift, exploded in the head after revealing part of the information.’","“In other words, the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect who know this information are likely to have been cursed or imprisoned. Once the secret was leaked, he would die from an explosive in his head. Fairy Dongfang Six, Fairy Dongfang Six, you have to be careful on your side!”","He remembered that Fairy Dongfang Six had planted a spy in the Limitless Demon Sect and was preparing to send the news out.","If Fairy Dongfang Six’s spies were also imprisoned, he would have to be careful. Otherwise, if he was not careful, the spy’s head could blow up before the news could spread.","God of Racing replied, “Got it. Thank you for the information, Shuhang. I’Il","pay attention to the dangers in this area. I’ve already secretly contacted the planted in the Limitless Demon Sect, but it’ll take some time to get the exact news out. I’ll let them first check if there are any restrictions placed in their brains and think of a way to avoid them. When the time comes, I’ll send the information to the group and verify it with little friend Shuhangs information.’","They were both from the Demon Sect, so they naturally had the means to resolve the ‘confinement in the mind’. The ones who understood the fiend sect cultivators the most were naturally the cultivators from the other sects.","ID Officer: “Speaking of which, isn’t the Nine Provinces Number Two Group’s function getting more and more excessive? In the past, it would still display his daoist name, but why isn’t it displayed now? When I saw Server Group","Master, I was confused for a long time before 1 guessed that it was Shuhang.”","“l am Northern River.’","CPU: “We all know that you’re Northern River, but there are a few people I can’t guess. For example...Who is the gravitational wave?”","Gravitational Wave: “I’m Liu Ying... My title should be based on my cultivation technique?”","“Shuhang, don’t mess around. Change everyone’s daoist names back to normal.’","ServerGroup Owner: “Wait, I’ll adjust the background. There must have been a BUG in the system during this upgrade. I’ve already asked Miss Long Luo to check the reason. I believe the BUG will be fixed soon.’","Zhiyin.Pathogen: “Shuhang, your cultivation chat is an innate ability, right?","Why would there be a bug in it? You must have done something bad yesterday! Will I get infected by a virus in the future?”","ServerGroup Owner: .","In fact, this thing could really produce a virus. For example, Senior Three-Eyed’s garbage data attack could completely be included in the list of viruses.","Black Panther FriendDog Head Building Owner: “Text version of cute dog head emoji.”","“Tyrannical Song, send me a copy of the information related to the Xie Wang.","Then, transfer the Xie Wangs body to your Heavenly City fragment ‘Kitchen","No. 111’. Chuchu and I are going to study the ‘Xie Wang Recipe’ now!”","Black-skinned friend, Dog Head Buildings owner: “Rub the dog head upstairs in anger. Hand-made version of the text.”","Obsession. Rubbing dog heads was a type of obsession.","Very Delicious:","Server Group Leader: “Immortal Fairy Bie Xue, please wait a moment. I’ll immediately transfer the information and Xie Wangs body to you and Chu Chu. In addition, Senior Guo Da, I’ve met Master Ming Heng, a member of your Southern Eternal Sword Sect. This fellow Daoist is very interesting. He has a discerning eye and knows how to praise my unborn sister.”","Now that Immortal Fairy Bie Xue had arrived, the research on transforming evil into food ingredients could be launched.","Black Panther FriendDog Head Building Lord: “l t d like to know when you’ll be able to customize your emojis.”","“I’ll try to add this feature in the next update.” Song Shuhang replied.","Dog Food King Pharmacist: “In addition, Shuhang, I’m quickly developing a headache from this. What nicknames did you give everyone?”","“This really isn’t my fault. I’ve already consulted Madam Long Luo. She said that the nickname was automatically arranged by the system...” Song Shuhang replied with a serious expression. However, it was based on his understanding and impression of the seniors and fellow daoists.","However, this was indeed an automatic arrangement!","Mother Yellow Mountain,Group Owner: “Shuhang, I’ve already collected a batch of Xie Wangs and their cores. In a while, you can think of a way to send a ‘Branded Wooden Saber! to me and receive these evil illusions and their cores. After that, appraise these cores and see how many of them are the type raised by the Limitless Demon Sect. I want to mark them.”","“Roger that, Mother Yellow Mountain. I promise to complete the mission!” Song Shuhang replied.","But in less than a second, Song Shuhang found out that he had accidentally typed ‘Mother Yellow Mountain’.","“Retract, is there a recall function? Clumsy little squirrel, quickly retract my response.” Song Shuhang urgently ordered the ‘clumsy little squirrel’.","[Ding! Server Group Leader has retracted a message: Received, Mother Yellow","Mountain. I promise to complete the mission.]","“Retraction successful.’","Yellow Mountain MotherGroup Owner:...","Had Shuhang become arrogant lately, or had Venerable Yellow Mountain become unable to wield a saber?","Venerable Yellow Mountain pulled out his phone, opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and removed ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song from the group list without hesitation. He muted him for 30 days.","[System Notification: User Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has been muted by the administrator for 30 days.]","Song ShUhang:","He opened his group list and checked. He remembered that he had changed the nickname in the group to ‘Tyrannical Sage Tyrannical Song, so who was this Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","On the other side.","On a treasured saber.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber sat cross-legged and contemplated his 30-day mute. He had silently changed his nickname to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, intending to announce some big news. While wandering in the sea just now, he suddenly found that the mysterious island had reappeared and was heading towards the route to Spirit Butterfly Island.","However, he had unintentionally offended Senior Spirit Butterfly in Soft","Feather’s live broadcast barrage. Therefore, he didn’t want Senior Spirit Butterfly to know that he was wandering near Spirit Butterfly Island. Yes, he had lied when he said he wasn’t in the mortal world.","So, he changed his nickname and profile picture to Song Shuhangs...","But before he could take any action, Senior Yellow Mountain muted him.","What a predicament!","What a dilemma!"]},{"number":2547,"title":"Chapter 2547: It’s All Meant to Be","paragraphs":["Chapter 2547: It’s All Meant to Be","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If I had known earlier, I would have switched to the shady fortune teller or Soft Feather.","The shady fortune teller hadn’t been online recently. Maybe he’s busy giving birth? Soft Feather was the only one in the group who often changed her daoist name like Song Shuhang. If it were the two of them, it would be more suitable than Song Shuhang.","Thrice Reckless sighed.","He pondered for a while.","“So...Should I switch to Senior Skylark’s account?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s fingers tapped lightly on his phone.","He knew Skylark’s number because not long ago, he had helped Skylark upgrade her game level.","“No, it’s meaningless to use Senior Skylarks account.”","If he used Skylarks account to alert everyone, with Senior Spirit Butterfly’s intelligence, he would probably be able to quickly deduce that Thrice Reckless was near Spirit Butterfly Island.","At that time, he would be dead for sure.","He had just finished filming the previous “My Unrestrained Life” not long ago, and he didn’t want to be captured by Senior Spirit Butterfly to film the next one. Even if Thrice Reckless had a dream of becoming a star, he didn’t want to work so hard and make three or four big movies a year.","Therefore, he could only reluctantly give the interesting right to announce a big piece of news to someone else.","Thrice Reckless pondered for a moment before sending a private message to Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was one of the few reliable people in the Nine Provinces Number One Group. As long as Copper Trigram didn’t show up, he was very reliable.","Moreover, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber had always noticed that Northern","River’s Loose Cultivator was secretly protecting him from getting too wild.","Thereupon, Thrice Reckless first changed his nickname and profile picture back to normal. Then, he opened the friend list of the Nine Provinces Number One Group and casually pulled out Northern River’s Loose Cultivator’s location.","“Old Northern River, are you there?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber sent a","message.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator quickly replied, “I’m here. What’s the matter? Thrice Reckless?”","As expected of the man who was always online in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“l have some big news to tell everyone, but 1 was accidentally muted by Senior Yellow Mountain in the group. Therefore, I have no choice but to tell you this big news, and then you will pass it on to the fellow daoists in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said.","“Eh?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked in puzzlement. Wasn’t Senior Yellow Mountain silencing Shuhang just now?”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “[Lighting a cigarette, lonely, sad emoji] The banned Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is me. I was just about to joke with everyone. Before I could joke around, Senior Yellow Mountain silenced me.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “[Dumbfounded emoji].”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was speechless.","Thrice Reckless was really a clever little guy, and he was also quite unlucky.","“Anyway, I’ll tell you this big news first, and you can tell everyone else about it. But don’t say that I told you this big news.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said to Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator replied, “Alright, I promise you. Tell me, what is it?”","“To put it simply, the mysterious island where we lost our memories after we went up with True Monarch Ancient Lake Temple has appeared again! Now, it was approaching the Spirit Butterfly Island. This is a big deal. We must try again and think of a way to get to the mysterious island again. We’ll pick ourselves up from where we fell. With the experience from last time, we’ll definitely be able to seize this opportunity!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said.","After Northern River’s Loose Cultivator finished reading Thrice Reckless ‘message, he suddenly discovered a blind spot and asked, “Thrice Reckless, are you near Spirit Butterfly Island?”","“Yes, but don’t tell the fellow daoists in the group about this. You’re in charge of telling this information to the fellow daoists in the group and see if anyone is willing to form a team with us.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber repeatedly reminded him, afraid that Northern River’s Loose Cultivator would spill the beans and Senior Spirit Butterfly would catch onto his brilliance.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator replied, [Nodding emoji] Sure, no problem. I’ll tell the fellow daoists in the group about the mysterious island and let everyone prepare.”","“Right, Northern River, let’s find True Monarch Ancient Lake Temple to form a team again. Hehehe...” Perhaps Copper Trigram was also on this mysterious island. After we land on the mysterious island again, we’ll look for the place where the shady fortune teller lives. If he could find her, he might even have the chance to see the child that the shady fortune teller and the divine beast senior had. He just didn’t know that Copper Trigram would give birth to the baby. It was even given birth by a divine beast senior. It’s interesting just thinking about it.” After Thrice Reckless Mad Saber finished speaking, he even sent a string of ‘funny emojis.","Thinking about the shady fortune teller with a big belly and a few children in his arms, he felt that it was interesting.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was speechless.","“Alright, no problem. Is there anything else you need me to tell the fellow daoists in the group?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied, “Nothing, nothing. Just don’t mention me when you’re relaying the story! I can’t let Senior Spirit Butterfly know that I’m near Spirit Butterfly Island.”","“No problem, leave it to me.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator guaranteed.","A moment later, in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: ” Fellow Daoists, we have an urgent piece of news. This year, the ‘mysterious island’ has reappeared. According to our war reporter Brother Thrice Reckless, the mysterious island is slowly approaching Senior Spirit Butterfly’s ‘Spirit Butterfly Island.","If you are interested, you can go to the island to explore it again, and I recommend you to register for the event at the Spirit Butterfly Island. If you are not ready, please avoid the mysterious island, lest you suffer from amnesia.”","Then, he tagged Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly. “Senior Spirit Butterfly, our war reporter, Brother Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, is currently at the front line of the information center, wandering around Spirit Butterfly Island.","“Finally...l wish all fellow daoists good health and good luck, and may you have children soon.’","“Eh? The mysterious island is going to appear again?” Fairy Lychee asked curiously.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator:”???”","Spirit Butterfly Island Under Pressure (Soft Feather): Senior Northern River’s account numbers are different from before?”","Yellow Mountain was so tired that he wanted to retire.","Beside him, Doudou silently took out the ‘quick-acting heart- saving pill’ and stuffed it into his mouth to make a loud chewing sound. Venerable Yellow Mountain wanted to hear the sound of the ‘quick-acting heart- saving pill’ and reduce the burden on his heart.","On the treasured saber, Thrice Reckless opened the interface of the Nine","Provinces Number One Group. He was just about to see how Northern Loose Cultivator would explain the mysterious island to the fellow daoists in the group.","He was stunned when he opened it.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s face was filled with question marks: H ???”","He quickly opened Northern River’s Loose Cultivator’s account and sent a string of In the past.","“Northern River, you thick-browed, big-eyed fellow, you actually secretly tricked me at such a crucial moment?”","Fellow Daoist Thrice Reckless.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator replied,[You think I’m Northern River Qiao?] But actually, I’m Copper Trigram","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: ” ! ! ! ”","“l was thinking the same thing as you. I was just about to go online and imitate Northern River’s account, then announce the news to the fellow daoists in the group, and tease Northern River at the same time. I didn’t expect that you would come to me in private right after I changed my profile picture and chat account name.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator’s account changed to Iron Trigram’s account.","Not only did he imitate Northern River’s account, but he also used the account of his disciple, Immortal Fortune Teller Iron Trigram.","“You can only blame yourself for never having a private chat with my disciple Iron Trigram, Thrice Reckless! Otherwise,” Immortal Master Copper Trigram replied,” you could still deduce my identity through the chat records. All of this is the will of the heavens.’","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was speechless."]},{"number":2548,"title":"Chapter 2548: I Fear Nothing with This Lineup","paragraphs":["Chapter 2548: I Fear Nothing with This Lineup","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Despair had set in for this world that constantly hurt each other!","In this pitiful “Nine Provinces Number One Group,” trust among its members was practically non-existent. Staying in this wretched group was becoming unbearable.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, with tears in his eyes, opened the member list and found another “Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.” He opened a private chat box and scrolled through their chat history to confirm that this was indeed the real Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.","Once bitten, twice shy.","After meticulously verifying that this was the authentic Northern River’s","Loose Cultivator, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber began typing in the chat box: “Old Northern River, that shady fortune-teller posed as your account, attempting to deceive you!’","“l saw it,” replied Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.","“Let’s confront him. This shady fortune-teller’s actions are truly malicious, and we absolutely cannot let him off the hook!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber began inciting action.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator felt a headache coming on as he typed his response: “You need to be more cautious next time. Don’t fall for such traps so easily.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s face was filled with tears.","At Nine Provinces Number One Group, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator chimed in: “Shady fortune teller, why did you impersonate my account earlier? If you don’t provide a satisfactory explanation, don’t blame me for resorting to underhanded methods! ”","“It’s futile, Fellow Daoist Northern River. The shady fortune-teller has already logged off,” Medicine Master replied. “l noticed that Immortal Fortune Teller Iron Trigram’s account went offline briefly and then came back online. At this point, Iron Trigram’s account should have been returned to his actual self.”","Dealing with a situation where you were ready to confront someone, but they had already gone offline and vanished into thin air was indeed frustrating.","Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark added, “Senior Yellow Mountain, I strongly recommend kicking out Iron Trigram’s account. Otherwise, Copper Trigram will keep using Iron Trigram’s account to cause trouble. We must put a stop to this malicious trend... If you can’t handle it, Senior Skylark and I can help clean up the mess in our group using our accounts and restore peace among the members.’","“Senior [Shivering], I’m innocent,” Immortal Fortune Teller Iron Trigram pleaded.","“You’re an accomplice! Modern Chinese law also states that if you lend your car to someone and an accident happens, the owner is still held responsible. The same logic applies here, You lent your account to your master, and after he broke the rules, you, as the account owner, can’t escape responsibility. Old Northern River, the main perpetrator has escaped, but the accomplice cannot. If you have any underhanded methods, feel free to use them on the accomplice. Debts must be repaid!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber passionately stated, using Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark’s account.","Immortal Fortune Teller Iron Trigram responded with a tearful emoji.","His master had always used his account. He knew that eventually, he would incur the public’s wrath, and that would likely be the end for him.","At this moment, Sage Monarch Tyrannical Extermination suddenly stepped in to uphold justice. “But Senior Thrice Reckless, you’re using Xuan Nu Sect’s","Senior Skylark’s account to cause trouble.”","Senior Yellow Mountain was exhausted and felt like retiring: ???","Sage Monarch Tyrannical Extermination?","Song Shuhang?","How was he still able to speak?","Then, who was the idiotic Profound Sage Tyrannical Song that I muted earlier?","Venerable Yellow Mountain extended his hand and scrolled through his friend list for quite some time. Finally, he saw that Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s account had a muted mark.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless.","So, it was this idiot Thrice Reckless.","No wonder he suddenly used Senior Skylarks account to go online.","As it turned out, he had impersonated Song Shuhang earlier and had been muted by mistake, rendering him unable to speak.","Venerable Yellow Mountain sighed and reached out to remove Thrice Reckless’s mute.","But suddenly, Venerable Yellow Mountain’s finger paused.","Wait a minute...","Impersonating Song Shuhang?","Causing trouble?","Alright, Thrice Reckless.","You were already prepared to impersonate Song Shuhang and cause trouble, yet here you are passionately reprimanding Iron Trigram?","“Kick him. After that, I’ll kick out Copper Trigram and Song Shuhang,” Doudou said from the side. “These three guys are already beyond saving.”","When Song Shuhang first joined the group, he was such a pure and kind young man. However, after he was infected with the Thrice Reckless Disease, he started running wildly on the road to death. Now, he was no longer worth saving.","Venerable Yellow Mountain looked up at the sky and sighed for a long while.","“It’s okay. I can adapt,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said firmly.","Doudou was bewildered. “???”","“Thanks to them, I feel that my Taoist heart is getting stronger and stronger.","No matter what kind of desperate situation I face, I can always stay calm,”","Venerable Yellow Mountain said slowly.","No matter how terrifying the situation was...","However, when Venerable Yellow Mountain thought about the army formed by the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, he immediately felt fearless.","Senior Yellow Mountain’s mental map was as follows:","Commander-in-chief:",". Skylark...","[Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Immortal Master Copper Trigram, Song","Shuhang]","[Silly Doudou][Helpless Yellow Mountain] [Soft Feather] [Dongfang Snow, Dharma King Creation, Fairy Dongfang Six]",". [Senior White]...","The rear held the fort.","He had to face such a terrifying lineup every day. He ate the Quick-acting Heart Salvation Pill until he felt nauseous. The terrifying willpower that he had honed was almost invincible.","In this world, there was no difficulty that could defeat him.","Senior Yellow Mountain picked up the immortal tea beside him and silently took a sip.","Doudou was speechless.","Stupid Yellow Mountain finally went completely crazy.","Its gaze shifted to the chat interface on the computer.","Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Spirit Butterfly Island Under Pressure (Soft Feather): “Right, why did Senior Copper Trigram specially tag @ Abba earlier?”","“I’m here,” said Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly.","“Oh, Father, are you awake?” Soft Feather asked with a guilty conscience.","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, the mysterious island has appeared again. There should be a group of members in our group who want to go to the island to explore. Why don’t we meet at the Spirit Butterfly Island?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator said.","“Mysterious island?” Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly typed.","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, weren’t you online just now?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator replied. You can take a look at the chat records first.”","A moment later, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was speechless.","Senior Spirit Butterfly,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator said.” Is it inconvenient for the Spirit Butterfly Island to entertain us?”","“No, I didn’t. There’s nothing wrong with the Spirit Butterfly Island. Northern River, you don’t have to worry.” Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly replied.","At this moment, on the treasured saber, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, who was holding his phone in an uneasy manner, suddenly frowned.” Strange. Why do I feel that Senior Spirit Butterfly’s words are a little feminine?”","Could it be that I’ve been maliciously guessing that Senior Spirit Butterfly is a fairy, and as time passed, I even felt a feminine aura when I read his chat messages?","Was this the legendary person who had been single for a long time and could even read words with delicate features?","At this time, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly spoke again, “In other words, Tyrant also knows about this?”","“Yes, Senior Spirit Butterfly.”","“Tyrant, can I perform a memory erasing technique on you?” asked Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly.","Song Shuhang: “???”","At Spirit Butterfly Island, the Celestial Thearch rubbed her temples, feeling a headache.."]},{"number":2549,"title":"Chapter 2549: Halfway Surrender?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2549: Halfway Surrender?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Even if the Heavenly Dao Ball that controls the Heavenly Dao has already collapsed... The world still seems full of malice towards me,” The Celestial Thearch self-mockingly said.","She had gone through great lengths to deceive Song Shuhang and keep him unaware of the impending arrival of the ‘mysterious island,’ while even relocating him and Soft Feather away.","To prevent any potential mishaps, she had also imposed a fifteen-day block on Song Shuhang.","However, fate had other plans as the malicious world managed to overtake","Song Shuhang. It revealed the news that the ‘mysterious island’ was about to appear at the location of Spirit Butterfly Island, through various intermediaries.","The Celestial Thearch massaged her temple in frustration.","Knowing Song Shuhangs penchant for getting involved in trouble, if he were to meddle in the ‘mysterious island’ incident, she shuddered to think of how her carefully laid plans might unravel.","But there was still about a day left before the ideal time she had calculated for landing on the island...","Unbeknownst to her, Song Shuhang had already mastered the “True Heavenly Pengs Escape Technique,” and his proficiency in escape techniques had been greatly enhanced. Now, he could travel back and forth between Wenzhou City and Spirit Butterfly Island as effortlessly as taking an elevator.","“Since Song Shuhang has already uncovered the information about the mysterious island, I have to find a way to divert his attention,” The Celestial Thearch pondered while tapping her fingers lightly on the table.","A few moments later... The Celestial Thearch’s consciousness entered her cultivation chat friend list and reached out to Song Shuhang.","[Ding Your ‘rogue friend’ Celestial Thearch has remotely sent you a drop of energy today. P.S.: Senior Song, here’s your daily energy share","After several days, Song Shuhang once again received 1 point of energy from the Celestial Thearch.","At the same time, the Celestial Thearch removed the information blockade.","Song Shuhang immediately figured it out—the person who had used Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s account in the Nine Provinces Number One Group was most likely the Celestial Thearch!","“Senior Song, it’s been a few days since we last met.” The Celestial Thearch spoke first.","A faint smile played on the corners of Song Shuhangs mouth. He felt like he had caught the Celestial Thearch’s tail: “The mysterious island, right? You’ve known about the mysterious island’s passage through Spirit Butterfly Island, haven’t you? And if I’m not mistaken, you’re planning to land on the island at a specific time. That’s why you need to wait on Spirit Butterfly Island for an opportunity, rather than going directly to the mysterious island after we leave.’","“Yes, Senior Song. You’ve guessed correctly... It seems your once-troubled brain has finally returned to normal. Congratulations,” The Celestial Thearch replied calmly.","At the same time, she felt the world’s malice once again.","“So, are you contacting me to prevent me from landing on the island?” Song Shuhang asked again.","Could it be that the Celestial Thearch was actually considering a ‘memory wipe’ for him?","“Of course not! Whether anyone wants to go to the island or not, I won’t stop them. Whether you want to go to the island or not, the mysterious island is still there.” The Celestial Thearch’s tone remained emotionless.","After some contemplation, Song Shuhang replied, “In that case, I’m definitely going to the mysterious island!”","“Then I’ll be waiting for you on Spirit Butterfly Island,” The Celestial Thearch smiled and murmured. At the same time, she retrieved a book written in the Kingese language and gently flipped through its pages.","A few moments later, she turned to the page containing information on ‘Evil and Extravagance.’","The best way to divert Song Shuhangs attention was to divert the trouble. The Celestial Thearch’s slender fingers moved across the pages of the Kingese Book, and a smile curled at her lips.","A fellow cultivator might die, but a poor one would die!","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","The calmer the Celestial Thearch appeared, the more he felt there was a conspiracy at play.","As White Dragon had suggested, the Dao of Time was the most enigmatic Dao in the universe. Offending someone who had mastery over the Dao of Time could lead to one’s demise without even comprehending how.","From their conversation, it seemed that the Celestial Thearch was resolute about the mysterious island.","So... should I consider playing it safe?","Song Shuhang contemplated.","A real man could adapt and be flexible, not rush headlong into every situation.","At this moment, Soft Feather couldn’t help but inquire, “Senior Song, what are you thinking about?”","Song Shuhang had been lost in thought for quite some time.","“I’m fine. I was engaged in a verbal spar with a big shot in the ‘Cultivation Chat’ function just now,” Song Shuhang replied.","“And then?” Soft Feather asked.","“Then, I’m currently wondering whether I should be cautious,” Song Shuhang said seriously.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair quivered in surprise. She stretched her hair and pressed it against Song Shuhangs forehead to check his temperature.","After a moment, Pavilion Master Chu asked in bewilderment, “Huh? No fever! Who was the other party? They actually made you think of caution before any contact? Could it be Hegemon White from the Netherworld?”","“It’s the Celestial Thearch,” Song Shuhang replied. At the same time, he made up his mind. He couldn’t be overly cautious, but he also couldn’t act recklessly. Therefore, he decided to be half-cautious and half-bold.","Soft Feather blinked her eyes and asked, “Half-cautious? Is that the word?’” “It’s not a wordplay; it’s a physical strategy,” Song Shuhang explained.","He decided that he would split himself in half when the time came, with one half going to the mysterious island and the other half remaining in the main world. Since he had learned the technique to split himself, Song Shuhang had become quite proficient at it.","The White Dragon was at a loss for words.","“Shuhang, be careful this time. Don’t go overboard again,” Su Clan’s Sixteen cautioned.","“Don’t worry,” Song Shuhang nodded. “1 have experience this time, so I won’t easily make mistakes. Moreover, Spirit Butterfly Island wasn’t too far from Wenzhou City. I’ll use the Heavenly Peng Escape Technique to go there and keep a lookout near Spirit Butterfly Island in case of any emergencies.”","After that, he could travel back and forth between Spirit Butterfly Island and Wenzhou City more conveniently than taking an elevator.","“Then, shall we continue farming Evil Fantasy?” Soft Feather asked.","“Of course! When the time comes, I can leave half of my body behind to cooperate with everyone. Also, we have to find an opportunity to expose the Limitless Demon Sect’s plans,” Song Shuhang said with a nod.","Having said all this, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and used it as a blade. He flung out the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique on Demon Monarch Anzhi’s body.","The undying flames burned Demon Monarch Anzhi!s body to ashes.","On the side, Young Master Hai r s incarnation was still entangled in his inner demons and was not awake.","“Oh right... Big Sister White Dragon, Senior Chu, do you have a spell like the ‘Soul Searching Spell’ that can forcefully read the information in Young Master Hai r s avatar’s mind?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","“l have a similar method, but the Young Master Hai in your hand is only an incarnation... After the connection between the avatar and the main body was severed, the avatar probably no longer has any useful information in its mind,” the White Dragon replied.."]},{"number":2550,"title":"Chapter 2550: I, Shuhang, Shall Become the Master of All","paragraphs":["Chapter 2550: I, Shuhang, Shall Become the Master of All","Laws!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even so, White Dragon finally extended her noble dragon claw and gently pressed it against the head of Young Master Hai r s incarnation.","The memory search spell activated between her claws, and the spell’s radiance ran through the incarnation of Young Master Hai r s brain. This incarnation had already severed its connection with the main body, so there was no need to worry about its brain.","Song Shuhang had previously learned the Memory Erasure Technique from Senior White, which was a magical technique capable of accessing the C, D, and E sectors in the target’s brain. However, he had not yet mastered the corresponding memory-reading technique.","A moment later, White Dragon retracted her claws and said, “As expected, there’s no more useful information.’","“Then we can only keep it as a precaution against the Demon Leek leaving traces?” Song Shuhang expressed regret and pulled the incarnation of Young Master Hai back into his Inner World.","“Although 1 didn’t uncover any information about Xie Wang and the plans of the Limitless Demon Sect, I did manage to find some information about the fragments. Do you have a notebook? I’ll transcribe this information for you,” White Dragon inquired.","As soon as White Dragon finished speaking, there was suddenly a small hand on Su Clan’s Sixteen’s shoulder. The ghost fairy produced a thick notebook from somewhere and handed it to White Dragon.","“Ah... Ghost Spirit Fairy, next time, kindly make your presence known before appearing. Otherwise, it can be quite startling when your hands suddenly emerge from Sixteen’s body,” White Dragon received the thick notebook with her small claws.","“Even if I make a sound, you might not notice me,” the ghost fairy replied with a smile.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was left speechless.","Song Shuhang was equally speechless.","The ghost fairy’s statement made perfect sense.","White Dragon opened the thick notebook and waved her little claws. In the blink of an eye, numerous pieces of information were copied into the notebook.","“What kind of spell is this?” Song Shuhang inquired. It resembled a printer.","“It’s just an ordinary Stored Spell, a small Tier 4 Spell. We used to employ it for Storing Images. Would you like to learn it?” White Dragon casually asked.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and then asked, “Sister White Dragon, can you simplify this magical technique to the point where it can be executed with just a rune?”","“Get lost! Whether you want to learn it or not is up to you,” White Dragon scolded.","“Who would be so bored as to simplify this easily learnable spell into runes and then teach it to you? With the time and energy required for that, I could develop several potent level-nine spell techniques.”","Song Shuhang raised his head and gazed at the sky. “l wish to learn it, but my aptitude for acquiring magical techniques is evident. Even with","Five-Blow-Thunderstruck, I only managed to master three thunderbolts. I fear 1 won’t be able to master such a complex magical technique in a short period. ”","Just as Song Shuhang was speaking, the artifact spirit on his right fist’s Defiant Whale Glove, Little Fairy, suddenly extended her hand and began drawing in the air.","She mimicked White Dragon’s movements and sketched out a gourd.","A moment later, she replicated a drawing in the air. It depicted Song Shuhang sacrificing himself to plunge into the Nine Virtues Phoenix Fire and forge a weapon!","However, as there was no medium, the pattern in the void quickly dissipated.","“Wait, is this a Stored Spell?” Song Shuhang was astonished.","“Sob, sob, sob er Fairy Artifact Spirit nodded and merrily slid on the back of Song Shuhangs hand.","“You rascal, you’re finished,” White Dragon handed the notebook to Song Shuhang and mockingly remarked, “You can’t even compete with your own fairy artifact spirit. Given your aptitude, it might be best to focus on honing your saber skills rather than learning magical techniques.”","“Wonderful!” Song Shuhang accepted the notebook and suddenly exclaimed.","White Dragon was confused.","What’s going on? Why is he so surprised?","Song Shuhang laughed and explained, “Sister White Dragon, I’ve just had a brilliant idea. Consider this: I possess two sets of 33-beast-type combined magical treasures and 66 life-bound magical treasures on the verge of giving birth to weapon spirits. If, in the future, I manage to condense all the weapon spirits of my life-bound magic weapons... When that day comes, each Artifact Spirit can learn 10 spells, and I’ll become the man who has mastered 660 spells! If each weapon spirit can master around 152 spells, then I could potentially acquire over 10,000 spells.","A Master of Ten Thousand Arts; just thinking about it fills me with excitement.”","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","White Dragon was left speechless.","This young man’s thought process was peculiar... It had reached an irredeemable point.","The two elder sisters believed that they had grown accustomed to Song Shuhang’s eccentric thought patterns during their time together. They never expected that they would still be caught off guard.","“D*mn... Heaven,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet couldn’t help but exclaim.","“In theory, it doesn’t seem entirely unreasonable,” the sword remarked.","The life-bound magical treasure was an extension of the cultivator himself.","If a cultivator mastered 10,000 spells through his life-bound magical treasure, he could rightfully be called the Master of All Spells.","“If he truly becomes the Master of All Laws through this method, it would undoubtedly be a scandal in the world of cultivators,” White Dragon commented.","Su Clan’s Sixteen chimed in softly, “l find it rather appealing. Times are changing, and we need to adapt.”","White Dragon was at a loss for words.","You call this adapting to the times?","“l also believe that Senior Songs creativity is exceptional. Senior Song, I’ll be waiting for the day you become the master of all laws. If necessary, you can come to our Spirit Butterfly Island to study spells,” Soft Feather giggled.","“We’ll cross that bridge when we get there... I’m still far from condensing all the artifact spirits,” Song Shuhang admitted.","The main reason was a lack of resources. In the cultivation world, acquiring knowledge typically required a corresponding investment.","Furthermore, Song Shuhang still had karmic debts to settle. These debts were incurred by the Karma Blade, which was formed from the karma of influential figures. They remained unpaid.","Sister White Dragon, what are these information fragments?” Song Shuhang opened the notebook and discovered numerous jumbled data and even some formulas.","“Based on the information from the fragments, these are the research materials Young Master Hai used to enhance the Demon God Pillar Spell after inheriting the Demon Emperor’s legacy. His aim was to make the Demon God Pillar Spell better suited to himself. In this regard, Young Master Hai was indeed a genius. He didn’t confine himself to the path of his predecessors but rather used it as a foundation to forge his own Dao,” the White Dragon explained.","Young Master Hai r s life was the embodiment of the elite protagonist archetype... Unfortunately, he was born in the wrong era.","“The Demon God Pillar Spell? And modifying it to suit oneself?” Song Shuhangs interest was piqued, and he recalled something else. “Speaking of which, I have the demonic god pillar’s magical technique in my possession.”","As the attributes of the demonic god pillar’s magical technique did not align with Song Shuhangs, he had not been able to fully explore the inheritance of the Demon Emperor’s magical technique.","Young Master Hai!s research materials had now sparked some inspiration in Song Shuhang.","“l need to thoroughly examine this information. Perhaps I can follow Young Master Hai r s research and adapt the Demon God Pillar Spell into a spell that suits me,” Song Shuhang declared.","Becoming the Master of Ten Thousand Laws, starting today!"]},{"number":2551,"title":"Chapter 2551: The Secret of the Celestial Thearch","paragraphs":["Chapter 2551: The Secret of the Celestial Thearch","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Demon God Pillar Spell of the Demon Emperor was not only impressively cool, but wherever the Demon God Pillar stood, it became a part of my kingdom!","Furthermore, the Demon God Pillar spell was akin to telekinesis, which made it a highly versatile spell. Whether it was for offense, defense, sealing, healing, or empowerment, the Demon God Pillar could handle it all. Moreover, the spell’s upper limit was quite high, suitable for use at least at the Immortal realm.","This magical technique was a perfect fit for Song Shuhang!","“As long as my true body can learn one more spell, then my Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure’ will have one less spell to master for the Master of All Spells! If I can master 66 different spells... Wait, how many have I mastered?” Song Shuhang began counting the magical techniques he knew.","Minor techniques like the charging technique, hair- growing technique, and fire-controlling technique didn’t count.","His official spells included the city-level Lightning Palm, the third lightning of the Five-Blow-Thunderstruck, and the Vajra Divine Punishment Palm Imprint, a combination of lightning and palm techniques.","Then there were the Memory Erasing Technique obtained from Senior White and the Flame Substitute Technique, which could summon Sixteen.","In addition to the Divine Weapon Mirror that had transformed into spatial coordinates and the powerful spatial secret technique, the Holy Ape World Refining.","If he had to consider it, the evil technique Saber Nurturing Technique and the Blood Spitting Secret Appraisal Technique could be counted as spells, albeit barely.","Apart from that, the Ten Basic Spells of the Black Dragon World were challenging to include due to regional restrictions.","The Heavenly Peng Escape Technique was difficult to classify. It was possibly as an escape technique.","Song Shuhang counted for a while and realized that even after adding the two evil techniques, he had only mastered nine magical techniques, which was not enough to reach double digits.","Oh my, am I really this inept?","Song Shuhang raised his head and gazed at the sky. This goal might be a","long-term one. Why not set a smaller goal first?","Soft Feather encouraged him, “Senior Song, believe in yourself. Don’t give up easily! Sixty-six spells, you can do it.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen added, “Currently, you’ve mastered at least a dozen types of magical techniques. If you calculate and master another fifty or so magical techniques, you’ll have 66 types of magical techniques. Learning over fifty spells isn’t too difficult. If there’s a chance, I can take you to the Spirit River Su Clan to learn some useful spells. Strengthening your illusion skills would be beneficial. I can help you select a few more convenient and practical illusions.”","The White Dragon chimed in with a smile. “You’ll lose one minute of your lifespan every sixty seconds. I believe you can do it.”","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Sister White Dragon, are you genuinely trying to comfort me like this?","“Also, how do you plan to study this information?” The White Dragon arched an eyebrow and pointed at the notebook in Song Shuhangs hand. She didn’t mean to underestimate Song Shuhang, but he lacked the ability and time to study magical techniques. This was a fact that couldn’t be denied.","“Sister White Dragon, don’t worry. I have a workaround,” Song Shuhang stated.","After saying that, he shared a copy of Young Master Hai r s research materials with the busy Madam Long Luo and transferred the Demon Emperor Inheritance Pillar from his Inner World. After giving it nearly a hundred shots of the Blade Nurturing Technique, he transferred it to Madam Long Luo as well.","With Madam Long Luo’s work ethic, she would find time to complete this task even amidst her busy schedule, as long as it was a matter of deceiving the Demon Emperor.","Madam Long Luo was confused.","Song Shuhang responded with a thumbs-up emoji and said, “These are research materials about the Demon God Pillar Magical Technique, which the proud Demon Emperor More Than once possessed. Additionally, this is the","Demon God Pillar, an inheritance from Demon Emperor More Than. Madam","Long Luo, please see if you can modify them and make the Demon God Pillar Spell into a spell that I can cultivate as well. If possible, once I master this technique, I’ll go flaunt it in front of the Demon Emperor. Just thinking about it is exhilarating.”","Madam Long Luo replied with multiple thumbs-up emojis. “Leave it to me. I only need to work a few nights to handle this kind of thing.”","Madam Long Luo was extraordinarily confident.","Back when the Demon Emperor invaded the Black Dragon World, it had established itself in the primary node of the dragon channel, gaining control over it.","Later, not only was the Demon Emperor defeated by Song Shuhang, but the nest node it had left in the dragon channel was also destroyed. However, a considerable amount of information about the Demon Emperor remained within the entire dragon channel.","This information was now inherited by Lady Long Luo.","With these foundations, the new inheritance pillar, and Young Master Hai’s research materials, Madam Long Luo would soon be able to create the ‘Song Clan’s Demon God Pillar Secret Technique’ for Song Shuhang.","“Thank you for your hard work, Miss Long Luo. I’ll have to trouble you to work overtime for the next few days. By the way, do you need my help?” Song Shuhang asked.","Song Shuhang felt guilty about making Madam Long Luo work so hard, especially when he couldn’t even offer her a proper salary. He wanted to compensate her in some way.","“Yes... For such a minor matter, just help me scold the Demon Emperor.” Madam Long Luo responded.","Song Shuhang chuckled and said, “That’s not a problem. I’ll take care of it right away.”","With that, Song Shuhang quickly removed ‘Demon Emperor More Than One’ from his list of cultivation chats.","After some contemplation, he activated the livestream function to share with his friends in his friend list.","[Live stream of scolding the Demon Emperor].","After starting the live broadcast, Song Shuhang sent a private message to","Demon Emperor More Than. “Senior More Than, are you there?”","“How many times do I have to say it? He’s not here. Get lost!”","“I apologize, Senior. Accepting others’ requests and completing tasks on their behalf is part of my responsibility. I still need to assist you with something, and it will be done soon. Please be patient, Senior.” Song Shuhang replied.","Not only the Demon Emperor was confused.","Tyrannical Song, this unruly individual, was trying to scheme against him again?","Song Shuhang said, “Not only Senior, you’re a big... beep... beep...” The Demon Emperor was left speechless.","Song Shuhang continued, “Not only Senior, you’re an ugly groundhog!’ “What exactly do you want?” The Demon Emperor asked impatiently.","Song Shuhang said, “Senior, please wait a moment. Let me scold you a few more times, and the mission will be completed. Please don’t be in a hurry.”","The Demon Emperor was left speechless.","Was this guy intoxicated?","Song Shuhang thought for a while and came up with a rather spiteful curse. “Senior, it’s not just you. One day, you’ll be like me, and every day of the year will be a memorial day! And on every anniversary of your death, there will be three lunches and a supper!’","The Demon Emperor was left speechless.","Was this curse the most vicious one he had ever heard?","After cursing, Song Shuhang didn’t continue.","“Is it done?” The Demon Emperor couldn’t help but ask.","Song Shuhang said, “I’ll call it a day for now. I’ve been cursing for a while, and I accidentally pricked my heart. I need a break.”","“Seriously?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Tell me,” the Demon Emperor said. “We’ve been going in circles for so long.","What exactly do you want?”","Song Shuhang replied, “l was entrusted by someone to scold you.”","“l don’t believe you.”","The Demon Emperor’s powerful spiritual power expanded and enveloped the surroundings while he remained vigilant.","“By the way, Senior, apart from being edible, can Xie Wang be used to create Demon God Pillars? I have a feeling that there might be some connection between Xie Wang, the Demon God Pillar, and the Demon Nation?” Song Shuhang suddenly inquired.","[Senior Song, he’s lying.] At that moment, the Celestial Thearch, who was watching the live broadcast, saw an opportunity to sell ‘evil information’ to Song Shuhang.","1 apologize, but if you don’t want to die, you can go ahead and die peacefully"]},{"number":2552,"title":"Chapter 2552: The Blank Period in the Nine Hells World?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2552: The Blank Period in the Nine Hells World?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Celestial Thearch had been pondering when would be the right time to reveal the information about the Xie Wang to Song Shuhang and allow him to deal with them without troubling her.","However, to her surprise, in just a short moment, the Demon Emperor had delivered a fantastic assist.","Confused, Song Shuhang replied to the Celestial Thearch,","“Senior Song, you don’t need to go through the trouble of testing Xie Wang.","You can just ask me. I know just as much as Xie Wang, if not more. And Senior Song, your attempt to test Xie Wang was quite crude. It was painful for us, the audience watching the live broadcast,” the Celestial Thearch replied.","Song Shuhang chuckled and replied, “Actually, the testing was a spur-of-the-moment idea. My main task is to scold the Demon Emperor a bit on behalf of someone else.’","The Heavenly Emperor directly retorted, “Senior Song, there’s no need to hide it. Do you really believe what you just said?”","“Well, yes, because 1 really am just fulfilling a task by scolding him a bit.”","“To be honest, he’s too cautious when it comes to you. The moment you started probing him with questions, he became more alert. The more you beat around the bush, the less relaxed he gets. So, the indirect approach of testing and probing won’t work well with him. Next time, you can try the persuasion method, offer him an irresistible benefit that he can’t refuse to get the truth out of him. I believe that his response will satisfy you,” the Celestial Thearch advised Song Shuhang, sharing her insights.","But before Song Shuhang could respond, the Celestial Thearch added, “Oh, I almost forgot. Senior Song, you might be too poor, and with your spending speed, you probably can’t offer something enticing enough to get him to talk.” Song Shuhang: .","Was this a surprise attack out of nowhere? It hit him when he least expected","His right hand twitched uncontrollably in the void, a residual effect from being repeatedly hit in the heart by his sword before. Whenever his super-alloy glass heart was hit too hard, his right hand would start to twitch, always wanting to grab something and use the Saber Nurturing Technique.","“Huh?” The Sword noticed Song Shuhangs twitching right hand and saw an opportunity. Its sword body had become quite soft due to excessive use, and it urgently needed a Saber Nurturing Technique session.","Thinking of this, the Heart Devil Scarlet Abyss Sword leaped high into the air, ready to slip into Song Shuhangs right hand to enjoy a 20-stroke massage.","Just as the sword leaped out like a fish out of water, a black figure suddenly appeared from Song Shuhangs shadow. The black figure’s head collided with Song Shuhangs right hand as if by fate, and their hand and head fit together perfectly.","The black figure spoke, “Senior Song, Snow Fairy Ji asked you to send Fairy @#%x to the Core World to assist her with dealing with Xie Wang. The process of researching Xie Wang requires the power of merit to cooperate...","Huh?”","Song Shuhangs hand that had touched the black figure’s head had unintentionally performed 20 strokes of the Saber Nurturing Technique – it had become an instinctive reaction, much like a knee-jerk response.","The sword exclaimed, ” ! ! ! ”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “???”","Song Shuhang: .","“Senior Song, what did you do to my Heart Devil?” Soft Feather asked in confusion.","“My hand... slipped,” Song Shuhang awkwardly retracted his right hand.","“l didn’t feel anything unusual,” Black-skinned Soft Feather’s face remained unchanged, “but being touched on the head by Senior Song feels surprisingly nice, just like when Daddy pats my head.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen couldn’t help but turn to look at Song Shuhangs right hand.","Song Shuhang awkwardly looked up at the sky.","Even White’s clone would be affected by his Saber Nurturing Technique, and the Heart Devil Scarlet Abyss Sword loved the effect of Saber Nurturing Technique. But Black-skinned Soft Feather remained completely unaffected by it, which was quite extraordinary.","“By the way, Song Shuhang,” the Heart Devil Scarlet Abyss Sword asked, ’twas your reaction just now due to someone hitting you in the heart?”","“Mistake. I got hit in the heart and then got caught off guard,” Song Shuhang sighed. At the same time, he telepathically summoned the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous lamia appeared while stretching lazily.","And she performed a short water snake waist dance for everyone’s entertainment.","It was absolutely stunning.","Song Shuhang applauded lightly.","Then he instructed, “Go with Black-skinned Soft Feather to the Core World to assist Immortal Fairy Bing Xue and Chu Chu in researching Xie Wang.”","“You can count on me, don’t worry about anything. And if you’re wondering why, it’s because ‘I’m here!’” the virtuous lamia said confidently.","The Core World opened, and she and Black-skinned Soft Feather entered it one after the other, disappearing.","Spirit Butterfly Island.","The Celestial Thearch lay on the table, her slender fingers piercing through thick wooden table.","“Was it an accident, or has Black-skinned Soft Feather detected his weakness?” she wondered.","If it was an accident... it would be too coincidental, right? She had just hit Song Shuhangs heart, and then she was hit in return?","If her weakness had indeed been discovered by the other party... it would be a nightmare for her.","“Shall I test it again?” the Celestial Thearch thought to herself.","“Not feeling well?” Song Shuhangs message came again.","“Senior Song. I suddenly felt a bit unwell,” the Celestial Thearch replied, still testing the waters.","Song Shuhang: “???”","This question seemed to be a part of the ‘Deadly Questions’ series on the internet?","Considering his relationship with the Heavenly Dao...","At this point, the most appropriate answer for him was naturally, “Stay hydrated.”","Song Shuhang, the unyielding straight-shooter.","Sometimes, men had to be direct to avoid any misunderstandings.","The Celestial Thearch was left speechless.","Could he afford it? She, the Celestial Thearch , was worth millions of spirit stones per second. Even if he were willing to pay, he wouldn’t have enough to engage in a conversation with her.","As a result, the Celestial Thearch declined to answer Song Shuhangs question and got straight to the point, avoiding any opportunities for Song Shuhang to lead the conversation in a different direction.","This was the correct way to converse with Song Shuhang, or rather, with most members of the ‘Nine Continents Number One Group.’ Their thought processes were often unpredictable, and if they took control of the conversation, who knew where it would end up?","“Senior Song, how much do you understand about creatures like the Xie Wang?” the Celestial Thearch asked directly.","Song Shuhang replied honestly, “l have some knowledge.”","He possessed a treasure trove of information about Xie Wang, including extensive data on Xle Wang and methods to deal with them. Plus, he had obtained research materials on turning Xie Wang into ingredients from the Demon Emperor. So, when he said he had ‘some knowledge,’ he wasn’t exaggerating.","“In that case, Senior Song, how much do you know about the ‘Demons’ and the ‘Catastrophe of the Immortals?” the Celestial Thearch continued. She had noticed Song Shuhangs desire to learn about these topics from his conversation with the Demon Emperor.","Song Shuhang replied, “I just want to know about these things.”","He was being sincere. He didn’t have much interest in these topics beyond what he needed to know to deal with Xie Wang and protect his friends.","“First, let me describe the concept of the ‘Demon World.’ Senior Song, you’re not unfamiliar with the Nine Hells World, are you?” the Celestial Thearch asked.","“l know it,” Song Shuhang replied.","“The ‘Demon World,’ or ‘Demon Sea,’ can be considered the predecessor of the Nine Hells World,” the Celestial Thearch explained. “Back in the ancient era, during the Primordial Age, the Heavenly Dao was pure and didn’t have entities like the ‘Nine Continents Dominator.’ There were no special beings similar to avatars or split bodies. The world corresponding to the current world was the ‘Demon Sea World,’ which had no Dominator and was controlled by the Heavenly Dao.”","“Entities like the ‘Nine Continents Dominator’ only came into existence during the Second Heavenly Dao Era. Since then, the ‘Demon Sea’ transformed into the ‘Nine Hells World,’ corresponding to the current world.”","“The Xie Wang is, in essence, the key to reopening the Demon World. When the Heavenly Dao collapses, and the Nine Hells World loses its Dominator, the world enters a ‘vacant’ period. During this time, seizing the opportunity theoretically allows one to revert the Nine Hells World back into the Demon World.’","“Of course, achieving this is impossible, even during my prime. So, if someone is trying to manipulate the Xie Wang to open the Demon World,’ they might only be aiming to recreate a small part of the Demon World within the vast ‘Nine Hells World.’","The Celestial Thearch slowly shared the information she knew with Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang, halfway through listening, realized something interesting. “So, the collapse of the Heavenly Dao and the vacancy of the Nine Hells World are the main focus, right?”","“In theory, yes,” the Celestial Thearch replied.","Song Shuhang laughed heartily. “Haha, that’s a relief.”","He could relax now.","The Heavenly Dao Ball had collapsed, and the Fat Ball was finished.... but he still had White, Second White!"]},{"number":2553,"title":"Chapter 2553: Building a Grand Tomb for Oneself","paragraphs":["Chapter 2553: Building a Grand Tomb for Oneself","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","According to the Celestial Thearch’s explanation and speculation, given the size of the Limitless Demon Sect, it was practically impossible for them to completely restore the entire ‘Netherworld Realm’ into a Devil Nation. Their aim seemed to be taking advantage of the ‘Netherworld Realm’ being ownerless at the moment to carve out a small ‘Devil Nation’ within it for their grand plan.’","It’s safe to say that if the ‘Devil Nation’ were to be established, the Limitless Demon Sect would undoubtedly reap substantial benefits. Perhaps their overall power could be elevated by a significant notch. However, the members of the Limitless Demon Sect could never have anticipated that there were, in fact, two rulers of the Netherworld.","Reality always had a harsh and tear-inducing side.","The fat ball had vanished, but Senior White Two remained. Moreover, lurking in the shadows were a few former rulers of the Netherworld, including Senior Scabbers Dragon and Senior Three-Eyed.","So, regardless of what the grand plan of the Limitless Demon Sect was, it had already fallen apart before it could even begin.","“Nevertheless, just to be on the safe side, it’s better to report this to Senior White Two.” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Caution was of paramount importance. A thousand-mile dike could crumble from an ant’s nest.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and opened a private chat with Senior White Two, conveying the Celestial Thearch’s research and speculations about the ‘Devil Nation,’ as well as the plans of the Limitless Demon Sect. Senior White Two took a while to respond. “Hmm? Is it morning?”","“Senior White, are you sleeping?” Song Shuhang inquired, puzzled.","“Yes... Lately, I’ve been feeling occasional bouts of sleepiness, and they’ve been much stronger than before. It’s still pitch dark outside!” Senior White Two replied.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","Wasn’t the Netherworld Realm perpetually shrouded in darkness? Moreover, Senior White had been experiencing drowsiness lately?","Could it be related to the upheaval in the Heavenly Dao?","“You’ve sent quite a bit of information over? I’ll go through the research materials I obtained from the Demon Emperor later. Also, this information about the Devil Nation is rather intriguing. I’ll keep an eye on developments in this area. If you come across any new information about the Devil Nation, please send it to me.” Senior White Two responded.","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “No problem.”","“Then that’s it... I need to catch up on my sleep. If you send me a message and I don’t respond right away, contact Little Sun T233.” Senior White Two yawned and continued.","“Senior White... Are you alright? Will the upheaval in the Heavenly Dao affect you?” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but inquire.","“Don’t worry. At least until the next Heavenly Axiom ascends, there shouldn’t be any issues on my end.” Senior White Two replied with confidence.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang felt somewhat reassured, though not entirely.","At Spirit Butterfly Island, the Celestial Thearch furrowed her brows, lightly tapping her finger on the table, leaving a small dent.","It seemed that Song Shuhang had suddenly relaxed during their conversation, which wasn’t what she had anticipated. If she didn’t lure Song Shuhang away, she would have a headache during the upcoming incident on the mysterious island.","Just as she was lost in thought, Song Shuhang sent her a new message, “If someone actually succeeds in establishing a small ‘devil country’ in the","Netherworld Realm, would it bring about any changes in the main world?”","“Certainly. If the Devil Nation were truly established, the power of the Devil Nation would extend into the present world, inevitably causing upheaval in the present world. The one who establishes the Devil Nation might gain certain benefits, but for the Tribulation Transcenders of the main world, this would be unfavorable.” replied the Celestial Thearch.","Song Shuhang inquired, “The Tribulation Transcender’s Thousand Tribulations?”","“Yes,” the Celestial Thearch leaned back in her chair and explained, “1 possess some fragmented information that records details from the ancient era. When the Netherworld Realm was known as the Devil Sea Realm, reaching the Tribulation Transcender realm would subject one to a fatal tribulation. Surviving the death tribulation would lead to a significant boost in strength and longevity. However, failure would result in the Tribulation Transcender’s consciousness being wiped out, and their body being possessed by the power of the Devil Sea, giving rise to an ancient devil that would enter the Devil Nation.”","She didn’t withhold this information from Song Shuhang, but she cautioned that the information in her possession was incomplete. Therefore, most of the details in her response were her own interpretations, and she couldn’t guarantee their accuracy.","“This is also why, in the ancient era, Tribulation Transcenders would prepare tombs for themselves in advance. These grand tombs of the ancient era were constructed in anticipation of the death tribulation. Succeeding in transcending the tribulation would greatly enhance their cultivation and lifespan. If they failed the Death Tribulation, their tomb could be used to seal their body, preventing them from becoming a demon and wreaking havoc on the world,” added the Celestial Thearch.","“You mean building a tomb for oneself while still alive?” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but think of the inheritance of the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.’","Each wielder of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had to construct a tomb for themselves during their lifetime, leaving behind their legacy. The next generation Numerics Cultivators would inherit the legacy from the tomb of the previous generation Numerics Cultivator and sign their names on the contract.","Previously, he had considered it merely a peculiar ritual of the ‘number cultivator.’","However, after listening to the Celestial Thearch’s explanation today, he somehow connected the dots between the two concepts.","Song Shuhang pulled up his friends list in the ‘cultivation chat’ and clicked on ‘Little Scabber,’ sending a message: “Senior Striped Dragon, is the inheritance of the Nine Phoenix Saber related to the tradition of the ‘great tomb of the Tribulation Transcender’?”","“l don’t know,” Senior Striped Dragon Two replied lazily. “The individual I corresponded with never mentioned anything about the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.’ I’m also clueless about how it escaped the Wielder of the Will’s position. ”","Ever since it learned that Song Shuhang had inherited the daoist name ‘Cheng","Lin’ and was also the successor of the ‘Number Cultivator,’ its attitude towards Song Shuhang, a human who didn’t conform to its aesthetic standards, had improved significantly.","“However... That individual’s seemingly meaningless actions often concealed deeper meanings. Since the inheritance of the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ involves ‘digital cultivators’ building tombs for themselves, it’s advisable to make preparations in advance. There must be important information hidden within this practice.” Senior Striped Dragon Two unusually offered some advice to Song Shuhang.","“For oneself, constructing a grand tomb?” Song Shuhang muttered while looking down at his companion—Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet hanging from his waist. If he were to construct a tomb, at least he could save on the tombstone.","“Have you finished your conversation with the esteemed senior, Senior Song?” Feather asked.","“Alright,” Song Shuhang nodded. “I’ve gathered most of the information I wanted.’","Su Clan’s Sixteen turned to him and inquired, “What’s this about building a tomb?”","“l just consulted another senior. They suggested that I should prepare to build a tomb for myself in advance, as it might yield some benefits,” Song Shuhang explained.","At this point, he suddenly thought of something and added, “Sixteen, would you like to join me in building a grand tomb?”","After all, Sixteen had numerous ‘Little Sixteen’ crystal coffins to handle.","“Building a tomb together?” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s face turned red, and she vigorously pulled the White Dragon up with her small hand.","The White Dragon was left speechless.."]},{"number":2554,"title":"Chapter 2554: Confirmation through Eye Contact, Fellow Cultivators!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2554: Confirmation through Eye Contact, Fellow Cultivators!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Shuhang, if you have some free time, consider reading some sweet and romantic love stories. Seriously, I’m begging you,” said Sister White Dragon. She was afraid she couldn’t resist Shuhangs cheesy pick-up lines much longer.","Song Shuhang looked utterly puzzled.","Pavilion Master Chu chimed in, “Asking a young lady to share a grave with you before marriage is rather uncouth. But, all things considered, these pick-up lines aren’t half bad.’","If Slow-Witted Song had dared to flirt with her like this in the past, she would have immediately built ten graves for him at the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion and buried him in them without hesitation.","Song Shuhang adjusted the mask on his face while contemplating.","“Are there any specific requirements for constructing a large tomb?” asked the sword, which had returned to Song Shuhangs side from Soft Feather’s hand.","“Honestly, I think building a tomb is as simple as digging a hole in the ground and erecting a stone tablet, Fellow Daoist. That should do the trick.”","Song Shuhang shook his head while stating, “The size of the tomb should match the scale of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber inheritance. When the time comes, I’ll first build a grand tomb for Lady Onion according to those specifications. Then, I’ll construct another one for myself using the same criteria. According to Senior Model Two’s speculation, there must be crucial information concealed within the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber inheritance tomb.’","He proceeded to share the information he had obtained from the Celestial","Thearch about Xie Wang, the Devil Nation, Tribulation Transcender’s","Thousand Calamities, and the Tribulation Transcender’s Tomb with the Nine Provinces Number Two Group. He also informed the group’s seniors about his theory regarding the number cultivator’s inheritance tomb.","However, Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was currently busy assisting Senior White with experiments and didn’t respond immediately.","“Lady Onion, do you have your own tomb?” Su Clan’s Sixteen asked as she held onto Sister White Dragon’s body.","“l have a vague recollection of it!” Song Shuhang nodded and said, “Back when I saw your tomb, Sister White Dragon, you gave me a good scolding!’","“Shuhang, don’t make empty promises and tarnish my innocence.","Furthermore, my tomb was built to escape the Heavenly Emperor’s Dao, so it’s unrelated to this matter,” Sister White Dragon replied.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair seemed to bristle slightly as she analyzed, “There are traces of vehicles leaving on the ground... The guards must have left safely.”","“In addition, there’s the aura of the Demon Sect’s cultivation technique... We might have hit the jackpot,” exclaimed the sword excitedly.","The presence of the Demon Sect’s cultivation technique indicated that a disciple of the Limitless Demon Sect had likely been in this area.","Song Shuhang nodded and secretly activated the four body-tempering techniques to protect himself. The Slow-Witted Song’s Big Bone Shards secret technique was also at the ready.","As a precaution, Song Shuhang draped a similar sheet to the Almighty Merchant’s over himself.","In the depths of Xie Wangs lair, a figure floated in the air, cloaked in a magical garment that concealed their aura. Even Song Shuhangs divine sense couldn’t detect them.","At this moment, they held a disciple of the Limitless Demon Sect in their hand, seemingly extracting information from the disciple’s mind.","Song Shuhang, wearing his draped blanket, and the cloaked figure bumped into each other unexpectedly.","Both parties shared a tacit understanding and looked at each other simultaneously.","Their eyes locked.","‘We’re on the same page!’","Song Shuhang observed that this figure only had their upper body, with the lower half missing. The incision at the waist was clean, indicating that they had deliberately severed their body into two parts to move independently.."]},{"number":2555,"title":"Chapter 2555: Are You Doing Stand-up Comedy?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2555: Are You Doing Stand-up Comedy?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The first impression between people can be quite intriguing. Sometimes, all it takes is a small similarity to make a connection. When Song Shuhang saw the way the other person divided themselves in half, he felt an odd sense of familiarity.","However, it’s hard to say what the other person thought of him. At this moment, Song Shuhang was wrapped in a blanket and wearing a mask. His appearance was highly unconventional, and no matter how you looked at it, he didn’t seem like a good guy.","The half-bodied fellow Daoist, upon seeing Song Shuhang, clearly had some reservations. His divine sense discreetly scanned Song Shuhang.","After the scan, the divine sense of the half-bodied fellow Daoist couldn’t help but shudder. He sensed that the other party also had a magical artifact that concealed and suppressed their aura, hiding their true strength and realm. However, even the exposed hair exuded a terrifying aura. In his perception, the aura of the hair on the other party’s head was like an endless sea. It was unfathomable! The power within it could split the heavens and the earth.","The aura of just a strand of hair was already so terrifying. If the other party were to remove the magical artifact suppressing their aura, it was impossible to imagine how terrifying it would be.","This was definitely a peerless senior!","He couldn’t afford to offend them.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair swayed slightly, showing her dissatisfaction that a junior had scanned her with divine sense.","Song Shuhang extended his hand to calm Pavilion Master Chu’s unruly hair, then looked at the other person, ready to speak.","“Hey? Senior, are you the Almighty Merchant?” the half-bodied fellow Daoist suddenly exclaimed.","He had recognized the sheet covering Song Shuhang.","The half-bodied fellow Daoist had once had the privilege of meeting the merchant and had a deep impression of this sheet. Moreover, Song Shuhang was wearing a mask, so his face couldn’t be seen, and even a lock of his hair was unfathomable. When all these clues were combined, it led to a rather amusing misunderstanding.","Song Shuhang chuckled and shook his head.","The half-bodied fellow Daoist froze for a moment.","Then, a spark of realization flashed across his eyes.","“Almighty Merchant Fairy?”","Song Shuhang was confused.","Seriously, can’t you recognize my voice? Despite wearing a mask, my voice is unmistakably male! Your thought process is making me uneasy.","“Fairy, hahahaha.” Pavilion Master Chu gloated and commented, “Shuhang, have your recent hormone levels gone awry?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Seeing the mysterious senior remain silent, the half-bodied fellow Daoist finally comprehended the situation. “The sheet you’re wearing... Are you the Merchant’s disciple?” he asked.","“A gift from someone else,” Song Shuhang responded. This was the counterfeit that Senior White Two had given him.","“That’s great,” the half-bodied fellow Daoist replied enviously.","His three simple words conveyed a mix of disappointment, envy, good wishes, sorrow, and more. Song Shuhang, well-versed in the language of Fairy Creation, keenly sensed the emotional shifts.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","It seemed that the fellow Daoist before him had spun a grand narrative within seconds.","Were all cultivators nowadays aspiring scriptwriters? Their imagination was truly remarkable!","The two mysterious individuals, concealed from head to toe, exchanged silent glances, unable to continue their conversation.","After a prolonged silence, Song Shuhang broke the ice. “Fellow Daoist, are you also here to deal with Xie Wang?”","“Senior, have you come for the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect?” they inquired simultaneously.","Another pause ensued.","“As a matter of fact, I’m also here for the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect,” Song Shuhang confirmed.","“Actually, I’m here for Xie Wang as well,” the other party revealed simultaneously.","Another moment of silence.","“Fellow Daoist, what’s your name?” Song Shuhang inquired, attempting to break the pattern.","“Senior, how should I address you?” the half m bodied fellow Daoist queried in Yet another pause.","It appeared a curious understanding existed between them.","“Do you both perform stand-up comedy?” Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t resist asking.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“Cou# Senior, let me go first.” The half-bodied fellow Daoist relented and introduced himself, “I’m Daoist Wang Lin, the guardian of the passage connecting the Netherworld Realm and the mortal realm.”","A nail- sized mark on his forehead substantiated his identity.","“Eh, then why are you here?” Pavilion Master Chu inquired, her curiosity piqued.","Between the Netherworld Realm and the mortal world, numerous passages of varying stability existed. Weaker demons lacking spatial abilities used these passages to infiltrate the mortal realm. Conversely, cultivators from the mortal realm occasionally ventured into the Netherworld through these channels.","However, due to the tumultuous nature of the Netherworld Realm, most passages connecting it to the mortal world remained unstable. Some were fragile, rendering them impassable, while others appeared fleetingly, only to vanish shortly thereafter. The string of demodragons assembled by Senior White had discovered one such temporary passage, intent on making a name for themselves in the mortal realm. Regrettably, their aspirations were thwarted when Senior White’s car accident inadvertently pierced through their ranks, transforming them into raw materials for Song Shuhangs demodragon pills.","Nonetheless, stable passages occasionally formed between the mortal world and the Netherworld, serving as pivotal defense points for both realms.","Daoist Wang Lin, who had divided himself in half, acted as the guardian of one such passage.","Pavilion Master Chu’s sudden query caught Daoist Wang Lin off guard.","However, this time, he managed to conceal his surprise and replied, “Actually, there are some things that can be shared.”","After organizing his thoughts, Wang Lin briefly recounted the reason for his presence.","Lately, the guardians of the Netherworld passages had observed an escalating frequency of demon attacks on the mortal world. Even with the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, the demons shouldn’t have been this agitated. The guardians launched an investigation, uncovering the restlessness of the Limitless Demon Sect’s disciples. They had repeatedly entered the Netherworld through temporary passages, and after the upheaval in the world and the outbreak of malevolence, they became even more active in malevolence-ridden areas.","The convergence of multiple clues raised alarms among the guardians of the Netherworld passages.","They secretly dispatched agents to investigate the Limitless Demon Sect, eager to ascertain their intentions and the potential impact on the Netherworld Realm and the mortal world.","Daoist Wang Lin was one of the guardians who had covertly embarked on this mission to investigate the Limitless Demon Sect.","“The frequency of demon attacks from the Netherworld on the mortal world is increasing?” Song Shuhang noted with concern.","How could such a development occur when only Senior White Two remained in the Netherworld?"]},{"number":2556,"title":"Chapter 2556: The True Vigilante","paragraphs":["Chapter 2556: The True Vigilante","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The ruler of the Netherworld Realm had absolute control over the","Netherworld Realm, and all the demons of the Netherworld Realm obeyed his commands and submitted to his will.","In the past, there were two rulers of the Netherworld Realm. With Senior White Two barely involved, the actions of the Netherworld demons mostly followed the directives of the enigmatic Fat Ball.","Now, the Fat Ball had vanished and left behind only a minor amnesiac clone who was still duking it out as Song Shuhang on Mars. Presently, the entire","Netherworld Realm had only one will, and that was the will of Senior White Two.","“Could it be that the old associates of the Fat Ball are making a final assault on the modern world? Or perhaps the Limitless Demon Sect has really stirred up trouble in the Netherworld Realm?” Song Shuhang pondered.","Meanwhile, Daoist Wang Lin’s introduction was nearing its end. “Because I still bear the heavy responsibility of guarding the passage between the","Netherworld and the main world, when I came out to investigate the Limitless Demon Sect, I used a secret technique to split myself in half. One half remains at the Netherworld passage, continuing to guard it alongside my companions. The other half quietly entered the main world to investigate the affairs of the Limitless Demon Sect.’","He provided this explanation to the prominent figure across from him to ensure there was no room for misunderstandings.","“It’s fortunate for the world to have a cultivator as dedicated as yourself.” Song Shuhang nodded approvingly. Splitting himself in half and working independently was a the actions of a kindred spirit.","“It’s my duty, and 1 dare not accept your praise,” Daoist Wang Lin responded humbly while tossing the Limitless Demon Sect disciple aside and bowing to Song Shuhang. “May I inquire how 1 should address you? Are you a good friend of Senior Almighty Merchant?”","“You’re absolutely correct. I share a close friendship with Almighty Merchant. Although he’s had a minor misunderstanding about me recently, hahaha,” Song Shuhang chuckled awkwardly.","Pavilion Master Chu was left dumbfounded.","The lamia’s reticulated skin stealthily recorded Song Shuhangs words, ready to play a short clip the next time it encountered Almighty Merchant.","Daoist Wang Lin pondered for a moment before suddenly showing a look of understanding, tinged with an unavoidably concealed sense of disappointment.","Undoubtedly, Fellow Daoist Wang Lin had concocted another elaborate script in his imagination.","This fellow Daoist must have an entire team of scriptwriters in his mind, all skilled in crafting love triangles and polyamorous plots.","“As for my Daoist name, you can call me Tyrannical Saber Song One,” Song Shuhang deliberated briefly before settling on this Daoist name.","He retained a degree of confidence in his choice. He was aware of the impact that names like Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, and Tyrannical Annihilation had on cultivators across the realms.","Moreover, with Ball Shuhang on Mars drawing attention away from him, his primary identity would use the Daoist name Tyrannical Saber Song One for now.","“So you’re Tyrannical Saber Senior. I’ve heard much about you,” Daoist Priest Wang Lin greeted with a courteous bow.","Song Shuhang was taken aback, blurting out, “Eh? Have you heard of this Daoist name for long?”","“Fool, he’s just being polite,” Pavilion Master Chu admonished Song Shuhang.","Daoist Wang Lin, on the other hand, remained speechless.","Senior Tyrannical Saber Song One came off as somewhat endearing?","“Actually, we’ve been investigating information about the Limitless Demon Sect recently. We can exchange information regarding the Limitless Demon Sect,” Song Shuhang cleared his throat and retrieved a notebook.","On the back of his clenched fist, the artifact spirit, Ghost Fairy, knelt and dozed off. Her head drooped, struggled to rise, then drooped again.","Song Shuhang extended a gentle poke to the artifact spirit.","“Yi Wuwuwu the artifact spirit reluctantly opened her eyes and grumbled in protest.","Song Shuhang opened the notebook and smiled at her.","The artifact spirit rubbed her eyes and leaped up joyfully. Much like a child, she always sought opportunities to show off her newfound spells.","She clasped her hands together and gently rubbed them to activate the Stored Spell.","The information about the Limitless Demon Sect that Song Shuhang had stored began appearing in the notebook, almost as if it were being printed.","This included details about the Devil Nation Plan, the Thousand Tribulations of the Tribulation Transcender, the Evil Fantasy Plan, and more.","Unveiling the secrets and privacy that the enemy had carefully concealed was immensely satisfying. It was several times better than spreading ordinary gossip.","Song Shuhang tore out those pages and handed them to Daoist Priest MJang Lin. “This is all the information I have on the Limitless Demon Sect. You can utilize it to put the Limitless Demon Sect on the back foot.”","Wang Lin accepted the notes, only to find that they contained highly confidential information. “Eh?”","“Hmm?”","Daoist Wang Lin remained speechless.","Tyrannical Saber Song... Tyrannical Song...","Tyrannical Song!","He conjured an image of Senior Tyrannical Song that he had seen in his mind and compared it with Tyrannical Saber Song One.","That’s right, it was Tyrannical Song.","Furthermore, this voice was unmistakably that of Senior Tyrannical Song. The speech voice had been enhanced by the Profound Sage Speech function and transformed into the voice of the Great Dao, making it difficult for him to recognize initially!","Considering this, Daoist Wang Lin instinctively shrunk back and discreetly avoided Senior Tyrannical Songs gaze.","“Haha, you’re still recognized,” sword said gleefully.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet added, “It’s inevitable. Even when wearing a mask and blanket, some of Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Songs characteristics are too distinctive.’","“Senior Tyrannical Saber, I also have some minor information here that can supplement your information. Part of it pertains to the Limitless Demon Sect’s cultivation process of Xie Wang.” Wang Lin pretended to be composed and began using a scribing technique to leave his information in Song Shuhangs notebook.","“The data on cultivating Xie Wang is precisely the information I’m seeking. Well done, Daoist Wang Lin,” Song Shuhang praised.","“To be able to gain the recognition of Senior Tyrannical Saber is my honor,” Taoist Priest Wang Lin replied breathlessly. He had not been breathing, which resulted in a slightly odd sound.","Song Shuhang took out his phone and asked, “Do you have a phone? If you do, add me as a friend. If you come across any new information or updates, feel free to contact me.’","“Yes, I do,” Daoist Priest Wang Lin took out his phone, logged into a messaging app, and added Song Shuhang as a friend.","He glanced at Senior Tyrannical Song’s information.","His nickname was The Man with Seven Daoist Names. He was nineteen years old and his address was on Baijing Street in Wenzhou City.","He reached out and marked Song Shuhang as Tyrannical Song and added him to his friend list, carefully saving it. Song Shuhang was speechless.","I saw your remarks!","Shortly after, Daoist Priest Wang Lin bade farewell to Song Shuhang and quickly left the Xie Wangs lair.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and contacted Senior White Two again.","“Senior White, are you awake?”","“You’ve woken me up again,” Senior White Two grumbled unhappily.","Song Shuhang awkwardly replied, “Haha.”","“Haha? What’s so funny? What do you want? Summarize it in thirty words,” Senior White Two demanded drowsily.","Song Shuhang said, “Senior White, the demons of the Netherworld Realm are attacking the passage between the main world and the Netherworld Realm.”","Senior White Two replied, “Hmm?”","A moment later.","“Oh right, the Fat Ball is gone. These things need a ruler to manage,” Senior White Two sighed.","After a long pause.","“Forget it, I’m too sleepy. Help me take care of it,” Senior White Two said, “It just so happens that your Limitless Demon Sect wants to cause trouble in the Netherworld Realm. I’ll give you some control over the Netherworld. You can play with them.”","Song Shuhang was confused.","What? What did Senior White Two just say?","He wanted to give me a portion of the authority of the Netherworld Realm and let me manage it?","How was this possible?","“Come to the Netherworld when you’re free,” Senior White Two lazily said.."]},{"number":2557,"title":"Chapter 2557: The Pride of Humanity – Senior Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2557: The Pride of Humanity – Senior Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Whenever you’re ready, I can wrap up today’s Xie Wang hunting on my end. Once I’ve got the two junior cultivators settled, I’ll head over to the Black Lotus World to find you,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Two junior cultivators? Are you bringing those youngsters along?” Senior White Two casually inquired. He knew that Song Shuhang had a good relationship with some talented junior cultivators.","Song Shuhang explained, “It’s not the young monks and the others. It’s two junior cultivators at the Fourth Stage.”","Senior White Two was left speechless.","In theory, there was nothing wrong with it. However, when he heard Song Shuhang refer to Fourth Stage cultivators as junior cultivators, it felt quite incongruous. This sense of discord would take some time to fade away.","“When the time comes, remember to bring my stone tablet along. I’ll need it,” Senior White Two added as a reminder.","“Sure, Senior White. We’ll catch up later,” Song Shuhang replied.","Senior White Two cautioned, “Hurry up. If I fall asleep, you can’t wake me up.”","“I’ll be there soon,” Song Shuhang assured him.","After ending the call with Senior White, his consciousness exited the cultivation chat function.","“Sixteen, Soft Feather, let’s ?????? up today’s activities for now. Next, we’re heading to the Netherworld Realm,” Song Shuhang quickly suggested. “Why stop? 1 can handle a few more. I’m not tired, Senior Song,” Soft Feather expressed some reluctance. She hadn’t had her fill of fun yet. Each Xie Wang was unique, and farming them was like opening a treasure chest. Each one could bring surprises, and she wanted to continue for a while longer.","“We have something important to do in the Netherworld Realm,” Song","Shuhang replied. At the same time, he secretly messaged Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen, saying, “When we go to the Netherworld Realm later, I plan to search for the treasure left by the Fat Ball.” It may have collapsed, but its treasure should still be intact!","Senior White Two was prepared to grant him some authority over the Netherworld’s ruler, so he couldn’t afford to waste time.","At that point, he would try to deceive Ball Shuhang on Mars and obtain the location of the treasure from it. With partial authority over the Netherworld’s ruler, he could retrieve the treasure left by the Fat Ball!","If successful, he would be rich!","Song Shuhang was daydreaming.","Life was already challenging enough... so he had to imagine the best-case scenario. What if it actually came true?","“Aren’t we going to deal with the Xie Wangs?” Su Clan’s Sixteen asked.","“Of course, we’ll deal with them, but I have a better way to handle them. Don’t worry; the Limitless Demon Sect won’t cause any trouble this time,” Song Shuhang confidently declared. With just the three of them, even after three days and nights of farming, they couldn’t harvest too many Xie Wangs.","Once they visited the Netherworld Realm and obtained a portion of Senior White Two’s authority as the ruler of the Netherworld, they might be able to mobilize some of the Netherworld’s demons!","This would allow them to send a group of powerful Netherworld demons to discreetly deal with the Xie Wangs.","Fighting fire with fire!","“I’ll go, I’ll go! I’ll go with Senior Song to the Netherworld Realm!” Soft Feather eagerly volunteered. While farming Xie Wangs was fun, compared to a quest like ‘exploring the treasures of the ruler of the Netherworld,’ the excitement paled!","“I’ll go with you wherever you go,” Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded and said softly.","Hearing this, Song Shuhangs heart warmed.","The White Dragon gave Song Shuhang a reproachful look. “Take notes, this is how you initiate a romantic conversation! ”","Su Clan’s Sixteen was at a loss for words.","“Senior Song, I’m the same. I’ll go with you wherever you go,” Soft Feather also pledged her support.","On the sidelines, Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing were filled with ?admiration.","Senior Tyrannical Song was planning to enter the Netherworld Realm and fight for the living beings of the main world!","In Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qings eyes, Senior Tyrannical Song had abandoned the Xie Wang hunt due to information provided by Daoist Wang Lin, the guardian of the passage between the Netherworld and the main world. The demons of the Netherworld Realm were currently attacking the passageway to the main world. If they succeeded, the situation in the main world would worsen.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, are you intending to forcefully enter the","Netherworld Realm to investigate the truth behind the demon uprising?” Eon Sea Scholar inquired to confirm his suspicion.","“Yes, that’s part of the plan,” Song Shuhang acknowledged.","Eon Sea Scholar clenched his fists. His conjecture had been correct.","“But, Senior Tyrannical Song, if you venture into the Netherworld Realm alone, won’t it be dangerous?” Daoist Nun Miao Qing voiced her concern.","“Don’t worry,” Song Shuhang reassured them with a smile. “It’s not my first time in the Netherworld Realm. Don’t forget that I once revealed my divinity there.’","“Senior Tyrannical Song, do you need to use the passage between the Netherworld and the main world? If you require it, I’ll promptly register it for you,” Miao Qing reminded.","With Senior Tyrannical Songs power, he could naturally tear through space and reach the Netherworld. However, it would consume unnecessary spiritual energy.","“No need. I have my own passage to the Netherworld Realm,” Song Shuhang waved off the offer. Then, he indicated the unconscious disciple of the","Limitless Demon Sect who had undergone soul-searching by Daoist Wang Lin. “Take him with you. You might extract some valuable information from him.” “We’ll take care of it,” Eon Sea Scholar pledged.","“I’ll get in touch with you again after my return from the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Daoist Nun Miao Qing nodded. “We’ll await Senior Tyrannical Songs contact.”","“Farewell then,” Song Shuhang bid goodbye to the scholar and the Daoist nun.","Before embarking on his journey to the Netherworld Realm, he retrieved his cellphone and sent a message to Mama Song, informing her that he would be taking Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather with him for a while, and that he might not be able to return home for a few days.","Mama Song responded quickly, confirming receipt of the message. At the end of her reply, she reminded Song Shuhang to take precautions against unexpected life events.."]},{"number":2558,"title":"Chapter 2558: Senior White Two, I Have News","paragraphs":["Chapter 2558: Senior White Two, I Have News","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was speechless.","In fact, Mama Songs concerns were entirely unnecessary. Although Song Shuhang had not yet reached the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm, his body had been steadily strengthening, and he was just a step away from achieving sterility.","Furthermore, even if they weren’t completely sterile, it had become exceedingly difficult for them to conceive.","In fact, not only Song Shuhang but even an ordinary Seventh Stage Venerable would struggle to conceive the next generation. Various methods were required to enhance the chances of pregnancy, and it could take many years of effort to achieve it.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and offered a reassuring smile as he replied, “Mom, it’s still too early for the little one in my belly to make an appearance. I’ve only recently become pregnant, and it’ll take at least ten months for her to be born. So, don’t worry. There’s no need to be concerned about premature delivery.”","Of course, he understood the underlying message in his mother’s words, but he couldn’t resist the temptation to playfully respond this way.","A moment of mischievous delight was rather addictive.","“Let’s go, Sixteen, Soft Feather,” Song Shuhang said without waiting for Mama Songs response. He pocketed his phone and reached for the entrance to his Inner World.","Behind him, Su Clan’s Sixteen firmly grasped the White Dragon and followed him into the Inner World. It went without saying that cultivators had exceptional eyesight, and she happened to catch a glimpse of Mama Songs reply.","The White Dragon rolled her eyes and began seriously contemplating Dumb Chu’s suggestion. Should she allow Song Shuhang to use the sinister technique, “Niutated Hair Growing Technique,” on her and transform her body into a furry ball? Otherwise, if she continued to be pulled around by Sixteen like this, she feared she might gain weight and lose her figure.","Soft Feather lightly leaped, and the spirit butterflies surrounding her fluttered to form a protective barrier as she entered the Inner World.","“My two young friends, I’ll need you to compile a list of all the malevolent locations in Wenzhou City and the neighboring cities for me over the next few days. When I return, 1 intend to eliminate all evil in one fell swoop to prevent future problems,” Song Shuhang instructed. He placed his hands behind his back and stepped into the Inner World, disappearing from view.","Eon Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing respectfully watched as Senior Tyrannical Song departed.","“l can’t wait to join Senior Tyrannical Song in storming into the Netherworld Realm and eradicating the demons that threaten the main world’s passage, safeguarding all living beings!” Eon Sea Scholar clenched his fists tightly while lamenting his lack of strength.","“In the days when Senior Tyrannical Song is absent, we must take care of the Song Family’s ancestor and the Zhao Family’s fairy ancestor. We cannot allow Xie Wang to affect their quality of life,” Miao Qing added.","When Senior Tyrannical Song headed to the front lines for the sake of all living beings, they couldn’t directly assist him, nor could they fight alongside him in the Netherworld. However, they could at least provide support from behind, ensuring he had nothing to worry about.","The scholar and the Daoist nun respectfully bowed in the direction where Song Shuhang had disappeared and then vanished along with the unconscious disciple of the Limitless Demon Sect.","In the Inner World, Song Shuhang handed over all the malevolent creatures he had vanquished to Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu. He also provided them with the information he had recently acquired from Daoist Wang Lin regarding the Limitless Demon Sect’s cultivation of malevolent creatures.","All this information would help Immortal Fairy Bie Xue gain a deeper understanding of Evil Wang, allowing her to expedite its transformation into an ingredient to be served on the cultivators’ dining tables worldwide.","Song Shuhang and Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s goal was to elevate the untamed Xie Wang into a “first-class protected creature” within the cultivation world, opening up a new era of scientific breeding. An assembly line would be used to breed Xie Wang, and beings across the universe would fall in love with it.","To support Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s research, Song Shuhang instructed his “core assistant” to cooperate fully. The Inner World’s spirit beasts and magical creatures, the spirit plants and immortal dishes, the living spring’s rejuvenating water, and some edible treasures obtained from King Kun were all at Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s disposal for her experiments.","After giving his instructions to Immortal Fairy Bie Xue, Song Shuhang opened the portal to the Black Lotus World and stepped inside with Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather.","In the world of the Black Lotus, as soon as Song Shuhang arrived, an invisible","hamster pounced on his face and playfully poked his chin several times.","Ding, ding, ding—sparks flew.","“Cut it out, Hamster,” Song Shuhang casually grabbed the hamster in his hand. “Lead us to Senior White. We can’t afford to be late, or he might enter a deep slumber.”","Senior White Two might sleep for a thousand years or even longer.","If he truly entered such a deep slumber, everything would become cold over the course of a millennium.","“Your face has become stiff,” the hamster remarked.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang replied, puzzled. “Wuuuu~” The ghost fairy artifact spirit exclaimed happily upon seeing the hamster, who was about the same size as her.","“This is the weapon spirit of my Defiant Whale Glove. In the future, you two can play together...” Song Shuhang began proudly introducing.","The Fairy Artifact Spirit’s eyes gleamed as she stared at the hamster’s toothpick sword.","“Stop fooling around,” the hamster chided. “Why would a glove spirit learn sword techniques? And give back the Myriad World Piercing Shuttle my master borrowed from you.”","Song Shuhang nodded and retrieved the flying shuttle, returning it to the hamster. “By the way, it feels strange to return items 1 borrowed from seniors. ”","The hamster was speechless.","“Let’s go. I’ve also brought Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet with me,” Song Shuhang said, revealing Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s dao.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in, “Perfect timing. This time, I want my master to change the inscription on my tombstone to ‘Tyrannical Songs tomb.’ It will enhance my reputation even further.”","The hamster concurred with a creaking noise.","“Tyrannical Songs tomb” sounded much more intriguing than simply “Song","Shuhangs tomb.” After all, it was accustomed to referring to Song Shuhang as “Tyrannical Song,” and when using his actual name, “Song Shuhang,” it felt somewhat uncomfortable.","“All right, I’ll ask Senior White to make that change later,” Song Shuhang happily agreed.","The hamster was perplexed.","Wasn’t Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Songs mind still recovering from its downed state? Why was he so delighted about altering his tombstone’s name?","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song needs to have a tomb ready for himself,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet replied, addressing the hamster’s confusion. “Why does he need to prepare a tomb for himself? Is he tired of living? Does he want to die?” the hamster asked.","“Haha, when the time comes, would you like to have a small tomb next to my grand tomb?” Song Shuhang jestingly inquired.","“Get lost!” the hamster retorted angrily.","As they conversed, they reached the place where Senior White Two was resting.","At this moment, Senior White Two lay within a “sealing pillar” and floated up and dovvn.","Song Shuhang was baffled.","Wasn’t this sealing pillar originally used to contain the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball? Why was Senior White Two inside it?","“Shuhang, you’re here,” Senior White Two greeted, her eyes half-lidded.","“What’s your current status?”","Senior White Two’s body rotated, and she focused her gaze on Song Shuhang, appearing much more alert.","“What’s wrong?” Song Shuhang inquired, perplexed.","“Have you been pondering how two distinct individuals can achieve immortality and ascend to the Heavenly Dao?” Senior White Two inquired, relief evident in her voice. This was the task she had assigned Song Shuhang previously.","This was the enigmatic message left behind by Bai Tendo. “Different individuals achieving immortality together” was the key to resolving the situation. Senior White Two had given Song Shuhang some homework, asking him to contemplate this issue when he had the opportunity.","“Haha, well...” Song Shuhang began awkwardly. “Actually, Senior White, I’ve figured it out.”","Senior White Two was confused.."]},{"number":2559,"title":"Chapter 2559: The Final Attempt, No Regrets","paragraphs":["Chapter 2559: The Final Attempt, No Regrets","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The nearby hamster was left agape, asking, “Tyrannical Song, what do you mean by ‘got it?”","“l mean it literally,” Song Shuhang chuckled while pointing at his stomach.","The hamster fell into deep contemplation.","Except for Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen, everyone else remained silent.","They struggled to put their complex feelings into words.","After a while...","“So, we’ve been misunderstanding you all this time?” The hamster analyzed calmly. “Are you actually Fairy Shuhang?”","“Don’t joke around. Although I got pregnant by accident, my gender hasn’t changed,” Song Shuhang replied.","The gorilla general’s eyes suddenly brightened as he exclaimed, “I understand. Tyrannical Song, you’re the type of creature that can reproduce asexually!” “l am a pure human,” Song Shuhang stated.","Little Sun T233’s voice chimed in, “So, how did you ‘have it,’ Tyrannical Song?”","“It’s a long and complicated story. The main culprit was the fat ball... To be precise, it’s related to the Heavenly Dao Ball,” Song Shuhang calmly analyzed the situation.","“So it’s the child of the fat ball?” the beautiful Seven-Colored Tree Monster, Tree Tree, said in surprise.","“Don’t interrupt me. Let me finish my story,” Song Shuhang waved his hand and began to explain from the beginning to the end.","A few months ago, when he came into contact with the golden-haired mechanical girl and inadvertently caused her to enter a state of resurrection, when he integrated the core reactor into his small dantian, and when he encountered King Kun, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, and the Heavenly Dao Ball in the scholarly faction this year...","In the end, under the effect of his Impregnating Gaze and Embryonic Gaze, the golden-haired mechanical girl became an embryonic seed. Due to some inexplicable principles, this embryonic seed was accepted by Song Shuhangs ‘core reactor’ dantian and started growing inside his body.","After summarizing the entire tale, Song Shuhang took a sip of water to moisten his throat. This was a miracle brought about by a series of coincidences. However, overall, there was still a distinction between this and traditional pregnancy. After all, he had an additional embryo in his small dantian. To classify it accurately, he should be considered a ‘surrogate’ individual.","Senior White Two was speechless.","The little hamster was speechless.","Little Sun T233 was speechless.","“So,” the beautiful Seven-Colored Tree Monster said, “you came to see my Lord this time because you want my Lord to address this ’embryo’ issue?”","“Exactly, Tree Tree, you’ve hit the nail on the head!” Song Shuhang laughed.","But in reality, when he had entered the Netherworld Realm, his mind had been preoccupied with the idea of carrying out some operations after gaining a portion of the Netherworld Realm ruler’s authority from Senior White Two, and he had completely forgotten about his pregnancy.","If it weren’t for Tree Tree, he might have forgotten to seek help from the all-knowing Senior White Two.","“Apologies, Shuhang,” Senior White Two said helplessly. “Although I can do almost everything, I can’t give birth. Therefore, I don’t have a solution to your ‘having children’ problem. If it really doesn’t work out, you can nurture this child until it matures, then come to me for a caesarean section. I’ll assist in the delivery.”","Furthermore, Senior White Two had contemplated even deeper.","In the secret message left by Senior White through various means, he had expressed that the key to breaking the situation was ‘different individuals vindicating their Dao and becoming immortal.’","In that case, did Song Shuhangs current state fit the requirements?","Song Shuhangs main body was a complete individual, and the golden-haired girl gestating in his stomach was also an independent individual. In this scenario, did it align with the possibility of two different individuals striving for immortality?","Of course, there was a flaw in this hypothesis, namely the strength of the embryo. Judging from the current sensory feedback, the embryo’s cultivation realm was not high, roughly equivalent to that of a human cultivator at the First Stage.","If the embryo’s strength couldn’t be rapidly improved, even if they both entered the stage of ‘different individuals vindicating their Dao’ simultaneously, she wouldn’t be able to withstand the power of immortality and would explode.","“Therefore, we need to study this further,” Senior White Two declared.","Thorough research was required. If this method proved effective, after Song Shuhang gave birth to the girl embryo inside him, they could explore a similar approach for him to become pregnant with a different individual possessing more potential to compete for immortality.","At this point, Song Shuhang inquired, “Senior White, can’t you extract her from my body first and place the core reactor containing her in an incubator for artificial cultivation?”","“I lack the relevant knowledge. The most I can do is perform a caesarean section for you,” Senior White Two replied.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“Additionally, Shuhang, are you preparing for your sixth heavenly tribulation and divinity unveiling?” Senior White Two inquired.","If Song Shuhang, who was pregnant, underwent his sixth tribulation and divinity unveiling, it could serve as an early test of the proposition of ‘different individuals vindicating the Dao at the same time.’","Would Song Shuhangs tribulation while pregnant be considered as one person or two?","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “In terms of realm, I’ve long been in a state where I can transcend the tribulation at any time... However, due to the sudden collapse of the Heavenly Dao, my last tribulation wasn’t entirely successful. So, for the sixth tribulation, 1 want to prepare thoroughly and pass it in one go. Aside from that, I’ve been pondering the issue of sterilizing","Eighth Stage Profound Sages.”","While it was true that finding an Immortal related to the Great Dao of ‘life’ could potentially solve the problem of Eighth Stage Profound Sage sterilization, Song Shuhang needed to consider this matter before reaching the Eighth Stage, just in case.","Senior White Two asked, “How do you plan to address this issue?”","“This sort of thing can’t be rushed, especially in the realm of emotions. Feelings need time to develop, and it can’t be rushed. However, even if I can’t solve this problem before reaching the Eighth Stage, it’s not a big issue. At that time, I can try to turn the problem of ‘Eighth Stage Profound Sage sterilization’ into my obsession, then further nurture it into my inner demon.” After saying this, Song Shuhang accidentally swallowed his saliva. “If it’s successful, when I transcend the Eighth Stage Realm’s heavenly tribulation, I’ll extract the inner demon and host a celebration for everyone.”","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","The White Dragon was left speechless.","Senior White Two floated up and down within the sealing pillar and said, “You can handle the sterilization issue on your own. However, I can offer a suggestion regarding your final attempt to attain the Eighth Stage Profound","Sage Realm.”","“Please, Senior White, go ahead,” Song Shuhang said while sitting upright.","“Your first five Prominent Divine Tribulations were all quite unique. So, for the last one, we should strive to make it perfect and leave no regrets,” Senior White Two proposed. “That’s why we can manipulate things behind the scenes... Utilize the Little Demon Sect in the main world.’ “Limitless Demon Sect?” Song Shuhang inquired.."]},{"number":2560,"title":"Chapter 2560: How Can One See a Rainbow Without Going Through Wind and Rain","paragraphs":["Chapter 2560: How Can One See a Rainbow Without Going Through Wind and Rain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Yes, it’s the Devil Sect you reported to me before,” Senior White Two replied.","Song Shuhangs previous five tribulations had all been innovative.","From the first group tribulation to the second divine appearance in the Netherworld, followed by the third Black Dragon world’s transcending hyperspace lecture, the fourth journey back to the ‘past’ with Sixteen, and finally, the fifth Heavenly Dao Eradication lecture.","No matter the number of participants, location, dimension, time, or even the Heavenly Dao itself, none could stop Song Shuhang from delivering his lecture.","Therefore, the sixth lecture must not disappoint the cultivators of the myriad worlds.","“I’ve gathered information about the Demon Sea World... By my estimates, it’s a very special world, even more chaotic than the Netherworld Realm, without any semblance of order. It stands in opposition to the present world, with laws vastly different from ours. If we could carve out a portion of the Demon Sea World within the Netherworld Realm, we might even be able to summon the aura of the Primordial Era. So, how about it? Do you want to take on the challenge? To undergo your final tribulation in the Demon Sea World?” Senior White Two suggested.","“Completely opposite to the present world? Will the rules for the tribulation and divine proclamation be the same?” Song Shuhang pondered.","Senior White Two floated slightly upward as he spoke, “I’ve simulated the structure of the Demon Sea World. The most fundamental rules are certainly the same. In the ancient times, both the Demon Sea World and the present world were under the dominion of the Heavenly Dao alone, without a Netherworld ruler. The most basic rules that form the world would definitely be the same. It’s in the specifics where there would be opposite characteristics. For instance... after the divine proclamation, you might not receive the power of virtue, but rather some other force that stimulates the inner demons in","your heart, making the tribulation undergoer even more violent.”","“Will the strength of the inner demon become uncontrollable?” Song Shuhang asked.","He wanted to cultivate his inner demon mainly to use it as an ingredient and to experience the joy of nurturing it... However, he did not want the inner demon’s strength to exceed his control and lead to self-destruction.","After all, he could not match Skylark and Thrice Reckless in their daring. At the critical moment of tempting fate, he would still hold back, lacking the courage to go all out in one fell swoop, as well as Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s intuition and vast experience in flirting with the brink of death.","“No cultivator can assure they will fully control their inner demons. Even those with the strongest Dao-heart will have moments of weakness. However, in your current state, you need not worry about losing control when confronting your inner demons,” Senior White Two glanced at Song Shuhang. Song Shuhang quickly understood, “The power of virtue?”","“Yes,” Senior White Two nodded. Song Shuhangs power of virtue came from accumulating five divine proclamations and Profound Sage Lectures.","After harvesting ‘virtue’ from the universe’s practitioners five consecutive times, Song Shuhangs power of virtue was unparalleled.","With such an immense amount of power of virtue, Song Shuhang was essentially unbeatable when facing his inner demons.","“Moreover, it’s about time you went through a ‘Heart Demon Tribulation’ to gain some experience,” Senior White Two added.","Song Shuhang reviewed everything Senior White Two had said, concluding, “So, we first use the Limitless Demon Sect to carve out a small ‘demon nation’ in a specific part of the Netherworld Realm. Then, we take over this demon nation, leveraging its unique properties to allow me to transcend the tribulation within and officially advance to the Eighth Stage Realm.”","Initially, Song Shuhang merely intended to use Senior White Two’s authority as the ruler of the Netherworld Realm to give the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect, who aimed to exploit the Netherworld Realm’s lack of a master and restore a ‘demon nation’ there, a taste of despair. “You thought the Netherworld Realm had no ruler? In reality, the Netherworld Realm still has me, Senior Big White Two, overseeing it. Eat sh*t, Limitless Demon Sect!”","He hadn’t anticipated that Senior White Two’s scheme to be even deeper. The ruler of the Netherworld truly lived up to his title. According to Senior White Two’s plan, he aimed to further exploit the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect and use the ruler’s authority to covertly lead them to pay a significant price to establish a ‘Demon Nation’ in the Netherworld Realm.","Once the ‘Demon Nation’ was successfully established, just as the disciples of the Limitless Demon","Sect reached the peak of their demonic life, he would use the ruler’s authority to forcibly take over the ‘Demon Nation,’ casting the Limitless Demon Sect from the pinnacle of power down to the mortal realm... and even into the abyss.","“Exactly, that’s the strategy,” Senior White Two confirmed.","“Senior Song, you’re practically a devil,” Soft Feather silently mourned for the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect for 0.0001 seconds before switching to a cheerful mode.","Song Shuhang remained speechless.","“However, my lord, if the Limitless Demon Sect truly establishes a Demon Nation, won’t it affect the stability of our Netherworld Realm?” Little Sun T233 inquired.","According to Senior White Two’s description, the Demon Nation seemed to be a primitive world not under the Netherworld ruler’s control.","“If the Netherworld had no master and they managed to establish a Demon Nation, it might cause headaches for the next ruler. But now, the Netherworld Realm still has me, the strongest squatter,” Senior White Two said with a smile.","With a master in the Netherworld Realm, it was entirely possible to first select a region, cultivate it thoroughly, and lay all the groundwork. Then, set the location for the ‘Demon Sea World’ that the Limitless Demon Sect intended to open and restore. As the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, he could do whatever he pleased.","“So, in the early stages... Not only do we not need to thwart the grand plans of the Limitless Demon Sect, but we can also provide them with some conveniences in the Netherworld Realm at the right time, enabling them to successfully establish a portion of the Demon Sea World in a specific location within the Netherworld Realm?” Song Shuhang suggested.","“No, Senior Song. We cannot afford to provide any advantages to the Limitless Demon Sect, nor can we cease our efforts to undermine their grand plans in the main world,” Soft Feather suddenly interjected.","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded, “l share Soft Feather’s sentiment. Our efforts to undermine the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plans must continue. We need to ensure their plan faces constant setbacks and challenges. After enduring numerous hardships, they will finally succeed in establishing a Demon Nation in the Netherworld Realm. This way, the Limitless Demon Sect’s members won’t harbor any suspicions.”","Disciples of the Demon Sect are inherently skeptical. If their grand plan proceeded too smoothly, they would become wary.","Thus, the setbacks and challenges they faced could not be halted—as long as they could ensure the successful establishment of the Demon Nation in the end.","There’s no sense of accomplishment in obtaining something too easily.","Only after enduring many trials and finally acquiring something does one truly feel a sense of fulfillment.","How could one witness a rainbow without first enduring the storm? Even though this rainbow was man-made, it was still a rainbow.."]},{"number":2561,"title":"Chapter 2561: A Millennium of Waiting, Just for Today","paragraphs":["Chapter 2561: A Millennium of Waiting, Just for Today","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Within the Limitless Demon Sect, there lay a secret realm known as the Demon Emperor Palace.","This “Demon Emperor Palace” was the true stronghold of the Limitless Demon Sect. It didn’t exist directly in the mortal realm but resided within a mystical treasure realm passed down since ancient times and covered an area similar to a medium-sized city.","In the mortal realm, various branches of the Limitless Demon Sect were mere offshoots or even smaller divisions. Only this “Demon Emperor Palace” stood as the genuine core of the Limitless Demon Sect, safeguarding all its legacies. Hidden deeply, it had never officially emerged before the public eye.","At this moment, within the Kali Demon Hall of the palace, a towering figure, reaching a hundred meters, materialized within the hall, pacing slowly.","Around him, tangible demonic flames burned, echoing with the cries of despair. Occasionally, flames fell from the towering figure, absorbed by the floor of the Kali Demon Hall and vanishing without a trace.","After several rounds of pacing, the towering giant settled onto the throne of the hall, gradually shrinking to a sturdy three-meter height.","Moments later, one after another, projections began to appear beneath the hall.","These projections, like the giant, were mere illusions. Their true bodies were scattered across the world or within various branches of the Limitless Demon Sect.","Appearing in the Demon Emperor Palace through a projection spell, akin to a remote video conference.","The first batch to appear were the true rulers of the current generation of the Limitless Demon Sect, their strength at least reaching the sixth stage or even having seventh-stage venerables presiding over them.","However, most of these current rulers of the Limitless Demon Sect were unaware of the true existence and location of the Demon Emperor Palace. They could only access it through this projection spell.","Once these rulers appeared and settled into their seats, the second batch of projections began to manifest.","These were all powerhouses of the fifth stage Spiritual Emperor realm and above, the backbone of this generation of the Limitless Demon Sect.","These fifth stage Spiritual Emperors took their seats based on the number of spirit patterns on their Gold Cores. The more spirit patterns, the closer they were seated to the first batch of projections.","Young Master Hai and Zheng Nengs figures occupied the foremost area among the fifth stage Spiritual Emperor seats.","Young Master Hai, with eight dragon patterns, possessed talents that could overshadow all heroes of the Demon Sect. Although not a genius with nine dragon patterns, in the Demon Sect’s tradition, eight dragon patterns also promised a bright future—more than representing the Demon Emperor, nine dragon patterns had the potential for immortality, and eight dragon patterns shared the same potential!","Beside Young Master Hai, Zheng Neng had condensed a Golden Core with seven dragon patterns, indicating his potential to advance to the eighth stage Profound Sage Realm in the future, perhaps even breaking through to the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","With eight and seven dragon patterns, Young Master Hai and Zheng Neng held some sway within the Limitless Demon Sect.","With this influence, they could secure greater benefits in the forthcoming grand plan of the Limitless Demon Sect and soar to new heights.","Young Master Hai smiled confidently and opened his folding fan—he had been awaiting this day for a long time!","Rumble~","The Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect on the throne waved his hand gently, causing the entire Demon Emperor Palace to emit a thunderous sound as it began to close, withdrawing into the void and severing the connection with the mortal realm.","“In that case, let’s commence the meeting of the Limitless Demon Sect.” The Sect Master’s voice was husky and magnetic, perfectly suited for singing love songs.","Below, all members of the Limitless Demon Sect sat upright.","Next came the progress report of the plan, its arrangements, and the division of benefits upon its success!","None present would be modest in this regard—each sought to secure as much resources as possible in this grand plan to propel their futures further!","“First, let’s report on the progress of our plan in the mortal realm and the","Netherworld Realm,” the Sect Master said, tapping the armrest of his throne.","The following moment, a Venerable of the Demon Sect nodded and said, “Despite encountering some obstacles, our plan in the mortal realm has progressed successfully. The effects are even better than anticipated. The freelance martial artists recruited some time ago have proven instrumental.","We have successfully mutated the majority of the Evil Phantoms and stationed them at various coordinates in the world. In another three days, the quantity and quality of Xie Wang will meet our requirements. By then, we can sacrifice all the Evil Phantoms at once and connect them into a formation.’","They only needed to guide the Xie Wang to mutate and reproduce. After that, whether the Xie Wang lived or died was unimportant. Even if they died, the mutated nest of Xie Wang would still exist and remain a part of the grand plan.","At that time, the array would activate, penetrating directly into the Netherworld Realm and sending the Demon God Pillars they had been repairing for nearly a thousand years into the Netherworld. With the synchronization plan in the Netherworld Realm, they could establish the prototype of a Devil Nation in the Netherworld Realm.","Before the new ruler of the Netherworld Realm appeared, they had to quickly restore the Netherworld Realm within the Devil Nation to the legendary Devil Sea Realm.","With that, the first step of the plan was considered successful.","Young Master Hai gently waved his fan—a small portion of these Demon God Pillars were said to be treasures passed down by a certain Demon Emperor. There was also a large portion of Eighth Stage Profound Sages who had appeared in the Limitless Demon Sect over the years. They were replicas of the Demon God Pillars of the Demon Emperor.","In addition, Young Master Hai had recently handed over ten Demon God Pillars. These were the gains he had obtained from the inheritance of the Demon Emperor.","After handing over these ten demon god pillars, his authority in the Limitless Demon Sect had increased.","“The disciples we sent into the Netherworld Realm have also progressed smoothly,” said another Venerable of the Demon Sect. They’ve successfully found more than twenty coordinates in the Netherworld Realm that are suitable for us to establish a Devil Nation... In addition, we’ve also successfully guided some demons of the Netherworld to attack the main world, creating some trouble for the main world, allowing our grand plan to progress more smoothly.”","They aimed to divert the attention of forces in the mortal realm to the Netherworld, creating a diversion.","“Understood.” The Sect Master on the throne nodded slowly. “All twenty coordinates have been marked.” In three days, they would sacrifice Xie Wang and carry out the first step of the grand plan. By then, the will of the Demon Emperor in the Demon God Pillar would choose the location of the Demon","Nation from the 20 coordinates. The next step is to trigger the Tribulation","Transcender’s death tribulation.’","It would be ideal if they could use the Tribulation Transcender’s Death","Tribulation to draw out some of the tombs of the Ancient Tribulation","Transcenders and take out the fallen bodies of the Tribulation Transcenders within, fusing them into the Devil Nation and turning them into the combat strength of the Devil Nation.","All disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect were excited. After waiting for so many years, in three days, they would witness the results.","“Also, who is in charge of collecting intelligence on Tyrannical Song?” The","Sect Master asked again.."]},{"number":2562,"title":"Chapter 2562: Three Minutes of True Grit!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2562: Three Minutes of True Grit!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is currently on Mars. He has already challenged three mysterious beings in succession, and has vanquished each one,” a senior elder of the Limitless Demon Sect replied.","Young Master Hai r s hand, waving his folding fan, froze for a moment. The Sect Master brought up Profound Sage Tyrannical Song at this moment... he probably wants to reduce his benefits in the grand scheme.","“Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs pursuit is the Dao of Immortality. His pursuit differs from ours. As long as Profound Sage Tyrannical Song truly follows through with his claim to challenge the enemy on Mars for seven days, we will have ample time to execute our grand scheme,” the Sect Master explained slowly while tapping on the armrest of the throne.","He didn’t directly rebuke Young Master Hai, but swiftly transitioned to the next topic.","This included the implementation of the next phase of the plan, important considerations, and the highly anticipated issue of final benefit distribution among the members of the Limitless Demon Sect.","In this era, nobody was willing to work without benefits. The Demon Sect was not a place where ideals mattered; here, benefits were paramount.","After the meeting concluded, the Sect Master reopened the Demon Emperor Palace. All members of the Limitless Demon Sect projections began to depart one by one.","Once all the members had vanished, the Sect Master closed the Demon Emperor Palace once more.","He rose from the throne. His body expanded and returned to the illusory form of a hundred-meter-tall giant. Even his aura increased, becoming terrifyingly powerful.","“Three more days,” the Sect Master muttered.","He glanced inward, where a terrifying seal exuded the scholarly aura on his chest after the devilish flames dissipated.","“This feeling of tightness in my chest, the insomnia... this damned state is finally about to end,” the Sect Master muttered while lightly patting his chest.","After establishing the Devil Nation in the Netherworld Realm, the Scholarly Sage’s seal would lead only to death with the power of the original Devil Sea Realm.","At that time, after integrating the Demon Sea world, his strength would increase even further, reaching a level of terror even he couldn’t estimate!","The Sect Master looked up at the void.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, recently rising to fame, possessed a hint of the Scholarly Sage’s aura. He dominated the heavens and the myriad worlds, his brilliance unparalleled.","Unfortunately, Tyrannical Song was destined to never become the second Scholarly Sage.","Upon his return from the Netherworld Realm, Tyrannical Song would be trampled underfoot and signal the universe of the peerless Demon Emperor’s return!","He was the most talented Demon Emperor in the history of the Demon Sect. His advancement was second only to the formidable Scholarly Sage. He condensed nine dragon patterns and achieved Dao immortality in the middle of the previous Heavenly Dao Battle, forging his own path.","Unfortunately, his aggressiveness back then led to a challenge against the Scholarly Sage at the end of the Heavenly Dao Battle. Ultimately, he was crushed and sealed by the Scholarly Sage, causing tightness in his chest and his realm to be forcefully suppressed.","For millions of years, he had diligently worked to break the saint’s seal, but with minimal results. Now, although he could temporarily unleash his true realm’s power under the sealed state, it could only last for three minutes.","Three minutes was too short!","“In three days, the demon god pillar will be the vanguard, piercing into the","Netherworld Realm. The power of the Evil Formation will send my Demon Emperor Palace into the Netherworld Realm and into the newly created","Demon Sea Realm. Endure for another three days,” the Sect Master of the","Limitless Demon Sect, Demon Emperor Og, continued to press on his chest.","He kept reminding himself not to be anxious. Thousands of years had passed. He didn’t need just a few days!","As the final juncture approached, he needed to carefully consider his plan for any gaps that needed filling.","“l can only function at full capacity for three minutes. I must use these three minutes wisely. After sending the Demon Emperor Palace into the Netherworld, we can use the remaining time to stabilize the embryonic form of the Demon Nation.” Demon Emperor Og thought to himself.","After repeatedly considering his plan and ensuring there were no loopholes, he began to softly hum a tune, feeling content.","On the other side, in the Netherworld Realm.","“Are you ready?” Senior White Two emerged from the sealing pillar, sat opposite Song Shuhang, and asked seriously.","“No problem, Senior White. I’m already prepared!” At that moment, Song Shuhang activated his Four Great Body Tempering Divine Techniques.","The Mutated Steel Hands Technique transformed him into a metallic hue, while the Liquid Golden Body Technique made his body resemble a plump ball. The Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha and the Holy Ape Dragon God Technique worked together, with a multitude of holy apes above their heads, holding scholarly scriptures with solemn expressions.","Facing their former master, Senior White Two, the lead great sage ape raised its head proudly, trying to display its best side. The group of holy ape followers behind it naturally couldn’t be weaker; they lined up neatly, akin to elite soldiers on parade.","“Hand me the stone tablet,” Senior White Two called out.","Without needing Song Shuhang to do anything, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had already happily leaped into Senior White Two’s hands, suggesting, “Lord White, how about you change the name on my tablet to ‘Tyrannical Songs tomb’? The name Tyrannical Song is more famous, and Song Shuhang is his real name, so it’s easily exploited by experts from the witchcraft department.” “Yes,” Senior White Two nodded.","He rubbed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, altering ‘Song Shuhang’s tomb’ to ‘Tyrannical Songs tomb’. Then, he began to inscribe new runes and forging formations on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body.","The gorilla general, the hamster, and the beautiful-faced tree continued to bring over refining materials.","“Senior White, are you going to refine the stone tablet again?” Song Shuhang","asked upon seeing this.","“I’m just strengthening it. If I don’t reinforce it, it won’t be able to withstand the power of the ruler of the Netherworld with its current material,” Senior White Two said casually.","Soon after, Little Sun T233 appeared. Its body was ablaze with true fire, available for Senior White Two’s artifact refining.","Senior White threw the stone tablet and the refining materials into Little Sun T233’s furnace one by one, beginning the refining process.","After dealing with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, he waved at Song Shuhang. Song Shuhang removed his clothes and revealed his muscled back.","“What do you want to tattoo?” Senior White Two asked.","Song Shuhang instinctively said, “Loyalty... No, no, I’m not that noble.” “Why not tattoo the head of a husky?” the hamster suggested.","Song Shuhang shook his head and then produced the QR code of his golden core.","Senior White glanced at it and said, “With the complexity of this pattern, it can accommodate more of my power. If you encounter any accidents, you can cooperate with the stone tablet and use a portion of my power to deal with any accidents for three minutes.’","“Three minutes of true grit? That’ll do,” Song Shuhang nodded.."]},{"number":2563,"title":"Chapter 2563: Tyrant Song, Ascend in Authority!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2563: Tyrant Song, Ascend in Authority!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The ‘Golden Core QR Code’ tattoo wasn’t the best choice, but for Song Shuhang at his current stage, it seemed like a suitable option.","After tattooing the Golden Core QR Code on his back, Song Shuhang could choose to tear off his clothes to boost his presence when battling enemies in the future. Simultaneously, he could also reveal the Golden Core QR Code on his back.","If the enemy big shot was careless and used their mental power to lightly scan the Golden Core QR Code... Then, what awaited them was Song Shuhangs ‘blacklist +1DB giant world’s garbage brain attack’ method. He would catch them off guard, flood their brains with junk information, cause their heads to ache, thereby revealing their vulnerabilities!","As long as there was a vulnerability, with Song Shuhangs accessories and various maneuvers, he could swiftly handle it regardless of whether he chose to confront or retreat.","“Sit tight. The pattern of the Golden Core QR Code’ is rather complex. While I’m still awake, let’s try to get it tattooed as soon as possible,” Senior White Two yawned and said.","His drowsiness was becoming stronger and was even beginning to affect the pets around him. For example, the hamster started washing its face with its paws.","Song Shuhang nodded and sat in front of Senior White Two with his back facing him. He adjusted his back muscles to facilitate the tattooing process.","Su Clan’s Sixteen, Soft Feather, the hamster, the ugly tiger, the gorilla general, and the others formed a circle, observing White Ruler tattooing Tyrannical Song.","Just as Senior White Two took out the needles and was about to start tattooing","Song Shuhang, Soft Feather raised her hand and asked, “Hey, Senior White Two, can 1 quietly take photos while you’re tattooing Senior Song?”","Senior White Two’s hand, holding the needle, paused for a moment. He turned his head, smiled at Soft Feather, and said, “Sure.’","This smile was indescribably charming.","Even an entity at White Dragon’s level felt as if its heart had stopped for a moment, let alone the pets surrounding it.","“Senior White, you’re really good-looking!” Soft Feather raised her phone and unhesitatingly snapped a series of photos to capture that captivating smile, which was undoubtedly excellent material.","Senior White Two maintained his charming smile, turned back, and ruthlessly stabbed Song Shuhangs back with the long needle.","Even with Song Shuhangs body-tempering divine techniques protecting him, he couldn’t withstand the piercing needle.","“Aa, Aaah~” Song Shuhangs face instantly turned pale while he cried out in pain.","When Senior White Two’s needle pierced him, a power containing the laws of the Netherworld Realm penetrated his body through his body-tempering divine technique, causing excruciating pain.","The pain caused by a small needle was even more intense than when the fat ball had punched him head-on.","Ever since Song Shuhangs pain database had been updated to the current level) this kind of pain that made him unable to hold back his screams was extremely rare, and it had exceeded his expectations.","“Don’t release your body-tempering technique. Grit your teeth and maintain your four great techniques, or else your body will explode in the next moment,” Senior White Two’s voice was like a gentle breeze. “This is only the first needle. To complete your ‘Golden Core QR Code,’ you’ll need at least tens of thousands of needles.’","Hearing this, Song Shuhang trembled, taking out a Ninth Stage spirit stone and stuffing it into his mouth to bite down on.","The realization that this kind of pain awaited him tens of thousands of times made Song Shuhang suddenly regret his choice to tattoo the image of the ‘Golden Core QR Code’ on his body.","On the side, Soft Feather took out a camera kit and put it on her phone. Then, she gently moved around Song Shuhang and Senior White Two, taking pictures of Senior White tattooing Song from all angles.","After collecting enough material, Soft Feather returned with satisfaction and selected the most beautiful photo from hundreds and sending it to the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","In the photo, Song Shuhangs face was pale, and his forehead was covered in cold sweat. Senior White Two, who had tattooed him on the back, had a smile on his face.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was the first to speak up. “Senior White tattooed Shuhang? When was this photo taken? Just now?”","Fairy Lychee: “Mother Yellow Mountain, Senior White is flirting with me.” Yellow Mountain was so tired that he wanted to retire.","He silently opened the group list and pulled out ‘Sage Monarch Tyrannical Extinguisher.’ After clicking on it and confirming that it was Song Shuhangs account, he stretched out his hand and muted Song Shuhang for 24 hours.","No matter how he thought about it, it was Song Shuhangs fault that Fairy Lychee called him Mother Yellow Mountain.","[System Notification: Sage Monarch Tyrant has been muted by the group owner ‘Yellow Mountain is so tired that he wants to retire’ for 24 hours.]","When this system notification rang out, Fairy Dongfang Six, Young Master Phoenix Slayer, Riverly Purple Mist, and the group of people who wanted to repeat Fairy Lychee’s words instantly woke up and controlled their restless fingers.","Challenging the limits of Senior Yellow Mountain’s patience at this time was undoubtedly a very irrational choice.","However, the Nine Provinces Number One Group was lacking in everything except for stubborn members.","Dongfang Snow: [Heart to Heart] Mother Yellow Mountain, Senior White is flirting with me. 1′′","Huang Shan was so tired that he wanted to retire.","Doudou was stunned for a moment. He silently stood up and handed the Quick-acting Heart-saving Pill’ to stupid Yellow Mountain. He had been sick of eating this thing recently, and he was too lazy to even chew it. It was better to give it back to stupid Yellow Mountain to chew it.","Venerable Yellow Mountain took the pill with one hand and used the other hand to mute Fairy Dongfang Snow for an hour without hesitation.","On the other side of the world, Fairy Dongfang Snow was both satisfied and regretful after being muted.","“l am the little white crane by the edge of the Heaven’s Edge. Wait a minute, wasn’t Senior White doing a very important experiment and so busy that he didn’t even have time to come out and chat? Why did he still have time to tattoo Song Shuhang? Spirit Butterfly Island is under great pressure (Soft Feather).”","“It’s the other Senior White,” Soft Feather replied. At the same time, she also uploaded the [Senior White’s mermaid emoji package (inner demon version)] that she had just made.","After uploading, Soft Feather nodded in satisfaction.","Then, she stretched out her hand and touched her back. The tattoo looked very interesting. After Senior Song finished doing it, should she ask Senior White Two to tattoo one for her? He wondered if Senior White Two had a painless tattoo technique.","“I am the little white crane by the edge of the Heaven’s Edge.”","A moment later, True Monarch White Crane changed the group nickname to","‘White Crane that is willing to be a member of the Song Family in the next life’.","If there was a next life, it hoped that it could be reincarnated as Song","Shuhang.","“Another crazy one,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer said.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator gently sipped his immortal tea and typed a","reply on the keyboard, “What pattern is Ruler White drawing for Song Shuhang? The Spirit Butterfly Island is under a lot of pressure (Soft Feather), so you’ll send us a picture after you’re done?”","He skillfully changed the topic, lest the members of the group continued to chat on this topic and accidentally died.","“It’s done. I’ll send the photos to everyone,” Soft Feather said.","While the seniors in the group were chatting, Senior White Two had already completed the tattoo.","Tyrant Song, ascend in authority!"]},{"number":2564,"title":"Chapter 2564: The Tyrant Scholar-Demon of the Netherworld Moderator","paragraphs":["Chapter 2564: The Tyrant Scholar-Demon of the Netherworld Moderator","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, a complete ‘Golden Core QR Code’ pattern emerged on Song Shuhangs back. In the center of the QR code pattern was the image of the virtuous lamia. She was the central figure of Song Shuhangs virtuous network.","In fact, upon closer inspection, one could see a miniature Song Shuhang at the tip of the virtuous lamia’s tail. The entire pattern conveyed the image of ‘Song Shuhang being protected by the Virtuous Lamia.’ However, due to Song Shuhangs small size in the pattern, he was easily overlooked.","Soft Feather adjusted the angle and took several close-up photos of Song Shuhang’s back, then shared them in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","The photos quickly loaded in the group.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “Hiss Little friend Shuhang tattooed the QR code on his back?”","This move was simply terrifying.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator followed Song Shuhangs train of thought. He could already anticipate that tearing clothes off during battles would become Song Shuhangs basic maneuver.","As they fought, clothes might get torn off.","“Eh? The third picture is interesting.” Doudou’s sharp eyes spotted the highlight.","In the third photo uploaded by Soft Feather, the Golden Core QR Code pattern of the virtuous lamia on Song Shuhangs back coincidentally echoed the Calabash Brothers pattern on his waist.","The two patterns, crafted by two Senior Whites, echoed each other marvelously.","“Speaking of which, why did the other Senior White suddenly want to give Song Shuhang a tattoo?” Fairy Dongfang Six asked curiously.","Soft Feather giggled. “The function of the tattoo is currently confidential. Senior Song will address everyone about it later.”","With that said, Soft Feather lowered her head and looked at the position of her legs—if she were to get a tattoo, she would want to ink a design on her ankles.","“Alright, it’s done. Shuhang, try activating this tattoo.” Senior White Two clapped and began to collaborate to grant Song Shuhang permissions.","Little Sun T233 also gently expelled a brand new stone tablet.","The completely renewed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet landed steadily next to Song Shuhang. At this moment, it had transcended the limitations of its material and upgraded from a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender magical treasure to an Immortal divine weapon.","In addition to its inherent uniqueness, with sufficient spirit stones and treasures, it could even contend with a dao artifact head-on. If lacking spirit stones, it would certainly not cower!","After this upgrade, it finally possessed the confidence to accompany Tyrant Song to confront the big shots of the myriad worlds, without feeling as insecure as it did before.","Song Shuhang extended his hand, grabbed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, and activated the tattoo on his back.","The tattoo pattern resonated with the new formation patterns on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body.","“Man and Monument as one state!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet exclaimed. Song Shuhang nonchalantly utilized the Saber Nurturing Technique to enhance the synchronization rate between him and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","This time, both parties felt they had a deeper understanding of each other, and their cooperation was seamless.","After the fusion of Song Shuhang and saber Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, the portion of authority that Senior White Two had prepared for them to become rulers of the Netherworld Realm was activated.","Song Shuhangs consciousness and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s consciousness began to ascend and improve. This sensation resembled the moment when","Song Shuhangs fifth Prominent Divinity Speech touched upon the laws of the Wielder of the M/ill, surpassing the laws accessible to Immortals.","Even if only for a moment, it was enough to benefit Song Shuhang for a lifetime.","Now, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and its consciousness had been elevated to the level of ‘Immortals,’ encountering the laws of authority of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Song Shuhangs vision cleared, enveloped by a layer of pure nomological power along with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","“Did you succeed? My Lord?” the hamster inquired.","Senior White Two yawned. “It’s a success. Now, keep an eye on him. This process will take some time.”","The management authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, even if only a","small part, was not to be taken lightly.","With that said, Senior White Two stretched his back and stepped into the sealing pillar, ensuring no one could disturb him.","Two days passed by.","During this extraordinary period, where the Heavenly Dao collapsed and the world underwent tremendous changes, every minute was critical, and the myriad worlds were in turmoil.","Regardless of their cultivation system, beings across realms fought for their future. From Immortals exuding the aura of destiny to ordinary mortals, everyone labored tirelessly for the future.","In the Netherworld Realm, within the former lair of the fat ball, Su Clan’s Sixteen propped her chin on her hands while struggling to stay awake as she observed Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, shrouded in the power of laws.","The White Dragon draped her arms around Sixteen’s neck lazily.","Soft Feather, her forehead still red from the flick, slept soundly on Su Clan’s Sixteen’s legs.","Not only Soft Feather but also the hamster, the ugly tiger, the beautiful-faced tree monster, and the gorilla general all succumbed to a deep slumber.","The sleepiness emanating from Senior White Two seemed contagious. Within a certain radius of his sealing pillar, it affected all living beings.","“Still not done?” The White Dragon, with drowsy eyes, inquired.","“It seems to be almost done,” Su Clan’s Sixteen speculated.","She noticed the dissipating circle of law around Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","The White Dragon yawned. “You should rest for a while. I’ll take care of it. White’s willpower is simply too overwhelming. This sleepiness is incredibly difficult to resist.’","“Sister White Dragon, don’t worry. I can manage for a bit longer,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied. The ghost fairy spirit within her secretly aided her, occasionally sending a refreshing aura to help her stay awake.","Su Clan’s Sixteen reached out and gently tapped the red spot on Soft Feather’s forehead. Two days had passed, yet it remained.","“Hiss Soft Feather, still asleep, took a sharp breath and shook her head vigorously as her small face brushing against Sixteen’s thigh.","Sixteen hurriedly stroked Soft Feather’s soft long hair, soothing her.","At that moment, the power of law surrounding Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet finally dissipated.","Song Shuhangs blurred vision cleared.","As he held the stone tablet, his consciousness stirred.","In the next moment, an illusory control panel emerged from Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body.","[Netherworld Ruler Authority Interface (Part)]","[1. Mission release function. [Hint: You can issue missions in the Netherworld","Realm according to your own will and mobilize the demons of the","Netherworld Realm to complete them.] After completing the mission, you can reward the demon with certain rewards.]","“2. Reward Function: You can reward the demons who have completed the mission or the demons you favor, including lifespan, power, treasures, and reputation in the Netherworld Realm.","“3. Punishment Function: You can punish the demons of the Netherworld who disobey orders according to their level.”","“4. Surveillance Function: You can instantly obtain information about every corner of the Netherworld Realm. You can use it ten times a day.”","[5...]","A long row of control panels dazzled Song Shuhangs eyes. The ruler of the Netherworld could do as he pleased!"]},{"number":2565,"title":"Chapter 2565: The Big Deception","paragraphs":["Chapter 2565: The Big Deception","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior White Two couldn’t be bothered to introduce Song Shuhang to the authority of the Ruler of the Netherworld, and he didn’t have the energy to personally teach him the various controls of the ruling authority.","So... in a drowsy state, Senior White Two casually created such a foolproof operating interface.","Simple, easy to understand, and very suitable for players like Song Shuhang, who had poor talent in learning magical techniques. With this interface, he didn’t need to undergo special training or obtain a certification to manage the Netherworld.","The only downside was that, due to Song Shuhangs current realm, some of the ruling authority had a limit on the number of times it could be used each day.","In addition to the basic management rights on the interface, after Song","Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet merged into one, they could also use the ‘Three Minutes of True Grit’ privilege to forcefully maintain the operation of the Netherworld.","Senior White Two had thought it through.","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, after adding new functions, do you want to consider changing your name to Fellow Daoist iPad?” Song Shuhangs finger moved across Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body while browsing through the entire Ruler of the Netherworld’s authority interface.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet didn’t get angry at this suggestion. Instead, it calmly replied, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, do you believe that I’ll shut down at the critical moment like the iPad due to low battery and then let my newly renamed Tyrannical Song Profound Sage Tomb immediately come into play?”","“Sorry, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Song Shuhang said while reaching out to gently tap, closing the projection of the Ruler of the Netherworld’s authority interface.","He closed his eyes and combined the insights he and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had gained after they merged into one. He then integrated this portion of his insights into the administrative authority on the interface while familiarizing himself with the management authority of the Netherworld.","“Are you done? I’m going to split,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said.","Song Shuhang nodded, saying, “Alright, it’s settled.”","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, don’t use shrimp genitals icons to mark key points,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet reminded him while its body shrank to the","size of a jade pendant and hung on Song Shuhang’s waist.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","After hanging the stone tablet, Song Shuhang stretched his body— he wasn’t sure how long he had been meditating, but his muscles felt stiff, as if he had been in a trance for too long.","“Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, how long were Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and I in a trance?” he asked.","As he spoke, Song Shuhang noticed that, except for Sister White Dragon and Su Clan’s Sixteen, all the other teammates in the fat ball’s nest were sound asleep. Even Pavilion Master Chu’s hair hung limply.","Su Clan’s Sixteen stretched out two fingers and gently shook them.","“I’ve been meditating for about two days,” Sister White Dragon added.","“So long?” Song Shuhang was a little surprised.","He knew that it would take some time for him to meditate this time, but he didn’t expect that two days would pass in the blink of an eye. Was this the true feeling of a day in the sky and a thousand years in the world?","Meditating felt like time travel, like sleeping for a minute after waking up. It would consume time.","“Not good. Two days have passed in one breath. How far has the Limitless Demon Sect’s plan progressed? Also, did the Celestial Thearch already go to the mysterious island? My parents would also be back in the scholarly world! As for Soft Feather, we have to send her back first. Otherwise, when Senior Spirit Butterfly wakes up and finds out that his daughter is missing, he’ll probably jump off the building in a hurry,” Song Shuhang scratched his head.","Two days had passed in the timeline, and he realized that there were too many things that he needed to deal with.","“Don’t worry, Shuhang. Things could be... Dealt with one by one,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said, but she couldn’t help but nod off drowsily.","She persisted for two days. After seeing that Song Shuhang had woken up, she finally relaxed and stopped resisting the power of Senior White Two’s sleepy halo.","“Are you very sleepy?” Song Shuhang hurriedly walked toward Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Su Clan’s Sixteen softly replied, “Mm.”","“I’ll take you to rest,” Song Shuhang was about to carry Su Clan’s Sixteen when he saw Soft Feather sleeping soundly on Sixteen’s legs.","When Soft Feather slept, she would occasionally smack her lips. It seemed that she had dreamed of something delicious.","In addition, there was a red fingerprint on Soft Feather’s forehead, which looked a bit like the eyebrow ornament on the virtuous lamia’s forehead. It was very eye-catching.","“What is this?” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but reach out and gently poke Soft Feather’s forehead.","Poke!","“Ahhhh Soft Feather suddenly opened her eyes wide. Then, she puffed up her cheeks and angrily stared at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang awkwardly withdrew his finger. Senior White Two was the witness. He had really only poked her lightly just now, the kind with very little strength. He didn’t expect Soft Feather to have such a big reaction.","“Senior Song, what did you do to us?” Soft Feather asked.","“Cough, Soft Feather, it’s time. Get up and go home,” Song Shuhang said to forcefully change the topic.","Soft Feather forcefully blew out the air in her mouth, and then rubbed Su Clan’s Sixteen’s legs. This was a habit of Soft Feather subconsciously rubbing her pillow after getting up.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was speechless.","Soft Feather rubbed her pillow and struggled to sit up. “Sixteen, Senior Song, how long have I been asleep?” she asked.","“Two days,” Song Shuhang replied, “It’s almost time. The Heavenly Emperor should have already gone to the mysterious island. You should hurry back to the Spirit Butterfly Island.”","On the side, after Soft Feather stood up, Su Clan’s Sixteen lost her footing. She yawned, and her eyelids became heavy. She couldn’t hold on any longer, and she fell to the side.","Song Shuhang quickly reached out and caught Su Clan’s Sixteen, holding her in his arms.","“Senior Song, you big liar.” “What happened to coming to the Netherworld","Realm to explore the treasure of the fat ball?” Soft Feather said unhappily.","In the end, he tricked her into sleeping in the Netherworld Realm for two days. When he woke up, he didn’t manage to do anything and wanted to return to the Spirit Butterfly Island. Her time was so precious, yet she wasted it on sleeping.","“We naturally have to explore the treasure of the fat ball boss.” Song Shuhang revealed a smile as if he had everything under control. He stretched out his hand and took out several Sage-Sealed Wooden Sabers and handed them to Soft Feather. “Soft Feather, when you go back, take these wooden sabers with you. When the time comes, take one with you, and the others can be hidden on the Spirit Butterfly Island or in the sea area near the Spirit Butterfly Island.","This way, Senior Spirit Butterfly won’t be able to catch them all in one go. With these coordinates, we will inform you when we start the dungeon. When you are ready, I can pull you over through the Inner World and open the instance dungeon.”","Soft Feather’s eyes lit up.","The dignified ‘Ancient Sage Ling Die Zi t was easily bribed by a few ‘Sage Seal Wooden Sabers’.","“Senior Song, send me back to the main world first. I’m going back to Spirit Butterfly Island!” Soft Feather put away these ‘Sage Sealed Wooden Sabers’ and was in a good mood.","“Don’t worry, I’ll contact the Celestial Thearch first.” Song Shuhang smiled and opened the cultivation Chat features.","When he opened it, hundreds of messages popped up!"]},{"number":2566,"title":"Chapter 2566: Pseudo-Song Youyou","paragraphs":["Chapter 2566: Pseudo-Song Youyou","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The cultivation chat feature was incredibly user-friendly. It was able to sense Song Shuhangs state.","During Song Shuhangs crucial meditation, the feature would automatically save incoming private messages to the background and only pop up when Song Shuhang manually activated the cultivation chat function.","At the top of the chat was a message from the Celestial Thearch. Her messages were transmitted through long-distance energy transmission and had been prioritized at the forefront.","The first message from the Celestial Thearch was the routine acknowledgment of every drop of long-range energy.","Following the energy transmission, her second message included a postscript: “Senior Song, you better have Soft Feather back at Spirit Butterfly Island before eleven in the morning.”","Subsequent private chats followed:","“It’s already nine in the morning. I’m packing my bags and getting ready to leave Spirit Butterfly Island.","“It’s nine-thirty. Many members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group have arrived, and I’m playing the gracious host!","“It’s ten-thirty. Farewell, Spirit Butterfly Island’s trap. Please handle it yourself, Senior Song. Don’t contact me for the next few days; I’m swamped.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He reached out to reply to the Celestial Thearch: “Celestial Thearch, did you go to the mysterious island?”","[Foxy Friends] Celestial Thearch: “I’m sorry, the user you’re trying to reach is currently busy. Please end the call after a beep.”","...Song Shuhang: “Let’s not rush to end the private chat. I’m currently too busy to fuss about the mysterious island. You don’t need to be wary of me. I just finished meditating for a solid two days, and now I have a mountain of tasks to attend to that is enough to keep me busy for days.”","“Meditated for two days? Congratulations, Senior Song, on your successful meditation for such a duration. A polite yet awkward smile,” replied the Celestial Thearch.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Indeed, I’m swamped here. Senior Song, what’s up?” asked the Celestial Thearch.","Song Shuhang: “You left Spirit Butterfly Island? I haven’t had the chance to send Soft Feather back yet, so I wanted to check on Senior Spirit Butterfly’s current status. Is he awake?”","“Apologies, Senior Song, I’m a celestial being who keeps her promises. My agreement with Soft Feather has ended, so I left Spirit Butterfly Island promptly. As for what happened afterward, I have no idea.”","“Oh, before leaving Spirit Butterfly Island, a group of Nine Provinces Number One Group members arrived. I fed them bewitching soup, so they should still be unconscious. But don’t worry, Senior Song, my bewitching soup is a potent tonic. After waking up from a nap, their strength will greatly increase.” After the Celestial Thearch’s response, she added, “That’s it.”","It seemed she was genuinely busy... She was probably already on the mysterious island.","“l hope Senior Spirit Butterfly gets some more sleep.” Song Shuhang muttered, concluding the private chat with the Heavenly Emperor and opening other private messages.","[Yellow Mountain’s Mom.Group Owner]: “Shuhang, did your wooden sabers arrive? I’ve gathered a batch of Xie Wang’s cores and bodies. If your wooden sabers haven’t been sent yet, send them to Spirit Butterfly Island. Or come to Spirit Butterfly Island to find me.”","Did Yellow Mountain’s Mom also go to Spirit Butterfly Island to indulge in the Heavenly Emperor’s bewitching soup?","Song Shuhang scrolled down the message list and found that most of the seniors in the group had gone to Spirit Butterfly Island.","Snow Wolf Cave Lord, Seven Lives Talisman Palace Master, Lychee Fairy, Dongfang Fairy, and so on... All left messages for Song Shuhang. They were mostly asking if he wanted to join the mysterious island exploration activity?","“Huh? When did I become so popular? Everyone remembers me when they go on adventures to the mysterious island?” Song Shuhang wondered.","“If I’m not mistaken,” Sword said, “the fellow Daoists must have noticed your special physique. They’ll feel much more comfortable with you accompanying them to the mysterious island.”","Song Shuhang laughed. “That makes sense. With my robust body from the four great body refining techniques, I’ll definitely be a qualified meat shield if I accompany them to the mysterious island.”","“Well, you’re pretty much there,” Sword didn’t elaborate – in a way, Song Shuhang and Senior White had the same idea. Bringing Song Shuhang along on an adventure had the auspicious effect of avoiding disaster.","Of course, the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were only joking and asking Song Shuhang before setting off.","Song Shuhangs consciousness continued to slide down as he quickly browsed through the messages sent by the seniors.","When he reached the end, he finally saw a different message.","[Envious Style] True Monarch Eternal Fire: “Shuhang, we’ve already prepared an area in the world of the golden lotus suitable for your parents to temporarily reside in. Do you need me to send someone to bring them over?","Or will you transfer them yourself?”","Song Shuhang quickly replied, “Senior Eternal Fire, I’ll send my parents to the world of the golden lotus myself. I have the coordinates of the Scholarly Academy, so it’ll be very convenient to transfer them.”","True Monarch Eternal Fire quickly replied, “Alright, let me know in advance when you start the spatial teleportation.”","“Okay, Senior Eternal Fire. Thank you for your efforts,” Song Shuhang said gratefully.","A decision was made!","In a while, he would first split himself in half. One half would remain in the Netherworld Realm to manage the situation. The other half would go to fetch his parents to the scholarly faction and then send Soft Feather back to Spirit Butterfly Island.","If it was on the way, perhaps he could even split himself to explore the mysterious island?","“Soft Feather, I’ll send you back to the main world first, then go to Spirit Butterfly Island!” Song Shuhang used telekinesis to support Su Clan’s Sixteen, then reached out to grab the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and pointed it at his waist.","Soft Feather curiously asked, “Sure, but what are you going to do, Senior song?”","“I’m going to cut myself in half first. I’m too busy. I have to split myself in two.” Song Shuhang entered the pseudo-undying smoke mode.","However, just as Song Shuhang was about to cut himself, the QR code tattoo on his back was stimulated and sparked electrically.","Two forces clashed on Song Shuhangs body.","It was the power of pseudo-undying and the power of the ruler of the Netherworld, which Senior White Two had carved for him.","“What’s happening?”","“Don’t panic, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, let’s merge our stone and saber!” Song Shuhang said calmly.","He reached out and grabbed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, casting the Saber Nurturing Technique three times in a row, quickly entering Saber Man Fusion Mode.","Then, the formation patterns Senior White Two had tattooed on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body and the tattoo on Song Shuhangs back were activated.","Three Minutes of true grit was activated!","“Don’t tell me someone wants to read your fortune remotely again?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","“It’s not an external enemy.” Song Shuhangs smoke body expanded wildly.","“It’s internal strife.’","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was confused.","The White Dragon frowned, picked up Sixteen and Soft Feather, and retreated a certain distance.","“Come out!” He shouted.","In the next moment, a black figure was squeezed out of the Golden Core QR code tattoo.","This was something forcefully extracted from Song Shuhangs body.","“Inner demons?” Soft Feather licked the corner of her mouth. It was as black as the black-skinned Soft Feather.","“It’s not a heart demon... He doesn’t have the fragrance of the Inner Demon,” Song Shuhang was still in his true grit mode. His gaze locked on that black figure.","The dark figure slowly sat up from the ground.","This was a dark version of Song Shuhang. He had no hair, a cold expression, and bulging muscles!","“You You Song?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said in shock.."]},{"number":2567,"title":"Chapter 2567: A Startling Revelation from the Big Shot","paragraphs":["Chapter 2567: A Startling Revelation from the Big Shot","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“How is that possible?” questioned the Sword. “Song Shuhang hasn’t achieved immortality, so how could he conjure up a Youyou?”","Yet, this bald, muscular Dark- skinned Song stood before everyone with a stern expression, exuding a strong presence that was far from any illusion.","White Dragon furrowed her brow. She sensed something amiss.","Pavilion Master Chu’s soft, droopy hair also stood on end, as if receiving a signal.","“Could it be because you just utilized the ‘pseudo-immortal body?” calmly speculated Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement. “Exactly.”","The conflict between the pseudo-immortal body and the ruler of the Netherworld tattoo Senior White Two had given him had caused this black Song to emerge from within him.","Had he canceled the pseudo-immortal body earlier, the conflict in his body might have dissipated, and Dark Song wouldn’t have appeared. But he chose to activate the three minutes of true grit mode and enter Senior White Two’s combat mode.","Under the stimulation of the ruler of the Netherworld’s martial arts, the Dark Song before them was eventually born.","“Is this really Song Youyou?” Soft Feather asked curiously.","“It’s definitely not the real Song Youyou,” Song Shuhang replied while eyeing the Dark Song before him. To be honest, Dark Song gave him the feeling that he was a little like the fat ball’s clone.","In terms of appearance, Dark Song resembled Song Shuhangs ‘true self,’ with a bald head and bulging muscles. But his dark skin resembled that of a demon’s heart, unlike Senior White Two and the three-eyed young man, who were also rulers of the Netherworld but didn’t turn black. “Can he speak?” Song Shuhang inquired, looking at Dark Song.","Dark Song remained stern-faced and silent.","“Doesn’t he have self-awareness?” Soft Feather asked.","“Let me appraise him and find out,” Song Shuhang said, extending his right hand toward Dark Song.","At that moment, Dark Song swiftly extended his left hand, mirroring Song Shuhangs action. Their movements were identical, with Song Shuhang using his right hand while Dark Song used his left.","It was like looking into a mirror.","Song Shuhangs right hand met Dark Songs left hand, akin to skilled martial artists matching their internal energy.","Snap!","The glove on Song Shuhang’s right hand contracted as he initiated the secret appraisal technique.","After paying the price for the appraisal, Song Shuhang’s misty body bore several wounds, and intense pain surged through his brain for 0.01 seconds.","Then, the appraisal information appeared in Song Shuhangs mind.","[Unnamed model: Temporary partial authority type pseudo ruler of the","Netherworld. Relies on Senior White Two’s authority as the ruler of the Netherworld. Will dissipate after the expiration of the ‘temporary authority as the ruler of the Netherworld.’ Main component: Senior White Two’s power as the ruler of the Netherworld. Secondary components: Pseudo-immortal body factor, Serene Ball Space Talent Authority, Heavenly Dao Ball’s remaining power, Cheng Lin’s power fragment, divine third eye power information...]","“The composition is indeed complex,” Song Shuhang remarked while rubbing his temples.","On the other side, Dark Song also rubbed his temples while wordlessly maintaining his stern expression.","“Did you ascertain any information?” inquired Sister White Dragon.","“Yes, it can be confirmed that Dark Song is a ‘temporary, partial authority’ fake ruler of the Netherworld. The main component is Senior White Two’s power, and the secondary component is very complicated, incorporating nearly all the enhancements on my body,” Song Shuhang explained.","“A fake ruler of the Netherworld?” Sister White Dragon gazed up at the sky, uncertain of how to describe it.","After a brief pause, Soft Feather ventured, “So, is this Senior Song Two?”","“If we were to rank him, he’d be Song Four. I still have a clone transcending the Ninth Stage with Senior Melon Eater, and a steel clone with the Celestial Thearch,” Song Shuhang disclosed, a tinge of sadness crossing his face.","“And this Song Four is temporary. Once Senior White Two wakes up and reclaims his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld, Song Four will vanish. He’s a special individual born from the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang added.","“Does Song Four possess his own independent consciousness?” Sister White Dragon’s droopy fur swayed slightly.","“No, he doesn’t,” Song Shuhang regretfully shook his head.","After all, Song Four was a temporary counterfeit and didn’t possess independent consciousness.","On the other side, Song Four also shook his head expressionlessly. His actions mirrored his main body’s movements entirely.","“However, I should be able to control Song Four’s movements,” Song Shuhang asserted.","After all, he was a man who had once possessed Song Two and Song Three, so he was very experienced in controlling clones. Song Shuhang had already mastered multitasking.","With that said, he split his mental power, using a portion to control Song Four.","“Senior Song, care to try dancing?” Soft Feather suddenly suggested.","In the next moment, the expressionless Song Four suddenly performed a split on the spot and formed a perfect split.","Sister White Dragon was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","“Soft Feather, let’s not play around. I haven’t controlled my clone in a while, so I’m not used to it. As soon as I heard your command, I instinctively split,” Song Shuhang awkwardly waved his hand.","A few minutes later.","Song Shuhangs main body was ready to take Soft Feather back to Spirit Butterfly Island and send Papa Song and Mama Song back to the scholarly faction.","Meanwhile, the dark Song Four remained in the Netherworld Realm, managing the realm on Song Shuhangs behalf, pacifying the demons, and thwarting the Limitless Demon Sect’s plans.","“Then, I’ll be leaving first,” Song Shuhang opened the passage between the world of the black lotus and the Inner World and waved his hand behind him.","Sister White Dragon gently held Sixteen and waved her claws at Song","Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair rooted on Song Four’s bald head, gently swaying. Soft Feather and Song Shuhang’s main body disappeared into the passage and transferred to Wenzhou City through the Inner World.","Meanwhile, Song Four also began to get busy.","Under Song Shuhangs remote control, Song Four reached out and gently swiped across Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body to open the interface of the ruler of the Netherworld.","“First, I need to observe the situation of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Song Four’s finger lightly tapped on the monitoring function.","This function allowed him to instantly grasp the information of every corner of the Netherworld Realm. Due to the limitations of Song Shuhangs realm, he could only use it ten times a day.","With a light tap, the current situation of the Netherworld Realm was instantly projected into Song Shuhangs mind.","At the same time, Senior Three-Eyed, who was on the Throne of Wealth, was suddenly stunned. In his consciousness, he suddenly received the current situation of the Netherworld Realm! This was the first time he had received such a message since he had retired from his position as the ruler of the Netherworld.","The Ball Shuhang clone on Mars also trembled slightly.","Striped Dragon Two’s beard shook as he was frying tea, and the Immortal Tea leaves were destroyed.."]},{"number":2568,"title":"Chapter 2568: If There’s Confusion, It’s Definitely Tyrannical Song Stirring Up Trouble","paragraphs":["Chapter 2568: If There’s Confusion, It’s Definitely Tyrannical Song Stirring Up Trouble","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Whether it was the esteemed Senior Three-Eyes from the Throne of Wealth, or the big shot Striped Dragon Two from the independent small world, both had resigned from their positions as rulers of the Netherworld and were hidden in the mortal realm by their respective Heavenly Dao.","Ever since stepping down from their roles as rulers of the Netherworld, these two big shots hadn’t received any information from the Netherworld.","But now, the sudden appearance of information about the Netherworld in their minds caught them off guard.","“What’s going on? Why am I suddenly receiving information from the Netherworld?” The Three-Eyed Youth looked puzzled.","“Has something changed in the Netherworld? Could a new ruler of the Netherworld have been born?” Striped Dragon Two used his dragon whiskers to sweep up the overturned tea leaves and tossed them into the trash can.","A few moments later, both Three-Eyes and Striped Dragon Two decided to contact Song Shuhang—if something big happened in the world and they were clueless, it had to be Song Shuhangs fault!","Three-Eyes and Striped Dragon Two shared a mysterious understanding. Despite their respective Heavenly Dao and old grudges, they somehow had a tacit understanding.","“Hey, Tyrannical Song, what’s going on?” Three-Eyes contacted Song Shuhang through the imprint of the Throne of Wealth.","Meanwhile, Striped Dragon Two sent a direct message to Song Shuhang through the cultivation chat: “What’s happening in the Netherworld? What’s the situation right now? Why am 1 suddenly receiving information from the Netherworld? What are you up to?”","On Mars, Ball Shuhang was in high spirits—it felt the warmth of ‘home’ from the information about the Netherworld received from its main body.","After receiving this information, Ball Shuhang was energized and his fighting spirit soared. “Who else wants some? Who else?”","In this battle, only its main body was worthy of the position of Heavenly Dao! Whoever dared to defy it would taste its iron fist!","On the other side, in the mortal world, in Wenzhou.","Since Song Four was still receiving feedback from the monitoring function of the Netherworld, he was saturated with information. So the messages from Senior Three-Eyes and Striped Dragon Two were transferred to the main body.","Song Shuhang had just brought Soft Feather back to his hometown when he suddenly received inquiries from the two seniors. “I’m innocent. I didn’t do anything,” he replied skillfully.","Papa Song opened the door in confusion.","Mama Song, who followed them out, was surprised.","The couple subconsciously looked at Soft Feather.","A moment later.","“Where’s Sixteen?” Mama Song asked. Two fairies had left, so why did only one return?","“What did you do to Soft Feather?” Papa Song asked.","Soft Feather hurriedly waved her hand: “No, no, Senior Song and I didn’t do anything. I’ve been sleeping for the past two days.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","To prevent Soft Feathers explanation from becoming more confusing, Song Shuhang quickly explained himself. “l entered a meditative state two days ago, and Sixteen stayed by my side for two days. She fell asleep. Since Soft Feather’s time to go out and play is up, I have to send her home first.”","Papa Song asked in confusion, “Then what did you mean when you shouted","‘innocent, didn’t do anything? What’s that about?”","“That’s because I was just communicating with the two seniors through divine sense. I was on the phone,” Song Shuhang replied.","Mama Song: “...You don’t have to explain the second half of your sentence. We can understand what you mean.”","“Are you ready, Dad, Mom? How many people should I bring to the scholarly world? This time, I plan to send you to the scholarly world for a period of time,” Song Shuhang asked.","Papa Song shook his head. “It’s not that easy to bring someone along. It’s not easy to explain the specific reason to everyone, and communication can be difficult. Besides, three days is too short for a move.”","“No one came?” Song Shuhang asked with a frown.","“Yes, but we can’t make it in three days. After all, it’s not a vacation, but a family move,” Mama Song replied.","Given Papa Song and Mama Songs personalities, there were still many people willing to believe them. However, three days was too short. Their family and friends were scattered all over the country, and so were their children.","“l was careless. Three days is indeed too short. However, time was tight...Since that’s the case, our family will leave first. In a while, Dad, Mom, give me a detailed list of names. After I’m done with a few things, I’ll go to every house one by one and bring them to the scholarly world,” Song Shuhang said.","“Alright. It’ll be easier for you to explain the supernatural to them,” Papa Song said. “Your uncle’s family is waiting for your cousin to come back from abroad. You can go and pick up your uncle first.”","“Leave it to me. When the time comes, I won’t leave anyone behind. Is there anything in our house that needs to be moved?” Song Shuhang asked with a smile.","“The things that need to be taken away have already been packed here. There are more bits and pieces.” Mama Song pointed at the large pile of boxes behind her. “There are some things we can buy when we get there.”","The main thing was that some things had been used for many years and had gained sentimental value. She wanted to take them with her.","“Is this all you have? Easy, watch me!” The corners of Song Shuhangs mouth slightly rose. He stretched out his hand and put on the coat with big sleeves.","It was time to show his parents some real skills. His father had interrupted a performance last time. Song Shuhang wanted to make up for it today!","He still had to act cool!","Song Shuhang rolled up his sleeves and prepared to speak.","But at that moment, Fairy Creation jumped out before him, and with a wave of her long sleeves, she put all the luggage into her sleeves.","After packing her luggage, Fairy Creation turned around and smiled sweetly at Song Shuhang. She had an expression that said, “Hurry up and praise me!","Hurry up and praise me!”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He reached out and grabbed Fairy Creation and forced her back into his body.","Then, he stretched out his hand and wrapped Papa Song and Mama Song up with his telekinetic energy, entering his Inner World. “Let’s head to the scholarly world! ”","Soft Feather followed with a smile.","After moving his parents into the world of the golden lotus, Song Shuhang and Soft Feather returned to Wenzhou City.","He used the Heavenly Peng Escape Technique and brought Soft Feather to the Spirit Butterfly Island.","At this time, he finally found some time to reply to Senior Three-Eyed and Striped Dragon Two. In this world, there weren’t many people who were so stubborn that they dared to ignore the two of them and not reply for a long time.","“Senior Three-Eyed, I didn’t do anything. However, due to a small accident, I produced a fake incarnation of the ruler of the Netherworld. Did you sense my fake Song Youyou’s incarnation?” Song Shuhang replied to Senior Three-Eyed first.","Then, he tapped on Senior Striped Dragon Two’s phone and said, “Nothing has happened to the Netherworld for the time being. Hmm... I can’t guarantee it in a few days. In addition, Senior, did you sense my clone of Song Youyou just like Senior Three-Eyed?”","Wealth Scattering King Level Expert, Three-Eyed Youth was startled.","What the hell was this fake incarnation of the ruler of the Netherworld? Had","Shuhang advanced to the Wielder of the Will?","In the independent small world, Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Was something going to happen to Nine Nether in a few days?","And what the hell was Song Youyou’s incarnation?","“But sure enough, Tyrannical Song is the one causing trouble!” The two big shots had the same thought.."]},{"number":2569,"title":"Chapter 2569: The Enormous Debt Owed by a Responsible Man!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2569: The Enormous Debt Owed by a Responsible Man!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Is that weirdo with the eye fetish also chatting with you?” At the same time, Striped Dragon Two sensed the hidden message in Song Shuhangs recent reply— the three-eyed guy had also received the ‘Netherworld Realm information.’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","From the tone of his response, it seemed that Striped Dragon Two indeed had some history with the Three-Eyed Youth.","If he were to screenshot Striped Dragon Two’s reply and send it to the Three-Eyed Youth... These two big shots might resort to using the Netherworld Ruler’s Brain.","Of course, before they engaged in such a battle, he, as the middleman, would not fare well. He might become the battleground where the Three-Eyed junior and Striped Dragon Two fought from a distance, suffering undeserved calamity.","So, it was best to just think about such thrilling scenarios. Actually doing it would be too reckless—at least until his body was strong enough to handle the confrontation between the two big shots.","“What did you do to that eye fetish guy? Why is he also receiving ‘Netherworld Realm information?” Striped Dragon Two followed up with another question.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","What did I do to him? I didn’t do anything!","Wait, I actually did something quite outrageous to the Three-Eyed Youth.","“I once hung him on a demon god pillar and set him on fire?” Song Shuhang tentatively replied—this incident left a deep impression on him because he regretted not making a wish while hanging and burning alongside the eye butler.","Striped Dragon Two: n ! ! !”","The three exclamation marks indicated that Striped Dragon Two was three times more shocked than before.","Striped Dragon Two immediately asked, “How did you manage to do that?”","Given Song Shuhangs abilities, he was able to hang the eye fetish guy on a demon god pillar?","“This is a bit embarrassing to talk about, so... I’d prefer to remain silent,” Song Shuhang responded. He still had some dignity, after all. Some things were about a man’s pride, and he couldn’t let that slip.","“Two karmic loans!” Striped Dragon Two replied, “You still owe me a karma after you used the Karma Saber Technique last time. Now, if you tell me how you hung the eye fetish guy on the demon god pillar and burned him, I’ll grant you two karmic loans. After you repay the karma you owe me, you can borrow from me again the next time you use the Karma Saber Technique!’","Ah, tempting indeed!","Looking at the seven karmic debt marks on his wrist, Song Shuhang couldn’t resist Striped Dragon Two’s offer.","“What makes a man set aside his dignity and swallow his pride?","“Is it the enemy’s might? Is it precious friendship?","“No, none of that!","“It’s poverty, the enormous debt owed by a responsible man!”","Thus, Song Shuhang quickly replied, “Actually... It was an accident. I originally wanted to show the Three-Eyed senior my ‘illusory reality— that’s the ‘fake desert world’ I copied from Senior White. In this illusory world, demon god pillars would randomly rise and hang ‘me’ on them to burn. But, the","Three-Eyed senior happened to be standing in the perfect spot. When the demon god pillar shot up from the desert, it hung the Three-Eyed senior on it and burned him with raging demon fire.”","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","The reality of the situation was different from what he had imagined, and upon learning the story’s details, he realized the ‘pleasure’ of the story had diminished significantly!","“Some stories are enjoyable simply for their ending, but once you know the details, they lose their appeal.","“If I had known, I wouldn’t have asked Song Shuhang about it. I could have savored the fact that he hung the eye fetish guy on the demon god pillar and burned him for a long time.”","Striped Dragon Two somewhat sullenly tapped his claws and sent two karmic loans to Song Shuhang.","“One to offset the debt, and the other remaining with Song Shuhang as proof he could use the Karma Saber Technique next time.","“Just consider it a gift for Cheng Lin,” Striped Dragon Two thought to himself.","“Thank you for the two karmic loans, senior,” Song Shuhang said cheerfully. One of the seven karmic debt marks on his wrist disappeared, replaced by a small dragon-shaped mark.","“It’s nothing. Next time you find an opportunity to hang the eye fetish guy again, I’ll grant you three more karmic loans!” Striped Dragon Two said boldly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Maybe not. I might earn the karma but not be able to spend it.","At this point, Striped Dragon Two added, “Even if you have other plans, as long as you can satisfy the eye fetish guy and make me happy, I’ll grant you the corresponding number of karmic loans! ”","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up, and he quickly replied, “Actually, I’ve also gambled with the Three-Eyed senior several times, winning quite a lot from him each time. Does that count?”","“Pfft, what’s that? Do you think you’ve gained an advantage like I did? But you were just cleaning up the trash for its family. And while doing so, you were unknowingly helping it distribute its wealth and working for it. From start to finish, you didn’t gain anything. You’re still at a loss!” Striped Dragon Two said disdainfully.","Song Shuhang silently looked up at the sky. “I’m willing to do this kind of trash cleaning! I’m willing to suffer this loss! No matter how many losses, I’ll take them all!”","“If your house has similar ‘trash,’ I’m willing to come and collect it,” Song Shuhang reminded.","“The ‘trash’ you big shots talk about isn’t trash at all. It’s wealth!”","“Do you think I’m like that eye fetish guy? My house is full of trash? Other than real treasures, there’s nothing else in my house! I’m a clean dragon,” Striped Dragon Two said calmly, burning the freshly fried tea leaves in the trash can into ashes with its dragon breath.","The ‘trash’ in its house? Non-existent!","After cleaning the trash can, Striped Dragon Two sent Song Shuhang a message: “What’s the deal with your fake Song Youyou? I can feel that you’ve utilized some power related to me?”","“In simple terms, Senior White Two was tired and wanted to sleep, so he gave me some of the Netherworld Ruler’s authority. And because of a series of coincidences, the fake Netherworld Ruler, Song Youyou, was born within me. In my country’s terms, I’m now a temporary Netherworld Ruler,” Song","Shuhang replied. “I just used the monitoring function of the Netherworld Realm to check its current situation and manage the demons there. I didn’t expect it would involve you and the Three-Eyed senior.”","“You? Managing the Netherworld Realm? A temporary Netherworld Ruler?” Striped Dragon Two fell silent for a moment before suddenly asking, “Need any help?”","After stepping down from the position of Netherworld Ruler for so long, he suddenly began to miss the Netherworld a little.."]},{"number":2570,"title":"Chapter 2570: Not Quite the Right Field","paragraphs":["Chapter 2570: Not Quite the Right Field","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Dragons, as they aged, often found themselves lost in memories of the past.","Striped Dragon Two, corresponding to the third Celestial Dao, had been away from the Netherworld Realm for far too long... so long that it had almost forgotten what the Netherworld Realm looked like.","It was precisely because of this that the sudden transmission of information about the current state of the Netherworld Realm from Song Shuhang had thrown it off balance, even causing it to accidentally knock over the immortal tea it was brewing.","But now, with Song Shuhang as the temporary ruler of the Netherworld, perhaps it could revisit its old stomping grounds.","With the Heavenly Dao collapsing and the new Heavenly Dao yet to emerge, it was a rare opportunity.","At the thought, Striped Dragon Two was intrigued.","“Help? Senior, you want to assist me in managing the Netherworld Realm?” Song Shuhang asked.","Striped Dragon Two responded, “Yes, if you have any questions about managing the Netherworld Realm, I can lend a hand. After all, I once held sway as a ruler of the Netherworld, so I’m quite familiar with the business.”","“If you’re willing to help me, Senior, I certainly welcome it with open arms,” Song Shuhang replied. “But 1 must say upfront... I don’t have the funds to pay you for your assistance, Senior.”","The cost of enlisting the help of a ruler of the Netherworld Realm was too steep. Song Shuhang knew he definitely couldn’t afford it. Well, except for Senior White Two, who sometimes lent a hand for just a joke.","“No need for payment, and there’s not much about you that catches my eye anyway,” Striped Dragon Two scoffed. “If I’m feeling generous, I might even throw in a few karmic favors.’","A genuine smile spread across Song Shuhangs face. “Welcome, Senior Striped","Dragon, to offer your guidance.”","“Wait a moment. Let me see if I can utilize the power of Cheng Lin to project a portion of my consciousness to your side. Be careful not to hinder my consciousness projection later,” Striped Dragon Two replied via voice function this time.","Having carefully analyzed that Song Shuhangs temporary reign as ruler of the Netherworld borrowed power from Cheng Lin’s fragment, which was connected to its own, Striped Dragon Two realized it could potentially project its consciousness to the Netherworld through Song Shuhangs serene song.","“Welcome back to the Netherworld, Senior Striped Dragon,” Song Shuhang said with a faint smile, detecting a hint of urgency in Striped Dragon Two’s voice.","Atter all, the Netherworld Realm was Senior Striped Dragon Two’s old stomping grounds.","In the Netherworld, Song Four suddenly extended his hand and pointing towards the sky.","The White Dragon asked, “What’s up? Shuhang, what did you find?”","Song Four shook his head while replying with a serious expression, “It’s nothing. I’ll set up an antenna to receive the projection from another senior.” “Senior? Who?” Pavilion Master Chu asked while puzzled.","“It’s Senior Striped Dragon Two,” Song Four replied. “He’s offering to assist me in managing the Netherworld Realm. Since I lack experience in this area, having Senior Striped Dragon Two’s expertise for free is quite touching.” Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Song Shuhang had been entrusted with the responsibility of managing the Netherworld Realm by the current ruler and was now enlisting the help of several previous rulers for free labor. Song Shuhang certainly knew how to make the most of a situation.","Eventually, Song Four’s arm slightly lit up while revealing a dragon-shaped mark","Following that, the phantom of a one-legged striped dragon appeared behind Song Four, akin to a spell similar to Slow-Witted Songs Giant Skeleton.","After Striped Dragon Two appeared, it first surveyed its surroundings, then waved its dragon beard at everyone. “Hey there, folks. I’m Striped Dragon Two... Bah!”","Having been referred to as ‘Striped Dragon Two’ by Song Shuhang for so long, it had accepted the title without question.","“Senior Striped Dragon Two, please be mindful to conceal your aura. We don’t want to disturb Senior White Two’s slumber,” Song Four said sternly with a straight face,","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Glancing at Senior White Two, sleeping within the sealing pillar, it quietly restrained its aura to the lowest level. After all, Song Shuhangs temporary reign as ruler of the Netherworld was due to the slumbering White. If this White Ruler were to awaken, Song Shuhangs temporary authority would end and thwart its plans to return home.","After concealing its aura, Striped Dragon Two couldn’t help but steal a few more glances at White Two.","Ever since it had met with Sage Monarch White from the main world, Striped Dragon Two had gathered relevant information and even attempted to deduce the relationship between the White Ruler of the Netherworld and Sage White of the main world.","“After the collapse of the Eighth Celestial Dao, Ruler White, corresponding to the Seventh Celestial Dao and ruler of the Netherworld Realm, remained rooted in the Netherworld Realm. The schemes and methods of the Seventh Celestial Dao are truly terrifying,” Striped Dragon Two sighed.","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement. After all, Senior White was a special existence who was nearly transcendent.","“Let’s depart from the world of the black lotus and head to the Netherworld Realm. You should have already received information about the current state of the Netherworld Realm. Do you have any matters you wish to attend to? I’ll assist you from the sidelines,” Striped Dragon Two said.","“l have a few urgent matters to address,” Song Shuhang replied. “When I received the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, I’ve already wasted two days... We can’t afford further delay.”","“Tell me about them,” Striped Dragon Two said.","Song Shuhang continued, “Firstly, Senior, you should have received the information already. There’s a group of Netherworld demons attacking the passage between the Netherworld and the real world. They must have been instigated in secret, perhaps by the previous ruler of the Netherworld, Fat Ball. I want to pacify them.”","“Secondly, I need to choose a suitable area in the Netherworld Realm and establish it as the foundation for the Limitless Demon Sect’s plan to restore the Demon Sea Realm. We need to set up some contingencies so that when the","Limitless Demon Sect successfully opens the Demon Sea, we can ensure control of the sea remains in our hands.’","“Additionally, the incident involving some Xie Wang in the main world is also related to the Limitless Demon Sect. I want to see if I can mobilize a group of Netherworld demons to the main world to eliminate the Xie Wang. However, I’m concerned that once the Netherworld demons arrive in the main world, they may become uncontrollable and end up causing more trouble.”","The first task was relatively straightforward. With the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, managing a small group of demons in the Netherworld Realm wasn’t difficult.","The second task was more challenging. Selecting a suitable area in the Netherworld Realm and setting up contingencies... this task didn’t quite align with Song Shuhangs mechanical design major.","The third task could be accomplished through the ‘mission function.’ Controlling the movements of the demons after they arrived in the main world was the headache.","“Demon Sea? Someone wants to open up the Demon Sea in the Netherworld?”","Striped Dragon Two clenched its claw in a foul mood.."]},{"number":2571,"title":"Chapter 2571: Striped Dragon Two: Just a Dragon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2571: Striped Dragon Two: Just a Dragon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang didn’t expect the issue of the Limitless Demon Sect opening a ‘Demon Sea World’ in the Netherworld to infuriate Striped Dragon Two to such an extent. It seemed the Demon Sea World was even more troublesome than he had imagined.","“In that case, Senior, let’s hurry and pick out a prime location in the","Netherworld Realm for the Limitless Demon Sect and get this sorted out, shall we?” Song Shuhang proposed. Getting the Limitless Demon Sect settled sooner rather than later would put his mind at ease.","Striped Dragon Two’s whiskers stirred as it asked, “Are you trying to help the other party successfully establish a Demon Sea World!?”","“I’m not hiding anything, Senior. I plan to undergo my next tribulation in the Demon Sea World. I will use it to put an end to my sixth and final ‘public display of divinity,”‘ Song Shuhang answered truthfully.","Striped Dragon Two nodded slightly. “l underestimated you. Despite your appearance, you still possess some courage and wisdom to consider using the restored Demon Sea for your tribulation. Not bad.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He reached out to touch the expressionless face of Song Four — indeed, Striped Dragon Two was just a dragon. What did it know about human aesthetics?","A few moments later.","Striped Dragon Two began to calculate. “If you want to use that Demon Sect’s newly opened Demon Sea World for your tribulation, it’s best to place the Demon Sea coordinates closest to the Evil Lotus World. That way, even if something goes wrong later, we can use the Evil Lotus World to forcefully suppress or absorb the Demon Sea World.”","Plan for failure before planning for success, always leave an exit strategy.","With that said, Striped Dragon Two lightly tapped its whiskers, and a large three-dimensional map appeared in the air — the information Song Shuhang had gathered about the current state of the Netherworld Realm using the Netherworld Monitoring feature.","“We are currently located here,” Striped Dragon Two’s whiskers tapped on the map, indicating the coordinates of the Evil Lotus World and expanding the area. “Using this position as the center, you can select a coordinate in the surrounding area to set up a prime location for that Demon Sect.”","“It’s the Limitless Demon Sect,” Song Shuhang reminded the dragon. He combined the information in his mind and reached out to trace the edge of the Evil Lotus World.","Just one kilometer from the exit of the Evil Lotus World, there was an empty Sand Crystal World.","At this moment, in this Sand Crystal World, stood a familiar demon god pillar the one belonging to Senior More than One!","In other words, during the two days Senior White Two was asleep and meditating to receive the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, a disciple of the Limitless Demon Sect had risked their life to sneak into the","Netherworld Realm and coincidentally placed a demon god pillar in the Sand Crystal World!","The disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect didn’t nail down the Demon God Pillars here for fun—with a little speculation, it was easy to guess they must have used this place as coordinates to open up the Demon Sea World.","What a wonderful coincidence!","Song Shuhang had just thought of arranging a good place for the Limitless Demon Sect at the edge of the Evil Lotus World. However, the Limitless Demon Sect had already chosen a fantastic location on their own.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but marvel. “There’s a higher power at play.”","“Divine intervention? You still believe in that?” Striped Dragon Two scoffed. Song Shuhang was confused.","“Watch closely.” Striped Dragon Two continued tapping lightly on the Sand Crystal World.","The pattern of the Sand Crystal World was broken down layer by layer while revealing many hidden array patterns, spells, and containment methods at the bottom.","These array patterns and containment techniques were deeply hidden. Without the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, one would not be able to detect their existence!","Obviously, someone had set up a backup plan here long ago to attract the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect and set the coordinates with the Demon God Pillars.","“When did Senior White set up these things? Did you see Senior White Two go out and set up these formations, Sister White Dragon?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","“No,” the White Dragon shook her head. “Senior White hasn’t come out since sleeping inside the sealing pillar.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed-looking hair swayed slightly. “This is the","Netherworld Realm. Senior White is the master of the Netherworld Realm.","Perhaps he can do something similar in his dreams?”","“Setting up formations in a dream?” Song Shuhang looked at Senior White Two, who was sleeping soundly inside the sealing pillar.","“With the abilities of the ruler of the Netherworld, it’s not difficult to set up a trap in a dream. However, it will reduce the quality of sleep,” Striped Dragon Two said. “It seems like Senior White is also very interested in the restoration of the Demon Sea since he’s willing to sacrifice his sleep quality to set up a trap.”","“So, the matter of preparing the treasure land for the Limitless Demon Sect is completed just like that?” Song Shuhang said.","“Basically, it’s not a problem. However, to ensure the later part of the plan goes smoothly, you’d better go to that Feng Shui treasure land in advance and familiarize yourself with the hidden array. It’s best if you can use the Nine Nether Authority to adapt to that part of the array. Otherwise, you’ll be unable to control the hidden array patterns at the critical moment and lose the opportunity,” Senior Striped Dragon Two reminded.","“That makes sense. Let’s go to this Sand Crystal World and take a look, then.” Song Shuhang nodded.","The exit to the Evil Lotus World opened.","Senior White Two had already secretly opened a backdoor for the fat ball sealed by the Evil Lotus World.","Song Shuhang controlled Song Four to lead the way, followed by Striped Dragon Two, and the White Dragon, who was carrying the sleeping Su Clan’s Sixteen, at the back of the group.","“Oh, by the way, Striped Dragon Senior. What do you think of the hamster and gorilla sleeping in the Evil Lotus World earlier?” On the way to the Sand Crystal World, Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","“That gorilla’s level is about the same as yours,” Senior Striped Dragon Two calmly replied. “That demonic hamster is surprisingly powerful.” “What about the White Dragon?” Song Shuhang asked again. The White Dragon was confused. “Why am I suddenly involved?” “Not bad for a dragon,” Striped Dragon Two replied.","Song Shuhang asked, “Then what about the hair on my head?”","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","“What a beautiful strand of hair. She is the perfect combination of life and death. She’s withering and flourishing as one,” Striped Dragon Two replied.","Song Shuhang nodded with satisfaction and came to a conclusion. “As expected, Senior, you should pay more attention to the inner beauty of a person, and pay attention to the laws and Dao!”","Senior Striped Dragon Two did not understand beauty!"]},{"number":2572,"title":"Chapter 2572: Tentatively Titled: “Overlord Pillar”","paragraphs":["Chapter 2572: Tentatively Titled: “Overlord Pillar”","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“As long as you’re happy,” Senior Striped Dragon Two replied calmly. It chose not to continue the unproductive argument with Song Shuhang. Back in the Netherworld Realm, it preferred to spend its time admiring the scenery.","The air, the evil energy, and the chaos of the Netherworld all stirred a sense of nostalgia within.","“By the way, White Dragon, what exactly does your human form look like?” Song Shuhang inquired while recalling Senior Striped Dragon Two’s earlier comment about the White Dragon’s appearance being ‘pretty good for a dragon.’","After all, Senior Striped Dragon Two, being the former ruler of the","Netherworld, possessed vast knowledge. Coupled with its draconic nature, its judgment would naturally be more stringent when assessing a fellow dragon like the White Dragon.","Under such circumstances, its assessment of ‘pretty good’ could easily translate to top-tier dragon aesthetics.","“I don’t have a human form,” the White Dragon replied while rolling her eyes.","Song Shuhang paused for a moment before suddenly singing praise.","“Impressive, Slow-Witted Song!’","The White Dragon blinked in confusion.","“We’re here,” Pavilion Master Chu interjected gently. Her hair rotated softly while shielding Song Four and preventing the White Dragon from having a chance to swat him away.","At the same time, the White Dragon suddenly realized something.","“Senior Striped Dragon, how are we going to adapt to the formations beneath this Sand Crystal World?” Song Shuhang, already within the Sand Crystal World, gazed at the demon god pillar and inquired.","“Don’t rush... Remember, you’re now the proxy of the ruler of the Netherworld. You have the authority on your side. Within this Netherworld Realm, you’re an all-powerful plug-and-play interface. First, enter the location of the formation’s eye and activate the management function of the ruler of the Netherworld. Focus on adapting to the underground formations, and the ruler’s authority will gradually handle the rest,” Senior Striped Dragon Two explained.","The term ‘do as you wish’ wasn’t merely lip service.","“Where’s the formation core?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Can’t you see it? You can’t even discern such a simple formation core?” Senior Striped Dragon Two was surprised.","“Simple?” Song Shuhang scrutinized the layers of formations below that resembled a stack of complex mathematical equations without any discernible pattern. It was a dazzling sight—nothing like the scenes portrayed in movies, where the center of a formation plate was the focal point.","“My apologies for the interruption. I’ll take my leave!”","“How did you ascend to the pinnacle of the Seventh Stage, nearly reaching the","Eighth Stage Realm, yet struggle to understand such a basic formation?” Senior Striped Dragon Two’s dragon beard danced in disbelief. “You need some serious review! If you have the time, I’ll make sure to tutor you in formation knowledge.”","“Thank you, Senior. I promise to study diligently,” Song Shuhang replied with enthusiasm. The former ruler of the Netherworld teaching him formations firsthand was an opportunity not to be missed.","Not only did he intend to learn for himself, but he also planned to document the teachings for future disciples or share them in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“Listen to my instructions. Take three steps in the seven o’clock direction, then proceed five steps forward—that will lead you to the center of the formation. Let’s proceed,” Senior Striped Dragon Two instructed. “How much do you know about formations?”","“Uh...” Song Shuhang recollected. “I’ve probably finished reading the","Encyclopedia of Basic Five Elements Sealing Techniques and the Basic Illusionary Formation Layouts. At present, I’ve already mastered a simple basic illusion technique that allows me to conceal myself while flying on a sword. As for other formations, although I’ve read through them, I haven’t had the chance to experiment.”","Senior Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Its dragon whiskers extended, scratching its ears.","Was it hearing things?","Did it just hear two instances of ‘basic’ in a row?","“Basic formations? Basic illusions?” Senior Striped Dragon Two questioned him incredulously.","The White Dragon glanced skyward.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair also spun awkwardly.","“Yes, that’s correct,” Song Shuhang controlled Song Four while replying in a modest yet assertive tone.","Senior Striped Dragon Two fell silent for a moment.","“l almost forgot that you’ve only been cultivating for eight months. Suddenly, I feel like you’ve stabbed me in the heart,” it remarked, its dragon whiskers coiling around its temples. “My apologies for nearly forgetting your short cultivation time—it feels like you’ve dealt me a blow.”","“Apologies?” Song Shuhang queried.","“I’m not teaching anymore!” Senior Striped Dragon Two declared. “You have limited time; focus on practicing your body-tempering technique and saber technique. Don’t worry about formations for now. First, strive for enlightenment, then take your time to learn through the ages.”","“Senior Striped Dragon, are you that confident in my potential for enlightenment?” Song Shuhang asked. The high expectations surprised him.","Senior Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","“However, Senior, I still have the means to study some ‘formations.’” Song Shuhang gestured toward the demon god pillar in the distance. “It’s not just the Demon Emperor’s ‘demon god pillar’; it’s a versatile demonic technique encompassing attack, defense, illusion, healing, strengthening, sealing, and formations. Once I learn them, I might be able to set up formations with a mere wave of my hand in the future.”","Furthermore, Song Shuhang had another plan he hadn’t mentioned. Even if he couldn’t control the demon god pillar, he had 65 life-bound magical treasure spirits waiting to awaken.","If all 65 Artifact Spirits could be nurtured like the Artifact Spirit Fairy, he could choose one to specialize in array formations. He didn’t believe it wouldn’t be effective!","“The Demon God Pillar is a demonic cultivation technique which doesn’t suit you. Don’t dwell on it too much,” Senior Striped Dragon Two advised. “However, if you manage to obtain information about the creator of the demon god pillar cultivation technique and the idea behind its creation, I could modify it for you.”","As Song Shuhang and Senior Striped Dragon Two conversed, the cultivation chat Al Squirrel sent an urgent message: “[Overlord Administrator, you have an urgent new message. Please check it.]”","It was the first time the urgent new message notification had been activated.","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback. His consciousness entered the ‘cultivation chat,’ and he opened the new message.","It was a message from Madam Long Luo with an attachment.","Text:","[Notice: I have stayed up all night to complete the transformation of the","Demon God Pillar Divine Power. It is temporarily named the Overlord God Pillar. If you’re not satisfied with the name, you can change it yourself. The attachment contains the simplified cultivation method of the “Overlord God","Pillar No. 1” and “Overlord God Pillar No. 2.” Please download it and take a ?good look.]","[P.S. 1: The Demon God’s Inherited Demon God Pillar will be left with me for the time being. It will be used to develop the Overlord God Pillar No. 3 and other series. However, I’ve been very busy recently, so the update of this series of cultivation techniques will take time. Don’t rush me.]","[P.S. 2: Please abide by the agreement after cultivating the “Overlord God Pillar No. 1” and show the divine power of the “Overlord God Pillar” in front of the Demon Emperor. Please try your best to use vulgar words to hurt him psychologically..]"]},{"number":2573,"title":"Chapter 2573: Oversimplification!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2573: Oversimplification!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","That’s why he couldn’t easily offend women in the martial world, especially women with excellent memory, means, strength, connections, and a willingness to stay up all night!","To strike at the Demon Emperor, Madam Long Luo had toiled for three consecutive nights and forcefully transformed the “Demon God Pillar” into the “Overlord God Pillar.” Her obsession was so firm that it made the Demon Emperor silently weep!","She kept throwing tantrums just to let Song Shuhang play with the No. 1 pillar she had developed in front of the Demon Emperor to prick his mind while attacking his mind with some flirtatious words. It could be said that this was just child’s play.","For this kind of childish counterattack, Madam Long Luo was willing to go all out for three nights. One could imagine that if she could seize a bigger opportunity to make the Demon Emperor cry bitterly and wish he were dead, she would definitely be willing to pay a bigger price. For example, the liver could last for ten days to half a month, or even eight to ten years.","“No problem. I’m best at pricking Senior’s inner thoughts,” Song Shuhang replied.","Song Shuhang knew a thing or two about accurately piercing the heart... After being sick for a long time, he became a good doctor. After being stabbed in the heart by the pendants on his body, Song Shuhang also grasped the essence of talking the offensive.","After he finished cultivating the Overlord God Pillar No. 1, he could take a video and send it to Senior More than One.","He had already thought of the lines for the video, “It’s not just senior, I’m going to show you a treasure today.” What is this? A cute demon god pillar.","But now, it’s not called the Demon God Pillar anymore. It’s called the Overlord","God Pillar No. 1. After a while, I can also create its younger brother, the Overlord God Pillar No. 2. Also, the Overlord God Pillar No. 3 has already entered the preparatory stage and may meet everyone at any time. At that time, wherever the Tyrant God Pillar is inserted, it will be Tyrannical Songs country","Song Shuhang had always felt that the Demon Emperor’s line was cool, and now, it was also his line!","However, for the time being, he only thought of one line. He still had to consult the Heart Devil Scarlet Heaven Sword, the black- skinned Soft Feather, and the other accessories that were good at piercing his heart.","His goal was to create a 3,000-word collection of vulgar words to fulfill Madam Long Luo’s wish.","After all, Madam Long Luo had spent three whole nights in a frenzy, so his words had to be worthy of Madam Long Luffs efforts.","“When the time comes, give me access. I’ll watch,” Lady Long Luo replied to Song Shuhang in a concise manner. She was really busy, so busy that she didn’t have the time to communicate with Song Shuhang.","However, no matter how busy and tired she was, she still wanted to watch from the side when Song Shuhang pierced the Demon Emperor’s heart. She wanted to see how the Demon Emperor was stimulated.","Not only did the Demon Emperor bring her harm, she wanted to return it tenfold!","“Deal!” Song Shuhang replied.","“I’m busy. Bye,” Madam Long Luo replied.","The call ended.","Song Shuhang used it to control part of Song Four’s mind.","“You were distracted again. Were you receiving any messages?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze. She was rooted in Song Four’s skull, so she could sense some deep information through the subtle changes in the temperature of his skull.","Even if Song Shuhang was wearing a mask, and even if Song Four didn’t have a cold face, his pendants still had many ways to read Song Shuhangs internal information.","“Yes, I just received an urgent attachment from Miss Long Luo,” Song Shuhang replied.","Then, with a thought, he opened the ‘attachment’ message sent by Madam Long Luo.","Overlord God Pillar No. 1: Pillar technique No. 1 was an improvement of the original Demon God Pillar Technique basic pillar technique. It condensed an “attribute-less” Overlord God Pillar. Its main use was to smash people or to become a part of the ‘Overlord God Pillar formation.","Not only were the Demon God Pillars ‘offensive, defensive, illusionary, healing, strengthening, sealing, array formations, and other functions derived from this attribute-less Demon God Pillar.","Only after mastering this neutral pillar would one be able to use it as a foundation to develop offensive, defensive, and healing demon god pillars.","“Eh? I thought that as long as I learned the Overlord God Pillar, I would be able to immediately transform it into pillars with various functions. It turned out that the various attributes of the various pillars still needed to wait for the subsequent versions to be developed... However, that’s right. You have to take things one step at a time. There’s nothing wrong with that.” Song Shufang thought to himself.","He then clicked on the details of Overlord God Pillar No. 2.","According to Young Master Hai r s research, Lady Long Luo had made the Overlord God Pillar No. 2 no longer bound to the original Demon God Pillar of the Demon God Emperor. This had given it the potential to evolve. In the future, after Song Shuhang had familiarized himself with the Overlord God Pillar, he would be able to modify it to make it more suitable for him.","In addition, in Young Master Hai l s research, there was a portion of speculation and calculations about using Xie Wangs as a material to make Demon God Pillars. However, due to Young Master Hai r s lack of cultivation knowledge and theory, he couldn’t complete the deduction.","Long Luo’s realm, knowledge, and understanding of demon god pillars far surpassed Young Master Hai’s. She worked hard for three nights and completed Young Master Hai r s unfinished research in one go. Moreover, the raw materials were not limited to Xie Wangs.","All existences that were similar to evil, such as ‘spirit bodies’, or even huge energy collections, could become the raw materials for Overlord God Pillar 2. A pillar with a special function was condensed.","For example, using fire-attribute Xie Wang could condense the fire-attribute Overlord God Pillar.","The only flaw was that the power of the Overlord God Pillar No. 2 would be limited by the level of the raw materials. If the grade of the raw materials was too low, it would be very difficult to condense a powerful Overlord God Pillar. Perhaps the power of the pillar that he had painstakingly condensed would only be a little stronger than the Overlord God Pillar No. 1.","But correspondingly, if one had extremely powerful raw materials, one could also condense a powerful Overlord God Pillar No. 2. However, it was important to note that if the caster’s realm was not high enough, but he forcefully condensed the powerful Overlord God Pillar No. 2, it was very easy to cause","the pillar to bite back. After all, it was a product improved by the secret technique of the Demon Sect. It was inevitable that some of the characteristics of the Demon Sect’s cultivation techniques were inevitable.","“The name Overlord God Pillar... It’s not bad. It’s at least better than Basic Fist Number One. I won’t change it.” Song Shuhang laughed.","Most importantly, Madam Long Luo knew his talent for magic. The details she sent over were simplified cultivation techniques!","Long live the simplified version!","Although it wasn’t as simple as Senior White’s Lightning Palm, which could be directly used by drawing a rune, the cultivation method of the Overlord God Pillar was already within the scope of Song Shuhangs comprehension and mastery.","“Overlord God Pillar? Is this what Madam Long Luo sent you?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","Song Shuhang laughed, and said, “That’s right. It’s more than just a simplified version of Senior’s Demon God Pillar.’ Striped Dragon Two was confused.."]},{"number":2574,"title":"Chapter 2574: The World Of Geniuses","paragraphs":["Chapter 2574: The World Of Geniuses","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Striped Dragon Two was dumbfounded. “Wait, what happened when I was distracted just now?”","Did the timeline change or jump without my knowledge?","Just a while ago, Striped Dragon Two was still telling Song Shuhang that if he could get the information of the creator of the demon god pillar cultivation technique and the idea of creating it, it could help Song Shuhang improve the Demon God Pillar Cultivation Technique and make it a version that Song Shuhang could learn.","How could Song Shuhang suddenly take out a modified version of the Demon God Pillar Technique, the Overlord God Pillar while he was distracted?","How had it been simplified to such an extent?","Striped Dragon Two checked the time... It had not transmigrated!","It stared at Song Shuhang in dumbfounded silence while pondering the cause and effect of the matter. How did the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar suddenly appear?","“I’ll learn it first. If the effect of the Overlord God Pillar is good and it’s easy to learn, 1 can teach it to the others,” Song Shuhang said happily. Unfortunately, Song Four’s expression remained neutral and failed to convey his joy.","If the effect of the Overlord God Pillar could reach the expected level, then there was no doubt that the cultivation technique would become the heirloom of his Tyrannical Song lineage!","This was a divine ability that could allow one to directly use it at the Immortal level.","Together with Senior White Two’s Telekinesis technique, True Heavenly Roc’s Escape Technique, and the four body-tempering divine techniques, the embryonic form of the legacy of Tyrannical Songs lineage was formed!","He ran fast when he was scared, had a strong physique when he was fighting, had no spells but the omnipotent Telekinesis, and when necessary, the all-purpose Overlord God Pillar could attack, defend, and heal.","In addition, Song Shuhang was born with the Inner World, which was a mobile small world that served as the sect’s base.","‘It shouldn’t be a problem for my Tyrannical Song lineage to establish a sect.’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","“You want to learn the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar here, now? Why don’t you find the formation core first and match it with the formation patterns under this sand crystal world?” the White Dragon reminded.","Don’t forget the main mission!","“Sister White Dragon, don’t panic. The process of matching the array patterns under the sand crystal world is already in progress. I just need to stand here and not move,” Song Shuhang explained with a smile.","The entire matching process was fully automated under the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. He only needed to stand still like a salted fish and wait for the array patterns to adapt to him and complete synchronization with him.","“So, while I’m still adapting, I can try out the cultivation process of the Overlord God Pillar No.l first. Moreover, I have a feeling that if I can grasp the cultivation method of the Overlord God Pillar, it will be helpful for my next plan. Perhaps, at a crucial moment, I can use the Overlord God Pillar to replace all the demon god pillars that the Limitless Demon Sect needs in their plan,” Song Shuhang explained.","The White Dragon was speechless.","The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld really allowed him to do whatever he wanted.","“Oh right, Senior Chu, you should perk up a little,” Song Shuhang said.","Pavilion Master Chu was stunned.","“l want to wear a piece of equipment that will help me learn.” Song Shuhang controlled Song Four and stretched out his hand to open the Inner World while taking out a wisdom crown made of thorns.","This was a magic tool that was compatible with the Endurance Throne of Pain. It used the power of pain to bring wisdom.","After wearing this Crown of Thorns, while suffering, it could enhance the wearer’s learning ability, whether it was learning ancient languages or learning spells.","Song Shuhang raised the crown and stuck it on Song Four’s bald head.","After putting it on, Song Shuhang felt as if his head had turned cold, and he had become much more clear-headed. In fact, this was just the feeling of the ice-cold crown of thorns stuck on Song Four’s bald head.","In addition, he had all sorts of big boss pendants on him, and all of them had the effect of strengthening the Dao Comprehension Stone. More importantly, he now had the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, so he could do whatever he wanted in the Netherworld Realm.","With all kinds of special effects, Song Shuhangs learning ability had reached its peak today!","He solemnly opened the learning method of Overlord God Pillar No, 1 and browsed through it from beginning to end. He began to analyze its spell principles in his mind, construct the spell structure, calculate the spiritual power consumption of casting the spell, and the amount of spiritual awareness required to cooperate.","This kind of straight-A student state that he could understand and learn at a glance was unforgettable.","After the simplified version of the Tyrannical Divine Pillar No. 1, Song Shuhang quickly understood and grasped it.","Under the guidance of the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, Song Shuhangs potential was completely developed.","He closed his eyes and began to simulate the casting process of the Overlord God Pillar No. 1 in his mind, repeating it several times.","“Success!” Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","“Theoretically, I should have mastered it!” Song Shuhang nodded.","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and began to simulate the casting process of the ” No. 1 Overlord Pillar ” in his mind, trying to condense it in reality.","The spell model was successfully constructed, and the prototype of the Overlord God Pillar began to condense.","Everything went smoothly.","Striped Dragon Two, who was behind Song Shuhang, stared at the process of Song Shuhangs execution and evaluated the improved pillar.","“It’s at least an improvement on the level of a ruler of the Netherworld. Although the improvement of the entire Demon God Pillar is rather crude, there’s still room for modification and improvement.”","It felt like some hard-working ruler of the Netherworld had worked overtime to improve the Demon God Pillars cultivation technique for Song Shuhang.","“Come out! Overlord God Pillar No. 1!” Song Shuhang lightly shouted and increased his aura. When he first cast the technique, shouting the name of the technique would help to increase the effect of the technique.","In the next moment, a pitch-black pillar appeared in front of Song Shuhang.","This was the most basic, attribute-less Overlord God Pillar. However, because Song Four was the representative of the ruler of the Netherworld, the originally colorless and odorless Overlord God Pillar was dyed black. The White Dragon was a little surprised. “You succeeded in one try?”","“Song Shuhangs talent is unexpectedly outstanding when practicing simplified magical techniques.” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair swayed slightly.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet added, “In addition... I suspect that Song Shuhang is using the ‘Tyrant God Pillar’ as the Tyrannical Saber Technique. After imagining the pillar as a saber, his inexplicable saber talent will be activated.” For example, the integration of the stele and saber.","While they were talking, the Overlord God Pillar in front of Song Shuhang finally took shape.","It suddenly collapsed.","The outer cylindrical shell shattered and revealed a Ghost Head Blade that was more than ten meters tall.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.."]},{"number":2575,"title":"Chapter 2575: Should We Summon the Overlord God Pillar No. 2 Golden Dragon Pillar?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2575: Should We Summon the Overlord God Pillar No. 2 Golden Dragon Pillar?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","What’s up with this Ghost Head Blade?","This isn’t a pillar at all, but a ten-meter-long sword!","“Tsk, see, it’s indeed a sword,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said calmly—it knew that Song Shuhangs quick mastery of the spell must have been related to the sword.","Besides swordsmanship, the only thing he could learn so quickly was body tempering techniques.","The White Dragon turned to Song Shuhang in frustration. “So, the real name of the Overlord God Pillar should be the Overlord God Sword? After all this fuss, it’s still swordsmanship.”","“It pricked my lungs, Sister White Dragon,” Song Shuhang said despairingly while looking at the Ghost Head Blade Overlord Divine Pillar.","‘Why was this happening?","‘l already understood all the structure of the Overlord God Pillar spell, and I’ve simulated the casting process several times in my mind.","‘Why did it turn into the Overlord God Sword when I used it?","‘No choice, I have to contact Madam Long Luo and ask her what’s going on.","‘Unfortunately, Madam Long Luo is super busy now, and she doesn’t have time to answer my questions. Plus, after three days of intense liver activities, Madam Long Luo needs a short break.’","At the same time, behind Song Shuhang... Striped Dragon Two remained silent.","The simplified and improved version of the Demon God Pillar was one thing, but after the simplified and improved version of the Demon God Pillar passed to Song Shuhang, he still learned it as he wished. This wasn’t just a small technique like the Lightning Palm, but a secret technique that could be used all the way to the Immortal Realm.","No matter how many cheats Song Shuhang had, theoretically, he shouldn’t understand and grasp it so quickly.","Unless... Song Shuhang had already come into contact with the inheritance of the Demon Emperor? Or perhaps, he had obtained a will inheritance item like the ‘Pillar Intent’ of the demon god pillar?","Considering that Song Shuhang knew someone obsessed with eyes, it wasn’t strange for him to obtain the ‘will inheritance item’ from the other Dartv.","Inside the wooden door behind the Throne of Wealth.","In the sky, the warm sunlight illuminated the world.","The three-eyed youth held a cup of fragrant tea with both hands and gently took a sip while letting out a satisfied sigh.","“Master, are you in a good mood today?” The eyeball butler asked.","“Well, seeing an annoying guy being ruthlessly stabbed in the heart by","Tyrannical Song, I’m in a very good mood,” the three-eyed youth nodded.","That one-legged dragon finally experienced the pain of being stabbed in the heart by little friend Tyrannical Song.","When a person fell into a pit and his opponent was above the pit, he would be very anxious. And if his opponent also fell into the pit, then joy would involuntarily surface.","“Pierce its heart. Pierce this one-legged dragon’s heart into a thousand holes. Don’t pity it just because it has a beautiful ghost spirit daughter,” the three-eyed youth smiled as he cheered.","Just like Striped Dragon Two, Song Shuhangs Song Four had fused with the power of the divine third eye when it was condensed. Thus, the three-eyed youth was able to use his divine third eye to secretly attach a tiny bit of his consciousness to Song Four’s body, allowing him to return to his old place and silently admire the scenery of the Netherworld Realm, feeling the aura of the Netherworld Realm that he had not felt for a long time.","While they were revisiting the old place, they could also see the one-legged dragon being stabbed in the heart... This was double the joy.","If there was a chance, it could even apply to Song Shuhang for the right to project its power into the Netherworld and deal Striped Dragon Two a heavy physical blow.","Unable to reach Madam Long Luo on the phone, Song Shuhang could only temporarily give up.","He stretched out his hand, and not far away, the ten-meter-tall Ghost Head Blade Overlord God Pillar shattered with a loud bang and disappeared.","Seeing Song Shuhang seeming a bit disappointed, Striped Dragon Two comforted him. “Cheng Lin, appearance is just a form. There’s no difference between a blade- shaped and a pillar-shaped Overlord Divine Pillar. In fact, the blade- shaped Overlord Divine Pillar is even more exquisite in shape, isn’t it?”","“l see,” Song Shuhang trusted Senior Striped Dragon’s speculation.","At this time, Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze, “Speaking of which, there’s a number one in the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar. Is there a number two?”","“That’s right. There’s also the Overlord God Pillar No. 2. It’s an advanced spell model that can only be learned after mastering the basic Overlord God Pillar secret technique,” Song Shuhang nodded, giving a simple description of the second pillar.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood on end after listening to the description. She then said, “The second pillar can be made of evil or something similar to evil, as well as spirit bodies or energy clusters? Then should we try it right away?”","After saying that, Pavilion Master Chu pointed at the White Dragon. “Look, she’s also a powerful energy collective. Fellow Daoist White Scarf met all the requirements for the raw materials of the Overlord God Pillar No.2. Why not let her sacrifice herself and contribute her body to see if she could transform into a Overlord God Pillar? I’ve even thought of a name for the pillar—it’ll be called the Dominating God Pillar’s Golden Dragon Pillar!”","In any case, Fairy White Scarf was the same as Fairy Virtue. Even if she died once, as long as Su Clan’s Sixteen was fine, she could be reborn in Sixteen’s body after a while.","“Stupid Hair, if that’s the case, don’t you still have Chu Two’s clone? Your Chu Two clone is also very suitable to become a raw material, right?” The White Dragon retorted.","“I feel that the virtuous lamia is also very suitable to become a raw material,” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said.","Sword was speechless.","It wisely remained silent.","“However, I thought of something even better.” After saying this much, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and took out many scales from his Inner World-King Kun’s scales.."]},{"number":2576,"title":"Chapter 2576: I Want to Build a Series of Fine Grade Pillars","paragraphs":["Chapter 2576: I Want to Build a Series of Fine Grade Pillars","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This is the scale that was smashed down by Fairy White Bones during the battle with King Kun.","After the battle ended, the virtuous lamia put away these scales and treated them as spoils of war and storing them in Song Shuhangs Inner World.","Considered high-energy composites, each scale of King Kun contained a tremendous amount of energy. Even without refinement into a magical tool, simply wielding it could cause immense destruction.","Moreover, King Kun’s main body, the ‘King Kun Egg,’ was still in the Netherworld Realm, in Senior White Two’s treasure vault. By invoking the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and using the scales of King Kun as raw materials, it might be possible to draw out the power of King Kun’s main body and create a powerful pillar.","“Can this thing be used? Although these scales are considered energy composites, aren’t they essentially physical objects?” Pavilion Master Chu felt a bit resentful and continued to recommend the white dragon to Song Shuhang. “l think it’s better to use the scarf, Fellow Daoist. After all, she won’t die. Moreover, her realm, her Dao, and her quality are far superior to King Kun’s. The power condensed from her must be extraordinary!’","White Dragon bared her sharp teeth at Pavilion Master Chu. “Shuhang, open the Inner World. I want to enter the living spring and pull out this fool.” Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","A moment later, Pavilion Master Chu suddenly cowered and stopped provoking the White Dragon.","It wasn’t that she was afraid of the White Dragon.","Although she had only attained immortality last year, in fact, in ancient times, she was already in a state where she could step out of her Great Dao at any time. However, because of Slow-Witted Songs instructions, she had never attained immortality.","From ancient times until now, although she had not taken the final step, her strength had steadily increased. If they really had to fight, she really wasn’t afraid of the veteran Immortal Ancestral Golden Dragon.","However, it was really inconvenient for her to come out of the living spring at the moment.","She also wanted to continue provoking the White Dragon, but her body wouldn’t allow it.","When the White Dragon saw Pavilion Master Chu’s sudden cowardice, she was slightly stunned for a moment, but she quickly thought of the reason.","“Shuhang, what do you think comes after ‘the head and the crisp’?” The White Dragon asked cheerfully.","Song Shuhang didn’t even turn his head, and subconsciously replied, “Rainbow kidney. ”","The White Dragon was dumbfounded.","Why didn’t you answer according to the routine? Can’t you cooperate and answer me at this time?","“Heh Q’ The sword couldn’t help but laugh.","While the White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu were bickering, Song Shuhang had roughly grasped the technique of the Overlord God Pillar No. 2. Similarly, under the enhancement of the Brainiac Mode, he first analyzed the cultivation technique in his mind and simulated the casting process several times.","The final step.","Song Shuhang pressed his hands on the several pieces of King Kun’s scales and began to cast a spell.","“Come out, Overlord God Pillar...two!” Song Shuhang lightly shouted. The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld was activated.","The scales of King Kun in his hand were quickly disintegrated. Under the effect of the Overlord God Pillar No. 2 cultivation technique, the scales of King Kun began to grow taller and vaguely began to transform into a huge pillar that was nearly 40 meters long.","Different from the bald Overlord God Pillar No. 1, many delicate scales appeared on the Overlord God Pillar No. 2. At the tip of the pillar, there was a statue of a giant Kun. Its mouth was wide open, as if it wanted to devour everything.","Moreover, Song Shuhangs guess was correct. At the same time that the second divine pillar was condensed, due to the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, the pillar was vaguely connected to the King Kun egg sealed by Senior White Two, and it wanted to extract a portion of the original energy from the egg.","“What is this? Don’t even think about it. Don’t even think about extracting my power from me,” King Kun’s terrified cry came from the egg.","However, the ruler of the Netherworld can do whatever he wants. No matter how much the King Kun egg resisted, it was futile.","A small part of its original energy was extracted by the ruler of the","Netherworld and merged into Song Shuhangs “Overlord God Pillar No. 2.” At this point, the pillar was formed!","After fusing with King Kun’s power, the Overlord God Pillar seemed to have been bestowed with a soul. The entire pillar seemed to be coming alive!","More importantly... It was cylindrical and did not change shape! Looking at its exquisite and sturdy scales, it wasn’t like the Overlord God Pillar that easily shattered.","“Your name is therefore Kun King Pillar!” Song Shuhang said in satisfaction. He raised his right hand and clenched it into a fist. “Overlord Pillar, Longevity Pillar Series: Kun King Pillar!”","The Kun King Pillar was the first Overlord God Pillar No. 2, and it was at the level of the Longevity Pillar. However, it definitely wouldn’t be the last.","Song Shuhang decided to divide the pillars into the Longevity Pillar, the Tribulation Transcender Pillar, and the Profound Sage Pillar.","Those below the level of the Profound Sage Pillar were not qualified to become the raw material of the second pillar.","“Number 2 Overlord God Pillar, I must walk the fine route in the future!” Song Shuhang said heroically.","The black- skinned Soft Feather couldn’t help but remind him, “Senior Song, you’re too arrogant.”","“Eh?” Song Shuhang was startled.","This was bad. For a moment just now, his mentality had indeed unknowingly inflated! He was just a Seventh Stage Venerable, yet he still wanted to collect the Longevity Pillar series and the Tribulation Transcender Pillar series.","At this moment, Striped Dragon Two finally spoke up, “Little girl, don’t worry about it. This is a normal phenomenon.” Just now, the Unpretty Airboat used the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld continuously without any interval. It will definitely be affected by the will of the Netherworld.”","The ruler of the Netherworld was not a synonym for kindness. It was the evilest, fiercest, and most opposite.","To be honest, after using the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld repeatedly, Song Shuhang’s mentality had only become a little inflated, which was already beyond the expectations of Big Boss Striped Dragon Two.","Although he had only cultivated for eight months, he had to admit that Song Shuhangs indomitable will was incredible.","Considering Song Shuhangs strange ability to withstand pain... Does pain really make a man grow? It seems to make sense?","“Using the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld still produces such negative effects?” Song Shuhang withdrew his fist. “This is a kind of tempering for my own mentality and will.”","After a moment of contemplation, the black- skinned Soft Feather nodded slightly. “l believe you’ll be able to adapt to it very soon, Senior Song.” Song Shuhangs adaptability was superb.","Back when the black- skinned Soft Feather and the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword had just become Song Shuhangs pendants, he would still be affected by the Heart Demon from time to time and caused him to die from time to time.","However, after a long time, Song Shuhang got used to this state. He was now able to rationally die while maintaining a cautious state!","Therefore, she believed that Senior Song would soon be able to overcome the influence of the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld.","“Thank you for your trust, Black Skin Soft Feather.” Song Shuhang faintly smiled and stretched out his hand at the Kun King Pillar.","Rustle","The Kun Pillar started to shake.","A moment later, the Kun King Pillar was suddenly pulled up and flew toward Song Shuhang. The flaw of the high-quality Overlord God Pillar was that if the caster’s realm was not high enough and was unable to subdue the pillar, the pillar would rebel!","“Good timing.” Song Shuhang laughed. He rubbed his hands together, and an evil light flashed.."]},{"number":2577,"title":"Chapter 2577: I’m Just Looking, Nothing Else","paragraphs":["Chapter 2577: I’m Just Looking, Nothing Else","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Song Shuhang started rubbing his hands together, the sword, hanging at his waist, immediately became restless.","However, to the surprise of Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, when facing the incoming Pillar of Longevity: Kun King Pillar, Song Shuhang didn’t use the Sword Nurturing Technique.","Instead, he casually swept his sleeve. “Spatial Technique!’","Whoosh","The nearly forty-meter-long Kun King Pillar was instantly tucked away into Song Shuhang’s sleeve.","“Finally, I managed to pull it off!” Song Shuhang felt relieved. It was as if he had just enjoyed a cold soda on a hot summer day.","A few days ago, he had wanted to show off in front of his parents, but Fairy Creation had stolen his thunder. He had been frustrated until now, and now he finally let out a sigh of relief.","“Spatial technique, and this time it’s not relying on any external help, but his own spatial technique.” Striped Dragon Two affirmed in his mind.","Although there’s a saying that goes: “After three days of separation, you would view the world differently.”","But these three days were too accurate, weren’t they?","After a moment of contemplation, Striped Dragon Two suddenly said, “This must be the fault of that eye fetish guy.”","Black- skinned Soft Feather looked at Striped Dragon Two in confusion.","“It’s nothing. I was just cursing casually.” Striped Dragon Two smiled at Black- skinned Soft Feather.","Black- skinned Soft Feather obediently nodded and half of her body disappeared into Song Shuhangs shadow.","On the side, White Dragon said to Song Shuhang, “Your spatial technique won’t hold up for long, right? What’s your next move?” The Kun Pillar is a Pillar of Longevity, it will be bound by the Spatial","Technique for a short time, but it will soon break free.","“Now that it’s fallen into my sleeve, its fate is sealed,” Song Shuhang said. He was trying to keep calm but was unable to suppress the swelling in his heart.","As long as he caught it, there was only one course of action left—take it down!","As he spoke, he used his psychic power to lift the wide cuff of his sleeve, pressing his hands on the sleeve to hold down the Kun King Pillar. Then, the Sword Nurturing Technique, which had been ready to go, burst into light!","Because Song Four was the proxy of the ruler of the Netherworld, the light of the Sword Nurturing Technique took on a dark evil color.","Swish, swish, swish. Everyone saw Song Shuhangs hands moving at supersonic speed.","Sparks flew.","Every second, nearly 100 shots of the Sword Nurturing Technique slid out of Song Shuhang’s palms and acted on the Kun King Pillar.","Had this new Overlord God Pillar ever experienced such a scenario?","After all, back then, Song Shuhang’s hands had released the Sword Nurturing Technique 30 times in a row, allowing the divine Immortal weapon, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, to enjoy supreme massage pleasure.","The joy of being tempered and massaged from top to bottom was something that no living being could experience.","If the 30 consecutive shots of the Sword Nurturing Technique had such power, the effects of the 100 consecutive shots of the Sword Nurturing Technique were even more indescribable.","Unfortunately, Song Four was bald and couldn’t use the Braiding Technique. Otherwise, the effects of the Sword Nurturing Technique could have been increased by about 20 times.","Four seconds later, Song Shuhangs sleeve exploded.","The clothes weren’t magical treasures, so they couldn’t withstand the high-frequency friction between Song Shuhang and them.","After the sleeve exploded, the effect of Song Shuhangs Spatial Technique was also affected and exploded a few seconds later.","The forty-meter-long Kun King Pillar finally escaped from Song Four’s grasp.","The massive pillar fell to the ground, but it couldn’t maintain its upright posture. Instead, it trembled and fell to the ground, slowly rolling twice and falling into a stiff state.","Song Shuhang coolly waved his hands, expressionless, giving orders to the Kun King Pillar.","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, the Kun King Pillar rolled twice again before slowly but firmly standing up from the ground.","At this moment, the image of the Kun King Pillar was reminiscent of those main characters in big action movies who would never fall to the ground despite being shot several times. Even though it had been shot several times, it still managed to get up slowly and firmly, eliciting tears from the audience.","“I’m tearing up,” said the sword. “What about you guys?”","“It’s deeply moving. This scene is the most tear-jerking I’ve seen this year,” commented Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet seriously.","Song Shuhang said coldly, “Seniors, don’t make a scene. If you also want the","Sword Nurturing Technique, I’ll give it to you later. But let me take a breather. My palms are a bit hot, so let me cool them down first.”","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Why did it sound so strange when it was clearly an auxiliary spell meant for swordsmen or saber cultivators to cultivate their feelings with their swords or sabers in order to achieve the state of ‘one with the sword’?","“Very good, rise!” Song Shuhang raised his right hand and said in a deep voice.","With a swoosh, the Kun King Pillar rose from the ground.","In the next moment, a dazzling sword light flashed. The sharp sword light, accompanied by a dense chill, enveloped everyone present.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Where did the sword light come from? It was so pretentious and dazzling!","He narrowed his eyes and looked over, only to see... A roughly forty-meter-long nine-ringed sword suspended in the air. The cold sword qi and the sharp edge of the sword emitted an aura that made Song Shuhangs image collapse.","The originally handsome Kun statue had now become a beautiful decoration on the hilt.","Song Shuhang looked down and saw that the outer shell of the Kun King Pillar, covered in scales, was still in place. It turned out that it wasn’t the pillar, but the sword case that hid the sword.","The main body of the Kun King Pillar was the nine-ringed sword of the Kun Beast floating in the void!","Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword seized the opportunity and fiercely stabbed his heart. Do you think that the Overlord God Pillar No. 2 is a pillar? You’re wrong, it’s still a sword!”","Song Shuhang flipped his hand and fired 100 shots of the Sword Nurturing Technique at Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword to shut it up.","“Return to the case!” Then, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and waved it.","The Kun Beast’s nine-ringed sword returned to the Kun King Pillar with a swoosh.","“Overall, it’s acceptable.” Song Shuhang nodded.","As long as the Kun Beast Nine-ringed Sword was not pulled out, it would be the Kun King Pillar. The nine-ringed sword hidden in the pillar could also play a trick at the critical moment.","In short, Song Shuhang was very satisfied.","With a thought, the Kun King Pillar spun and fused into his body. The Overlord God Pillar No. 1 was a basic pillar condensed from pure energy. If he didn’t use it, he could just scatter it. However, the second Overlord God Pillar was different. It was condensed from precious materials, so it naturally could not be easily scattered and disappeared. It had to be recycled repeatedly.","After putting away the Kun Pillar, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but look at the White Dragon. It must be the power of the ruler of the Netherworld that was affecting him!","The White Dragon felt goosebumps all over her body. “What are you looking at? If you keep looking, I’ll slap you.”","Song Shuhang smiled awkwardly. Then, he raised his head and boldly looked at Striped Dragon Two.","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.."]},{"number":2578,"title":"Chapter 2578: Showing You Something Good","paragraphs":["Chapter 2578: Showing You Something Good","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Striped Dragon Two could sense that the string of ‘reason’ in Song Shuhangs mind was on the verge of snapping and ready to plunge into a state of hopelessness at any moment.","“Do you know about the world’s first ghost spirit?” Striped Dragon Two said in a low, almost spooky tone, as if recounting a ghost story.","“I do,” Song Shuhang nodded. “It’s Fairy Cheng Lin.”","“Then do you know the process of creating a ghost spirit?” Striped Dragon Two continued.","After a moment of thought, Song Shuhang replied, “I’d rather not know.”","Striped Dragon Two was left speechless.","The conversation came to an abrupt end.","Striped Dragon Two’s whiskers twitched while it itched to give Song Shuhang a good thrashing.","“Senior, hold on a moment. The array patterns at the bottom of my Sand Crystal World are about to be matched!” Song Shuhang hurriedly interjected and halted Striped Dragon Two’s actions.","If described in data terms, his synchronization matching progress had already reached 99-9%.","“There won’t be a next time,” Striped Dragon Two warned. “Otherwise, I’ll make sure you experience the agony of soul severing... It’s a technique I devised after studying the process of creating ghost spirits.”","The true creator of Cheng Lin was the Wielder of the Will, Striped Dragon. Later, Striped Dragon Two had also delved into the creation of ghost spirits in order to piece Cheng Lin’s fragments back together.","Striped Dragon Two was well-versed in soul severing and reattachment. It was confident in its ability to slice a soul into small pieces and then reassemble them.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but shiver. The pain of the soul was even more unbearable than physical pain, and infinitely more despairing.","In his pain database, there was yet to be any experience related to ‘Soul Severing...","So?","“Bah, bah, bah,” Song Shuhang shook his head repeatedly.","This wasn’t the way to seek death.","Ten minutes later.","“Has the synchronization not succeeded yet?” asked White Dragon Sister, somewhat bored.","“It’s the final step, but this last step is taking forever,” Song Shuhang said helplessly.","The synchronization progress had already reached 99-9%, but the last 0.1% seemed reluctant to budge.","“Could it be that you overlooked something? Do you need to activate key items?” Pavilion Master Chu speculated.","After a moment of pondering, Song Shuhangs gaze fell upon the demon god pillar.","This demon god pillar exuded the aura of a senior. It should be a relic left behind by the Demon Emperor, passed down through generations until it ended up in the hands of the Limitless Demon Sect.","It was undoubtedly an antique worth a considerable amount of spirit stones! “Could it be because of this demon god pillar?” Song Shuhang speculated.","“It’s possible,” the White Dragon speculated.","Pavilion Master Chu was stunned.","“Let me try,” Song Shuhang said as he drew his sword and slashed at his right arm.","The blade cut through and caused Song Four’s right hand to fall off. However, there was no blood at the wound, as the connection between his right hand and his body remained intact.","“Go!” Song Shuhang used his telekinesis to lift his right hand and send it flying toward the Demon God Pillar of the Demon Emperor. His body remained rooted at the center of the formation, unable to move until the matching process was completed. Any movement would undo all his previous efforts.","Thud~","Song Four’s right hand pressed against the demon god pillar, and the Saber Nurturing Technique, prepared in advance, flashed.","The demon god pillar trembled slightly.","Then, this ancient demon god pillar instinctively relayed this information to its main body.","In a place whose coordinates were unknown even to himself, the Demon Emperor suddenly felt a sensation.","“Is it the demon god pillar I left behind long ago, relaying information?” Not only did the Demon Emperor not take this matter seriously.","Back then, he had left behind numerous demon god pillars, some of which he had long abandoned.","Over the years, some demon god pillars had been destroyed, while others would occasionally be activated to send back information.","Not only would the Demon Emperor occasionally pay attention when he felt like it, but if he wasn’t interested, he would simply ignore it. He was quite carefree.","However, moments later, the Demon Emperor furrowed his brow.","The message from the demon god pillar today was a bit peculiar. It seemed to convey a sense of comfort and enjoyment?","Could a demon god pillar actually experience comfort and enjoyment?","Perhaps it had evolved spiritually due to some fortunate circumstance?","If it had indeed evolved into a spiritual entity, he couldn’t just ignore it. After all, a spiritual demon god pillar could be nurtured and refined again to become a magical tool with a sentient spirit.","With this in mind, the Demon Emperor tapped his forehead and released a strand of mental energy, traversing millions of planes to descend upon the location of the Demon God Pillar.","“Eh? In the Netherworld Realm? That makes sense...” If the demon god pillar was in the Netherworld Realm, it would have absorbed the malevolent energy of the Netherworld, potentially leading to spiritual evolution.","At this thought, not only did the Demon Emperor’s strand of mental energy fully descend, but his spirit also descended upon the Demon God Pillar. He spread out his mental power and scanned the surroundings.","In an instant, the location of the Demon God Pillar, the surrounding environment, and the creatures nearby were all reflected in the Demon Emperor’s mental strength.","“Is this an area made of sand crystals? This terrain isn’t common in the Netherworld Realm.","“Moreover, the concentration of malevolent energy of the Netherworld here seems unusually high.","“Eh? There are people nearby?","“That little girl floating and sleeping looks somewhat familiar.","“And there’s this one-armed bald man with a dark beard on the side... Damn!","“Tyrannical Song, it’s you, you scoundrel. Don’t think I won’t recognize you just because you changed your skin color,” the demon god pillar emitted the furious voice of the Demon Emperor.","Simultaneously, Song Shuhangs right hand, pressing against the demon god pillar, began to rub against it frantically... Ten consecutive Saber Nurturing Techniques landed.","“You... you... you...”","So this was the reason the demon god pillar had transmitted the ‘comfortable’ data.","It was all part of Tyrannical Songs scheme, and he was still trying to deceive him.","“Eh? Senior? Why are you here?” Song Shuhang was also taken aback. He reached out and stopped the Saber Nurturing Technique.","Song Shuhang had been a bit distracted just now.","While grinding the Saber Nurturing Technique on the demon god pillar, he suddenly wondered—could he turn the Demon God Pillar into raw materials and transform it into the Overlord God Pillar?","In the end, in a moment of distraction, not only did the Demon Emperor manifest, but more followed.","On the demon god pillar, the Demon Emperor’s mental energy retracted, and he looked at Song Shuhang warily. “What are you planning to do to me this time?”","“Nothing, I don’t want to do anything,” Song Shuhang waved his hands repeatedly. “It was an accident. I just wanted to improve the demon god pillar’s favorability to complete the final 0.1% of the matching process, which was stuck at 99-9% ”","The Demon Emperor was speechless.","What a mess? He couldn’t understand a word of what Tyrannical Song was saying.","“Oh, right, Senior. There’s something I need to do for you,” Song Shuhang suddenly remembered Madame Long Luffs instructions.","The Demon Emperor’s spirit tensed up instantly.","“Come on, Senior, I have something to show you,” Song Shuhang retracted his right hand and began rubbing his hands together.."]},{"number":2579,"title":"Chapter 2579: The Sovereign of the Netherworld Speaks","paragraphs":["Chapter 2579: The Sovereign of the Netherworld Speaks","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Get lost! I ain’t lookin’!” the Demon Emperor snapped in anger.","Ever since he crossed paths with this tyrant, nothing good had come his way. After being slashed in the Black Dragon World, it’d take a good ten years or more to fully recover.","Song Shuhang was a real pain in the neck!","So, no matter what Song Shuhang had in mind, he was flat-out refusing.","With that in mind, the Demon Emperor’s mental strength began to retreat, ready to leave the Netherworld—can’t stir up trouble if you’re not around to be stirred up, right? “You want me to see somethin’, but I ain’t lookin’, and I’m outta here!”","As one of the top Immortals, if the Demon Emperor wanted to leave, nobody in this world could stop him.","This Demon Emperor, who had been around since ancient times, was among the oldest of the Immortals, and had nearly seized the position of ruler of the Black Dragon World. At the height of his power, he was undoubtedly one of the top few in all the realms.","“Senior, please stay! Just take a look, don’t miss out! You don’t have to pay to look. You have nothing to lose by taking a peek!” Song Shuhang hurriedly called out to detain the Demon Emperor.","If he let the Senior’s mental strength retreat, then he’d have to chase after the Demon Emperor in his inbox again if he wanted to fulfill the task Madam Long Luo gave him after her liver went kaput. It would be a real hassle.","So, the Demon Emperor’s mental strength couldn’t leave!","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, the retreating mental strength of the Demon Emperor was suddenly confined.","It wasn’t some spell or mental suppression effect; it was more like a kind of ‘authority.’ Acting on him, it imprisoned his mental strength on the demon god pillar like it was a law. Demon Emperor was confused.","What’s going on?","Did Song Shuhang already mess with the demon god pillar?","No, the demon god pillar was fine.","The problem was with Song Shuhangs state! That word of his just now had a ‘speak and the world obeys’ effect! The entire Netherworld was following the ‘verbal’ commands of Sage Tyrannical Song.","This feeling... It was just like being a ‘ruler.’","The Demon Emperor wasn’t the only one who had nearly taken over the Dragon Channel Ruler of the Black Dragon World. He was very familiar with the effect of ‘speak and the world obeys.’","“Has he already taken over the ruler position? The Heavenly Dao collapsed, the new Heavenly Dao didn’t form, and the Nine Abysses had no ruler... Maybe it really is an opportunity?” This thought flashed through the Demon Emperor’s mind.","But soon, he dismissed this absurd idea.","If the position of ruler could be taken so easily, it wouldn’t be called the ruler of the Netherworld!","On the other side.","Behind Song Shuhang, Black-skinned Soft Feather emerged, holding a modified camera and starting to record the scene in front of her.","Song Shuhang faced the camera and showed off his acting chops. “Let’s get back on track. The pillar in front of us is Senior’s demon god pillar. Today, Senior has descended upon the pillar, which is truly our good fortune.”","After reciting the opening lines, he turned back to the demon god pillar and said, “Come on, Senior, I’ll show you a treasure!”","He forgot to turn on the camera earlier, so he had to make up for that line!","The Demon Emperor was speechless.","I’m not looking!","“What exactly are you trying to do?” The Demon Emperor’s retreating mental strength was suddenly imprisoned on the demon god pillar.","And he couldn’t even ‘turn off mental exploration—it was like being tied to a chair with his eyelids forced open, unable to close them, forced to watch.","“l really just wanna show you a treasure, it won’t hurt you.” Song Shuhang promised, rubbing the secret technique of Overlord God Pillar No. 1.","Demon Emperor was speechless.","Think I’m gonna believe your hogwash?","Since he’d just mastered this pillar technique, Song Shuhang was still a bit unfamiliar with using it, even making two mistakes in a row.","After two tries, he finally managed to activate Overlord God Pillar No. 1. “Sorry, Senior, I’m still getting the hang of this spell, made ya wait. Come on","out, Overlord God Pillar!” Song Shuhang waved his hand.","The ‘No. 1’ suffix was just a name he could call in his head; calling it out would lower his status.","Demon Emperor was speechless.","‘Overlord God Pillar’? This damn name just changed one word of his Demon God Pillar! Was he riding on the popularity of his ‘Demon God Pillar’ cultivation technique? Or maybe...","The Demon Emperor had an uneasy feeling.","Soon, his feeling came true,","The bald, black-clad Tyrant Song waved his hand. A pitch-black divine pillar materialized out of thin air and slammed into the crystal sand ground.","Because it was just a ‘basic pillar,’ there were no decorations on it.","‘Demon God Pillar’? The Demon Emperor’s mental strength trembled violently.","There was no mistaking it. This spellcasting process, the structure of the pillar, and this familiar scent were his demon god pillar cultivation techniques.","‘There was a slight difference in appearance... But it’s completely my demon god pillar cultivation technique!","‘Is it an improved version of my demon god pillar?’","“Heh, Senior, take a look at this.” Song Shuhang began reciting the lines he had prepared earlier and ruthless stabbed Senior More Than’s heart.","“How’d you do it? I’m about to cuss you out.” The Demon Emperor’s voice became sluggish—it was fine if he changed his demon god pillar secret technique, but now he wanted to snatch his classic lines too?","“No problem, the dirtier, the better.” Song Shuhang nodded seriously.","Demon Emperor gave up speaking.","This way, it’d be tough to report back to Madam Long Luo.","As expected, he’d better refine the demon god pillar into Overlord God Pillar No. 2. While the Demon Emperor’s mental strength was still on the demon god pillar and hadn’t left, he’d refine it into the Overlord God Pillar in one go!","The pillar’s name would be Longevity Pillar, Overlord Pillar!","As soon as this thought popped into his head, it was amplified and intensified by the power of the ruler.","Even though he’d said earlier he wouldn’t harm Senior More Than, could he trust the words of the ruler? Even if he was just a temporary ruler, it was still the same.."]},{"number":2580,"title":"Chapter 2580: I’m Just Temporarily Filling In","paragraphs":["Chapter 2580: I’m Just Temporarily Filling In","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just a second ago, Song, the Temporary Worker, was saying, “I’m really just showing you something, Senior, and I definitely won’t harm you,” unceremoniously began the casting process for Overlord God Pillar No. 2.","At this moment, he was already a qualified ruler of the Netherworld!","To ensure the casting process went smoothly, Song Shuhang didn’t hesitate to activate the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and had the Netherworld cooperate with him in the casting process. Therefore, there were no mistakes this time, and he successfully completed the refining technique in one go.","The Demon Emperor was stunned speechless.","His instinct told him that Tyrannical Song was up to something very disadvantageous for him.","The Demon Emperor frantically urged his mental energy, but the confinement from the Netherworld Realm firmly suppressed his mental energy and rendered it unable to move.","“What are you trying to do?!” The Demon Emperor exclaimed.","“I’m just here to demonstrate the refining process you. This process is very different from the first pillar. It’s a brand new path that evolved from the demon god pillar,” Song Shuhang clenched his right hand into a fist.","Next, the entire Demon God Pillar and the Demon Emperor’s spiritual energy attached to it were enveloped by the power of Overlord God Pillar No. 2 and began to be refined.","The Overlord God Pillar was derived from the Demon God Pillar. After sensing it, the Demon Emperor realized that this was indeed a brand new method. It was different from his Demon God Pillar condensation method. This method directly transformed some energy bodies or spirit bodies into pillars.","This was indeed a good idea. It was a new variant of the demon god pillar. Under normal circumstances, not only would the Demon Emperor be willing to observe the entire process of Overlord God Pillar No. 2 in detail, but he would also be able to draw inspiration from it.","But now, his spiritual power was being refined!","“l knew you wouldn’t have any good intentions.” The Demon Emperor wasn’t the only one who didn’t believe Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs words about not hurting him.","“But trying to refine my mental energy? You’re dreaming too big.” The Demon","Emperor sneered.","After saying that, not only did ?? mental energy begin to converge, but it also condensed into a ball and compressed... and prepared to self-destruct. After his mental energy self-destructed, he would also be able to destroy the demon god pillar. Tyrannical Song wouldn’t get anything!","When the Demon Emperor’s mental energy was highly compressed, his mental energy perception became stronger. In his mental energy perception, he suddenly swept across a supreme figure.","He finally saw the black-and-white striped dragon floating behind Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. It had one leg and two dragon whiskers that were moving agilely. It was extremely terrifying.","If the Scholarly Sage was the nightmare of most Immortals in the world, and he was the one who had suppressed them for an entire lifetime, then this one-legged striped dragon was not just the nightmare of the Demon Emperor.","Back then, not only did the Demon Emperor fight for the last step of the Heavenly Dao Immortal Seat, but he also faced the Striped Dragon. The result was obvious... He was not only trampled to the ground beneath someone’s feet, but he was also traumatized by it. In the end, he fled far away from the main world and ran to the Black Dragon World.","“It’s you!” The Demon Emperor cried out in shock. He lost control of his emotions, and the decibel of his voice soared!","Originally, after trillions of years, it was not just the demon emperor who had long become indifferent to the matters of the Supreme Ancient Immortal Realms. Under normal circumstances, even if the Demon Emperor was facing the Striped Dragon, he would still be able to maintain his composure and would definitely not lose control like this.","However, when Striped Dragon and Tyrannical Song were combined, their lethality was completely different!","One was the existence that had once given him the greatest blow in the immemorial era, pushing him from the peak to the bottomless abyss.","One was Tyrannical Song, who had just given him the second biggest blow in his life last year and blowing him up from the Black Dragon World.","When these two were combined, it was not just the Demon Emperor that was worth 1+1= 100 million!","“Hehehe, you finally spotted me.” Striped Dragon Two chuckled. He waved his dragon beard and waved at the Demon Emperor.” Long time no see.”","Striped Dragon Two still had some memories of this last enemy on his path to becoming the Wielder of the Will and becoming immortal.","During the immemorial era, it was not only different from the Demon Emperor’s path of vindication but also different from the Scholarly Sage’s.","The Scholarly Sage faced the myriad worlds alone.","And he and the Demon Emperor were fighting in different areas back then. The two of them did not meet before the final battle. One was the king of the eastern myriad worlds, and the other was the demon emperor of the western myriad worlds. Back then, both of them were the strongest in the eyes of cultivators in the myriad worlds.","After both of them became the strongest in their respective regions, they would then engage in the final confrontation... The result was quite unexpected.","Originally, the cultivators of the myriad worlds felt that it would be an unprecedented battle.","In the end, it wasn’t just the Demon Emperor who was easily pressed down by the Striped Dragon. Back then, the two of them were not even on the same level!","If the average combat strength of the Heavenly Dao candidates from the immemorial era was set at 60-90, then not only would the Demon Emperor’s combat strength be close to the full score of 100, but he would also be able to firmly suppress all the other Heavenly Dao candidates.","However, the Striped Dragon’s combat strength was not restricted by the ‘full score’. At the same time, he also had at least 50 points.","You scored 98 points, but the top student scored 100 points. Don’t think that you’re very close to being a top student... You scored 98 points because your strength was 98 points. The reason why the champ scored 100 points was because there were only 100 points in the test paper.","I understand now. So Tyrannical Song is your reincarnation.” The devil emperor was enlightened.","It was no wonder that he, a dignified Demon Emperor, was restrained by","Tyrannical Song along the way. It was no wonder that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song always found trouble with him and harassed him for no reason.","Now, after seeing the phantom of the striped dragon floating behind Song Shuhang, the Demon Emperor finally understood the cause and effect.","“What?” Striped Dragon Two was dumbfounded.","It seems that the Demon Emperor’s brain circuits have become chaotic.","“You don’t have to quibble. How could you control the power of the","Netherworld Realm if you weren’t the reincarnated Striped Dragon?” the Demon Emperor asked after sensing his current state. “l felt that something was wrong before. You clearly have part of the authority of the Netherworld!”","“That’s because I’m a temporary worker.” Song Shuhang replied.","The Demon Emperor was confused.","“I’m an... acting ruler of the Netherworld?” Song Shuhang put his palms together.","The Demon God Pillar that ?????? mental energy was attached to finally transformed into the Overlord God Pillar.","“From today onwards, you are the Longevity Pillar series, the Beyond Pillar.” The black-skinned Soft Feather announced loudly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.."]},{"number":2581,"title":"Chapter 2581: Orders of Ruler Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2581: Orders of Ruler Tyrannical Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a real challenge for Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia not to be near Song Four of the Netherworld Realm, yet he still couldn’t manage to grab his lines!","Why was it as difficult as snagging a red envelope to deliver a line?","If he didn’t recite a few lines soon, what would happen when he proposed in the future? Would he need the pendant on his body to speak for him?","Song Shuhangs ancestral liver began to ache in waves.","“Senior Song, can we end the video here?” asked Soft Feather, her shy demeanor evident. It was her first attempt at snatching Senior Songs lines— both Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia were vying for them. If she didn’t make a few attempts, she’d be left out of Senior Songs pendant girl trio and appear quite unsociable.","“Yeah, let’s wrap up the video recording. Send it to me later,” Song Shuhang said while looking at the Longevity Pillar.","The Demon Emperor Pillar stood at 50 meters tall, slightly taller than the Kun King Pillar... but not much stronger in terms of power.","After all, the Longevity Pillar was only a fusion of a Demon God Pillar and a strand of the Demon Emperor’s mental energy, while the Kun Pillar was fused with Senior Kun Kings origin power. Material-wise, the Kun Pillar had the upper hand.","“Oh, Soft Feather... do you know how to edit videos?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","“I know a bit. I learned some when my main body was making emojis,” Soft Feather nodded.","“Then, help me edit the video later and cut out some unnecessary content. For example, let’s trim out the mistakes in my previous spellcasting. The key is to","keep the video concise, emphasizing the scene where Senior is stabbed in the heart,” Song Shuhang instructed.","“No problem, Senior Song. Leave it to me,” Soft Feather assured. Song Shuhang nodded. Soft Feather’s assurance was quite reliable.","Then, his gaze fell on the Longevity Pillar in the distance.","An evil aura emanated from the pillar. Its body was even more splendid than the Kun King Pillar, adorned with intricate drawings—it was the Devil Country Map of the Demon Emperor. The places where the Demon God Pillar was inserted were all Devil Countries. At the tip of the pillar, a menacing statue of a great demon stood—the true form of the Demon Emperor!","“It’s done,” Song Shuhang said softly. The moment he transformed this pillar into the Overlord God Pillar, he and the formation patterns underground in the Sand Crystal World finally completed synchronization and reached a compatibility of 100%.","When the Limitless Demon Sect opened this area as the Demon Sea World, Song Shuhang would be able to activate all the underground formation patterns and hundreds of backup plans, seizing control of the Demon Sea World.","Now, he needed to subdue this Longevity Pillar and continue to embed it in the Sand Crystal World as the coordinates of the Limitless Demon Sect!","“Let’s do this, Longevity Pillar,” Song Shuhang said heroically. Having learned from the Kun King Pillar, he already had some experience in subduing the Overlord God Pillar 2.","The Blade Nurturing Technique was the best method to subdue the Overlord God Pillar 2.","As long as he could cast 100 shots of the Blade Nurturing Technique per second, even the unyielding Tyrant God Pillar would turn into the Tyrant God Blade!","However, to Song Shuhangs surprise... the Longevity Pillar didn’t resist.","The moment it was born, it chose to submit!","Perhaps, before it was refined into a pillar, Song Shuhang had sent it a lot of Blade Nurturing Technique and established a good rapport.","Or perhaps it wasn’t just because the Demon Emperors mental energy had descended, but also because the combination of Song Shuhang and Striped Dragon Two had given it too much pressure?","Or perhaps... was it pretending to submit, waiting for an opportunity to strike?","“Rise!” Song Shuhang flicked his finger, and the pillar flew toward him and landed gracefully in front of him.","Without hesitation, Song Shuhang stretched out his hands and pressed them on the pillar, relentlessly using the Blade Nurturing Technique.","Song Shuhang had been using the Blade Nurturing Technique for nearly two","minutes/","When his sword, hanging at his waist, saw this, it cried with envy.","After more than 10,000 strokes of the Blade Nurturing Technique, a faint seven-colored divine artifact light began to appear on the pillar. Though it quickly dissipated, the fact that it appeared at all was significant. With continuous brushing, the seven-colored light might stabilize.","“That’s it for now. When I have time, I’ll come back for more,” Song Shuhang said contentedly while controlling the pillar to return to the center of the Sand Crystal World and replacing the demon god pillar as the coordinates of the Limitless Demon Sect’s Demon Sea World Plan.","Speaking of which, his Inner World still had a sealing pillar containing the Confucian Classic of the Scholarly Sage. He needed to retrieve this treasure as soon as possible.","“Your Blade Nurturing Technique lacks a soul,” Striped Dragon Two couldn’t help but comment.","“If the quality isn’t enough, we’ll make up for it with quantity! And as long as it’s effective, it’s fine. For example, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword doesn’t care if my Blade Nurturing Technique has a soul. It’s just a form of massage. You don’t have to fall in love with the masseuse to enjoy the massage process, right?” Song Shuhang retorted.","“That makes sense,” the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword replied.","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","“Now that the coordinates of the Sand Crystal World are set, let’s go deal with the demons from the Netherworld attacking the main world and the passageway to the Netherworld Realm,” Song Shuhang said, seeking advice from Striped Dragon Two.","“It’s simple. Use your authority as the ruler of the Netherworld to summon a few powerful demons from the Netherworld and assign them the role of ‘messengers of the ruler of the Netherworld.’ Then, write them a decree to head to the passage between the Netherworld and the main world and announce your decree to the demons of the Netherworld on your behalf,” Striped Dragon Two suggested.","Spreading my decree? That’s cool!"]},{"number":2582,"title":"Chapter 2582: The Gathering of Ten Thousand Demons","paragraphs":["Chapter 2582: The Gathering of Ten Thousand Demons","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Such a handsome fantasy style didn’t seem to quite fit with his own vibe.","Nevertheless, he liked it.","“Hey, Stone Tablet!” Song Shuhang reached out and grabbed his friend, Stone Tablet.","After employing the Saber Nurturing Technique, their synchronization rate increased. Song Shuhang opened the interface of the ruler of the Netherworld and swiftly navigated through it.","After scrolling to the 82nd entry on the authority list, he finally found the Evil Demon Summoning Authority function.","“How many passages across the heavens and myriad realms are currently under attack by the demons of the Netherworld?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“In the mortal realm, Earth, there are seven passages scattered around the world. The star area near Earth is a hotspot, with each passage connecting to the Netherworld being occupied by a group of Netherworld demons. Rough estimates suggest there are at least nearly ten thousand passages connecting the other heavens and myriad realms to the Netherworld, with signs of Netherworld demons launching attacks,” Stone Tablet explained.","The number of passages between the Nine Nether and the myriad realms exceeded ten thousand... However, aside from Earth, only a few of the numerous passages between other planes and the Netherworld were actively threatened by Netherworld demons.","This was a normal occurrence.","There would always be idle Netherworld demons seeking to tour the mortal realm and cause havoc along the way.","Killing or being killed, destruction, death, and chaos were inherent to Netherworld demons. This was an immutable fact, akin to how ordinary people needed to breathe and eat.","The reason why all seven passages on Earth were occupied was due to the machinations of the Limitless Demon Sect. They would not stop inciting and provoking Netherworld demons to riot, attacking passages, and drawing the attention of Earth’s cultivators to pave the way for the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plan.","Song Shuhang proposed, “Then why don’t we summon ten thousand high-level demons to proclaim our decree?”","Time was of the essence, and they were unsure of the progress of the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plan’... Therefore, some matters were best resolved in one fell swoop. Since there were over ten thousand passages, he would simply dispatch over ten thousand high-level demons to proclaim his decree.","“Let me lend you a hand. Otherwise, with just you, you’ll at best summon ten thousand miscellaneous demons,” Striped Dragon Two chimed in.","With that said, Striped Dragon Two’s right dragon beard extended and wrapped around Song Four’s right hand.","At the same time, in the world of the Throne of Wealth, Senior Three-Eyed was trimming branches in the flower bushes. He reached out and gently plucked a blue flower. He bent down to inhale its fragrance with a smile on his face while exuding an otherworldly aura.","The forest after the rain, the smiling beautiful boy, the blooming flowers... This scene was as picturesque as a painting.","“Master, are you squatting in the flower bushes to take a dump? We can build a dedicated bathroom, ah...” Before the butler could finish his sentence this time, he was pierced by a large pair of scissors used for trimming the flowers. He collapsed to the ground with a loud thud as blood pooled around him.","The three-eyed youth clapped his hands and stood up from the bushes. “Since the one-legged dragon has made a move, how can I show weakness?” With that thought in mind, the three-eyed youth activated his own power to secretly assist Song Shuhang through his divine third eye.","Black- skinned Soft Feather once again raised her camera and began recording.","“Summon demons, determined to be of Sixth Grade or higher, with a quantity of ten thousand or more.” Song Shuhang opened the interface of the ruler of the Netherworld and input the necessary data.","The Netherworld was incomprehensibly vast as it corresponded to the expansive myriad realms. More than ten thousand demons of Sixth Grade or higher were like a drop in the ocean to the Netherworld.","After Song Shuhang finished inputting the instructions, Striped Dragon Two began to exert his influence. “Additional command: reserve four or more Ninth Grade demons, and one hundred Eighth Grade demons. Upgrade the grade of summoned demons from Sixth Grade and above to Seventh Grade and above.’","Under the proclamation of the ruler of the Netherworld, demons of Sixth Grade were deemed too weak, with even Seventh Grade demons barely meeting the mark.","After Striped Dragon Two finished exerting his influence, the three-eyed youth also made a move in secret, strengthening the number of Ninth Grade demons he could summon to seven. It was sufficient to match the number of passages on Earth. He also doubled the number of Eighth Grade demons.","“Command issued.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed the ‘confirm’ button on the interface.","Buzz","Under the law of the ruler of the Netherworld, this summoning order was transmitted to every corner of the Netherworld.","The entire Netherworld began to tremble.","All Seventh Grade demons received the summoning order from the ruler of the Netherworld.","A multitude of Eighth Grade demons and seven Ninth Grade demons also received the summons from the ruler.","Upon confirmation of the order, the nearest Seventh Grade Netherworld demons swiftly rose to their feet.","They abandoned whatever they were doing and rushed madly toward the location of ‘Song Shuhang.","Under normal circumstances, Seventh Grade Netherworld demons would never have the chance to see the ruler of the Netherworld in their lifetime. Now that there were over ten thousand slots to meet the ruler of the Netherworld, Seventh Grade demons naturally wouldn’t give up.","They exerted all their efforts, using their escape techniques and secret arts to vie for the ten thousand slots—even if they couldn’t secure a slot, just having the chance to see the ruler of the Netherworld from afar would be a huge gain for Netherworld demons!","The ruler of the Netherworld was the center of the Netherworld’s laws, and the entire realm revolved around him. Merely catching a glimpse from afar, if they could gain some insights, it would be equivalent to the accomplishments of Netherworld demons after many years of slaughter.","No demon would pass up such an opportunity.","Simultaneously, the nearest Eighth Grade demons to Song Shuhang also quickly moved into action—breaking through to Ninth Grade was even more difficult for Eighth Grade demons than it was for cultivators in the mortal realm. If they could fulfill the task given by the ruler of the Netherworld, they would receive the ruler’s blessing and reward, possibly allowing them to break through the Eighth Grade realm and peer into the Ninth Grade!","In the end, a total of seven Ninth Grade demons accurately received the command.","In a bone domain formed by countless bones, a Ninth Grade bone dragon with a diamond luster awakened from its slumber. This was an ancient relic with an extraordinarily long lifespan, surpassing even the lifespan limit of a Ninth Grade demon. It had existed since ancient times, entering slumber in the distant past and only awakening today.","The Diamond Bone Dragon raised its head and emitted a wolf howl. It opened a spatial gate and entered it.","In the fat ball’s private treasury, a dragon-shaped statue suddenly came to life and transformed into a steel dragon.","The steel dragon moved its body and bones, silently opening a spatial door","and agilely jumping in.","Similar occurrences took place in the Netherworld realm.","A strange dragon resembling a centipede with many legs and a beautiful dragon with rainbow stripes, rarely seen in the Netherworld, awakened from their slumber and were summoned to cross space.","These four Ninth Grade demonic dragons were summoned with the assistance of Striped Dragon Two and the clandestine support of Senior Three-Eyed.","Following the summoning of the four Ninth Grade demonic dragons, three more locations in the Netherworld realm began to stir. Senior Three-Eyed’s covert support began to exert its strength.."]},{"number":2583,"title":"Chapter 2583: Feigning Dragon Might","paragraphs":["Chapter 2583: Feigning Dragon Might","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In a deep abyss within the Netherworld Realm dwelled a species of diminutive","Eye Demons, most of which possessed only first or second-rank strength. They numbered in abundance and reproduced at an alarming rate.","Their combination of weakness, potent reproduction, and group survival made them prime prey for nearby ordinary demons of the third and fourth ranks. Each day, a large number of these third and fourth-ranked","Netherworld demons would lurk at the edge of the abyss, while feasting on these low-level Eye Demons.","Today was no exception. A multitude of ordinary demons gathered near the abyss in search of sustenance.","Just as these ordinary demons were about to capture Eye Demons for a hearty meal, all the first and second-rank Eye Demons within the abyss suddenly began to merge!","In an extremely short span of time, these previously insignificant first and second-rank Eye Demons coalesced into a Ninth-rank Eye Demon Supreme.","Its massive form obscured the heavens and the earth and exuded an overwhelming presence.","Under the pressure of a Ninth-rank Sovereign, all the ordinary demons of the third and fourth-rank who came to feed were petrified with fear. Their legs gave out as they collapsed to the ground while trembling.","The Ninth-rank Supreme Eye Demon scanned the abyss with a frigid gaze, unleashing a cold light that instantly reduced all the low-level demons seeking sustenance to dust.","The demons who came in search of death had succeeded—henceforth, they would no longer hunger, for they were now deceased.","After dealing with the group of self-destructive demons, the Supreme Eye Demon leisurely opened a spatial gate and squeezed its bulky form through. It had been summoned to meet the ruler of the Netherworld.","In a stretch of ocean within the Netherworld Realm.","Within this expanse of water lay an island that had existed since ancient times. It was home to numerous marine demons that thrived and multiplied on and around it.","However, today, this island suddenly trembled. The earth, rocks, sand, and demons residing upon it were shaken off.","The island slowly ascended and revealed its colossal true form—an island with large eyes.","With a gentle shake, the island rid itself of all the demons that inhabited it.","In the next moment, an incomprehensibly massive spatial gate opened, and the island with large eyes disappeared into it.","At the very moment the island with large eyes began its movement, a small asteroid pretending to orbit a star suddenly opened its eyes, as if it had sensed something amiss.","In another treasury belonging to the fat ball.","This particular private vault was rather pitiful, having already been quietly emptied by Senior White Two and left behind only a facade of treasures. In reality, it was barren.","Within this nearly empty treasury, there hung a mural.","The mural faintly illuminated, depicting a gentleman demon with three pairs of gem-like eyes stepping out of the painting. After descending, the demon courteously bowed to the empty treasury of the fat ball, then tapped its cane lightly against the wall. A spatial gate opened, and the six-eyed gentleman demon stepped through, disappearing from sight.","In the crevice between the Netherworld Realm and the earthly realm.","An incomprehensibly massive turtle shell drifted slowly, its back adorned with a flourishing pavilion sect. Within the sect were mountains, rivers, and trees, creating a picturesque landscape.","Beside one of the small lakes, a girl in a black dress sat. Her hair was thick and long, cascading behind her.","Adorning her skirt was a pearl the size of a pigeon egg, emitting a faint glow.","At this moment, the girl in the black dress seemed to sense the summoning order of the ruler of the Netherworld. After a moment’s contemplation, she refrained from action, merely swaying her feet gently in the water to create ripples that mirrored her state of mind.","Amidst the thundering sounds akin to ten thousand charging horses, over ten thousand seventh-rank demons approached Song Shuhangs location.","“We need to find a wider space!” Song Shuhang suggested.","This Sand Crystal World still needed to be preserved to accommodate the members of the Limitless Demon Sect, with the goal of transforming it into a base.","“Just keep moving,” Senior Striped Dragon Two replied. “The ruler of the Netherworld’s authority will guide the demons who received the order and automatically lock onto your position.”","Song Shuhang nodded while recalling the information he had obtained from using the monitoring function of the Netherworld Realm to find a suitable location on the outskirts of the Sand Crystal World.","With a mental command, Song Shuhang activated the ruler of the","Netherworld Realm’s authority to traverse space—similar to his actions within the Inner World. As its master, he could appear in any area at will. The ruler of the Netherworld Realm provided the same capability within its realm.","Clutching his pendant, Song Shuhang relocated to a wilderness far from the Sand Crystal World, selecting a modest mountain to descend upon, preparing to receive the demons.","The White Dragon enveloped Su Clan’s Sixteen and employed an aura-concealing technique to mask her presence. After all, Su Clan’s Sixteen possessed a human body, and her presence could potentially cause chaos when the demons arrived.","Senior Striped Dragon Two remained shrouded around Song Shuhang, resembling Slow-Witted Songs corporeal form.","A few breaths later, over ten thousand seventh-rank demons and nearly two hundred eighth-rank demons arrived first, having hastened from the nearby Netherworld region upon receiving the summons. They encircled the small mountain, gazing up at the ruler of the Netherworld atop its peak.","However, Song Shuhang remained concealed by the imposing Striped Dragon Two. The true form of the ruler of the Netherworld was hidden from the demons.","After nearly 10,000 seventh-rank demons and nearly 300 eighth-rank demons gathered, seven spatial gates materialized in the air.","These were the summoned ninth-rank demons.","They refrained from revealing themselves immediately, lingering within the spatial passageways, gradually tempering their auras. This precaution prevented them from inciting chaos among the seventh-rank demons or disturbing the ruler of the Netherworld upon emerging from the gates.","As the seven ninth-rank demons suppressed their auras, they covertly observed the ruler of the Netherworld.","Upon witnessing the illusionary form of Striped Dragon Two, the four demonic dragons couldn’t contain their excitement.","Observing Song Shuhang through Striped Dragon Two, the three demons detected a faintly familiar aura that stirred their hearts.","With the assembly of ten thousand demons complete and the summoned demons accounted for, the Evil Demon Summoning command concluded.","The seventh-rank and eighth-rank demons yet to arrive could only halt their journey, forfeiting the chance to meet the ruler of the Netherworld.","On a wilderness mountain, gazing upon the myriad seventh and eighth-rank demons, Song Shuhang felt akin to a lamb amidst a pack of ravenous wolves.","The lamb borrowed the dragon’s might.."]},{"number":2584,"title":"Chapter 2584: Greetings, Lord... Daddy!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2584: Greetings, Lord... Daddy!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang had the eerie feeling that if he revealed his true self, he would be completely devoured by the demons.","“Greetings, Ruler of the Netherworld.” All the demons below bowed to the ruler atop the mountain. Without needing visual confirmation, the summoning authority ensured all the Netherworld’s demons were locked onto Song Shuhang.","Black Feather Soft Feather, camera in hand, floated behind Song Shuhang. She found the perfect angle, spun around, and captured the scene. At that moment, she assumed the role of a reporter. She was only missing a microphone to ask Song Shuhang about his feelings.","As the Netherworld’s demons bowed to Song Shuhang, Senior Striped Dragon Two’s form slightly dispersed and revealed Song Four’s true essence.","He was merely a retired ruler of the Netherworld. The demons below were paying homage to Song Shuhang, in spite of his temporary station. With Senior Striped Dragon Two’s withdrawal, Song Four’s real identity was exposed.","Under the Authority, the tens of thousands of demons below, after completing their salutations, instinctively looked up in unison and gazed at the current ruler standing on the small hill.","The most crucial part of meeting was to personally lay eyes upon the current ruler. They hoped this would grant them insights and an opportunity to enhance their own realms.","A pitch-black, muscular, bald head appeared before the tens of thousands of demons.","Every demon shuddered.","This dark, muscular bald head, though slightly different from the figure in their memories, was unmistakable to any seventh-rank demon. Even if he were reduced to ashes, they would never mistake him.","After all, this had only happened five months ago.","Given the Netherworld demons’ lengthy lifespans and strong memories, an event five months ago was as fresh as if it had occurred five days ago.","The fear this formidable man had once instilled in the Netherworld had not yet faded. Every demon seemed to still harbor the aftereffects of that pain.","“Da...Tyrannical Scholar!” “Da...Tyrannical Song!” “Da... Tyrant Demon!”","“D-Da-Daddy!’","Various cries echoed intermittently. Regardless of the title, they all referred to the same man.","Why was this man the ruler?","Were they living a nightmare?","What had happened to this world?","Tyrannical Song was actually the Ruler of the Netherworld?","In an instant, hundreds of thoughts of doubt and disbelief surged through the minds of the Netherworld’s demons.","However, no matter their skepticism and incredulity, the authority of the Sovereign of the Netherworld clearly informed them that the man before them was indeed their Sovereign, the entity that had summoned them!","The tens of thousands of Seventh-rank Netherworld demons began to breathe deeply.","Inhale Exhale??????? Inhale","The wilderness was filled with the heavy breathing of the Netherworld’s demons, casting an eerie atmosphere.","Song Shuhang had underestimated his impact in the Netherworld.","He thought he was a sheep in dragon’s skin, masquerading as a dragon...","But in reality, in the eyes of the Netherworld’s demons, Tyrannical Song was not a sheep but a demon among demons, the devil of devils.","This most malevolent demon, cloaked in the guise of a hypocrite, was not pretending to be a dragon; he was an evil dragon in sheep’s clothing.","Black Feather Soft Feather contentedly recorded the video, her inspiration for editing flowing endlessly.","“Shocking! When all the demons worshipped Senior Song, they all called him","Daddy! Does Senior Song actually have tens of thousands of children in the Netherworld?”","“The most shocking scene in history. What caused the tens of thousands of heavy breaths in the wilderness? What makes tens of thousands of demons take such deep breaths?”","She was eager to edit these two videos.","The instinct of the inner demon strongly urged Black Feather Soft Feather to make a video that would unsettle Senior Song. However, her conscience told her that such actions were wrong; the video should not be taken out of context!","“When the time comes, I’ll leave this video to my main body to handle.” Eventually, Black Feather Soft Feather decided on a middle ground and neither leaning toward good nor evil.","In the wilderness.","The tens of thousands of Seventh-rank demons continued their deep breathing, their hearts caught in a profound dilemma.","They had rushed here to pay homage, to see, and to be seen by the Ruler of the Netherworld!","Being observed meant being under the gaze of the ‘laws of the Netherworld,’ which would afford them a certain level of protection in their future cultivation.","This was the process of entering the Saint’s Eye.","But now... to be observed by the Tyrannical Scholar?","The Seventh-rank demons felt intense turmoil in their guts.","The Eighth-rrank demons were no better off. Aside from having a stronger resolve, they too had been affected by pregnancy before.","At this time, the Ruler of the Netherworld, Tyrannical Song, standing on a hill in the wilderness, finally spoke: “Very well, citizens of the Netherworld summoned here, your every action will be under my watch!”","As he spoke, a light briefly shone at Song Four’s third eye and swept a gaze over all the demons below!","In a short period of time, all the Netherworld’s demons present fell under the gaze of Tyrannical Song.","All the demons immediately straightened their bodies and controlled their trembling, eager to leave their mark in the Ruler of the Netherworld’s memory —after all, the future was more important than pregnancy!","Pregnancy, it’s so enticing!","“I’ve summoned you here today because there is a task you need to execute,” Song Shuhang slowly stated.","“The Ruler commands,” the Netherworld’s demons replied in unison.","“I need you to disperse and head to each passageway between the Netherworld and the mortal realm. Announce my decree: for the next month, no demon of the Netherworld is allowed to enter the mortal realm’s passageways without my permission,” Song Shuhang declared firmly. “Upon successful delivery of my decree, you will receive a reward from me.”","As he spoke, his authority was activated, automatically assigning missions and destinations to the tens of thousands of Netherworld demons, allowing them to disperse and proclaim the will of Tyrannical Song.","The Netherworld’s demons agreed in unison. not Questioning the significance of the decree. As long as it was the decree, they would execute it.","The Seventh and Eighth-rank demons received their missions.","Then, seven Space Gates fully opened in the void.","The Diamond Bone Dragon, the Steel Dragon, the Centipede-Legged Dragon, the Rainbow Striped Dragon, the Supreme Eye Devil, the Long-Eyed Island, and the Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon all stepped out from the Space Gates.","“You seven, head to the passageway between the mortal world, Earth, and the Netherworld to announce my decree,” Song Shuhang instructed.","“We are honored to serve our master,” the four demonic dragons said to Striped Dragon Two, who was behind Song Shuhang.","“We are prepared to die for our Lord,” the three eyeball demons said while addressing Song Shuhangs forehead.","“Are these your former subordinates, Senior Striped Dragon?” Song Shuhang asked, looking up at Big Boss Striped Dragon Two.","“Four of them are the results of my initial experiments with the Will of","Heaven. After the experiments, 1 took them in as my subordinates, and they have survived since the ancient times. The other three... haha,” Striped Dragon Two responded.","“Are they Senior Three-Eyed e s subordinates?” Song Shuhang guessed. Since they were the original subordinates of the two seniors, there was another task that could be assigned to them.","For instance... cleansing the mortal world of evil.","Wouldn’t using a Ninth-rank demon to eliminate evil be a bit of overkill?"]},{"number":2585,"title":"Chapter 2585: Without The Ability To Read Lines, What Is The Point Of My Existence?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2585: Without The Ability To Read Lines, What Is The Point Of My Existence?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang had already pondered over sending some formidable demons from the Netherworld to the main world to target the Xie Wang, thereby thwarting the progress of the Limitless Demon Sect’s plan and complicating the sect’s Demon Nation Plan. After all, one cannot witness a rainbow without first enduring a storm. The more challenging the execution of the Limitless Demon Sect’s Devil Nation Plan became, the less likely they would be to harbor suspicions.","Yet, Song Shuhang held reservations. Once the demons of the Netherworld left their realm, they would no longer be under the jurisdiction of the temporary ruler of the Netherworld, which would make it difficult to restrain them with authority.","At that point, after the Netherworld demons were tasked with eliminating the Xie Wang, they themselves could take the Xie Wangs place and create chaos in the main world, presenting an even greater headache.","After all, Xie Wang were akin to a homebody disaster, typically confined to a specific territory that could be sealed and monitored. However, the demons of the Netherworld were a different story; they were a roving disaster which made them much more troublesome to deal with.","Now, upon encountering the seven Tribulation Transcender Realm demons of the Netherworld, the plan to target Xie Wang resurfaced in Song Shuhangs mind.","These seven Ninth-rank demons felt to him like they were Senior White Two’s pets. Although they were still Netherworld demons, they had already shed the malicious pleasure of ‘killing or being killed’ that typical Netherworld demons indulged in.","If it were them, perhaps it could work?","“Senior Striped Dragon Two,” Song Shuhang turned and addressed the formidable Striped Dragon Two, “I wanted to ask—","“No problem,” Striped Dragon Two cut in before Song Shuhang could finish.","Song Shuhang blinked in surprise.","He quickly touched Song Four’s cold face. Could it be that not even Song Four’s icy demeanor could shield his inner thoughts and secrets from the powerful beings?","After having his lines stolen, now he wasn’t even allowed to finish speaking?","Without the ability to deliver lines, what purpose did he serve?","“It’s not about reading faces; it’s about reading minds. Don’t forget, I was just collaborating with you. We entered the ‘human-dragon unity’ state and summoned the Netherworld demons. I haven’t left this synchronized state yet, so I’m intimately familiar with your thoughts. You have no privacy in front of me now,” Striped Dragon Two said with a cold laugh.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","So, the fleeting thoughts that crossed his mind had all been read by Striped Dragon Two?","“Exactly. For instance, when you saw the multi-legged dragon, you compared me to it and even maliciously speculated about how I would look if my body was covered in legs. Or when you saw the rainbow dragon, you imagined filling my body’s stripes with rainbow colors. I didn’t miss any of it. In the","brief time we’ve met, not only did the ‘Sniper Xie Wang Plan’ pop you’re your mind, but so did many other imaginative scenarios and plots. You’re quite the thinker,” Striped Dragon Two continued with a cold laugh.","Song Shuhang was speechless again.","Thus, mind reading was the most annoying thing. One day, he vowed to abolish the face-reading technique across all worlds... and the mind-reading technique as well. He was determined to create an era that valued privacy.","“After the Demon Sea issue is resolved, I’ll attach four more legs to you and make you a man with six legs. I’ll also add a layer of rainbow stripes to make you stand out. Don’t worry, I’m quite skilled at these experiments,” Senior Striped Dragon Two said, lightly patting Song Shuhang with his beard.","Then, it exited the ‘human-dragon unity’ state. Mind reading was a trivial skill for a top-notch big shot, usable at will.","However, it had no interest in reading Song Shuhangs mind. Who knew how this guy’s thought process was wired? His thoughts jumped rapidly, and his mind was filled with one lurid thought after another. Being in sync with Song Shuhang meant constantly receiving junk information and heart-wrenching images.","“Six legs, rainbow-colored?” Song Shuhang pondered for a moment, then exclaimed with joy, “Alright, thank you, Senior!”","Striped Dragon Two was puzzled.","“Six legs are brilliant,” Song Shuhang said. With six legs, if he ever wanted to split himself in half in the future, he could start by cutting off two legs to form one half of his body, then another two for the other half.","Effectively, he’d gain two extra halves out of nowhere, a sure win.","“After the Demon Sea matter is settled, Senior, please attach four more legs to me,” Song Shuhang cheerfully requested. Moreover, if he could master the technique Striped Dragon Two used to attach the four legs, he might be able to deduce the principle behind it. Then, he could assemble a complete clone!","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Communicating with this guy was exhausting, and he wasn’t even particularly good-looking.","Thus, it decided to remain silent, no longer engaging in Song Shuhangs banter, and turned its attention to its four dragon king protectors.","Striped Dragon Two beckoned with a wave of its hand.","The four demonic dragons stepped forward in unison, ready to introduce themselves to Song Shuhang.","“I am Cheng Zuan, Dragon King of the Eastern Abyss,” the Diamond Bone Dragon said in a deep voice.","“I am Cheng Gang, Dragon King of the Western Abyss,” the steel dragon declared solemnly.","“I am Cheng Duo, Dragon King of the Southern Abyss,” the centipede dragon whispered softly.","“I am Cheng Hong, Dragon King of the Northern Abyss,” the rainbow-patterned dragon added.","As Song Shuhang nodded silently, he said to Senior Striped Dragon Two, “Senior, I’ve realized your talent for naming is truly abysmal... It’s precisely because of individuals like you that the cultivation world has names like Basic Diamond Fist Technique and Sword Dragging Technique.”","Compared to the arbitrary names of the four dragon kings, Song Shuhang suddenly found the daoist name ‘Fairy Cheng Lin’ to be beautifully poetic.","Indeed, everything in the world requires contrast and backdrop for its beauty to emerge.","“I’ve decided, Cheng Lin,” Striped Dragon Two suddenly said with a gentle smile, gently tapping Song Shuhang with its whisker, “I’ll change your daoist name. From today on, your daoist name will be... Cheng Goudan!”","Striped Dragon Two’s words seemed to carry the power of destiny.","Song Shuhang felt as though the daoist name ‘Cheng Lin’, inherited from Fairy Deathless, had been changed to ‘Cheng Goudan’?","Was this for real?","As Song Shuhang pondered, his ‘cultivation chat’ private chat notification went off wildly.","Several messages popped up in an instant.","Who was sending urgent messages?","Opening the chat, Song Shuhang saw:","[Fairy Couldn’t Be More Dead] Cheng Goudan: n ???”","Cheng Goudan: “!!!”","Cheng Goudan: “Song, what have you done? Tell me, what exactly have you done?”","Cheng Goudan: “Come out, stop playing dead. I was so angry I leapt out of bed.","Come out! Tell me, what does Cheng Goudan mean?”","[ServerCheng GoudanGroup Owner] Song Shuhang: .","The two Cheng Goudans faced each other in a harmonious standoff.."]},{"number":2586,"title":"Chapter 2586: Don’t Discard the Used Demon Sea World, Repurpose It..","paragraphs":["Chapter 2586: Don’t Discard the Used Demon Sea World, Repurpose It..","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Upon seeing the title “Cheng Goudan” preceding Song Shuhangs name, Fairy Cheng Lin felt a direct challenge from Song Goudan. The proverb, “A dog in wealth must not be looked down upon,” seemed to suggest a standoff between two dogs.","Cheng Goudan demanded, “Stop with the ellipses. Explain clearly, what in the world is Cheng Goudan?”","A daoist name is a matter of grave importance, not something to be changed on a whim.","Thinking ellipses could serve as a cover was a mistake.","“This is an excellent question, quite profound. So... Fairy, why not inquire with the miraculous Father Goudan? I believe he could provide a definitive answer,” Song Shuhang replied.","Aside from Father Goudan, who else had the power to change the daoist name Cheng Lin?","“What exactly did you do?”","Song Shuhang sighed and responded with the voice function, “It’s a long story. Ever since I became the ruler of the Netherworld...","“Since you became the ruler of the Netherworld?” Cheng Goudan queried.","“Fairy Cheng Lin, no need to panic. I’m just filling in temporarily. I’m taking over for Senior White Two for a bit,” Song Shuhang explained.","Cheng Goudan pressed, “Ever since Senior White and Senior White Two came into the picture, you’ve really been doing whatever you please. Cut the chatter, don’t veer off topic, and make it brief! You have one minute to make things clear, or else!”","“I was already making it brief, but you interrupted,” Song Shuhang claimed innocently. “In essence, ever since I took on the temporary role of the Netherworld’s ruler, I’ve been influenced by its authority. My ego has inflated to the point of being uncontrollable. During a conversation with Goudan’s father, I couldn’t help but voice my true feelings, pointing out his lack of talent in naming. As a result, Goudan’s father, infuriated and humiliated, changed my daoist name from ‘Cheng Lin’ to ‘Cheng Goudan.’”","Cheng Goudan was speechless.","Jhy should Cheng Goudan bear the consequences of Song Shuhangs actions?","“I initially thought it was only my daoist name that had been changed to","Cheng Goudan. Discovering that your daoist name had been altered as well, Fairy Cheng Lin, brings me some comfort. After all, we’re in the same boat now,” Song Shuhang mentioned, finding a peculiar sense of balance.","Cheng Goudan was again speechless.","“Fairy Cheng Lin, do you have any other questions? I’m actually quite busy at the moment,” Song Shuhang responded.","“What are you busy with?”","“Busy saving the world?” Song Shuhang offered. He mentioned the seven Ninth-ranked demons awaiting his commands and an evil entity on Earth awaiting his deployment of demons. Claiming to save the Earth wasn’t unwarranted.","Cheng Goudan incredulously threatened, “Believe it or not, I, Cheng Lin, will come over right now and smash your dog head!”","“The Limitless Demon Sect has a plan to open up the Demon Sea World in the Netherworld. I’m planning to use their scheme as an opportunity to save the world as well,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Opening the Demon Sea? And Senior White Two has no objections?”","“Senior White Two actually wants me to utilize the magical world to deliver my final divine speech, putting a period at the end of my Profound Sage Speech,” Song Shuhang said.","The sense of doing as one pleases felt great, Cheng Goudan noted, “Also...","hurry up and ask Father Goudan to revert my daoist name!”","“You should speak to Father Goudan yourself,” Song Shuhang suggested.","“Have I lost my mind?” Cheng Goudan retorted. “If I spend even a moment in conversation with Father Goudan, he could trace my location through the internet. Now that the Heavenly Dao has collapsed, he enjoys a great deal of freedom.”","“Alright, I’ll go and apologize to Father Goudan. With the right attitude, I might succeed,” Song Shuhang stated—acknowledging one’s faults is a traditional Chinese virtue, while refusal to change is a customary practice in the Netherworld.","Cheng Goudan added, “Speaking of the ‘Demon Sea World,’ it reminds me... When the time comes, mention to Father Goudan and Senior White Two not to discard the Demon Sea World’ after use.’","“Dipped in egg wash, coated in breadcrumbs, fried until golden and crispy?” Song Shuhang quickly replied.","Cheng Goudan found Song Shuhangs attitude, heavily influenced by the authority of the Netherworld’s ruler, to be exceedingly arrogant.","“Apologies, I’ve become arrogant again,” Song Shuhang promptly admitted, though he could not guarantee he wouldn’t repeat the mistake. The influence of the Netherworld ruler’s authority was indeed formidable!","Cheng Goudan took a deep breath and shared, “When the Third Wielder of the Will was creating the seeds for the world of the golden lotus, the world of the black lotus, and your Inner World, he conducted an experiment to revert a small portion of the Netherworld Realm to the Devil Sea Realm. The reason your Inner World’s seed can devour the Netherworld’s evil energy for its growth is because it requires the power of the Netherworld Realm... to be precise, the energy of the Devil Sea Realm.”","“So, I should not only use the Demon Sea world for my tribulation but also seize the entire Demon Sea world for the growth of my Inner World?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“Exactly,” Cheng Goudan confirmed.","“That’s precisely my intention,” Song Shuhang stated.","From the outset, he had never planned to return the Devil Sea World to the Limitless Demon Sect.","Cheng Goudan concluded, “Enough chat. Go apologize to Father Goudan and change your name... If Cheng Goudan’s daoist name isn’t reverted, don’t even think about seeing me again.”","After these words, Fairy Cheng Lin ended the private chat.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Following the chat’s conclusion, Song Shuhang looked up at Striped Dragon Two.","“Do you have something to say?” Striped Dragon Two inquired.","With a stern face, Song Shuhang earnestly said, “Father Goudan, I inadvertently became arrogant again. I need to apologize. Could you possibly revert the daoist name Cheng Goudan?”","Striped Dragon Two was left speechless.","The title of Father Goudan brought Striped Dragon Two immense discomfort.","Inflicting damage on oneself to harm the enemy.","“What’s the use of merely apologizing? You need to rectify your mistakes. I’ll change your daoist name back when you’re no longer arrogant,” Striped Dragon Two asserted, unwilling to compromise his dignity.","Simply wanting a change wasn’t enough; Father Goudan needed to maintain his pride.","“Father Goudan, there’s another matter. The other Cheng Goudan mentioned that the Demon Sea world might promote the next evolution of the Inner World. Thus, we must take control of the ‘Demon Sea World’ and find a way to integrate it into the Inner World,” Song Shuhang reminded.","The Inner World had reached a developmental threshold, and the incremental benefits of the Netherworld’s ordinary evil energy had become limited—Song Shuhang planned to venture into the Netherworld soon to locate an area rich in pure evil energy for the Inner World to feast upon.","“Incorporating the Demon Sea into the Inner World?” Striped Dragon Two pondered briefly before stating, “We’ll need to carefully calculate that when the time comes. The Demon Sea world poses significant risks, and we must proceed with utmost caution when integrating it into the Inner World.”","“Yes, we’ll meticulously plan when the time arrives,” Song Shuhang agreed.","“Let’s first complete our current tasks.”","He, Song Shuhang, would save the world!","In the real world, his main body had already escorted Soft Feather back to","Spirit Butterfly Island and had begun contacting the Vast Sea Scholar and Daoist Nun Miao Qing.. With the aid of the seven Ninth Stage demons, he could scourge Mother Earth and bring about destruction within a day!"]},{"number":2587,"title":"Chapter 2587: But You’re Single","paragraphs":["Chapter 2587: But You’re Single","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As long as he willed it, the world would tremble beneath him!","On average, a qualified ruler of the Netherworld experiences the desire to destroy the world every three seconds and entertains the thought of annihilating all living beings every ten seconds.","“No, my thought process is skewed again. I’m supposed to save the world,” Song Shuhang massaged his temples and sighed. “The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld is like an expansion bolt; once it’s driven into the core, it begins to expand within the body and make it incredibly difficult to resist.”","Father Goudan countered, “Don’t lay all the blame at the ruler of the Netherworld’s feet. The ruler’s authority merely acts as an amplifier. A good portion of your hubris is on you.”","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","“I’ll temporarily entrust the four Dragonbeasts to you. During this period, you can direct them as you see fit. Whether you can earn their true allegiance in the future depends on your methods,” Striped Dragon Two added—after all, they were originally meant to be inherited by Cheng Lin, so passing them to Cheng Goudan made no difference.","The four dragons offered Song Shuhang a friendly smile.","They had been in deep slumber since the ancient times and had not had the chance to receive Song Shuhangs ‘Tyrannical Scholar’s Pregnancy Lecture’ in the Netherworld. Therefore, they lacked an understanding of this Hegemon Tyrannical Song.","Like the mortal world, the speech of an eighth-ranked Demon Sage in the Netherworld also features a ‘broadcast’ function. For various reasons, those who couldn’t tune into the live broadcast of the Demon Sage’s speech could catch the ‘rebroadcast’ later.","However, similar to the mortal realm, the ‘rebroadcast’ of the Demon Sage’s speech was time-limited. Generally, the duration of the ‘rebroadcast’ in the Netherworld matched the duration of the ‘Unknown to All’ effect.","At this point, the four dragons speculated about Song Shuhangs identity, pondering whether he was the reincarnation of Striped Dragon Two or a special descendant of his.","Regardless of the scenario, they deemed it worth their loyalty.","After the four dragon beasts had introduced themselves and gotten acquainted with Song Shuhang, the acting ruler of the Netherworld, the three ninth-ranked demons, each resembling an eyeball, stepped forward in Leading the way, the Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon, followed by Long-Eyed Island and the Supreme Eye Demon, reported their names in turn.","“Housekeeper, Divine Eye Li, at your service,” the Six-Eyed Gentleman bowed to Song Shuhang.","“Cook, Supreme Eye Demon,” the collective of eyeballs introduced themselves next.","“Coachman, Gaze Island,” the island demon voiced in a deep and resonant tone.","Contrasting with Striped Dragon Two’s approach, Senior Three-Eyed’s subordinates held more familial titles.","After introducing themselves, the Six-Eyed Gentleman Li summarized, “We three, summoned by the ruler’s call) shall adhere to all the ruler’s commands.”","Senior Three-Eyed, secretly watching from afar and unable to show himself, had the Six-Eyed Housekeeper step in on his behalf.","Just like Striped Dragon Two, Senior Three-Eyed, in high spirits, temporarily transferred the three eyeball demons to Song Shuhang.","The seven ninth-ranked demons, fully committed, were ready to serve at","Song Shuhangs behest.","“Give them your commands,” Father Goudan suggested.","Song Shuhang nodded and declared, “l need you to head to the seven passages between the Netherworld and Earth. Announce my decree there and forcibly return any demons of the Netherworld attacking the passages, or dispose of them as you see fit.”","The demons attacking the passages between the Netherworld and Earth were clearly being provoked and misled. To prevent these demons from causing chaos, Song Shuhang required the ninth-ranked demons to forcibly return them to the Netherworld or eliminate them on the spot.","The seven ninth-ranked demons bowed slightly, “As per the ruler’s wish.”","“After you’ve announced my decree, remain near the passages and prepare to enter the mortal realm. Subsequently, I need you to enter the mortal realm to deal with a group of malevolent spirits, creating obstacles for the Demon Sea Grand Plan’ of the Demon Sect,” Song Shuhang instructed.","At that moment, the Six-Eyed Gentleman demon pondered briefly before reminding, “Ruler, if we ninth-ranked demons enter the mortal realm together, it’s likely we’ll attract the ‘heavenly punishment.’ Should we consider taking turns entering the mortal realm?”","“There’s no need for excessive concern. The Heavenly Dao has already collapsed, and the restrictions on the Netherworld by the mortal realm will be significantly weakened for a short period,” Striped Dragon Two stated slowly.","“The Heavenly Dao collapsed?” The seven ninth-ranked demons, having slept","from the ancient era to the present, were dumbfounded for quite some time, struggling to grasp the situation. If the Heavenly Dao had collapsed, what did that make this Ruler Tyrannical Song?","“However, to be cautious... Before you venture into the mortal realm, I’ll add a layer of protection,” Father Goudan interjected.","After speaking, its dragon whiskers gently swayed, and seven sealing formations descended upon the seven ninth-ranked demons, suppressing their auras to around the eighth rank...","Father Goudan’s seal, somewhat akin to the Great Northern Emperor’s seal used on Senior Turtle, targeted only the aura and did not restrict the demons’ actual power. With the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, certain measures could be relaxed, avoiding undue seriousness. As long as appearances were maintained, the mechanism of the ‘Heavenly Dao’ would not be triggered.","“Go, proceed to all spatial passages, and proclaim my will to the beings of the mortal world and the demons of the Netherworld!” Song Shuhang dramatically raised his arm, elegantly lifting the long robe he wore.","The seven ninth-ranked demons accepted the command, opened a spatial gate, and stepped through it. Guided by the ‘Authority Mission Function of the Netherworld Ruler,’ they headed towards the coordinates of the passage between the mortal world and Earth.","The demons below also dispersed, carrying the decree of the Netherworld Realm ruler to various parts of the Netherworld.","Moments later, tranquility returned to the entire wilderness.","“Father Goudan, was my last pose cool?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Striped Dragon Two was rendered speechless.","Due to pride, it couldn’t immediately revert the dao name back from ‘Cheng Goudan.’ Now, every time Song Shuhang addressed it as ‘Father Goudan,’ it felt a pang in its liver.","Was there a way to change Cheng Goudan back without losing face?","For instance, by devising a way for Tyrannical Song to make a minor contribution, it could gracefully step down.","“Haha, Father Goudan, what an apt name. Great job, little friend Song, truly impressive,” the three-eyed youth sipped his tea, looking at the eyeball butler lying in a pool of blood, with a radiant smile.","Just the name ‘Father Goudan’ could keep him amused for a year.","“But... My Lord, Cheng Goudan... She was the daughter of the Striped Dragon Ruler... And you, you don’t have a daughter... You’re single...” the eyeball butler in the pool of blood uttered with a trembling voice.","Even if its body was thoroughly pierced by scissors, even if it was bleeding profusely, even if it was in hell, it would still use its decaying voice to burst its master’s bubble of inflated pride.."]},{"number":2588,"title":"Chapter 2588: Don’t Worry, I’ m Already Here!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2588: Don’t Worry, I’ m Already Here!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Huaxia Corridor—one of the seven gateways between the Netherworld and the earthly realm—the guardians of the passage continued their blood- soaked struggle against the demons of the Netherworld. Days of relentless combat had left the guardians drained, with the toll of dead and wounded climbing on both sides.","Reinforcements for both the Netherworld demons and the guardians were summoned from the rear, plunging into the battle for control over the passage. The seven spatial gateways to Earth had become akin to seven meat grinders that indiscriminately pulled in more cultivators and Netherworld demons and slaughtered them without mercy.","On the secondary line of the battle within the spatial passage, Daoist Wang Lin, who had previously used a secret technique to sever himself in half to stealthily enter the earthly realm for investigation, was now lying exhausted. He had been fighting for two days and nights, to the point where he could no longer move a finger.","A few days earlier, he had disseminated the information he received from","Senior Tyrannical Song about the upheaval caused by the Limitless Demon Sect and the Netherworld demons, along with the spread of evil in the earthly realm.","However, the impact was negligible.","The Limitless Demon Sect had anticipated their actions being noticed. Far from concealing their cultivation of malevolence and the secret mobilization of Netherworld demons, they had made little effort to hide their activities.","Indeed, it wasn’t that the Limitless Demon Sect scorned concealment but rather that they were pressed for time to enact their grand plan.","The abrupt collapse of the Heavenly Dao left many unprepared. Not just the Limitless Demon Sect, but countless cultivators across the myriad worlds had to prematurely enact their plans and goals due to the sudden collapse of the Heavenly Dao.","Acting prematurely meant that many aspects of their ‘grand plan’ were imperfectly laid.","Such was the case for the Limitless Demon Sect. After the sudden collaose of the Heavenly Dao, they had to hastily proceed with their plan for the Demon Nation, lacking the time for thorough concealment or foundation laying. Certain aspects of the plan had to be abruptly abandoned to vie for the outcome of the grand plan’.","“Wonder if Senior Tyrannical Song has any strategies against the Limitless Demon Sect’s plans?” Daoist Wang Lin took out his phone, instinctively opened the chat app, and scrolled to Senior Tyrannical Song, who silently lay in his friend list.","At this moment, should he seek help from Senior Tyrannical Song?","The Netherworld demons on the other end of the passage had already gone mad. They didn’t need any provocation; more Netherworld demons kept gathering here, like sharks drawn to blood, throwing themselves into the tunnel of the meat grinder and engaging in a life-and-death struggle with the guardians of the passage.","Killing and being killed were ingrained in the Netherworld demons’ genes.","The more intense the slaughter in the tunnel, the more excited the Netherworld demons became.","Attracted by the bloodshed, an increasing number of Netherworld demons converged on the site. Many of the weaker demons rushed into the tunnel with bloodshot eyes, seeking death. They barely made it into the passage, without even managing to cast a minor spell, before falling at the feet of the guardians of the passage. Yet, even in death, they served to deplete the guardians’ stamina.","Compared to the seemingly infinite number of Netherworld demons, the number of guardians on Earth was limited. All resting guardians had been summoned back, and the major sects on Earth were notified immediately to request support.","The first wave of reinforcements from the various sects had already been deployed to defend the passage. Because of this, Daoist Wang Lin was able to retreat from the front line of the battle alive and rest for a while.","“We can’t keep this up. A war of attrition is not in our favor,” Daoist Wang Lin said weakly.","“Indeed,” replied a guardian beside him. He was also severely injured and exhausted. “The Netherworld’s demons have gone mad. With the Heavenly Dao collapsed and no Netherworld ruler to restrain them, the demons will continue to assault the spatial passage until they kill us all. Then, the demon army will invade the earthly realm... Now, we need the assistance of a senior powerhouse. ”","As he spoke, the weary guardian caught a glimpse of the ‘Tyrannical Song account on Daoist Wang Lin’s phone, standing out prominently. “Ba...Senior Tyrannical Song?” The guardian looked at Daoist Wang Lin in surprise.","“Dang, I didn’t expect the thick-browed Daoist Wang Lin to actually know Senior Tyrannical Song? It’s like finding out your ordinary dorm roommate knows a heavyweight.”","“You know Senior Tyrannical Song?” The exhausted guardian perked up.","“Didn’t I sever myself in half last time and escape to the earthly realm to investigate the Limitless Demon Sect?” Daoist Wang Lin nodded. “l happened to meet Senior Tyrannical Song, who was also investigating the Limitless Demon Sect, in the lair of Evil Wang.”","“Is Senior Tyrannical Song easy to get along with? Is it like the legend says, that merely breathing the same air as him will get you pregnant?” The guardian couldn’t help but ask.","Daoist Wang Lin replied, “It’s not as exaggerated as the rumors suggest. However, Senior Tyrannical Song is very approachable and easy to get along with.’","“Then, should we ask Senior Tyrannical Song for help first? Before the senior guardians arrive, perhaps Senior Tyrannical Song could offer us some long-distance assistance or a few pointers?” The guardian suggested.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, a senior of great wisdom and merit, might have a solution to the current predicament of the Netherworld demons’ frenzied assault on the spatial passageway.","A senior of such caliber could resolve the desperate situation of ordinary cultivators with just a few words of guidance!","“Let me ask,” Daoist Wang Lin nodded.","He gritted his teeth, opened ‘Tyrannical Song’s’ profile, and sent a message: “Senior Tyrannical Song, are you free now? Regarding the Netherworld demons attacking the passage to the earthly realm, do you have any plans or advice for us? To be honest, if we continue to exhaust ourselves like this, it won’t be good for us. We’re already feeling like we can’t hold on much longer.”","After sending the message, Daoist Wang Lin felt a bit hesitant. It took courage to suddenly disturb a great senior, especially when such a senior was renowned.","Ding!","As soon as Daoist Wang Lin sent the message, he received a reply from Senior Tyrannical Song.","“Don’t worry. Leave the Netherworld demons to me,” Senior Tyrannical Song replied. “I’m already here.”","Daoist Wang Lin leaped up from the ground upon receiving the message. “He’s here! ”","“Eh?” The other guardians who were resting and recuperating suddenly jumped up. “The Netherworld demons have attacked this place?”","“No, it’s not the Netherworld demons,” Daoist Wang Lin quickly waved his hand. “It’s Senior Tyrannical Song...”","Just as they were speaking, a terrifying aura emanated from the other end of the spatial passageway, from the Netherworld realm.","It was beyond the Eighth Stage, reaching the pinnacle of the Ninth Stage. This aura directly crushed into the spatial tunnel, forcibly suppressing all the cultivators and demons.","The demons and cultivators engaged in battle felt their bodies grow heavy, and they all knelt on the ground.","In the next moment, immense fear surged in the hearts of all the guardians and cultivators.","The Netherworld had actually dispatched a Ninth Stage demon!","And on the side of the earthly realm, not even an Eighth Stage Profound Sage had arrived in time.","Were they going to die?"]},{"number":2589,"title":"Chapter 2589: Surprise? Awe? Excitement?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2589: Surprise? Awe? Excitement?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No one had expected a Ninth Stage demon from the Netherworld Realm to make such an unguarded entrance.","With the strength of a Ninth Stage demon, it could shatter this spatial passage in mere moments!","As for the current world, even if someone could immediately get in touch with a Tribulation Transcender of equal rank, the Transcender would still need a bit of time to respond after receiving the signal and crossing through space to arrive.","This window of time was more than enough for a Ninth Stage demon from the Netherworld to obliterate the guardians of the passage multiple times over!","—Had this been thousands of years ago, the passageways between the current world and the Netherworld Realm would have been under the vigilant watch of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders. As soon as the Netherworld dispatched Ninth Stage demons, the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders of the current world would have immediately crossed space to intercept the demons.","However, in the recent millennium, with the Heavenly Dao on the brink of collapse, Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals had all retreated into seclusion. It was only this year, when Profound Sage Tyrannical Song caused the Heavenly Dao to collapse, that the Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals of the current world began to stir slightly.","In other words, nowadays, Tribulation Transcenders probably didn’t have the time to monitor the passage leading to the Netherworld.","“I’m going to die... I’m going to die.”","“It’s all over. Everythings finished.”","The guardians and disciples of the spatial passage were overwhelmed by immense pressure while sinking into despair.","They seemed to have caught the scent of death.","Similarly, this scenario was playing out in all passages between Earth and the Netherworld. Ninth Stage demons descended from all seven passages, using their power to oppress both Netherworld demons and cultivators of the current world.","Despair shrouded every passage across the globe.","The oppressed Netherworld demons within the seven passages all wore expressions of excitement. Although they were immobilized and couldn’t move, the arrival of Ninth Stage demons naturally meant the tide was in their favor.","These beings from the current world were as good as dead!","“Don’t despair!” At the China passage, Daoist Wang Lin shouted with all his might, “Don’t give up, we still have hope!’","Senior Tyrannical Song had said he was coming.","A demon of the Ninth Stage was no match for Senior Tyrannical Song.","Therefore, it wasn’t time to give up just yet.","Daoist Wang Lin clutched his phone tightly.","Senior Tyrannical Song, you’ve got to hurry! A few seconds later, and you’d be collecting my remains... No, after a Ninth Stage demon from the Netherworld makes its move, I doubt there’d even be remains left, just ashes.","I don’t want to die yet.","Since the day he became the guardian of the passage and took on this mission, Daoist Wang Lin had braced himself for death. Yet, having the resolve to face death and not wanting to die were not contradictory.","At this moment, all he could do was pray, hoping for the arrival of Senior","Tyrannical Song.","Knock, knock, knock...","At that moment, the steady sound of a cane hitting the ground reached the ears of every Netherworld demon and cultivator present.","As the sound of the cane striking the ground drew closer, the pressure bearing down on the demons and cultivators grew even more intense. They were all forced to the ground, unable to move or even utter a sound.","The entire passage to the Netherworld Realm fell into complete silence, the only sounds that of the methodical cane taps and steady footsteps.","A moment later, the owner of the cane, a tall, slender figure, came into view for everyone.","This tall, slender figure was dressed in ancient-style clothing, with a black hat atop his head and an exquisite cane in his hand. The terrifying aura of a Ninth Stage demon emanated from him.","All members within the China Space Tunnel couldn’t help but gaze at this tall, slender figure... Was this really a Ninth Stage demon?","Honestly, his appearance was vastly different from that of a typical Netherworld demon, making it difficult to associate this tall, slender figure with the term “Ninth Stage demon.”","This tall, slender figure felt more like an elegant gentleman.","“Good evening, everyone,” this tall, slender figure said while removing his hat to reveal six beautiful, gem-like eyes and offering a warm smile to all the demons and human cultivators, “Sorry to interrupt.”","A malevolent Netherworld demon actually offering a warm smile created a stark contrast, the dissonance of which was beyond description.","“If anyone has a problem with me interrupting your battle, feel free to take a shot at me!” the tall, gentlemanly demon reminded kindly.","All the Netherworld demons lying on the ground shook their heads frantically—they might enjoy slaughter, but they weren’t about to foolishly charge at a Ninth Stage demon and get squashed with a flick of its finger.","The human cultivators in the passage harbored no such rash thoughts either.","Moreover, all the cultivators felt something off about this Ninth Stage Netherworld demon—if it had come to attack the spatial passage, why bother wasting so much time talking?","“Could it be trying to lure out human Ninth Stage powerhouses? Setting a trap here?” Such thoughts couldn’t help but emerge in the minds of all cultivators.","“If no one has any objections to my arrival, then I will now announce a decree from the Ruler. This is also my duty for appearing here,” the six-eyed gentleman demon said, tapping his cane lightly, “Everyone, listen up.”","Knock, knock","All the Netherworld demons and human cultivators involuntarily focused their attention on him. This was a kind of compulsion spell, a natural ability for a Ninth Stage demon, becoming a technique in its own right.","“The Ruler’s Decree? Hadn’t the Heavenly Dao already collapsed? Why is there still a decree?”","“Could it be that a new Heavenly Dao has emerged? No, that can’t be right. If the Heavenly Dao had surfaced, it wouldn’t be silent.”","“Then, who is this “Ruler” the Ninth Stage demon speaks of?”","The six-eyed gentleman demon swept his gaze across the crowd, then announced in a calm voice, “This is the decree of the Tyrannical Scholar from the Netherworld Realm: Starting today, all Netherworld demons within the spatial passageways between the current world and the Netherworld Realm are to withdraw to the Netherworld. For the next month, no Netherworld demons are permitted to enter the passageways to the current world without the Tyrannical Scholar’s permission. Violators will be put to death.”","After this declaration, the six-eyed gentleman demon lightly tapped his cane on the ground again, relieving the Netherworld demons of the pressure: ‘You have one minute to comply with the Tyrannical Scholar’s decree. All beings of the Netherworld begin your orderly retreat. You may guard the entrance to the Netherworld Realm and wait for an opportunity. However, without the Tyrannical Scholar’s permission, you are forbidden from stepping even half a foot into the passageway.”","All the Netherworld demons in the passageway were dumbfounded.","Wait, the Ruler’s command is for us to retreat through the spatial tunnel?","Did we hear that right?","And... What’s this about the Tyrannical Scholar?","The Netherworld demons instinctively wanted to ask questions.","“In one minute, any Netherworld demons who haven’t retreated from the spatial tunnel will never need to leave. This, too, is the Tyrannical Scholar’s decree,” the six-eyed gentleman demon calmly added.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","All the Netherworld demons, without a word, quickly retreated back to the Netherworld.","Demons, unlike humans, were very straightforward.","In the blink of an eye, all the Netherworld demons had evacuated the battlefield’s spatial tunnel.","Even as they retreated, they tidied up the battlefield, dragging away all the corpses.","The human cultivators, still pinned down by the pressure, were left stunned.","“The Tyrannical Scholar?”","“Tyrannical... Isn’t that Senior Tyrannical Song?”","“Following the Tyrannical Scholar’s decree is the same as following Senior","Tyrannical Songs orders?”","“Senior Tyrannical Song, the ruler of the Netherworld?”"]},{"number":2590,"title":"Chapter 2590: We’re Gonna Blow Senior Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2590: We’re Gonna Blow Senior Tyrannical Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A massive influx of information inundated the minds of all guardians and practitioners from various sects, almost causing their brains to crash.","Theoretically speaking, Senior Tyrannical Song couldn’t possibly be the ruler of the Netherworld.","As guardians of the Netherworld Channel, they had some basic intel about the","Netherworld. The ruler of the Netherworld was the counterpart of the","Heavenly Dao. Without achieving immortality and becoming the Heavenly","Dao, it was impossible to give birth to a corresponding “Ruler of the Netherworld.’","Senior Tyrannical Song was still battling the immortals from myriad worlds on Mars while vying for the position of the Heavenly Dao. He hadn’t achieved enlightenment yet, so theoretically, he couldn’t possess the status of “Ruler","Tyrannical Song.”","So, what did the title “Ruler Tyrannical Scholar” mean?","A group of guardians exchanged glances and silently communicated their speculations through group messaging spells.","Perhaps the term “Ruler Tyrannical Scholar” mentioned by this Ninth Stage demon wasn’t referring to the ruler of the Netherworld but something akin to a “Demon Emperor”?","Following this line of thought, could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song took advantage of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao and the vacancy in the Netherworld to infiltrate it, conquer the demons, and establish a massive demon kingdom? Thus being hailed as the Ruler Tyrannical Scholar by the demons?","Thinking along these lines seemed to make sense! Moreover, this speculation was the most fitting for the current situation.","“Is this the solution to the Netherworld demon problem that Senior Tyrannical Song mentioned? Did he directly rule over the Netherworld?” Daoist Wang Lin muttered.","Senior Tyrannical Song was incredible!","At this moment, this group of guardians even felt the urge to write a biography for Senior Tyrannical Song. He had entered the Netherworld as a human, conquered demons, and established a demon kingdom, a feat even the great sages of old couldn’t achieve.","The six-eyed gentleman demon scanned the group of human cultivators with its six eyes.","Its six eyes possessed various innate abilities, including the ability to read minds.","It had seen the secret exchanges and speculations of the group of human cultivators in front of it.","“It seems that the true identity of Ruler Tyrannical Scholar is even more intriguing than I imagined.” The six-eyed gentleman demon put its hat back on.","That special temporary authority as the ruler of the Netherworld, along with his masters, the Second Ruler of the Netherworld and the Third Ruler of the Netherworld, Ruler Striped Dragon, were all backing him. Furthermore, there should be a hidden ruler of the Netherworld supporting Ruler Tyrannical","Scholar, making this hidden ruler the greatest supporter of Ruler Tyrannical Scholar.","Was this the darling of the rulers of the Netherworld?","Though not conventionally attractive, she still garnered the recognition of many rulers of the Netherworld because of her overwhelming strength.","“Then everyone, farewell.” The six-eyed gentleman demon gently adjusted the brim of its hat. Before leaving, it gave Ruler Tyrannical Scholar a boost.","“Living beings of the present world, you should feel fortunate. In the midst of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao and the chaos in the Netherworld, Ruler Tyrannical Scholar single-handedly ruled over the entire Netherworld. Under his control, the unruly demons of the Netherworld refrained from invading the mortal realm, allowing you to preserve your lives.” With that, the six-eyed gentleman demon turned around and returned to the Netherworld.","The pressure from the Ninth Stage demons dissipated.","All the practitioners in the space channel collapsed to the ground.","“Our speculation earlier was indeed correct... Senior Tyrannical Song stepped into the Netherworld and suppressed it when the Heavenly Dao collapsed and the Netherworld had no master!”","“But Senior Tyrannical Song is even more impressive than we imagined. Just now, the Ninth Stage demon mentioned that Senior Tyrannical Song alone ruled over the entire Netherworld! Not just conquering a Demon Nation. Even though he hasn’t ascended to the Heavenly Dao, Senior Tyrannical Song is already the master of the Netherworld.”","“No wonder the Netherworld demons call him ‘Hegemon Tyrannical Scholar.’ In the Netherworld, the title ‘Hegemon’ isn’t just thrown around casually.”","“And let’s not forget that Senior Tyrannical Song is restraining the Netherworld demons, preventing them from entering the mortal realm! In other words, the reason Senior Tyrannical Song conquered the Netherworld was to protect all beings! He fights for all beings!’ Senior Tyrannical Song was amazing!","We’re gonna blow Senior Tyrannical Song up!","“It’s a shame that Senior Tyrannical Song has already deviated from his own path and no longer conducts the ‘divine revelation’ experiment. Otherwise, based solely on his deeds of protecting all beings and conquering the Netherworld, how much merit would he have accumulated? Anyway, I’m gonna blow it up!’","“I really miss Senior Tyrannical Songs monthly sermons.”","Whether human or demon, they were all fickle... Just a few months ago, they trembled at the thought of Senior Tyrannical Song’s sermons, but now they were already nostalgic for them.","Similar occurrences took place in the other six channels between the Netherworld and the mortal world.","Whether the four Dragon Beasts or the three Eyeball Demons, after completing their tasks assigned by Hegemon Tyrannical Scholar, they all tried to impress him before departing.","In this information-rich world, Senior Tyrannical Songs awesomeness would spread to every corner of the mortal realm at an extremely fast pace.","The whole world wanted to blow Senior Tyrannical Song up.","Song Shuhang was really awesome this time.","After the seven Ninth Stage demons returned to the Netherworld, they quietly awaited Song Shuhangs subsequent instructions.","While waiting for orders, the seven Ninth Stage demons, curious about ‘Ruler","Tyrannical Scholar,’ all simultaneously opened the broadcast of Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’s lecture in the Netherworld and the mortal world. They hoped to gain a better understanding of Ruler Tyrannical Scholar by watching the lecture.","Among Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs five lectures, only Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’s lecture could be watched by the demons of the","Netherworld.","The beginning of the lecture was ordinary and unremarkable. But halfway through, Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’s lecture took on a bizarre tone. The seven Ninth Stage demons frowned, sensing that something was amiss.","Soon, their intuition was confirmed.","When Ruler Tyrannical Scholar asked, “What is filial piety? What is love? Do you understand the greatness of a mother’s love?” as the three questions were posed, a strange light emitted from the broadcast.","This terrifying light had been amplified by both the mortal realm and the Netherworld. Only Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders who had comprehended their own Dao would be immune!","Not only that, but Song Shuhangs identity had also changed. He was now the representative of the ruler of the Netherworld, the focal point of the laws of the Netherworld. Hence, the effects of Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’s lecture had been intensified by the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. The effect of the expert appraisal technique had reached its limit, and its power was nearly equivalent to the original version of the Sage.","This time, not even top-tier Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders could avoid the repercussions; even some of the Immortals would have to endure the agony of pregnancy!","The seven powerful demons of the Ninth Stage looked at their swollen bellies in despair, doubting their own existence.","How did Ruler Tyrannical Scholar develop such a diabolical spell?","Song Shuhang obtained detailed information about the distribution of Xie Wangs on Earth from the Sea Scholar.","“It’s time to clean up the evil spirits in the mortal realm, increase the experimental materials for Fairy Bie Xue, and collect the cores of the evil spirits for Senior White.” Song Shuhang activated his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld and started to remotely contact the seven Ninth Stage demons. “Are you all ready? I’m going to send you to the mortal realm next.”","“Ruler Tyrannical Scholar, please wait a moment,” replied the six-eyed gentleman demon.","“What’s wrong?” asked Song Shuhang. “Is there trouble with the passage between the Netherworld and the mortal realm?”","“No, no, no. We’re pregnant,” replied the six-eyed gentleman demon with a sorrowful tone while looking up at the sky.","Song Shuhang subconsciously responded, “What a coincidence? I just got pregnant, and now you’re pregnant too?”","The seven Ninth Stage demons were speechless.."]},{"number":2591,"title":"Chapter 2591: Behold, What an Evil Presence!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Truly fitting for a man who could become the ‘Proxy Ruler. His way of answering questions was so deviously cunning. Even demons were unsure of how to respond.","More importantly, despite the fact that the suffering of the seven demons’ pregnancies and childbirths is the fault of the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler, he himself seemed completely oblivious, how devilish!","“So, how did you seven manage to get pregnant?” Song Shuhang asked again.","How could seven peak Ninth Stage demons end up pregnant?","In truth, Song Shuhang had a slight inkling of how this happened... But because his ‘Expert Appraisal Technique’ did not work on top Ninth Stage experts and Immortals, and the seven demons’ realms are theoretically immune to this technique, he asked this question.","The Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon and the other six demons were speechless.","Can you believe the audacity of this guy? Asking us how we got pregnant? As if you, being directly involved, wouldn’t know? He’s really pushing the boundaries of bad taste with this question.","Truly befitting a man chosen by multiple rulers to represent them. His level of wickedness was off the charts.","The Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon rubbed its round belly. The pain of childbirth had already hit—it’s a torment it had never even considered. Before today, the Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon would never have thought it would experience the day when female demons would be pregnant and giving birth.","Life as a demon is unpredictable.","After a sigh, it began to address the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler’s question—the ruler asked, so they had to answer, no matter how distasteful the question may be.","“Dear Tyrannical Scholar Ruler, the reason the seven of us are pregnant is because of you,” the Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon spoke on behalf of the other six demons. “We simply admired your authority and listened to your teachings. And as you can see, the seven of us are now enduring the pains of pregnancy and childbirth. It’s beyond words.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The seven peak Ninth Stage demons were speechless.","Now that we’ve given our honest answer, surely the Ruler’s morbid curiosity has been satisfied? So why the silence? Does the Ruler not wish to pursue this topic further? Or were our answers not satisfactory? Awkward.","Both parties fell into a brief moment of awkwardness.","A moment later.","Song Shuhang said, “Logically, my ‘Expert Appraisal Technique’ shouldn’t be able to cause demons at the peak of the Tribulation Transcender Stage to become pregnant.”","The Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon paused for a moment before responding, “Perhaps it’s because you’ve become a ruler. So, the effects of your teachings have been strengthened.”","Upon finishing its reply, the Six-Eyed Gentleman Demon suddenly paused... It wasn’t that he wanted to give birth, but he had finally realized a crucial detail.","When the seven demons awoke from their slumber, they were actually able to receive the teachings of the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler!","In other words, the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler had advanced to the Scholarly Sage Stage within a year? Because the duration of the broadcast of the teachings was essentially the same as the effect of ‘No Demon in the Nine Hells Knows No Monarch’.","An individual who had recently become a Scholarly Sage within a year had been selected by many rulers of the Nine Hells to represent them.","Just how had the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler achieved this?","Not only he, but the other six demons also reacted almost simultaneously and pondered this.","“Ruler Tyrannical Scholar, did you ascend to a Scholarly Sage this year?” Diamond Bone Dragon Cheng Zuan couldn’t help but ask.","In the high-tech steel nest of the fat ball, Song Shuhang was currently controlling Song Four while practicing the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ on the sealing pillar of the ‘Confucian Classics’.","Upon receiving Cheng Zuan’s question, Song Four’s hands, which were practicing the Saber Nurturing Technique, paused. He glanced up and looked at Striped Dragon Two.","“Don’t even think about it. There’s no way I’m becoming material for your Overlord God Pillar,” Striped Dragon Two cautioned—it knew that under the influence of the ruler position, Tyrannical Songs audacity was greatly inflated. He dared to think of anything, and he even had the audacity to do anything.","“That’s not the issue. Cheng Zuan suddenly asked if I became a Scholarly Sage this year. I’m not sure how to respond,” Song Shuhang remarked.","“What’s so difficult about that?” Striped Dragon Two asked.","Song Shuhang sighed. “If I answer them directly, they’ll assume I’m only at the Eighth Stage Scholarly Realm, right? But in reality, I’m only at Peak","Seventh Stage currently. If your realm is too low, it’ll be hard to lead a team.” White Dragon Sister scratched her chin for a moment and suggested, “Then you can answer their question indirectly. For example, you delivered your first divinity demonstration speech in the main world last September, your second speech in the Netherworld last October, your speech in the Black Dragon World last November, your speech in the past last December, and your fifth speech at the beginning of this year that caused the collapse of the Heavenly Axiom. If you reply like this, you’ll seem like the Scholarly Sage.”","Song Shuhangs eyes lit up. “Great idea! This response indeed gives off the aura of the Scholarly Sage!’","“Don’t spoil my precious subordinates,” Striped Dragon Two said while rubbing its temples.","Since it had decided to entrust its subordinates to Song Shuhang, he didn’t need to worry about their loyalty.","“Um...” Song Shuhang awkwardly tapped the keyboard in the air. “I just replied according to what Sister White Dragon suggested.”","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Oops, inadvertently let you show off in front of my subordinates again. Now I wonder what kind of scenario those four precious subordinates of mine will come up with.","After the seven Ninth Stage demons received Song Shuhangs response, they were so shocked that even the pain of childbirth couldn’t hold them back.","Five divinity demonstration speeches, how did he manage it?","It’s as if the laws of the Heavenly Dao meant nothing.","And these five speeches are all different.","The main world, the Netherworld, the Black Dragon World, the past, when the Heavenly Dao collapsed... Whether it’s time, space, or individuals, the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler seems to have free rein over his speeches.","The rules of the main world were simply being rubbed in the dirt by the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler.","As expected of a man chosen by multiple rulers to represent them, he’s truly formidable!","“Ruler, do you have any other orders? Please command us!” The centipede monster Long Cheng Duo’s tone became even more respectful. “Although there’s still a slight pain in the abdomen, it no longer affects our work.” “Excellent. I need you to clandestinely infiltrate the main world and eradicate all the Xie Wangs within the information I provided you. Be cautious in your actions and preserve their cores and bodies after eliminating them. Their bodies are still useful. I’m currently researching how to convert them into ingredients. In my sixth divinity demonstration speech, I intend to divulge the method of consuming Xie Wangs to the myriad worlds,” Song Shuhang instructed.","The sixth divinity demonstration speech? Research on consuming Xie Wangs? Behold! This is the Tyrannical Scholar Ruler! Such an unadulterated demon!"]},{"number":2592,"title":"Chapter 2592: May Profound Sage Tyrannical Song Protect Us and Prevent Chaos","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“When you go to the main world to carry out your mission, remember to keep a low profile. Focus on gathering ingredients, and while you’re at it, disrupt the progress of the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand scheme,” Song Shuhang advised.","The steel dragon Cheng Gang replied, “We’ll make sure to follow the orders of","Tyrannical Scholar and keep things low-key.”","With their combined power, the seven Ninth-Stage demons found it easy to clean up the evil on a single planet. While most cultivators struggled with the Xie Wangs, it was a walk in the park for these Ninth Stage demons. The vast difference in their realms meant that they could crush evil with ease. Coupled with their spatial abilities, they could appear anywhere on Earth in an instant and made their efforts highly efficient.","“When you return with sufficient ingredients, you’ll have the opportunity to be among the first to taste the Evil Feast. Additionally, I’m sure you’ll be interested in trying the ‘Inner Demon Tribulation Feast’ from the Heavenly Tribulation Set Meal. I’ll have a feast prepared for you then,” Song Shuhang said.","Aside from the rewards granted by Senior White Two, the only offerings Song Shuhang could provide these Ninth-Stage demons seemed to be the Heavenly Tribulation Feast and Evil dishes.","The seven Ninth-Stage demons exclaimed in surprise.","Not only evil dishes, but even heavenly tribulations were now on Tyrannical Scholar’s menu.","The heavenly tribulations, a source of distress for beings in both the main world and the Netherworld, were now regarded as mere ingredients by Tyrannical Scholar.","A man among men. He was worthy of the title ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,’ even if only as a proxy Ruler.","Under the concealment of the ‘face-covering’ formation cast by the esteemed Striped Dragon Two, the seven Ninth-Stage demons silently entered the main world.","They dispersed across various locations on Earth and swiftly cleaned up the Xie Wangs.","The process of cleansing evil was straightforward.","The seven Ninth-Stage demons, following the intelligence provided by Tyrannical Scholar, determined coordinates, activated their spatial powers, flashed to the designated points, and entered the lairs of evil. Without alerting the outer guards, they dealt a swift blow.","From start to finish, the Xie Wang never knew what struck them.","After dispatching them, the Ninth-Stage demons gently separated the core from their bodies and stored them for safekeeping.","Then, they moved on to the next coordinates, flashed through space, obliterated, and harvested... Rinse and repeat.","Dispatching one Xie Wang took less than a second.","The number of Xie Wang marked in the information provided by the Eon Sea Scholar was rapidly decreasing!","The densely marked red dots on the map were rapidly vanishing before the naked eye.","The significant change quickly caught the attention of Earth’s specialists monitoring the Xie Wangs.","They had established arrays at each location to monitor the enerw fluctuations of the malevolent forces and prevent them from running amok.","At this moment, the energy fluctuations of the malevolent forces suddenly dissipated in large numbers...","“Could these Xie Wangs have found a way to bypass the seal and quietly escape? Or have they undergone some sort of fusion?” The monitoring personnel quickly issued an alert and contacted the relevant individuals.","Simultaneously, they swiftly contacted the guards at the locations where the energy fluctuations of the Xie Wangs had disappeared. “Hey, guards at the","Brown Mountain Mining Area, have you noticed any unusual activity there?”","“No? There has been no reaction.’","“No cultivators came to exterminate the Xie Wangs?”","“Then send someone to sneak into the nest and see what’s going on. Yes, the surveillance on my end shows that their aura has dissipated.”","“The worst-case scenario is that the Xie Wangs have bypassed our surveillance array and may have even escaped from the seal. When you enter the nest, be sure to prioritize your safety. I’ll await your response before contacting the next location.”","Dozens of monitoring personnel quickly contacted the guards at various malevolent nests.","However, the responses they received were all the same. None of the guards noticed any activity, and there were no strange sounds from the Xie Wangs!","“May Profound Sage Tyrannical Song protect us, and may there be no major issues with the Xie Wangs.” Some of the monitoring personnel began to feel uneasy and started to pray.","“With the collapse of the Heavenly Dao and the prevalence of Xie Wangs, the world is already quite difficult... Let’s hope there are no further disturbances.”","“Let’s await the responses from the guards. May Senior Tyrannical Song protect us and keep us safe.”","Once someone started, others followed suit. Unbeknownst to them, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had become a symbol of safety in their hearts.","About five to six minutes later, the guards responded.","“I’ve received messages from the guards I contacted. They said the Xie Wangs have disappeared, although remnants of the malevolent aura and residual energy remain in the nests. They are nowhere to be found!”","“I’ve also received information. The Xie Wangs have disappeared as well. However, the police officers on my end reported that the Xie Wangs were eliminated by someone. They found traces of the Xie Wangs being blown up in the nests, and their bodies were taken away!’","“The same here! The Xie Wangs didn’t disappear; they were blown up! The guards found a small trace of their remains!”","“In other words, someone powerful took action to eliminate them? Without alerting the guards or the defensive arrays, they directly obliterated them...","How powerful must they be?”","“Could it be a Ninth-Stage Tribulation Transcender wielding spatial powers?”","“Don’t be ridiculous. How could a Ninth-Stage Tribulation Transcender waste their time dealing with these minor nuisances? Without them being of","Eighth-Stage or higher, it wouldn’t be worth it for a Ninth-Stage Tribulation Transcender to intervene. Besides, with the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, many Ninth-Stage Tribulation Transcenders are attempting to seize the opportunity to pursue their own paths and achieve immortality like Tyrannical Song.","“And look, the disappearance of the Xie Wang is occurring in seven different areas, expanding simultaneously. This means that at least seven experts agreed to take action simultaneously to eliminate them. So it definitely couldn’t be a Ninth-Stage Tribulation Transcender... Seven Ninth-Stage Tribulation Transcenders taking action to eliminate them? That’s absurd.”","“Perhaps the seven experts made a bet to see who could eliminate more Xie Wangs?”","“In any case, I’ve reported this matter to the personnel. Let’s see if they have any new information.”","A few minutes later.","“I’ve received a message from the Eon Sea Scholar... He said that not long ago, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song requested a map of the distribution of malevolent nests in the world from him, and Tyrannical Song mentioned that he would send someone to deal with the malevolent forces!”","“Could these seven experts be the ones sent by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to cleanse the malevolent forces?”","“Can we contact Eon Sea Scholar to confirm with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?”","“I’ll contact Eon Sea Scholar immediately... He is going to make a fortune. It’s my honor to be able to add Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to my friend list.”","At the same time, the Limitless Demon Sect also received news of powerful individuals taking action to clean up the Xie Wangs.","However, they only received news of the Xie Wangs being eliminated by experts. They were yet to know how fast the Xie Wangs had been eliminated. Secret intelligence always had its delays.."]},{"number":2593,"title":"Chapter 2593: Waiting for Countless Days and Nights","paragraphs":["Chapter 2593: Waiting for Countless Days and Nights","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Within the secret realm of the Limitless Demon Sect, lay the Demonic Emperor Palace.","In the halls of the Kali Demon Temple, today, all the top brass of the Limitless Demon Sect once again convened. Projected into the Demonic Emperor Palace were members arranged in circles according to their seniority and strength.","The Sect Master sat composedly upon the lofty throne. With the unfolding of the Limitless Demon Sect’s plan, all members within the Demonic Emperor Palace could sense the Sect Master’s power steadily ascending. It exerted greater pressure upon them than ever.","Indeed, not only the Sect Master, but all disciples privileged to enter the Demonic Emperor Palace’s “Kali Demon Temple” had reaped tremendous rewards. As the Demon God Pillars were implanted into the Netherworld, and as various abominations were placed across the world, resonances between the Netherworld and the mortal realm occurred. Consequently, the Demonic Emperor Palace, serving as the transit point for the plan, amassed a vast amount of demonic essence most conducive to the cultivation of Limitless Demon Sect members.","Each member who entered the Demonic Emperor Palace could take away a portion of this refined demonic essence after each projection, propelling their cultivation to great heights!","“Today marks a day worthy of engraving in the annals of our sect’s history,” declared the Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect with solemnity. “The ‘Demon Sea Plan’ that our sect has been preparing since antiquity has finally seen the dawn of maturity!’","With these words, he lightly snapped his fingers. The elder overseeing the grand plan began presenting the results.","The elder responsible for implanting Demon God Pillars in the Netherworld and determining the coordinates rose to speak. “As of today, we have inserted coordinates for the Demon God Pillars into thirty-three locations in the Netherworld suitable for opening the ‘Demon Sea Worlds’! Thirty-three is an auspicious number. Among these coordinates, three stand out remarkably well. I have ranked them as the top three.”","As he spoke, the elder gestured and conjured a partial map of the Netherworld in the air with demonic essence.","The thirty-three coordinates of the Demon God Pillars appeared across various locations on the map. Among them, three coordinates stood particularly prominent.","“l am most optimistic about this coordinate. It comprises an independent area formed by sand crystals, with a scarce number of Netherworld fiends nearby. However, deep underground, it harbors an immensely powerful Netherworld evil energy! Moreover, the volume of this Sand Crystal World is sufficiently vast; even the sand crystals on the surface, when converted, yield dense demonic essence!","“Next is this swamp region, which is nearly as ideal as the Sand Crystal World. Unfortunately, it harbors a dormant powerful Netherworld fiend. We dare not disturb it, estimating its strength to be above the Ninth-Rank.”","“Then there’s this coordinate in a part of the Netherworlds’ Ocean of Nine Remoteness. Although the island here is small, our true interest lies in the expanse of this sea area. It boasts the broadest range and greatest potential.”","“However, the final selection among these thirty-three coordinates depends on the will of the Demon God Pillars,” the elder declared solemnly. “May the Demon Emperor guide us.”","“The will of the Demon God Pillars will discern the most suitable coordinates for us,” the Sect Master concluded while nodding from his throne.","“Additionally, Sect Master, I have a matter to report. Regarding the passage between the Netherworlds and the mortal realm, the Xie Wangs we painstakingly lured over have been dispersed. It seems that some high-level combatants have intervened, but it’s unclear whether they hail from the mortal realm or the Netherworld,” the elder responsible for the Netherworld added.","“No matter. My Demon Sea Plan has become an unstoppable force. The changes in the passage between the Netherworld and the mortal realm no longer pose a threat to our grand plan,” the Sect Master assured with unwavering composure.","Under the Sect Master’s confident assurance, all present disciples were reassured.","Even below, Young Master Hai and Zheng Neng nodded in agreement. The two, with their high-level connections, coupled with Young Master Hai’s clandestine acquisition of the Demon Emperor’s Inheritance,’ possessed deep insights into the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plan. Indeed, in this grand plan, the passage between the Nine Netherworlds and the mortal realm was inconsequential.","“Furthermore, Sect Master, before entering the Demonic Emperor Palace, I received intel that powerful entities in the mortal realm are swiftly purging the abominations. It seems they’ve detected the grand plan of our Limitless Demon Sect,” another elder responsible for the mortal realm’s abominations reported.","“This, too, was within our expectations. There’s no need for alarm,” the Sect Master waved off their concerns.","Due to the sudden emergence of the Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, causing the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, many forces in the universe found themselves compelled to hasten their plans.","The likes of the Limitless Demon Sect’s ‘Demon Sea Grand Plan’ were among the first casualties.","A plan hastily unfurled naturally harbored some loopholes that could be exploited by vigilant forces in the mortal realm.","“Even if they eradicate all abominations, they cannot halt us. However... just to be safe,” the Sect Master rose from his throne while raising his hands high.","“The Demon Sea Grand Plan is now underway! Everyone, prepare yourselves.","Three breaths from now, the Demonic Emperor Palace will pull your ‘true selves’ over and draw you into the palace. Next, everyone, assume your positions... Activate the grand array of Xie Wangs in the mortal realm!”","“We obey the Sect Master’s command,” all members of the Limitless Demon Sect present solemnly declared while readying themselves.","Three breaths later.","Members scattered across various branches of the Limitless Demon Sect and peaks of demonic mountains were all drawn by the array of the Demonic Emperor Palace. Crossing space, they vanished on the spot, their true selves merging into the Demonic Emperor Palace.","As their true selves entered the Demonic Emperor Palace, their bodies were nourished by the demonic essence within. Such indulgence was utterly addictive.","“Clap! Clap!” The Sect Master lightly applauded.","A massive array long prepared manifested within the Kali Demon Temple, This array corresponded to the distribution of abominations’ lairs in the mortal realm.","Disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect took their designated positions within the array according to prearranged formations. The closer they stood to the array’s center, the greater the rewards they would reap upon the success of the Demon Sea Grand Plan.","“Activate the array... Synchronize the coordinates of abominations... Lock in the coordinates of the Netherworld,” the Sect Master declared.","Even the typically composed and collected Sect Master could not conceal his excitement as the Demon Sea Grand Plan commenced.","For countless days and nights, he had been waiting, anticipating the arrival of this day.","Mortal realm. Earth.","The seven Ninth-Stage demons who were frenziedly harvesting Xie Wangs suddenly paused.","Before them, the Xie Wangs about to be crushed seemed to be locked onto by a distant force.","The six-eyed gentleman demon squinted and extended his divine sense while covering the abomination nest he had cleared earlier. As expected, even the nests he had cleared were locked onto by a force.","“Ruler Scholar Tyrant, there’s been a change in the abomination nests in the mortal realm. Could it be the grand plan of the Limitless Demon Sect that you mentioned before is about to unfold?” the six-eyed gentleman demon reported to Song Shuhang.."]},{"number":2594,"title":"Chapter 2594: I Waited for Three Days and Nights, and Finally, I’ve Got You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2594: I Waited for Three Days and Nights, and Finally, I’ve Got You!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Hahaha, so the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plan is finally about to happen?” Song Shuhang burst into a hearty laugh upon hearing the news.","Three days!","He had endured three long days in the Netherworld while waiting patiently for the day when the Limitless Demon Sect’s plan would unfold.","Three whole days and nights felt like an eternity.","Under normal circumstances, these three days would have been enough for Song Shuhang to accomplish a lot! If luck was on his side, he could have even advanced his cultivation by a small realm.","If it weren’t for Senior White Two’s suggestion to wait for the members of the","Limitless Demon Sect to open the Devil Sea and then face his final Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation in the Devil Sea World and bring a perfect conclusion to his divine display, he would have aborted the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plan long ago!","“No, no, I mustn’t let my ego inflate. This isn’t good,” Song Shuhang muttered while lightly patting his chest.","He couldn’t afford to get complacent just because he was acting as the Ruler of the Netherworld.","If it weren’t for Senior White Two granting him the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, and the secret assistance from Father Goudan and Senior Three-Eyed, he would have been crushed by the unstoppable force of the Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plan, let alone thwart it.","“Calm down. Even though I’ve made all the necessary arrangements with the help of the seniors, and I’m waiting for the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect to take the bait, I still can’t underestimate the Limitless Demon Sect. Behind such a long-standing grand sect, there might be a formidable figure lurking,” Song Shuhang reminded himself. He remained vigilant and avoided overconfidence.","Striped Dragon Two was at a loss for words.","Song Shuhang was truly a contradiction. Sometimes, his willpower was strong enough to resist the influence of the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. Other times, he was utterly defeated by it.","It seemed that whenever kid was defeated... it was intentional.","“Right, Father Goudan, the other party’s grand plan is about to commence. Do you think there are any details we might have overlooked? For example, when I created the Overlord God Pillar, will there be any unforeseen circumstances when replacing the original Demon God Pillar? Can we successfully lure the Limitless Demon Sect over?” Song Shuhang suggested. “Father Goudan, should we consider consulting the Confucian Classics?”","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","“l feel like we don’t have time for you to consult the Classics now,” the sword chimed in while sensing the subtle changes in the Netherworld’s evil energy in the surrounding void.","“Don’t forget your authority. You’re the ruler of the Netherworld now. Can’t you manually correct the coordinates for the Sand Crystal World if the","Limitless Demon Sect didn’t choose it when projecting into the Netherworld?” Striped Dragon Two reminded.","“That’s right! Thank you, Father Goudan. After we’re done with this, I’ll take you around the Netherworld to let you experience the feeling of coming home. Then, in consideration of my filial piety, how about removing the Cheng Goudan name?” Song Shuhang proposed.","“We’ll see how you perform,” Striped Dragon Two replied. Since Song Shuhang had given it a way out, it would quickly seize the opportunity to come down. This was to prevent Song Shuhang from causing too much trouble and offending it repeatedly. It too wanted to remove the ‘Cheng Goudan’ name. Otherwise, it would be forever called Father Goudan.","Moreover, since Song Shuhang started calling him Father Goudan, Striped","Dragon Two found itself gradually getting used to this title.","Had Song Shuhang unknowingly used the power of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm’s ‘law of command’ to silently influence it?","“To tell you the truth, Senior Striped Dragon, I find the term ‘Father Goudan’ very endearing. Even after you remove Cheng Goudan, let’s continue calling you Father Goudan,” Song Shuhang suggested.","“Get lost!” Striped Dragon Two exclaimed.","Song Shuhang was somewhat surprised. “Senior, you actually don’t like this title?”","‘Oh well, is this a dragon’s fart hitting a dragon’s leg?’ Since Song Shuhang started calling Senior Striped Dragon Two ‘Father Goudan,’ the big boss Striped Dragon didn’t show any signs of objection from the beginning to the end. He gladly accepted this title. Song Shuhang thought that Senior Striped Dragon Two preferred this kind of name.","He did not expect the big boss to have such a big reaction to this uncouth title.","It was really unexpected.","This was a little awkward!","“Here we go! Hurry up and unite with the saber!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet shouted at this moment.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had already realized that the monolith-saber fusion was a lie. It would be better to abandon the facade and directly call it","the ‘human-saber fusion’ technique.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s voice interrupted Song Shuhangs embarrassment.","“Here we go!” Song Shuhang laughed and stretched out his hand to give Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet three shots of the Saber Nurturing Technique. The two of them entered the state of unity and activated the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm.","In the void.","Harnessing the power of the ‘Xie Wang Formation’ in the main world, the Limitless Demon Sect sacrificed all the Xie Wang and their nests in one go. Then, they finally sent their power into the Netherworld Realm.","The thirty-three demon god pillars that had been placed in the Netherworld Realm a long time ago turned into coordinates and automatically began to shine. However, the members of the Limitless Demon Sect didn’t expect that one of the demon god pillars had already been transformed by Song Shuhang into the ‘Overlord God Pillar,’ the ‘Longevity Pillar.’","The pillars merged perfectly into the coordinates of the thirty-three demon god pillars and began to respond to the call of the Limitless Demon Sect just like the demon god pillars.","Around three breaths later.","The thirty-three demon god pillars had finally determined a coordinate—the swamp area!","A powerful demon of the Netherworld was sleeping at the bottom of the swamp, and the demon god pillars had automatically chosen the best place to restore the Demon Sea!","This was because this area was once the experimental area of a certain Wielder of the Will. The Wielder of the Will had once secretly conducted a ‘small-scale fiendish nation experiment’ in this area.","Father Goudan, Song Shuhang, and the others didn’t know this.","“They didn’t choose the Sand Crystal World?” When Song Shuhang used his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld, he had sensed this in advance.","How could this do?","‘We’ve set up so many backup plans in the Sand Crystal World. If you don’t come over, how can I, the ruler of the Netherworld, show my face?’","After thinking up to this point, Song Shuhang willed it and cooperated with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to use the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld to control the will of the Netherworld and reverse karma!","Under the manipulation of the will of the Netherworld...The demon god pillars that were originally locked onto the swamp area finally changed their choice to the Sand Crystal World.","He then sent this signal back to the Limitless Demon Sect.","“Coordinates confirmed. The information from the demon god pillar of the Netherworld Realm... Sand Crystal World!” The elder in charge of the plan for the coordinates revealed a smug smile.","Just as he had guessed, the Sand Crystal World that he thought highly of finally became the choice of the demon god pillars!"]},{"number":2595,"title":"Chapter 2595: The Unbeatable Plan of the Demon Sea!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a shame. If not for the sake of stability, this elder would have gladly inserted all thirty-three demon god pillars into the Sand Crystal World he had his eye on, thus allowing the “Demon Sea World” to expand to its maximum in no time!","“Master, let’s establish a Devil Nation in the ‘Sand Crystal World’!” said the elder. Excitement was evident in his voice.","The master seated on the throne nodded slightly. “All disciples of the","Limitless Demon Sect, listen up. Let’s prepare to restore the Demon Sea World. We aim to establish our own nation in the Netherworld. Success or failure hinges on this single action!”","As he spoke, the master stood up and gestured, tossing several coins made of an unknown material.","This was a simple divination technique, also a kind of ritual—much like the opening ceremony for a film, mainly done for good luck.","Although just a ritualistic divination, the master’s true prowess was evident. As a Demon Emperor of his generation, even a casual divination from him had significant effects.","Several coins rolled in the air and landed with a pleasant sound.","“It’s favorable!” exclaimed the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect joyfully as they looked at the divination result.","This indicated that their Limitless Demon Sect’s Demon Sea Plan would have a promising start!","The master of the Limitless Demon Sect smiled faintly. “Indeed, the Sand","Crystal World is the best location chosen by the demon god pillars.”","The demon god pillars inserted into the Sand Crystal World were strongly providing feedback on coordinates that guided the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect.","There was no more room for hesitation. In fact... Regardless of whether this divination was auspicious or not, the Limitless Demon Sect had no other choice. The die was cast.","The master gently touched his chest and said solemnly, “All disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect, heed my command. Activate the power of the Xie Wang formation with all your might. Seize the opportunity of the Netherworld being masterless to break through the barrier between the mortal world and the","Netherworld. Channel the power of evil from the mortal world into the Sand Crystal World.”","“Yes, Master,” all the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect exerted their powers.","In the formation beneath their feet, demon god pillars appeared one after another—all the demon god pillars the Limitless Demon Sect had created and stored over the years were here.","In the mortal world, the Xie Wangs tampered with by the Limitless Demon","Sect were sacrificed in one go, transforming into the power of the formation. Under the guidance of the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect, this power was brought into the Demon Emperor Palace.","The power of evil was infused into the demon god pillars, adding a sinister aura to the demon god pillars that were originally filled with demonic energy.","Various strange sounds began emanating from the demon god pillars, even beginning to disturb some of the less mentally resilient Fifth Stage Golden Core members of the Limitless Demon Sect.","“The time is ripe. It’s now,” declared the master of the Limitless Demon Sect.","He had been silently orchestrating the entire affair.","Under his control, the power of the entire Limitless Demon Sect and the power of the formation were melded into one without any excess expenditure.","“Utilize the Limitless Demon Path to establish a Devil Nation in the","Netherworld. Demon God Pillars, rise!” All the members of the Limitless Demon Sect activated their demonic energy, beginning to guide the demon god pillars.","All the demon god pillars floated up and resonated with one another.","“When the demon god pillars break through the barrier between the","Netherworld and the mortal world, there will be a shockwave. Everyone, brace for impact!” the master commanded solemnly.","With that said, he slammed the armrest of the throne forcefully and activated the mechanism he had set up earlier.","Due to the influence of the Sage’s seal, he could only maintain his Demon Emperor state for three minutes.","Over the past thousands of years, he had carefully timed the activation of the Demon Emperor Mode and designed the arrays and mechanisms in the Demon Emperor Palace. All this effort was for this moment!","Boom, boom, boom—","The Demon God Roots tore through the air, using the Demon Emperor Palace as a transit point. With the support of the Demon Emperor’s array formation, they entered the Netherworld, using the Demon God Pillars of the Sand Crystal World as coordinates!","The entire process went smoothly.","The Netherworld did not obstruct the entry of these demon god pillars. In fact, the ‘barrier between the Netherworld and the mortal world’ that the master had predicted did not even appear.","“It seems that losing its ruler has weakened the influence of the Netherworld more than I imagined!” the master thought to himself.","This was a good thing.","The weaker the resistance of the Netherworld, the easier it would be for them to establish the Devil Sea in the Netherworld!","“Moreover, this Sand Crystal World is indeed a good place, perfectly suited for the establishment of a demon world.’","Under the control of the master of the Limitless Demon Sect, the demon god pillars revolved around the ‘Coordinate Demon God Pillars’ in the center of the Sand Crystal World. They were nailed down one by one according to the formation that had been set up long ago,","In the blink of an eye, an extremely intricate array of demon god pillars was completed.","The entire Sand Crystal World was enveloped by the Demon God Pillar Formation.","Wherever the demon god pillars were inserted, it was a Demon Nation!","At the center of the Sand Crystal World, the tall Coordinate Demon God Pillar emitted a powerful aura, giving off a vague sensation of the rebirth of the Demon Emperor.","Under the guidance of the coordinate demon god pillar, all the power of the demon god pillars was successfully twisted into one—the formation was complete!","The success of the formation greatly exceeded the expectations of the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect.","Hiss—","The power of the Demon God Pillar and the Xie Wangs began to come into contact with the evil energy of the Netherworld in the Sand Crystal World. After the three different powers mixed together, pitch-black smoke was emitted, and the sand crystals on the ground were corroded.","This was a perfect beginning!","“Did we succeed?”","“It seems easier than we thought!”","“The Netherworld is masterless, and we didn’t sense any resistance!”","“Whether it’s entering the Netherworld or setting up the Demon God Pillar","Formation, we can manipulate the Netherworld as we please!”","The disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect began to excitedly discuss.","This perfect start even exceeded their countless days and nights of fantasy.","This was the truth that reality was always more astonishing than fiction!","The master placed one hand on his chest and secretly began divining with the other hand.","“Will the opening of the Devil Sea be successful?” He divined again and again.","From the inception of the plan to now, the master had used a total of thirty-three different divination methods.","And the result of each divination method was exactly the same.","The Great Demon Sea Plan was destined for great success!","The Demon Sea world would be successfully established!","Heaven’s will was on their side.","Failure was impossible. There was no possibility of failure in the Great Demon Sea Plan!","The master raised his head and regained his composure. “The next step is to put all the Xie Wangs we’ve cultivated into the Sand Crystal Region!’","The members of the Limitless Demon Sect, who had long been prepared, sent all the artificially bred evil beings through the array into the demon god pillar country.","The Sand Crystal World began to boil.","The Xie Wangs, the power of the demon god pillars, and the evil energy of the Netherworld began to fuse together, turning into the most evil black mud.","This black mud... It was the foundation of the original ‘Demon Sea Realm..’"]},{"number":2596,"title":"Chapter 2596: The Netherworld Welcomes You. Opening Up Heaven and Earth for You!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Under the continuous infusion of artificial evil energy and the array formations of the Limitless Demon Sect, a large number of sand crystals in the Sand Crystal World were corroded into black mud.","As the quantity of black mud reached a certain threshold, it began voraciously assimilating the surrounding Netherworld evil energy and all other substances, expanding upwards and downwards! It swallowed the air above and the soil below, sparing nothing.","A semblance of the ‘Demon Sea World’ had already taken form.","However, just as the black mud boiled and the framework of the Demon Sea World was completed, a strange anomaly occurred. The instinctive operation of the laws of the Netherworld Realm began suppressing the impending birth of the ‘Demon God World’.’.","“Here it comes!” softly uttered the sect master in the Devil Emperor Palace.","Even without a Ruler, the most fundamental laws of the Netherworld were still in operation.","The revival of the Demon Sea World within the Netherworld was inherently a violation of the fundamental laws. Therefore, when the Demon Sea World was about to take shape, the Netherworld would surely react, just as the human body’s immune system would actively combat invading pathogens.","The sect master tapped the armrest lightly and closely monitored the operation of the Demon God Pillar Array.","Whoosh~","As the power of the Netherworld suppressed the Demon Sea World, the protective effect of the Demon God Pillar Array was activated, desperately guarding the still-nascent Demon Sea World.","The Demon God Pillar, a versatile spell, could unleash its effects in any environment. Whether activating the Demon Sea World or protecting it now, the power of the Demon God Pillar was indispensable.","“Hold on, just a few moments longer,” the sect master tightly gripped the throne’s armrest with his right hand.","Just a moment longer, and he could leverage the power of the Xie Wang Formation to directly transfer his Demon Emperor Palace to the Netherworld and press it into the Demon God Pillar Array to control the entire Demon Sea World.","If necessary, he could fully activate his power and make use of those three minutes to mature the Demon Sea World.","Crackle, crackle, crackle- Under the impact of the laws of the Netherworld, the Demon God Pillar Array teetered on the brink of collapse and emitted a teeth- gritting cracking sound.","The sect master’s fingers left five deep marks on the throne’s armrest. Even though he had secretly divined thirty-three times, he couldn’t help but feel nervous because it concerned his grand plan of millennia.","Finally... the Demon God Pillar held on!","Thanks to the central Coordinate Demon God Pillar suddenly erupting with terrifying demonic power, the pillar, engraved with demonic patterns, unexpectedly activated an ‘Armor Intent’.","The Armor Intent fused with the entire Demon God Pillar Array and finally blocked the suppression of the Netherworld!","“We made it,” the sect master secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","Not only were the Demon God Pillars of the Devil Emperor astounding, but each Demon God Pillar had different characteristics—like this one that could activate an Armor Intent, truly an anomaly among anomalies.","A perfect start!","At this point, the formation of the Demon Sea World was irreversible.","Next, he only needed to time it right and allow the Demon Emperor Palace to descend into the Netherworld, merge with the Demon Sea World, and he would succeed!","Not far from the Sand Crystal World, in the Evil Lotus World, Senior White","Two was sleeping peacefully, and the black- skinned Soft Feather secretly took a set of photos of Senior White Two to enrich her main body’s material library.","Song Shuhang controlled Song Four and brushed his hands against another sealing pillar containing the Scholarly Classic. He kept doing this whenever he had the chance, aiming to release the Scholarly Classic as soon as possible.","Behind him, Father Goudan said slowly, “Here it comes, the Demon Sea World!”","“Got it,” Song Shuhang loosened the sealing pillar while gently rubbing his temples.","The moment the framework of the Demon Sea World was completed, the Netherworld sent him an alert. A sharp pain, intense for ordinary people, spread from the center of Song Shuhangs brows to his temples.","For Song Shuhang, this level of pain was trivial. It was just like water and not worth mentioning.","“Those guys from the Limitless Demon Sect aren’t putting up much of a fight.","If I hadn’t held back and activated the Longevity Pillar, their Demon God Pillar Array would’ve collapsed,” Song Shuhang said.","“In fact, even if you hadn’t held back, the Limitless Demon Sect would likely have found a way to persevere. If you carefully sense it, you’ll notice traces of Immortals from the demon sects intervening in the process of the Limitless Demon Sect’s Great Demon Sea Plan,” said the sword.","Song Shuhang looked at Father Goudan.","“Exactly, there are traces of Immortals from the demon sects. And it’s not just that,” replied Striped Dragon Two.","Song Shuhang sighed, “l didn’t expect my casual remark to come true. There really is a big shot behind the Limitless Demon Sect.”","“Get ready to activate the array patterns beneath the Sand Crystal World. Don’t go too far. The Demon Sea World is extremely dangerous. It is something even I find troublesome. If you don’t control it well... you’ll die. After all, you’re just a proxy for the ruler of the Netherworld, not the ruler himself,” Goudan’s father warned.","“Thank you for your concern,” Song Shuhang said gratefully.","“Tablet, let’s join forces to confront the big shots across the myriad worlds! I promised you I wouldn’t hold back!” Song Shuhang declared boldly.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","The most regretful thing I ever said was making that promise!","As they spoke, Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet joined forces and activated the contingency plan set up by Senior White Two in the Sand Crystal World.","At the bottom of the nascent Demon Sea World, the array formations at the level of the ruler of the Nine Hells quietly began to operate, a force subtly seeping into the foundation of the Demon Sea World.","In the Demon Sea World, the pillar that had already infiltrated the enemy’s ranks and become the leader also extended its own pillar, successfully connecting to the Demon Emperor Palace, becoming the most important pillar.","Meanwhile, at the same time, the sect master of the Limitless Demon Sect, Demon Emperor Og, the youngest to vindicate his Dao, stood up. Terrifying demonic might emanated from his body. “Demon Emperor Palace, Limitless Dao! ”","The entire Demon Emperor Palace began to operate. Under the support of evil power, it brought the sect master and all the elites of the Limitless Demon Sect through the barrier separating the main world and the Netherworld, descending into the Netherworld.","The enormous Demon Palace appeared above the Sand Crystal World like a","UFO.","“The moment to witness history has come.” “Get ready to enter the Demon Nation!” The Sect Master looked at the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect with a domineering aura.","Rumble","The Devil Emperor Palace fell towards the Demon Sea.","The demon god pillars below took the initiative to welcome them, completing the connection with the Demon Emperor Palace.","The Demon God Pillars were nailed into the foundation of the Demon Emperor Palace. The Longevity Pillar was no exception.","The pillar that had already infiltrated the enemy’s internal ranks and become the leader also extended its own pillar and successfully connected to the Demon Emperor Palace, becoming the most important pillar.","The power of the Demon Sea flowed into the Demon Emperor Palace along the Demon God Pillars.","“This is our victory.” The sect master gently pressed his chest. It was time to bid farewell to the seal of the mighty saint!","“This is our victory!” All the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect exclaimed.","Young Master Hai and Zheng Neng looked at each other and quietly communicated with each other.","Young Master Hai, who had inherited the inheritance of the Demon Emperor, could use the Demon God Pillar Formation below to fight for a greater share of the benefits for himself and Zheng Neng.","“That’s right, this is our victory!” At this moment, a voice suddenly sounded.","“Welcome to the Netherworld.. The Netherworld welcomes you!’"]},{"number":2597,"title":"Chapter 2597: Let the Battle Begin!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2597: Let the Battle Begin!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A sinister voice pierced through the constraints of space and time while shattering the dimensional barriers and materializing within the Demon Emperor Palace!","In particular, the phrase “Welcome to the Netherworld!” echoed relentlessly in the minds of all disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect.","“Who goes there?” The Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect rose abruptly from his seat.","This voice didn’t belong to any of the disciples present in the Demon Emperor Palace.","Could it be that someone had infiltrated the inner sanctum of the Demon Emperor Palace?","Impossible! The Demon Emperor Palace was his treasured possession, a personal artifact. If anyone attempted to forcefully breach its defenses, he would surely sense it. Even the ancient sages wouldn’t be able to sneak into his palace undetected. Yet, so far, he hadn’t sensed the presence of any intruders!","If someone had truly infiltrated the Demon Emperor Palace, they must be a formidable adversary. The Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect tensed, prepared to activate his Three-Minute True Demon Emperor mode at a","moment’s notice.","However, he refrained from immediate action. The Demon Sea had already opened, and the Demon Emperor Palace had connected with it.","Every second he delayed was to his advantage. Once the Demon Sea fully","formed, he could break the seal placed on him by the Sage, reclaim his full power, and ascend to an unprecedented level of strength.","Silently, the Sect Master performed another divination. This time, he asked: “Will the Demon Sea World be successfully established?”","The result remained unchanged. The opening of the Demon Sea was an unstoppable trend and destined for success!","All members of the Limitless Demon Sect began to scrutinize each other. They had also discerned that the last voice didn’t belong to any of them.","“Who goes there?” “Who’s hiding in the shadows?”","“Come out and face us!”","The elders of the Limitless Demon Sect demanded sternly. The Great Demon Sea Plan was a legacy that generations of disciples had dedicated their lives to, and they wouldn’t tolerate any mistakes.","Meanwhile, in the third circle.","Beside Young Master Hai, a Peak Master of the Limitless Demon Sect asked quietly, “Young Master Hai, what’s your take on this?”","Young Master Hai was recognized as a wise individual among the current members of the Limitless Demon Sect. Perhaps he could shed some light on the situation?","“l...” Young Master Hai began, his voice trembling involuntarily.","Upon hearing the tremor in Young Master Hai r s voice, the Peak Master looked at him with confusion. Young Master Hai r s face paled, and even the hand holding his fan began to shake.","The Peak Master was puzzled. What was happening? It seemed that Young Master Hai had been greatly shocked. Was his inner demon about to surface?","“Are you alright, Young Master Hai?” The Peak Master inquired dubiously.","Beside him, he retrieved a specially crafted pill and administered it to Young Master Hai.","After taking the pill, Young Master Hai r s complexion regained some color.","“Young Master Hai, have you perhaps deduced the identity of this voice?” Another Peak Master speculated.","Zheng Neng and Young Master Hai exchanged glances and nodded slightly. Despite the theatrical nature of the final voice, they were certain they hadn’t misheard it. It was Tyrannical Songs voice!","But why would Tyrannical Songs voice appear here?","“What?” Zheng Neng took a deep breath and began to speak slowly, “If we’re not mistaken, the owner of this voice is...","Before Zheng Neng could finish his sentence, a projection descended into the center of the Demon Emperor Palace, directly under the watchful eyes of the disciples, the Sect Master, and Young Master Hai.","It was a muscular, bald man, with a single strand of hair atop his head swaying gently. This projection ignored the various restrictions of the Demon Emperor Palace, behaving as if it were his own domain.","“Hello, everyone. My apologies for only now formally introducing myself,” the bald man said while stroking his bald head in a suave manner. However, halfway through the gesture, he froze momentarily.","Nevertheless, he maintained a stern expression, masking any embarrassment.","The bald man lowered his hand and addressed all the disciples of the","Limitless Demon Sect once more, “Welcome once again to the Netherworld Realm. I am the ruler of the Netherworld Realm for this year... Acting, Agent","Cheng Goudan! ”","Cheng Goudan Cheng Goudan","As the bald man introduced himself, the entire Netherworld Realm resonated with his name.","The laws of the world began to imbue the atmosphere, and all the malevolent energy in the Netherworld chanted his name—Cheng Goudan! The representative ruler of the Netherworld, Cheng Goudan!","This appearance was simply too impressive.","“The ruler of the Netherworld? Acting?” The Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect furrowed his brow. This was an unheard-of title.","Since when did the ruler of the Netherworld have an acting representative?","Furthermore, with the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, the corresponding ruler of the Netherworld had naturally vanished.","If the ruler of the Netherworld was absent, how could there be such a thing as an acting representative?","“Tyrannical Song.” Zheng Neng managed to finish his sentence.","Upon hearing this name, he and all the Peak Masters beside Young Master Hai instinctively clutched their stomachs. They scrutinized Cheng Goudan quietly. Wasn’t this figure, claiming to be the acting ruler of the Netherworld, the dark, muscular, bald version of Tyrannical song?","“Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!’ “Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar!” “Ancient Sage Tyrant Dragon!’ “Lord Tyrant Demon! ”","“Daolord Tyrant! ”","Simultaneously, the members of the Limitless Demon Sect chanted one after another. Each sage name depicted a different narrative, yet all pointed to the same individual—Cheng Goudan!","“Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.” The Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect gripped the armrest tightly.","He had never imagined that Tyrannical Song, currently demonstrating his immortality and battling on the path of the Heavenly Dao, would appear here.","He had originally assumed that his confrontation with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would occur after he had unfurled the Devil Sea, shattered the Sage’s seal, and assimilated with the power of the Devil Sea to enhance his strength. Then, he would engage in an ultimate showdown with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to ascertain the position of the Heavenly Dao.","“Why are you here, Tyrannical Song?” The Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect intoned gravely.","“Why are you here?” Simultaneously, Young Master Hai posed the same question.","Song Four glanced at Young Master Hai and the Sect Master of the Limitless","Demon Sect before responding, “Because I’m the acting ruler of the Netherworld Realm. By unfurling the Devil Sea in the Netherworld, you’re encroaching upon my domain and excavating a hole in my home. How could I not intervene?”","The Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect sneered. Tyrannical Song was evidently attempting to thwart their Demon Sea plan, so there was no need for further discussion.."]},{"number":2598,"title":"Chapter 2598: Blood Boils, Clothes Burst!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2598: Blood Boils, Clothes Burst!","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“No need to play pretend anymore, Tyrannical Song... Bring your true self over here,” said the Sect Master of the Limitless Demon Sect in a deep voice. “Now that you’ve shown up, it’s clear you’re here to thwart our plans. Well then, let’s get to it!”","He could feel the World beneath the Devil Emperor Palace expanding. A constant stream of Devil Sea energy poured into the palace. In just three minutes, his world would be successfully established!","So, at this point, the sect master was fearless.","He could fully activate the Three Minutes True Demon Emperor mode, and after three minutes, the Devil Emperor Palace would gather enough power.","Once he devoured this power, the saint seal on his chest would be shattered!","There was no need for pretense or hiding anymore!","With each passing second, the time needed to remove the seal decreased!","The sect master’s aura began to steadily rise as devil mist swirled around him. Illusory devil flames fell from his body and landed on the ground of the Demon Emperor Palace while emitting a wave of devilish smoke.","He raised his hand and split the space into two.","One part was for him and Song Four, a space for their solitary battle. When the fight began, he could pull this battle space into the outside world at any time.","The other part was for the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect. It was to protect them and allow them to continue maintaining the Limitless Array undisturbed while peacefully restoring the Demon Sea World.","“I’ll delay Tyrannical Song for three minutes!” Demon Emperor Og gradually activated his true form while clenching his fists.","At the same time.","On the other side, Song Four also made a decision.","“There are still three minutes until the complete restoration of the Demon","Sea,” Father Goudan spoke up. “Just in case, you better suppress the hidden Demon Emperor within the Limitless Demon Sect within three minutes. Then, the moment the Devil Sea World is successfully established, we’ll use the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and the array patterns that have been set up underground long ago to take control of the Devil Sea World in one fell swoop.”","Immortals were powerful disruptors wherever they went.","No matter the situation, Immortals always retained the confidence to turn the tables.","To prevent the Demon Emperor of the Limitless Demon Sect from causing trouble at the last moment before the restoration of the Demon Sea, Goudan’s father suggested Song Shuhang suppress him.","“Three minutes, that’s just right!” Song Shuhang boldly declared.","He felt that the ‘three-minute true man’ mode that Senior White Two had left for him was meant for this moment.","“Stone Tablet Fellow Daoist!” Song Shuhang shouted lightly.","“Here I am, Old SongQ’ Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet happily replied. It began to activate the formation patterns left by Bai Youyou on its body, synchronizing with the ‘QR code tattoo’ on Song Shuhangs back to activate the ‘true man’ mode!","“Goudan’s father, White Dragon Sister, I’ll be right back!” With a thought,","Song Shuhang used the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld to transfer directly to the Demon Emperor Palace.","Inside the Devil Emperor Palace, the members of Limitless Demon Emperor stared at their Sect Master in astonishment.","They knew their Sect Master was powerful... but they didn’t expect him to be at the level of a Devil Emperor. With this revelation, the psychological pressure Tyrannical Song had placed on them greatly diminished.","Buzz~","In the void, the projection of the bald, muscular man shattered. In the next moment, Song Four’s figure replaced him and entered the arena.","The eyes of Demon Emperor Nightmare narrowed slightly. Even though he had taken full precautions, he still couldn’t figure out how Tyrannical Song had broken through to the Demon Emperor Palace.","The other party obviously didn’t force their way through the wall, indicating that Tyrannical Song possessed a very advanced spatial technique. He had to be cautious of this in the upcoming battles!","“Devil Emperor, Nightmare,” the Sect Master addressed the legendary Tyrannical Song in a deep voice. At the same time, he fully activated the ‘Three Minutes True Demon Emperor’ mode.","The raging devil flames burned fiercely and turned the space where he and Tyrannical Song stood into a realm of devil flames.","“Acting ruler of the Netherworld, Cheng Goudan,” Song Four said with a cold expression. He had entered the ‘three-minute true man’ mode almost simultaneously with the Demon Emperor.","A powerful aura belonging to the ruler of the Netherworld Realm burst forth from Song Four’s body. The entire Netherworld Realm centered around him, with all laws respecting him as the master, with his will as the master.","“In the Netherworld Realm, I am the ruler. No one here is my match,” Song","Four proclaimed. He was exaggerating, of course. The Three-Minutes of True Grit mode that Senior White Two gave him only allowed him to grasp a part of White Two’s combat strength, not become White Two.","But it didn’t matter. In any case, on the surface, the laws of the Netherworld Realm revolved around him, making him look very impressive.","“You may scare others, but not me... I know better than you how terrifying a true ruler of the Netherworld can be. You’re just a fake!” The Demon Emperor Nightmare was unfazed. “Demon God Suit!”","From his tone, it seemed he had come into contact with the true ruler of the","Netherworld and had even learned firsthand how terrifying the ruler of the Netherworld was. Therefore, when facing Song Shuhang, he could immediately sense the difference between Song Shuhang and the true ruler of the Netherworld.","Rumbl& m In the depths of the Demon Emperor Palace, a huge statue exploded.","A set of pitch-black devil emperor armor emerged from the statue and flew out.","This was Demon Emperor Omen’s magic tool. It had once been destroyed in battle with the Scholarly Sage and had only been repaired after thousands of years. Previously, it had always been sealed in a statue and received worship from the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect to be tempered and strengthened.","The pitch-black Demon Emperor Armor was equipped on Nightmare’s body. At this moment, his aura reached its peak.","“You think you know the ruler of the Netherworld better than I do? You’re quite confident,” Song Shuhang said slowly. He clenched his fists and shouted.","The terrifying aura of the ruler of the Netherworld exploded from his body.","The clothes on his upper body couldn’t withstand this aura and exploded. After all, they were just ordinary clothes.","After the clothes exploded, Song Four’s exaggerated muscles were revealed along with a mysterious pattern on his back.","Everyone’s eyes involuntarily focused on that mysterious pattern.","Even Demon Emperor Nightmare was no exception. He could sense that the mysterious pattern that Tyrannical Song had revealed after his clothes exploded was the source of his strength. Tyrannical Songs power of the ruler of the Netherworld seemed to emanate from this pattern!","Even an existence like Demon Emperor Nightmare was interested in the pattern hiding the power of the ruler of the Netherworld.","He subconsciously activated his divine sense and gently scanned the pattern on Tyrannical Songs back.","“Ding! You have added ‘ServerCheng GoudanGroup Master’ as a friend..”"]},{"number":2599,"title":"Chapter 2599: Three Minutes True Grit vsa Three Minutes Demon Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2599: Three Minutes True Grit vsa Three Minutes Demon Emperor","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Demon Emperor og’s face was filled with confusion. n ???”","“l just used my spiritual power to lightly brush over the tattoo on your back, and you came at me with this whole string of fancy maneuvers?”","Moreover, what concerned him more was the account named ‘Senior More than One’ that flashed through the ‘Blacklist 1’ list just now.","This legendary Demon Emperor in the Demon Sect... Don’t tell me Tyrannical Song has also come into contact with More Than, the Demon Emperor?","A sense of foreboding surged in Demon Emperor Og’s heart.","At the same time, he felt a desire to find an opportunity to chat with the legendary Demon Emperor of the Demon Sect, Senior More than One. If they were both on the ‘blacklist’ list, he might be able to connect with More than Demon Emperor.","But Demon Emperor Nightmare didn’t have the time to turn his thoughts into action. The data package that Song Shuhang had sent him using the group master and server privileges had already arrived!","A wave of data so immense that it couldn’t be measured in simple ‘units’ was forcefully poured into his mind.","Due to the ‘Three Minutes of True Grit’ state, Song Shuhang was now almost half as powerful as White Two. He could borrow the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and forcefully pour all the rubbish information in his mind into the Nightmare.","This rubbish information included, but was not limited to, the ‘feedback on the problems of the speech of the various universes’ that Senior Three-Eyed had almost caused him to collapse, as well as the ‘information package of the man-made giant world’ that he had received later on. There was also the information about the living fragments of the demons of the Netherworld that he had obtained through the ‘monitoring’ of the Netherworld after he had taken over the Netherworld.","Moreover, to prevent Demon Emperor Nightmare from finding useful information from this garbage, Song Shuhang deliberately scattered all the information and cut it repeatedly, turning it into completely useless garbage fragments.","This wasn’t the first time Song Shuhang had used this method to force an enemy to receive trash information. He was very familiar with it, and now, he could add some new ideas to the method every time. Without the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, no one would be able to withstand receiving trash information from the entire Netherworld Realm, not even the Demon Emperor!","“Ahhh! What the hell is this?” Demon Emperor Nightmare felt a sharp pain in his head.","Illusion?","No, this wasn’t an illusion. It was real data forcefully poured into his mind!","The magnitude of this information was so great that even Immortals would find it difficult to digest it.","The Demon Emperor’s brain and divine sense were working frantically, but it was impossible for him to digest so many information fragments in a short period of time.","Moreover, there were many things in these pieces of junk information that made Demon Emperor Og speechless. For example, the way the creatures of a small world ate, drank, and pooped to reproduce, as well as the foolish desires of the low-level demons of the Netherworld...","The data was useless to him. It could only occupy his mind like a virus.","White smoke rose from Demon Emperor’s head, and his brain was almost paralyzed!","A battle between Immortals was just so dangerous. Every contact, every gaze, and every pattern could hide a killing intent!","In the eyes of the members of the Limitless Demon Sect, Tyrannical Song had appeared and confronted their Sect Master. Tyrannical Songs clothes had been ripped off, and then their Sect Master had suddenly hugged his head and let out a miserable cry.","As for what had happened, all the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect were still in a state of confusion. No one understood what had happened.","Was a battle between Immortals so strange and terrifying?","“It must be painful, but the pain you’re suffering now is only a small part of what I’m suffering!” Song Shuhang imitated Senior Three-Eyed’s tone and recited his lines.","Moreover, while he was reciting his lines, he had already taken the opportunity to cast his second spell, Expert Identification!","A life-and-death battle was not a turn-based game. One had to take advantage of the enemy’s weakness to take his life!","While the Demon Emperor Nightmare was in pain, Song Shuhang seized the opportunity to launch a series of attacks.","This time, he didn’t use the Scholarly Sage’s eye to use the ‘Expert Appraisal Technique’. The attributes of the Scholarly Sage’s eye weren’t very compatible with Song Four’s clone.","Therefore, Song Shuhang could only rely on his own abilities to use the Impregnating Gaze. Anyway, with the authority of the ruler of the","Netherworld and the support of the laws, the effect wouldn’t be too bad!","A beam of light that caused the myriad worlds and the Netherworld to tremble shot towards Demon Emperor.","In the void, the nomological laws of the Netherworld revolved while emitting a low hum that was similar to the sound of the Great Dao.","“What is filial piety? What is love? Do you know the greatness of maternal love?” In the dubbing of the Netherworld, no one could defeat the ruler of the Netherworld!","Moreover, the moment the Impregnating Gaze was released, Song Shuhang used his Ruler of the Netherworld authority to lock down the space, not giving the other party a chance to use the power of space to dodge!","Locking the space before a battle was the basic operation of a true big shot. He had finally experienced it!","“Saint Impregnating Gaze!” Demon Emperor held his head in pain. He used all his strength to shift his body and finally narrowly avoided the light of the Impregnating Gaze!","He had succeeded!","Seeing that he had successfully avoided the light, Demon Emperor Og finally heaved a sigh of relief. Fortunately, he had long been prepared for Tyrannical Songs Impregnating Gaze, so when Tyrannical Song used this secret technique, he was already in a tactical dodging position.","Demon Emperor Og rubbed his temples hard. He had gradually accepted the damage caused by the forced influx of trash information. He had already avoided the light of the Impregnating Gaze.","Now, it was finally time for him to counterattack with the Limitless Great Dao.","Just as he was thinking, his sixth sense suddenly sent him an intense danger signal.","Within the range of his divine sense, he ‘saw’ the Impregnating Gaze light that he had avoided. It actually strangely made a circle and returned.","Demon Emperor Og was confused.","F*ck, what the hell? The Scholarly Sage’s Impregnating Gaze had a turning function?","The Impregnating Gaze, which had been strengthened by the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, was so fast that when Demon Emperor Nightmare sensed danger, the circling gaze had already hit his back!","When you ‘see’ this light, you’ve already fallen for it!","“Descartes Leaf Appraisal Divine Art!” At this time,","Tyrannical Songs cold voice sounded, “You’re the second person to force me to use this move!”","If the Descartes Leaf Appraisal Divine Art had failed, Song Shuhang still had the Equal Triangle Line Appraisal Divine Art and the Archimedes Spiral Appraisal Divine Art waiting to be used!","There would always be one that would be suitable for Demon Emperor Og!","“Hisss!” All the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect gasped.","“Hisss!” Demon Emperor Og also sucked in a breath of cold air, and his abdomen began to swell.","A familiar smell, a familiar formula, and a familiar annoying feeling.."]},{"number":2600,"title":"Chapter 2600: The Battle of Immortals is a Clash of Worlds!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2600: The Battle of Immortals is a Clash of Worlds!","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Be it the “garbage data brainwashing attack” or the “curveball expert identification technique,” Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs approach to combat was anything but ordinary. He unleashed a myriad of cunning moves that left his enemies utterly bewildered!","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang’s combo attack was far from over.","Naturally, a three-strike assault was the minimum expectation!","Song Shuhang decided to conclude this series of attacks with the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","The Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword materialized in his hand. With a gentle twist of his wrist, the Heaven Burning Flame roared to life... At the same time, his understanding and mastery of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique surged dramatically!","This bore a striking resemblance to when he had used Young Master Phoenix","Slayer’s processing power within his mind for cultivation. Now, leveraging the Netherworld Sovereign’s authority, he utilized the Netherworld’s laws to enhance his grasp of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique. The fierce flames, originating from the blade, enveloped Song Shuhang.","Moisture in the air rapidly evaporated.","Centered around Song Shuhang, the floor of the Demon Emperor’s Palace, the decorations on the pillars, and the demonic mist in the void all spontaneously combusted.","Everything was mercilessly consumed by the flames!","Even though they were in separate dimensions, disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect felt their throats parch and their skin crack.","On the other side, Demon Emperor Nightmare, still affected by the Expert Identification Technique, found his rapidly swelling abdomen rendering him immobile and his body rigid.","“Netherworld Space Slash! You cannot escape my Space Slash!” Song Shuhang declared coldly, his voice booming like thunder.","—As the Netherworld Ruler, every word must blur the line between truth and falsehood and leave the enemy unable to discern reality. Even the name of the technique must embody this ambiguity! And, at just the right moment, one must also inflate their ego!","The Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword mercilessly descended, and the flames of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique engulfed Demon Emperor Nightmare.","“What in the world is this Space Slash!” All disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect inwardly raged.","Isn’t this your signature saber technique, the “Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique’!? Don’t think we’re out of the loop; the “Daily Cultivator” last reported that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had vanquished “Sage Monarch Melon Eater” with a single strike of this very technique!","Boom—","The Impregnating Gaze seemed to awaken a long-sealed trauma within Demon Emperor Og. Astonishingly, he did not evade and was directly struck by the “Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.”","The relentless Heaven-burning Flames devoured him. Subsequently, the entire space was enveloped in flames.","However, Song Shuhang, slowly sheathing his sword, furrowed his brow slightly. The sensation of this strike felt off, as if he had hit something trivial and not the Demon Emperor he targeted.","“Sneaking around, do you think you can fool anyone?” Suddenly, Pavilion Master Chu, perched atop Song Shuhangs head, snorted disdainfully.","Immediately after, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair suddenly extended, lashing out at a shadow behind Song Shuhang.","Pa!","The dull hair collided with the shadow, emitting a clang as if metal struck metal.","Within the shadows, Demon Emperor Og’s grim face slowly emerged. A faint hair mark adorned his left arm guard, and his right hand clutched a snake-shaped dagger.","His long-prepared Backstab Kidney Strike was effortlessly thwarted.","“An immortal-level fool,” Demon Emperor Og glared at the hair atop Song Shuhangs head—no one had anticipated that this bald head’s hair possessed the power of an immortal!","“l!!” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair scoffed, “Shuhang, take him down!”","Do you fancy yourself a white scarf fairy?","Aside from the long white scarf, anyone in this world who dares call me a fool must face death! Song Shuhang is no exception. Cheng Goudan is merely awaiting his demise!","Song Shuhangs gaze then shifted to Demon Emperor Og’s abdomen.","He was certain the “Expert Identification Technique” had taken effect, yet Demon Emperor Og seemed unaffected?","“l won’t fall for the same spell twice,” Demon Emperor Og stated calmly while sensing Song Shuhangs gaze.","Having experienced the terror of the “Impregnating Gaze,” he naturally undertook targeted research against it, such as boosting his immunity to the “pregnant state” or simulating combat in the “ten-month pregnancy and childbirth” state, etc.","In other words, while the Impregnating Gaze did affect him, it did not diminish his combat strength.","“So, another heavyweight who was once thrashed by the Scholarly Sage,” Song Shuhang realized.","“The tedious warm-up act is over,” declared Demon Emperor Og, who had been covertly timing the encounter, unwilling to waste any more time— regrettably, his sneak attack had missed. Otherwise, had his snake-shaped dagger pierced Tyrannical Songs waist, the next two minutes would have seen Tyrannical Song pinned to the ground.","Since stealth attacks proved futile, he would now engage in a battle befitting an immortal, fair and square.","“Fiendgod World Defying Sword!” Demon Emperor Og brandished his dagger, seemingly executing a sophisticated sword technique... but in reality, he was unleashing his most potent move, the Limitless Demon Path, World of Despair.","Whether it’s the Demon Emperor or the Netherworld Ruler, any technique name uttered by them should be taken with a grain of salt.","As he swung the dagger, the entire Demon Emperor’s Palace began to resonate... Following that, the power from the Devil Sea World below was drawn forth, augmenting Demon Emperor Og’s strike,","In Song Shuhangs eyes, Demon Emperor Og transformed into an entire world—a world of collapse, destruction, death, and despair.","As the Demon Emperor’s dagger thrust forward, this world of despair and death bore down on Song Shuhang!","This was the true might of a Demon Emperor, the prowess of an immortal. A single strike carried the force of an entire world.","Such a method of attack was beyond Song Shuhang, merely a Seventh Stage Realm being acting as the Netherworld Sovereign’s proxy.","“Slow-Witted Songs giant skeleton.” Facing the Demon Emperor’s ultimate move, Song Shuhang had no intention of backing down. He activated the Netherworld Sovereign’s authority, employing the corresponding immortal combat techniques to face the challenge head-on.","What he had learned from Immortal Fairy White Bones was also a formidable technique among immortal spells.","A massive white skeletal giant enveloped Song Shuhangs body... Regrettably, even with the enhanced authority of the Netherworld Sovereign, this skeleton giant still only had an upper body.","It extended its hands to directly meet the Demon Emperor’s lethal blow.","Though the skeletal giant was immense, it appeared minuscule against the Demon Emperor’s entire World of Despair. From the looks of it, the skeletal giant seemed on the verge of being crushed by the World of Despair at any moment.","“Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure!” Song Shuhang thought.","Two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure were transferred from the Inner World.","Then, the two sets of magical tools were equipped on the skeletal giant.","Buzz—","The synergy of the Netherworld Sovereign’s authority, the white skeleton giant, and the two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure resulted in an intriguing transformation.","“It’s still the Holy City that will never fall!” The skeletal giant was armed with only one set of magical tools, while the other set was activated as the Holy City.","But this time, the Impregnable Holy City was not merely a defensive stronghold.","It too transformed into a world, confronting the World of Despair..","9 O","COMMENT Vote","5 comment","Chapter 2601: Have a Total of Eight Such World-Class Powers!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","One was the World of Despair, the entire world akin to the embodiment of doomsday, eager to devour everything.","The other was the Sacred City World, formed by absolute defense capabilities. Behind that dazzling Sacred City, an entire world was hidden, its defense, crafted by the whole world, could resist nearly all attacks!","The two worlds collided with a thunderous impact.","At first glance, this appeared to be a confrontation between Despair and Enduring Hope,","However, that was not the case. As the Netherworld Ruler’s Proxy, Song Shuhang would not allow himself to be in a passive defensive mode.","Breaking the enemy’s head was stronger than any defense, so the","Impregnable Holy City was merely a primer. The real backup plan was behind the Holy City!","“Do you feel it? This ultimate despair, this world without hope... Be devoured by my despair!” A low groan continuously spread from the World of Despair of Demon Emperor Og. In this world of despair, one had to transmit the will of despair from the physical body to the mind, utterly crushing the enemy’s will.","“Despair? What is this level of despair to me?” Song Shuhang retorted.","His ‘Sacred City World’ was fully formed. Wrapped in the bone giant, he stood tall and proud at the forefront of the Sacred City. “My Despair is a new version of the ship you have never experienced before!”","Moreover, discussing despair with the ruler of the Netherworld? Though he was only a proxy, his understanding of ‘despair’ was no less profound than that of Demon Emperor Og.","“Collapse, Holy City!” Song Shuhang clenched his right fist. The skeletal giant mimicked the action, clenching its fist.","Boom","The world transformed by the Impregnable Holy City began to collapse. In an instant, the Sacred City World, which was combating the World of Despair, was devoured by the opposing force.","The various calamities and tribulations accompanying the World of Despair began to devour the Sacred City World. Apocalyptic flames, destructive lightning, violent hurricanes, and endless calamities descended upon the","Sacred City World. They seized the victory to destroy the ruins of the Sacred","However, Demon Lord Og was slightly taken aback. He could naturally see that Tyrannical Songs ‘Sacred City World’ was not defeated by his ‘World of Despair’ but had voluntarily collapsed, yielding its territory.","What did this mean?","A self-inflicted wound?","He had combated many immortals with ‘world attacks’ but had never encountered a situation like Tyrannical Songs. Facing a formidable enemy, he even struck first, severely injuring himself.","“Despair, after the collapse of the Holy City... The giant that destroys everything!” Song Shuhang inwardly called. Some move names contained the function of spoiling magical techniques, so he couldn’t let the enemy hear their names. Some names were also a bit uncool, like the previous name of the Skeletal Giant’s move, which he also only mentioned in his heart.","“Aaah A roar filled with endless despair emanated from the ruins of the ‘Holy City,’ that voice of extreme unwillingness directly reaching the depths of one’s soul!","Even Demon Lord Og’s World of Despair seemed inferior.","With this desperate roar, the calamities and tribulations in the sky above the Sacred City were all frozen in time. All the calamities and tribulations were forcefully fixed, unable to descend any further.","From beneath Song Shuhangs feet, a figure emerged. It was a man in golden armor, appearing under Song Shuhangs feet like a reflection in a mirror. Song Shuhang stood upright, while the golden-armored man stood inverted.","The painful roar from before came from the golden-armored man.","He clutched his head, knelt on the ground, and banged his head on the ground as if mad...","Madness, despair, unwillingness, pain...","No one knew what this golden-armored man had gone through.","In the next moment, the desperate golden-armored man leaped from under Song Shuhangs feet.","The two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure covered his body, transforming him into a gigantic destroyer who knew only slaughter, brutal and devoid of emotion.","The Destruction Giant stood in the ruins of the ‘Sacred City World,’ roaring at the ‘World of Despair.’","“My pain surpasses yours, my despair exceeds yours, my style outmatches yours!”","The Sacred City World began to transform, from a defensive world to a destructive and offensive world.","The giant that could destroy everything leaped high, combating the entire destructive world with its own strength. Everything it passed collapsed, even the apocalyptic fire, the lightning of destruction, and the violent hurricanes were torn apart by the giant.","Song Shuhang, with a stern face, stood on the ruins of the Sacred City World. Sometimes, a temporary retreat was not a sign of weakness but a gathering of strength for a more ferocious counterattack.","With the Destruction Giant leading the charge, the Ruin World counterattacked the World of Despair, beginning to devour it in turn.","“Fancy, this is a futile fancy tactic,” said Demon Emperor Og coldly from the other side. “Your Destruction Giant might be able to surprise me with an attack, but that’s all. As long as I pay a little attention, how can the world of ruins carried by the giant compete with my world of despair?”","Indeed, after Demon Emperor Og made some adjustments, the indomitable attacks of the Destruction Giant were gradually suppressed.","The corner of Demon Emperor Og’s mouth rose. As he had guessed, Tyrannical Song was using this ‘world confrontation’ technique for the first time.","In fact, the Destruction Giant and the Ruin World were far more powerful than what Demon Emperor Og had claimed. Nightmare was merely using his rich combat experience to suppress Song Shuhang.","“It seems that the Destruction Giant World indeed has difficulty destroying your World of Despair,” Song Shuhang appeared to be misled by Demon Emperor Og.","“Therefore, the outcome is already determined,” said Demon Emperor Og gravely. “You are destined to fail, while my Demon Sea World is destined to succeed.’","“I agree,” Song Shuhang said.","Demon Emperor Og was stunned... How did Tyrannical Song respond? He conceded so quickly?","“Perhaps the Demon Sea World will be successfully established, but you are destined to fail!” Song Shuhang said, snapping his fingers.","Behind him, a second world began to take shape!","The second world was named “The Holy Sword that Brings End to the World”.","This was a world where, from the perspective of the ‘Netherworld Ruler,’ all living things were slaughtered—perfectly fitting Song Shuhangs current identity as the Netherworld Ruler’s Proxy!","The compatibility was 100%, and the potential of this world was fully unleashed!","Under Song Shuhangs control, the Holy Sword of the End circled around the World of Despair and, together with the World of the Destruction Giant, attacked the World of Despair.","“A second world? How is that possible?” Demon Emperor Nightmare exclaimed.","“Nothing is impossible. In such a world... I have a total of eight!” Song Shuhang’s face was stern as he let out a triumphant laugh.","Behind him, new worlds began to take shape one after another.","The ‘Boundless Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion World! symbolized the ‘curse.’","The technological style of the ‘Star of Destruction.’","The primitive aura of the ‘Ancient Sorcery Altar.’","A karma world formed by countless dots and lines.","And then... It was the ‘Ancient Voice, the Sage’s World of Dao’ that terrified Demon Emperor Og immensely. It symbolized ‘teaching..’"]}]);
